"es":["Revisión de código automática","Generación de pruebas para proyectos MERN","Soporte para MongoDB, Express, React y Node.js","Mejora de la calidad del código","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Révision de code automatique","Génération de tests pour les projets MERN","Prise en charge de MongoDB, Express, React et Node.js","Amélioration de la qualité du code","Intégration avec les outils de développement"],"de":["Automatische Code-Überprüfung","Testgenerierung für MERN-Projekte","Unterstützung für MongoDB, Express, React und Node.js","Verbesserung der Code-Qualität","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Revisão de código para projetos MERN","Geração de testes para MongoDB, Express, React e Node.js","Melhoria da qualidade do código","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a equipes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Ревью кода для проектов MERN","Генерация тестов для MongoDB, Express, React и Node.js","Улучшение качества кода","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка команд разработки"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود لمشاريع MERN","إنشاء الاختبارات لمشاريع MongoDB و Express و React و Node.js","تحسين جودة الكود","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم فرق التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代码审查工具","MERN栈项目代码审查","自动化测试生成","Claude Code Reviewer教程","代码审查工具比较","如何使用Claude Code Reviewer","代码审查最佳实践","MERN栈项目开发效率","代码审查流程优化"],"ja":["AIエージェントによるコードレビューツール","MERNスタックプロジェクトのコードレビュー","自動テスト生成","Claude Code Reviewerの使い方","コードレビューツールの比較","Claude Code Reviewerのセットアップ","コードレビューのベストプラクティス","MERNスタックプロジェクトの開発効率","コードレビューのプロセス最適化"],"ko":["AI 코드 리뷰어","MERN 스택 프로젝트 코드 리뷰","자동 테스트 생성","Claude Code Reviewer 사용법","코드 리뷰어 비교","Claude Code Reviewer 설치 가이드","코드 리뷰의 모범 사례","MERN 스택 프로젝트 개발 효율성","코드 리뷰 프로세스 최적화"],"es":["herramientas de revisión de código","cómo usar Claude Code","qué es un revisor de código","alternativas a Claude Code","instalación de Claude Code","guía de configuración de Claude Code"],"fr":["outils de révision de code","comment utiliser Claude Code","qu''est-ce qu''un réviseur de code","alternatives à Claude Code","installation de Claude Code","guide de configuration de Claude Code"],"de":["Code-Review-Tools","wie man Claude Code verwendet","was ist ein Code-Reviewer","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Installation von Claude Code","Konfigurationsanleitung für Claude Code"],"pt":["ferramentas de revisão de código MERN","como usar Claude Code Reviewer","o que é revisor de código MERN","Claude Code Reviewer alternativa","instalar Claude Code Reviewer","guia de configuração do Claude Code Reviewer"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для код-ревью","как использовать Claude Code Reviewer","что такое ИИ Агент для код-ревью","алтернативы Claude Code Reviewer","установить Claude Code Reviewer","руководство по настройке Claude Code Reviewer"],"ar":["أدوات مراجعة الكود MERN","كيفية استخدام كلود كود ريفيوير","ما هو مراقب الكود MERN","بديل كلود كود ريفيوير","تثبيت كلود كود ريفيوير","دليل إعداد كلود كود ريفيوير"]}},"owner":"9tykeshav","repo":"mern-ninja-cc","repoPath":"9tykeshav/mern-ninja-cc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.763Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-reviewer","description":"Use when asked to review MERN stack code - comprehensive code reviewer that checks project health, security, maintainability, performance, testing, and architecture. Combines general code quality analysis with MERN-specific expertise.","bodyPreview":"# Code Reviewer\n\n## Overview\n\nComprehensive code review: General intelligence + MERN specialization.\n\n**Philosophy:** Check project health FIRST, then dive into code. A 6,000-line file is a problem regardless of what''s in it.\n\n## Review Workflow\n\n### Phase 0: Project Health (Do This First)\n\nBefore reading any code, assess project health:\n\n1. **Build status:** Run `tsc --noEmit` or check for compilation errors\n2. **Project docs:** Read README, any STATUS/BUGS/TODO files - look for deployment bloc","body":"# Code Reviewer\n\n## Overview\n\nComprehensive code review: General intelligence + MERN specialization.\n\n**Philosophy:** Check project health FIRST, then dive into code. A 6,000-line file is a problem regardless of what''s in it.\n\n## Review Workflow\n\n### Phase 0: Project Health (Do This First)\n\nBefore reading any code, assess project health:\n\n1. **Build status:** Run `tsc --noEmit` or check for compilation errors\n2. **Project docs:** Read README, any STATUS/BUGS/TODO files - look for deployment blockers\n3. **Test health:** Do tests exist? Check `package.json` scripts, look for test directories\n4. **File sizes:** `find src -name \"*.ts\" -o -name \"*.tsx\" | xargs wc -l | sort -n | tail -20`\n5. **Dependencies:** Check for `npm audit` issues, unusual deps (Angular in React?)\n\n**Stop here if:** Build is broken, docs say \"DO NOT DEPLOY\", or critical blockers found. Report immediately.\n\n### Phase 1: Scope Detection\n\n1. Identify scope from context:\n   - Full repo → Broad review, sample key files\n   - Feature/PR → All changed files\n   - Single file → Deep dive\n2. Detect layers: React? Express? MongoDB? Node.js?\n3. If ambiguous → ask user\n\n### Phase 2: Review by Priority\n\n| Priority | Focus | Severity |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| 0. Blockers | Build failures, \"DO NOT DEPLOY\", broken deploys | STOP |\n| 1. Security | Injection, auth, secrets, XSS | Critical |\n| 2. Maintainability | God files, complexity, duplication | Critical/Important |\n| 3. Performance | N+1, missing indexes, re-renders | Important |\n| 4. Testing | No tests, low coverage, flaky tests | Important |\n| 5. Best Practices | Error handling, async patterns | Suggestion |\n| 6. Architecture | API design, state management | Suggestion |\n\nLoad reference files ON-DEMAND when you hit MERN-specific edge cases.\n\n### Phase 3: Report\n\nUse the output format below. Offer to fix starting with Critical.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# MERN Code Review\n\n## Project Health\n- Build: [Compiles / X errors / Not checked]\n- Tests: [X passing / X failing / None found]\n- Blockers: [Any deployment blockers from docs]\n- Large files: [Files >500 lines]\n\n## Scope\n[What was reviewed]\n\n## Summary\n- Files reviewed: X\n- Issues: X Critical, X Important, X Suggestions\n\n## Critical (Must Fix)\n### [C1] Category: Title\n**File:** `path:line`\n**Why:** [1-2 sentences]\n**Fix:** [Code or instruction]\n\n## Important (Should Fix)\n### [I1] Category: Title\n...\n\n## Suggestions\n- `file:line` - Note\n\n## What''s Good\n- [Positive observations]\n\n## Verdict\n[Ready to deploy / Blocked / Needs fixes] - [1 sentence reason]\n\n---\n**Ready to fix these?** Starting with Critical issues.\n```\n\n## Checklists\n\n**Minimum required checks.** Report other issues you find during review.\n\n### Blockers (Check First)\n- [ ] Project compiles without errors\n- [ ] No \"DO NOT DEPLOY\" or similar warnings in docs\n- [ ] No critical security advisories in `npm audit`\n\n### Security\n- [ ] No `$where`, `$ne`, `$regex` with user input (NoSQL injection/ReDoS)\n- [ ] No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` without DOMPurify\n- [ ] JWT in httpOnly cookies, not localStorage\n- [ ] Secrets in env vars, not hardcoded (check config files too, not just code)\n- [ ] Helmet middleware configured\n- [ ] CORS properly restricted\n- [ ] Rate limiting on auth endpoints\n- [ ] Input validation on all endpoints\n- [ ] No `eval()` or `new Function()` with user input\n\n### Maintainability\n- [ ] No file >500 lines (god files)\n- [ ] No function >50 lines\n- [ ] No class/component with >20 methods\n- [ ] No deep nesting (>4 levels)\n- [ ] No copy-paste blocks >10 lines (DRY)\n- [ ] Clear naming (no cryptic abbreviations)\n- [ ] Consistent code style\n\n### Performance\n- [ ] No N+1 queries (use populate/$lookup)\n- [ ] Indexes on frequently queried fields\n- [ ] `.lean()` for read-only Mongoose queries\n- [ ] No `fs.readFileSync` in request handlers\n- [ ] React.memo on expensive components\n- [ ] useCallback/useMemo where beneficial\n- [ ] Pagination on list endpoints\n\n### Testing\n- [ ] Tests exist for critical paths (auth, payments, core flows)\n- [ ] Test coverage reasonable (>50% for services)\n- [ ] No skipped/commented-out tests\n- [ ] Tests actually assert behavior (not just \"doesn''t crash\")\n- [ ] Mocks don''t hide real integration issues\n\n### Best Practices\n- [ ] Async errors handled (try/catch or error middleware)\n- [ ] useEffect cleanup functions present\n- [ ] No floating promises (unhandled async)\n- [ ] Middleware order correct (body-parser before routes, error handler last)\n- [ ] Environment variables validated at startup\n- [ ] Graceful shutdown handlers\n\n### Architecture\n- [ ] Consistent API response format\n- [ ] Service layer between controllers and DB\n- [ ] Types aligned frontend/backend\n- [ ] No circular dependencies\n- [ ] Clear module boundaries\n- [ ] No god components (React >300 lines)\n- [ ] State management appropriate for complexity\n\n## Red Flags (Immediate Critical)\n\nThese are automatic Critical issues:\n\n- `eval()`, `new Function()` with user input\n- Hardcoded secrets/credentials in code\n- `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` without sanitization\n- JWT/auth tokens in localStorage\n- Missing auth middleware on protected routes\n- `$where` clause with user input\n- File >1000 lines\n- \"DO NOT DEPLOY\" in project docs\n- `npm audit` critical vulnerabilities\n\n## Scope Calibration\n\n| Scope | Phase 0 | Code Depth | Focus |\n|-------|---------|------------|-------|\n| Single file | Skip | Deep | All checklists on that file |\n| Last commit | Quick | Medium | Changed lines + immediate context |\n| Feature/PR | Quick | Medium | All changed files |\n| Full repo | Full | Broad | Sample key files, architecture |\n\n## Reference Files\n\nLoad ONLY when you encounter MERN-specific patterns you need to verify:\n\n| When to Load | Reference |\n|--------------|-----------|\n| NoSQL query security question | [security.md](reference/security.md) |\n| React hooks/re-render issue | [react.md](reference/react.md) |\n| Express middleware question | [express.md](reference/express.md) |\n| MongoDB schema/index question | [mongodb.md](reference/mongodb.md) |\n| Node.js async/memory issue | [nodejs.md](reference/nodejs.md) |\n| API design/auth flow question | [fullstack.md](reference/fullstack.md) |\n\n**Do NOT load all references upfront.** They''re for edge cases, not general review.\n\n## Don''t\n\n- Don''t claim \"no issues found\" without actually searching for them\n- Don''t report on code you haven''t read\n- Don''t classify style issues as Critical\n\n## Examples\n\n### God File Detection\n```\nFound: EventService.ts - 6,165 lines\n→ Critical [C1] Maintainability: God file\n→ Recommend split into: EventQueryService, EventBookingService,\n   EventGuestService, EventInviteService (~500 lines each)\n```\n\n### Missing Health Check\n```\nFound: CURRENT_STATUS_AND_BUGS.md contains \"DO NOT DEPLOY\"\n→ Critical [C1] Blocker: Deployment blocked by known issues\n→ Fix TypeScript errors in EditEventModal.tsx before proceeding\n```\n\n### Security + Specific Fix\n```\nFound: No Helmet middleware in index.ts\n→ Critical [C2] Security: Missing security headers\n→ Fix: npm install helmet && app.use(helmet())\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:16:09.630Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing comprehensive MERN stack code review and testing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要全面MERN堆栈代码审查和测试功能的全栈代理。","ja":"MERNスタックのコードレビューとテスト機能が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"전체 스택 에이전트에게 적합하며, 포괄적인 MERN 스택 코드 검토 및 테스트 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan capacidades completas de revisión de código y pruebas para el stack MERN.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Full Stack ayant besoin de capacités complètes de revue de code et de test pour la stack MERN.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agenten, die umfassende Fähigkeiten zur Code-Überprüfung und zum Testen des MERN-Stacks benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de uma revisão e testes de código abrangentes da pilha MERN.","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов, которым необходим всесторонний обзор и тестирование кода стека MERN.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الكاملون الذين يحتاجون إلى مراجعة وتحليل شامل للكود المكون من حزمة MERN."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to assess project health, perform thorough code reviews, and generate tests for MongoDB, Express, React, and Node.js projects using tools like `tsc --noEmit` for compilation error checking and reviewing project documentation such as README files.","zh":"赋予代理人评估项目健康状况、进行彻底的代码审查以及为使用`tsc --noEmit`等工具的MongoDB、Express、React和Node.js项目生成测试的能力，包括编译错误检查和审查项目文档，如README文件。","ja":"エージェントがプロジェクトのヘルスチェック、徹底的なコードレビュー、`tsc --noEmit`などのツールを使用したMongoDB、Express、React、Node.jsプロジェクトのテスト生成を行うことができます。プロジェクトのドキュメント（READMEファイルなど）をレビューすることもできます。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트의 건강 상태를 평가하고, 철저한 코드 검토를 수행하며, `tsc --noEmit`와 같은 도구를 사용하여 MongoDB, Express, React 및 Node.js 프로젝트에 대한 테스트를 생성할 수 있습니다. 프로젝트 문서(README 파일 등)를 검토할 수도 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes evaluar la salud del proyecto, realizar revisiones de código exhaustivas y generar pruebas para proyectos de MongoDB, Express, React y Node.js utilizando herramientas como `tsc --noEmit` para la comprobación de errores de compilación y la revisión de la documentación del proyecto, como archivos README.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer l''état de santé du projet, d''effectuer des revues de code approfondies et de générer des tests pour des projets MongoDB, Express, React et Node.js en utilisant des outils comme `tsc --noEmit` pour la vérification des erreurs de compilation et l''examen de la documentation du projet, tels que les fichiers README.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Projektgesundheit zu bewerten, gründliche Code-Überprüfungen durchzuführen und Tests für MongoDB-, Express-, React- und Node.js-Projekte zu generieren, unter Verwendung von Tools wie `tsc --noEmit` zur Überprüfung von Kompilierungsfehlern und zur Durchsicht von Projekt dokumentation wie README-Dateien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar a saúde do projeto, realizar revisões de código abrangentes e gerar testes para projetos MongoDB, Express, React e Node.js usando ferramentas como `tsc --noEmit` para verificação de erros de compilação e revisão da documentação do projeto, como arquivos README.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценить состояние проекта, провести всесторонний обзор кода и генерировать тесты для проектов MongoDB, Express, React и Node.js, используя инструменты, такие как `tsc --noEmit` для проверки ошибок компиляции и обзора документации проекта, например, файлов README.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تقييم صحة المشروع وإجراء مراجعة شاملة للكود وتوليد الاختبارات لمشاريع MongoDB و Express و React و Node.js باستخدام أدوات مثل `tsc --noEmit` للتحقق من أخطاء الترجمة ومراجعة توثيق المشروع مثل ملفات README."},"useCases":{"en":["Assessing project health through build status and documentation review","Performing comprehensive code reviews for MERN stack projects","Generating tests for MongoDB, Express, React, and Node.js applications"],"zh":["通过构建状态和文档审查评估项目健康状况","对MERN堆栈项目进行全面代码审查","为MongoDB、Express、React和Node.js应用程序生成测试"],"ja":["ビルド状態とドキュメントのレビューを通じてプロジェクトのヘルスチェックを行う","MERNスタックプロジェクトの徹底的なコードレビューを行う","MongoDB、Express、React、Node.jsアプリケーションのテストを生成する"],"ko":["빌드 상태 및 문서 검토를 통해 프로젝트 건강 상태 평가","MERN 스택 프로젝트에 대한 철저한 코드 검토","MongoDB, Express, React 및 Node.js 애플리케이션에 대한 테스트 생성"],"es":["Evaluación de la salud del proyecto mediante el estado de compilación y la revisión de la documentación","Realización de revisiones de código exhaustivas para proyectos del stack MERN","Generación de pruebas para aplicaciones de MongoDB, Express, React y Node.js"],"fr":["Évaluation de l''état de santé du projet via le statut de build et la revue de la documentation","Réalisation de revues de code complètes pour les projets de la stack MERN","Génération de tests pour les applications MongoDB, Express, React et Node.js"],"de":["Bewertung der Projektgesundheit durch Build-Status und Überprüfung der Dokumentation","Durchführung umfassender Code-Überprüfungen für MERN-Stack-Projekte","Generierung von Tests für MongoDB-, Express-, React- und Node.js-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Avaliando a saúde do projeto por meio do status da compilação e revisão da documentação","Realizando revisões de código abrangentes para projetos da pilha MERN","Gerando testes para aplicações MongoDB, Express, React e Node.js"],"ru":["Оценка состояния проекта на основе статуса сборки и обзора документации","Проведение всестороннего обзора кода для проектов стека MERN","Генерирование тестов для приложений MongoDB, Express, React и Node.js"],"ar":["تقييم صحة المشروع من خلال حالة الترجمة ومراجعة التوثيق","إجراء مراجعة شاملة للكود لمشاريع حزمة MERN","توليد الاختبارات لتطبيقات MongoDB و Express و React و Node.js"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project codebase and documentation","MERN stack specialization may limit applicability to other tech stacks"],"zh":["需要访问项目代码库和文档","MERN堆栈专门化可能会限制其在其他技术栈中的适用性"],"ja":["プロジェクトのコードベースとドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","MERNスタック専門化により他のテクノロジースタックへの適用性が制限される可能性"],"ko":["프로젝트 코드베이스 및 문서에 대한 액세스가 필요","MERN 스택 전문화로 인해 다른 기술 스택에 대한適用성이 제한될 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código base del proyecto y a su documentación","La especialización en el stack MERN puede limitar la aplicabilidad a otros stacks tecnológicos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au codebase du projet et à sa documentation","La spécialisation dans la stack MERN peut limiter l''applicabilité à d''autres stacks technologiques"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Projekt-Codebasis und Dokumentation","Die Spezialisierung auf den MERN-Stack kann die Anwendbarkeit auf andere Tech-Stacks einschränken"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código e documentação do projeto","Especialização em pilha MERN pode limitar a aplicabilidade a outras pilhas de tecnologia"],"ru":["Требует доступа к базе кода и документации проекта","Специализация на стеке MERN может ограничить применимость к другим технологическим стекам"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الكود وتوثيق المشروع","التركيز على حزمة MERN قد يقيد التطبيق على حزم تكنولوجيا أخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2da5aad6f88cfea08e8301a478422f1f3fcea1c71d0d868760415c32b1694b15","qualityScore":60}');
