OpenClaw y Claude Code","Optimización de contexto para mejoras de eficiencia","Integración con Gemini, Cursor y Antigravity","Soporte para múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Amélioration des performances des agents IA","Compatibilité avec OpenClaw et Claude Code","Optimisation de contexte pour améliorer l''efficacité","Intégration avec Gemini, Cursor et Antigravity","Prise en charge de plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Leistungsverbesserung von KI-Agents","Kompatibilität mit OpenClaw und Claude Code","Kontext-Optimierung für Effizienzverbesserung","Integration mit Gemini, Cursor und Antigravity","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen"],"pt":["Melhoria do desempenho das ferramentas de IA","Compatibilidade com OpenClaw, Claude Code, Gemini, Cursor e Antigravity","Otimização de contexto para melhorar a precisão","Integração com bibliotecas de IA populares","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Улучшение производительности ИИ агентов","Совместимость с OpenClaw, Claude Code, Gemini, Cursor и Antigravity","Контекстная оптимизация для улучшения точности","Интеграция с популярными библиотеками ИИ","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки"],"ar":["تحسين أداء أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التوافق مع OpenClaw، Claude Code، Gemini، Cursor و Antigravity","تحسين السياق لتحسين الدقة","التكامل مع مكتبات الذكاء الاصطناعي الشهيرة","دعم بيئات متعددة للتنمية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体优化","上下文优化技能","Agent Skills Hub","如何使用AI智能体","AI智能体的优势","AI智能体与传统方法的比较","AI智能体安装指南","AI智能体设置教程"],"ja":["AIエージェントの最適化","コンテキスト最適化スキル","Agent Skills Hub","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントの利点","AIエージェントと伝統的な方法の比較","AIエージェントのインストールガイド","AIエージェントの設定チュートリアル"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 최적화","컨텍스트 최적화 기술","Agent Skills Hub","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트의 장점","AI 에이전트와 전통적인 방법의 비교","AI 에이전트 설치 가이드","AI 에이전트 설정 튜토리얼"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de IA","qué es la optimización de contexto","agentes de IA alternativos","OpenClaw vs Claude Code","instalación de agentes de IA","guía de configuración de agentes de IA","desarrollo de agentes de IA con Python","agentes de IA con Node.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents IA","quoi est l''optimisation de contexte","alternatives aux agents IA","OpenClaw vs Claude Code","installation des agents IA","guide de configuration des agents IA","développement d''agents IA avec Python","agents IA avec Node.js"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist die Kontext-Optimierung","KI-Agents-Alternativen","OpenClaw vs Claude Code","Installation von KI-Agents","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Agents","Entwicklung von KI-Agents mit Python","KI-Agents mit Node.js"],"pt":["otimização de contexto","ferramentas de IA","OpenClaw","Claude Code","Gemini","Cursor","Antigravity","como usar otimização de contexto","o que é otimização de contexto"],"ru":["контекстная оптимизация","ИИ агенты","OpenClaw","Claude Code","Gemini","Cursor","Antigravity","как использовать контекстную оптимизацию","что такое контекстная оптимизация"],"ar":["تحسين السياق","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","OpenClaw","Claude Code","Gemini","Cursor","Antigravity","كيفية استخدام تحسين السياق","ما هو تحسين السياق"]}},"owner":"legendaryabhi","repo":"agent-skills-hub","repoPath":"legendaryabhi/agent-skills-hub","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.798Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-optimization","description":"Apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies","bodyPreview":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective con","body":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective context capacity without requiring larger models or longer contexts.\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Context limits constrain task complexity\n- Optimizing for cost reduction (fewer tokens = lower costs)\n- Reducing latency for long conversations\n- Implementing long-running agent systems\n- Needing to handle larger documents or conversations\n- Building production systems at scale\n\n## Core Concepts\n\nContext optimization extends effective capacity through four primary strategies: compaction (summarizing context near limits), observation masking (replacing verbose outputs with references), KV-cache optimization (reusing cached computations), and context partitioning (splitting work across isolated contexts).\n\nThe key insight is that context quality matters more than quantity. Optimization preserves signal while reducing noise. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard, and when to apply each technique.\n\n## Detailed Topics\n\n### Compaction Strategies\n\n**What is Compaction**\nCompaction is the practice of summarizing context contents when approaching limits, then reinitializing a new context window with the summary. This distills the contents of a context window in a high-fidelity manner, enabling the agent to continue with minimal performance degradation.\n\nCompaction typically serves as the first lever in context optimization. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard.\n\n**Compaction Implementation**\nCompaction works by identifying sections that can be compressed, generating summaries that capture essential points, and replacing full content with summaries. Priority for compression goes to tool outputs (replace with summaries), old turns (summarize early conversation), retrieved docs (summarize if recent versions exist), and never compress system prompt.\n\n**Summary Generation**\nEffective summaries preserve different elements depending on message type:\n\nTool outputs: Preserve key findings, metrics, and conclusions. Remove verbose raw output.\n\nConversational turns: Preserve key decisions, commitments, and context shifts. Remove filler and back-and-forth.\n\nRetrieved documents: Preserve key facts and claims. Remove supporting evidence and elaboration.\n\n### Observation Masking\n\n**The Observation Problem**\nTool outputs can comprise 80%+ of token usage in agent trajectories. Much of this is verbose output that has already served its purpose. Once an agent has used a tool output to make a decision, keeping the full output provides diminishing value while consuming significant context.\n\nObservation masking replaces verbose tool outputs with compact references. The information remains accessible if needed but does not consume context continuously.\n\n**Masking Strategy Selection**\nNot all observations should be masked equally:\n\nNever mask: Observations critical to current task, observations from the most recent turn, observations used in active reasoning.\n\nConsider masking: Observations from 3+ turns ago, verbose outputs with key points extractable, observations whose purpose has been served.\n\nAlways mask: Repeated outputs, boilerplate headers/footers, outputs already summarized in conversation.\n\n### KV-Cache Optimization\n\n**Understanding KV-Cache**\nThe KV-cache stores Key and Value tensors computed during inference, growing linearly with sequence length. Caching the KV-cache across requests sharing identical prefixes avoids recomputation.\n\nPrefix caching reuses KV blocks across requests with identical prefixes using hash-based block matching. This dramatically reduces cost and latency for requests with common prefixes like system prompts.\n\n**Cache Optimization Patterns**\nOptimize for caching by reordering context elements to maximize cache hits. Place stable elements first (system prompt, tool definitions), then frequently reused elements, then unique elements last.\n\nDesign prompts to maximize cache stability: avoid dynamic content like timestamps, use consistent formatting, keep structure stable across sessions.\n\n### Context Partitioning\n\n**Sub-Agent Partitioning**\nThe most aggressive form of context optimization is partitioning work across sub-agents with isolated contexts. Each sub-agent operates in a clean context focused on its subtask without carrying accumulated context from other subtasks.\n\nThis approach achieves separation of concerns—the detailed search context remains isolated within sub-agents while the coordinator focuses on synthesis and analysis.\n\n**Result Aggregation**\nAggregate results from partitioned subtasks by validating all partitions completed, merging compatible results, and summarizing if still too large.\n\n### Budget Management\n\n**Context Budget Allocation**\nDesign explicit context budgets. Allocate tokens to categories: system prompt, tool definitions, retrieved docs, message history, and reserved buffer. Monitor usage against budget and trigger optimization when approaching limits.\n\n**Trigger-Based Optimization**\nMonitor signals for optimization triggers: token utilization above 80%, degradation indicators, and performance drops. Apply appropriate optimization techniques based on context composition.\n\n## Practical Guidance\n\n### Optimization Decision Framework\n\nWhen to optimize:\n- Context utilization exceeds 70%\n- Response quality degrades as conversations extend\n- Costs increase due to long contexts\n- Latency increases with conversation length\n\nWhat to apply:\n- Tool outputs dominate: observation masking\n- Retrieved documents dominate: summarization or partitioning\n- Message history dominates: compaction with summarization\n- Multiple components: combine strategies\n\n### Performance Considerations\n\nCompaction should achieve 50-70% token reduction with less than 5% quality degradation. Masking should achieve 60-80% reduction in masked observations. Cache optimization should achieve 70%+ hit rate for stable workloads.\n\nMonitor and iterate on optimization strategies based on measured effectiveness.\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example 1: Compaction Trigger**\n```python\nif context_tokens / context_limit > 0.8:\n    context = compact_context(context)\n```\n\n**Example 2: Observation Masking**\n```python\nif len(observation) > max_length:\n    ref_id = store_observation(observation)\n    return f\"[Obs:{ref_id} elided. Key: {extract_key(observation)}]\"\n```\n\n**Example 3: Cache-Friendly Ordering**\n```python\n# Stable content first\ncontext = [system_prompt, tool_definitions]  # Cacheable\ncontext += [reused_templates]  # Reusable\ncontext += [unique_content]  # Unique\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. Measure before optimizing—know your current state\n2. Apply compaction before masking when possible\n3. Design for cache stability with consistent prompts\n4. Partition before context becomes problematic\n5. Monitor optimization effectiveness over time\n6. Balance token savings against quality preservation\n7. Test optimization at production scale\n8. Implement graceful degradation for edge cases\n\n## Integration\n\nThis skill builds on context-fundamentals and context-degradation. It connects to:\n\n- multi-agent-patterns - Partitioning as isolation\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization effectiveness\n- memory-systems - Offloading context to memory\n\n## References\n\nInternal reference:\n- [Optimization Techniques Reference](./references/optimization_techniques.md) - Detailed technical reference\n\nRelated skills in this collection:\n- context-fundamentals - Context basics\n- context-degradation - Understanding when to optimize\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization\n\nExternal resources:\n- Research on context window limitations\n- KV-cache optimization techniques\n- Production engineering guides\n\n---\n\n## Skill Metadata\n\n**Created**: 2025-12-20\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-20\n**Author**: Agent Skills for Context Engineering Contributors\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:28:54.027Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing advanced context window management through compaction, masking, and caching strategies.","zh":"非常适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要高级的上下文窗口管理通过压缩、遮罩和缓存策略。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しています。これらのエージェントは、圧縮、遮蔽、キャッシング戦略を通じて高度なコンテキストウィンドウ管理を必要とします。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 이 에이전트들은 압축, 마스킹, 캐싱 전략을 통해 고급 컨텍스트 창 관리를 필요로 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan una gestión avanzada de la ventana de contexto a través de estrategias de compactación, enmascaramiento y almacenamiento en caché.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une gestion avancée de la fenêtre de contexte via des stratégies de compactage, de masquage et de mise en cache.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine erweiterte Kontextfensterverwaltung durch Komprimierungs-, Maskierungs- und Cachestrategien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de gerenciamento avançado de janela de contexto por meio de estratégias de compactação, mascaramento e cache.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуется продвинутый менеджмент контекстного окна через стратегии компактирования, маскирования и кэширования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات智能 اصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة لنسخة السياق من خلال استراتيجيات الضغط والتخفي والแคش."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to strategically compress, mask, and cache context data, effectively doubling or tripling the capacity of limited context windows through techniques like partitioning, thereby enhancing overall performance and efficiency in applications using OpenClaw, Gemini, and more.","zh":"赋予代理人战略性地压缩、遮罩和缓存上下文数据的能力，通过技术如分区，从而有效地将有限的上下文窗口的容量加倍或三倍，提高使用OpenClaw、Gemini等应用程序的整体性能和效率。","ja":"エージェントに戦略的にコンテキストデータを圧縮、遮蔽、キャッシュする能力を与え、パーティショニングなどの技術を使用して、制限付きのコンテキストウィンドウの容量を効果的に2倍または3倍にし、OpenClaw、Geminiなどのアプリケーションの全体的なパフォーマンスと効率を高めます。","ko":"에이전트에게 전략적으로 컨텍스트 데이터를 압축, 마스킹, 캐싱할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 분할과 같은 기술을 사용하여 제한된 컨텍스트 창의 용량을 효과적으로 2배 또는 3배로 늘리고, OpenClaw, Gemini와 같은 애플리케이션의 전체적인 성능과 효율성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes comprimir, enmascarar y almacenar en caché los datos de contexto de manera estratégica, lo que efectivamente duplica o triplica la capacidad de las ventanas de contexto limitadas a través de técnicas como la partición, mejorando así el rendimiento general y la eficiencia en aplicaciones que utilizan OpenClaw, Gemini y más.","fr":"Permet aux agents de compresser, de masquer et de mettre en cache les données de contexte de manière stratégique, ce qui double ou triple efficacement la capacité des fenêtres de contexte limitées via des techniques comme le partitionnement, améliorant ainsi les performances globales et l''efficacité dans les applications utilisant OpenClaw, Gemini et plus.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Kontextdaten strategisch zu komprimieren, zu maskieren und zu cachen, was die Kapazität begrenzter Kontextfenster effektiv verdoppelt oder verdreifacht durch Techniken wie Partitionierung, und verbessert so die Gesamtleistung und Effizienz in Anwendungen, die OpenClaw, Gemini und mehr verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a comprimir, mascarar e armazenar em cache os dados de contexto de forma estratégica, efetivamente dobrando ou triplicando a capacidade de janelas de contexto limitadas por meio de técnicas como particionamento, melhorando assim o desempenho geral e a eficiência em aplicações que usam OpenClaw, Gemini e mais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью стратегически сжимать, маскировать и кэшировать контекстные данные, эффективно удваивая или утраивая емкость ограниченных контекстных окон с помощью таких методов, как разделение, тем самым повышая общую производительность и эффективность в приложениях, использующих OpenClaw, Gemini и другие.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من ضغط البيانات السياقية وتخفيها وتخزينها في ذاكرة 캐ش بطريقة استراتيجية، وبالتالي تضاعف أو ثلاثة سعة نوافذ السياق المحدودة من خلال تقنيات مثل التقسيم، مما يعزز الأداء العام والكفاءة في التطبيقات التي تستخدم OpenClaw و Gemini وغيرها."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying compaction strategies to reduce context window size","Implementing masking techniques to focus on relevant context data","Utilizing caching to improve response times in context-dependent queries"],"zh":["应用压缩策略以减少上下文窗口大小","实施遮罩技术以关注相关上下文数据","利用缓存以提高上下文依赖性查询的响应时间"],"ja":["コンテキストウィンドウのサイズを減らすために圧縮戦略を適用する","関連するコンテキストデータに焦点を当てるためにマスキング技術を実装する","コンテキスト依存のクエリの応答時間を改善するためにキャッシングを利用する"],"ko":["컨텍스트 창 크기를 줄이기 위한 압축 전략을 적용하는 것","관련 컨텍스트 데이터에 초점을 맞추기 위한 마스킹 기술을 구현하는 것","컨텍스트 종속성 쿼리의 응답 시간을 개선하기 위한 캐싱을 활용하는 것"],"es":["Aplicar estrategias de compactación para reducir el tamaño de la ventana de contexto","Implementar técnicas de enmascaramiento para centrarse en los datos de contexto relevantes","Utilizar el almacenamiento en caché para mejorar los tiempos de respuesta en consultas dependientes del contexto"],"fr":["Appliquer des stratégies de compactage pour réduire la taille de la fenêtre de contexte","Mettre en œuvre des techniques de masquage pour se concentrer sur les données de contexte pertinentes","Utiliser la mise en cache pour améliorer les temps de réponse dans les requêtes dépendantes du contexte"],"de":["Komprimierungsstrategien anwenden, um die Größe des Kontextfensters zu reduzieren","Maskierungstechniken implementieren, um sich auf relevante Kontextdaten zu konzentrieren","Caching nutzen, um die Antwortzeiten in kontextabhängigen Abfragen zu verbessern"],"pt":["Aplicar estratégias de compactação para reduzir o tamanho da janela de contexto","Implementar técnicas de mascaramento para se concentrar em dados de contexto relevantes","Utilizar o cache para melhorar os tempos de resposta em consultas dependentes de contexto"],"ru":["Применение стратегий компактирования для уменьшения размера контекстного окна","Реализация методов маскирования для сосредоточения внимания на релевантных контекстных данных","Использование кэша для улучшения времени ответа в запросах, зависящих от контекста"],"ar":["تطبيق استراتيجيات الضغط لتقليل حجم نافذة السياق","تنفيذ تقنيات التخفي للتركيز على بيانات السياق ذات الصلة","استخدام الكاش لتحسين أوقات الاستجابة في الاستفسارات التابعة للسياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strategic planning for effective context optimization","Dependent on the capacity of the available context window","Optimization techniques may vary in effectiveness across different AI agent platforms"],"zh":["需要战略规划以有效地优化上下文","依赖于可用的上下文窗口的容量","优化技术可能会在不同的AI代理平台上具有不同的有效性"],"ja":["効果的なコンテキスト最適化のために戦略的な計画が必要","利用可能なコンテキストウィンドウの容量に依存する","最適化テクニックは、異なるAIエージェントプラットフォームで異なる有効性を持ちます"],"ko":["유효한 컨텍스트 최적화를 위한 전략적 계획이 필요함","사용 가능한 컨텍스트 창의 용량에 의존함","최적화 기법은 서로 다른 AI 에이전트 플랫폼에서 서로 다른 효율성을 가질 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una planificación estratégica para una optimización de contexto efectiva","Depende de la capacidad de la ventana de contexto disponible","Las técnicas de optimización pueden variar en eficacia en diferentes plataformas de agentes de IA"],"fr":["Nécessite une planification stratégique pour une optimisation de contexte efficace","Dépend de la capacité de la fenêtre de contexte disponible","Les techniques d''optimisation peuvent varier en efficacité sur différentes plates-formes d''agents d''IA"],"de":["Erfordert eine strategische Planung für eine effektive Kontextoptimierung","Hängt von der Kapazität des verfügbaren Kontextfensters ab","Optimierungstechniken können in ihrer Wirksamkeit auf verschiedenen KI-Agent-Plattformen variieren"],"pt":["Exige planejamento estratégico para otimização eficaz de contexto","Depende da capacidade da janela de contexto disponível","Técnicas de otimização podem variar em eficácia em diferentes plataformas de agentes de IA"],"ru":["Требует стратегического планирования для эффективной оптимизации контекста","Зависит от емкости доступного контекстного окна","Методы оптимизации могут различаться по эффективности на различных платформах агентов ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب التخطيط الاستراتيجي لتحسين السياق بشكل فعال","يعتمد على سعة نافذة السياق المتاحة","قد تختلف تقنيات التحسين في الفعالية عبر منصات عملاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المختلفة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"668e224aa8df85c378580794c9a5da8544e13d9a5a09d0eca46326cbc92badf0","qualityScore":60}');
