Produktivität für Entwickler","KI-Lösungen für die Datenverwaltung","Integration mit SQL-Entwicklungstools","Analyse und Optimierung von Skripten"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de SQL avançado","Otimização de consultas","Análise de desempenho","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplos bancos de dados"],"ru":["Расширенное развитие SQL","Оптимизация запросов","Анализ производительности","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких баз данных"],"ar":["تطوير SQL متقدم","تحسين الاستفسارات","تحليل الأداء","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير أخرى","دعم قواعد بيانات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","SQL脚本开发","digital-brain","如何使用digital-brain","digital-brain安装指南","SQL脚本开发最佳实践","digital-brain与其他AI工具的比较","digital-brain的优点和缺点"],"ja":["AIエージェント","SQLスクリプト開発","digital-brain","digital-brainの使い方","digital-brainのインストールガイド","SQLスクリプト開発のベストプラクティス","digital-brainと他のAIツールの比較","digital-brainの利点と欠点"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","SQL 스크립트 개발","digital-brain","digital-brain 사용법","digital-brain 설치 가이드","SQL 스크립트 개발最佳实践","digital-brain과 다른 AI 도구의 비교","digital-brain의 장단점"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de scripts SQL","mejora de la productividad","soluciones de inteligencia artificial","alternativas a digital-brain","cómo usar digital-brain","guias de instalación de digital-brain","configuración de digital-brain"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","développement de scripts SQL","amélioration de la productivité","solutions d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à digital-brain","comment utiliser digital-brain","guides d''installation de digital-brain","configuration de digital-brain"],"de":["KI-Tools","SQL-Skriptentwicklung","Steigerung der Produktivität","KI-Lösungen","Alternativen zu digital-brain","wie man digital-brain verwendet","Installationsanleitungen für digital-brain","Konfiguration von digital-brain"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento de sql","otimização de consultas","análise de desempenho","digital-brain alternative","como usar digital-brain","guia de instalação digital-brain","configuração digital-brain"],"ru":["ии агенты","разработка sql","оптимизация запросов","анализ производительности","digital-brain альтернатива","как использовать digital-brain","руководство по установке digital-brain","настройка digital-brain"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير sql","تحسين الاستفسارات","تحليل الأداء","بديل digital-brain","كيفية استخدام digital-brain","دليل تثبيت digital-brain","إعداد digital-brain"]}},"owner":"chenjiongwei","repo":"zjsy","repoPath":"chenjiongwei/zjsy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.848Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"digital-brain","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to write a post, check my voice, look up contact, prepare for meeting, weekly review, track goals, or mentions personal brand, content creation, network management, or voice consistency.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Digital Brain\n\nA structured personal operating system for managing digital presence, knowledge, relationships, and goals with AI assistance. Designed for founders building in public, content creators growing their audience, and tech-savvy professionals seeking AI-assisted personal management.\n\n**Important**: This skill uses progressive disclosure. Module-specific instructions are in each subdirectory''s `.md` file. Only load what''s needed for the current task.\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate thi","body":"# Digital Brain\n\nA structured personal operating system for managing digital presence, knowledge, relationships, and goals with AI assistance. Designed for founders building in public, content creators growing their audience, and tech-savvy professionals seeking AI-assisted personal management.\n\n**Important**: This skill uses progressive disclosure. Module-specific instructions are in each subdirectory''s `.md` file. Only load what''s needed for the current task.\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when the user:\n\n- Requests content creation (posts, threads, newsletters) - load identity/voice.md first\n- Asks for help with personal brand or positioning\n- Needs to look up or manage contacts/relationships\n- Wants to capture or develop content ideas\n- Requests meeting preparation or follow-up\n- Asks for weekly reviews or goal tracking\n- Needs to save or retrieve bookmarked resources\n- Wants to organize research or learning materials\n\n**Trigger phrases**: \"write a post\", \"my voice\", \"content ideas\", \"who is [name]\", \"prepare for meeting\", \"weekly review\", \"save this\", \"my goals\"\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Progressive Disclosure Architecture\n\nThe Digital Brain follows a three-level loading pattern:\n\n| Level | When Loaded | Content |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| **L1: Metadata** | Always | This SKILL.md overview |\n| **L2: Module Instructions** | On-demand | `[module]/[MODULE].md` files |\n| **L3: Data Files** | As-needed | `.jsonl`, `.yaml`, `.md` data |\n\n### File Format Strategy\n\nFormats chosen for optimal agent parsing:\n\n- **JSONL** (`.jsonl`): Append-only logs - ideas, posts, contacts, interactions\n- **YAML** (`.yaml`): Structured configs - goals, values, circles\n- **Markdown** (`.md`): Narrative content - voice, brand, calendar, todos\n- **XML** (`.xml`): Complex prompts - content generation templates\n\n### Append-Only Data Integrity\n\nJSONL files are **append-only**. Never delete entries:\n- Mark as `\"status\": \"archived\"` instead of deleting\n- Preserves history for pattern analysis\n- Enables \"what worked\" retrospectives\n\n## Detailed Topics\n\n### Module Overview\n\n```\ndigital-brain/\n├── identity/     → Voice, brand, values (READ FIRST for content)\n├── content/      → Ideas, drafts, posts, calendar\n├── knowledge/    → Bookmarks, research, learning\n├── network/      → Contacts, interactions, intros\n├── operations/   → Todos, goals, meetings, metrics\n└── agents/       → Automation scripts\n```\n\n### Identity Module (Critical for Content)\n\n**Always read `identity/voice.md` before generating any content.**\n\nContains:\n- `voice.md` - Tone, style, vocabulary, patterns\n- `brand.md` - Positioning, audience, content pillars\n- `values.yaml` - Core beliefs and principles\n- `bio-variants.md` - Platform-specific bios\n- `prompts/` - Reusable generation templates\n\n### Content Module\n\nPipeline: `ideas.jsonl` → `drafts/` → `posts.jsonl`\n\n- Capture ideas immediately to `ideas.jsonl`\n- Develop in `drafts/` using `templates/`\n- Log published content to `posts.jsonl` with metrics\n- Plan in `calendar.md`\n\n### Network Module\n\nPersonal CRM with relationship tiers:\n- `inner` - Weekly touchpoints\n- `active` - Bi-weekly touchpoints\n- `network` - Monthly touchpoints\n- `dormant` - Quarterly reactivation checks\n\n### Operations Module\n\nProductivity system with priority levels:\n- P0: Do today, blocking\n- P1: This week, important\n- P2: This month, valuable\n- P3: Backlog, nice to have\n\n## Practical Guidance\n\n### Content Creation Workflow\n\n```\n1. Read identity/voice.md (REQUIRED)\n2. Check identity/brand.md for topic alignment\n3. Reference content/posts.jsonl for successful patterns\n4. Use content/templates/ as starting structure\n5. Draft matching voice attributes\n6. Log to posts.jsonl after publishing\n```\n\n### Pre-Meeting Preparation\n\n```\n1. Look up contact: network/contacts.jsonl\n2. Get history: network/interactions.jsonl\n3. Check pending: operations/todos.md\n4. Generate brief with context\n```\n\n### Weekly Review Process\n\n```\n1. Run: python agents/scripts/weekly_review.py\n2. Review metrics in operations/metrics.jsonl\n3. Check stale contacts: agents/scripts/stale_contacts.py\n4. Update goals progress in operations/goals.yaml\n5. Plan next week in content/calendar.md\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example: Writing an X Post\n\n**Input**: \"Help me write a post about AI agents\"\n\n**Process**:\n1. Read `identity/voice.md` → Extract voice attributes\n2. Check `identity/brand.md` → Confirm \"ai_agents\" is a content pillar\n3. Reference `content/posts.jsonl` → Find similar successful posts\n4. Draft post matching voice patterns\n5. Suggest adding to `content/ideas.jsonl` if not publishing immediately\n\n**Output**: Post draft in user''s authentic voice with platform-appropriate format.\n\n### Example: Contact Lookup\n\n**Input**: \"Prepare me for my call with Sarah Chen\"\n\n**Process**:\n1. Search `network/contacts.jsonl` for \"Sarah Chen\"\n2. Get recent entries from `network/interactions.jsonl`\n3. Check `operations/todos.md` for pending items with Sarah\n4. Compile brief: role, context, last discussed, follow-ups\n\n**Output**: Pre-meeting brief with relationship context.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. **Voice First**: Always read `identity/voice.md` before any content generation\n2. **Append Only**: Never delete from JSONL files - archive instead\n3. **Update Timestamps**: Set `updated` field when modifying tracked data\n4. **Cross-Reference**: Knowledge informs content, network informs operations\n5. **Log Interactions**: Always log meetings/calls to `interactions.jsonl`\n6. **Preserve History**: Past content in `posts.jsonl` informs future performance\n\n## Integration\n\nThis skill integrates context engineering principles:\n\n- **context-fundamentals** - Progressive disclosure, attention budget management\n- **memory-systems** - JSONL for persistent memory, structured recall\n- **tool-design** - Scripts in `agents/scripts/` follow tool design principles\n- **context-optimization** - Module separation prevents context bloat\n\n## References\n\nInternal references:\n- [Identity Module](./identity/IDENTITY.md) - Voice and brand details\n- [Content Module](./content/CONTENT.md) - Content pipeline docs\n- [Network Module](./network/NETWORK.md) - CRM documentation\n- [Operations Module](./operations/OPERATIONS.md) - Productivity system\n- [Agent Scripts](./agents/AGENTS.md) - Automation documentation\n\nExternal resources:\n- [Agent Skills for Context Engineering](https://github.com/muratcankoylan/Agent-Skills-for-Context-Engineering)\n- [Anthropic Context Engineering Guide](https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-context-engineering-for-ai-agents)\n\n---\n\n## Skill Metadata\n\n**Created**: 2024-12-29\n**Last Updated**: 2024-12-29\n**Author**: Murat Can Koylan\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:49:22.975Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Founders and Content Creators needing a structured personal operating system with AI assistance for managing digital presence and knowledge","zh":"非常适合需要结构化个人操作系统的创始人和内容创作者，使用AI辅助来管理数字化存在和知识","ja":"創設者やコンテンツクリエイターが、デジタルな存在感や知識をAIの支援を受けて管理するために、構造化された個人オペレーティングシステムが必要な場合に最適","ko":"디지털 존재감과 지식을 AI로 지원하는 구조화된 개인 운영 체제가 필요한 창립자와 콘텐츠 크리에이터에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para fundadores y creadores de contenido que necesitan un sistema operativo personal estructurado con asistencia de inteligencia artificial para gestionar la presencia digital y el conocimiento","fr":"Idéal pour les fondateurs et les créateurs de contenu qui ont besoin d''un système d''exploitation personnel structuré avec une assistance d''intelligence artificielle pour gérer la présence numérique et les connaissances","de":"Perfekt für Gründer und Content-Ersteller, die ein strukturiertes persönliches Betriebssystem mit KI-Unterstützung zur Verwaltung von digitalem Auftritt und Wissen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Fundadores e Criadores de Conteúdo que precisam de um sistema operacional pessoal estruturado com assistência de IA para gerenciar presença digital e conhecimento","ru":"Идеально подходит для Основателей и Создателей Контента, которым нужна структурированная личная операционная система с помощью ИИ для управления цифровым присутствием и знаниями","ar":"مثالي للمؤسسين وواضعي المحتوى الذين يحتاجون إلى نظام تشغيل شخصي منظم مع مساعدة ذكاء اصطناعي لادارة الحضور الرقمي والمعرفة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage digital presence, knowledge, relationships, and goals using SQL scripts and AI assistance, leveraging progressive disclosure for efficient task management and module-specific instructions","zh":"赋予代理人使用SQL脚本和AI辅助来管理数字化存在感、知识、关系和目标的能力，利用渐进式披露来实现高效的任务管理和特定模块的指令","ja":"SQLスクリプトとAIの支援を使用してデジタルな存在感、知識、関係、目標を管理するエージェントを権限付与し、効率的なタスク管理とモジュール固有の指示を実現するため逐次的な開示を利用","ko":"SQL 스크립트와 AI 지원을 사용하여 디지털 존재감, 지식, 관계, 목표를 관리할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고, 효율적인 작업 관리와 모듈별 지침을 위한 점진적 공개를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar la presencia digital, el conocimiento, las relaciones y los objetivos utilizando scripts SQL y asistencia de inteligencia artificial, aprovechando la divulgación progresiva para una gestión de tareas eficiente y instrucciones específicas de módulo","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer la présence numérique, les connaissances, les relations et les objectifs en utilisant des scripts SQL et une assistance d''intelligence artificielle, en exploitant la divulgation progressive pour une gestion de tâches efficace et des instructions spécifiques au module","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, digitale Präsenz, Wissen, Beziehungen und Ziele mithilfe von SQL-Skripten und KI-Unterstützung zu verwalten, indem progressive Offenlegung für effizientes Task-Management und modulspezifische Anweisungen genutzt wird","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerenciar presença digital, conhecimento, relacionamentos e metas usando scripts SQL e assistência de IA, aproveitando a divulgação progressiva para gerenciamento de tarefas eficiente e instruções específicas de módulo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять цифровым присутствием, знаниями, отношениями и целями с помощью скриптов SQL и помощи ИИ, используя постепенное раскрытие для эффективного управления задачами и инструкций, специфичных для модуля","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة الحضور الرقمي والمعرفة والعلاقات والأهداف باستخدام سكريبتات SQL ومساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي، واستخدام الإفصاح التدريجي لإدارة المهام الفعالة والتعليمات المحددة للمكون الإضافي"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating digital presence management","Generating knowledge graphs with SQL scripts","Debugging relationship networks with AI assistance"],"zh":["自动化数字化存在感管理","使用SQL脚本生成知识图","使用AI辅助调试关系网络"],"ja":["デジタルな存在感管理の自動化","SQLスクリプトを使用して知識グラフを生成","AIの支援を使用して関係ネットワークをデバッグ"],"ko":["디지털 존재감 관리 자동화","SQL 스크립트를 사용하여 지식 그래프 생성","AI 지원을 사용하여 관계 네트워크 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de la presencia digital","Generación de gráficos de conocimiento con scripts SQL","Depuración de redes de relaciones con asistencia de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion de la présence numérique","Génération de graphiques de connaissances avec des scripts SQL","Débogage de réseaux de relations avec une assistance d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Automatisierung der Verwaltung von digitalem Auftritt","Generierung von Wissensgraphen mit SQL-Skripten","Fehlerbehebung von Beziehungsnetzwerken mit KI-Unterstützung"],"pt":["Automating digital presence management","Generating knowledge graphs with SQL scripts","Debugging relationship networks with AI assistance"],"ru":["Автоматизация управления цифровым присутствием","Генерация графов знаний с помощью скриптов SQL","Отладка сетей отношений с помощью помощи ИИ"],"ar":["تأتميم إدارة الحضور الرقمي","генерация رسوم المعرفة باستخدام سكريبتات SQL","تصحيح شبكات العلاقات بمساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires module-specific instructions in each subdirectory''s .md file","Designed for founders building in public, content creators, and tech-savvy professionals"],"zh":["需要每个子目录的.md文件中包含特定模块的指令","仅适用于公开建设的创始人、内容创作者和技术专业人士"],"ja":["各サブディレクトリの.mdファイルにモジュール固有の指示を含める必要がある","公開で構築している創設者、コンテンツクリエイター、テクノロジー専門家のみに対応"],"ko":["각 하위 디렉토리의 .md 파일에 모듈별 지침을 포함해야 함","공개적으로 구축하는 창립자, 콘텐츠 크리에이터 및 기술 전문가만 해당"],"es":["Requiere instrucciones específicas de módulo en cada archivo .md del subdirectorio","Diseñado para fundadores que construyen en público, creadores de contenido y profesionales con conocimientos técnicos"],"fr":["Nécessite des instructions spécifiques au module dans chaque fichier .md du sous-répertoire","Conçu pour les fondateurs qui construisent en public, les créateurs de contenu et les professionnels ayant des connaissances techniques"],"de":["Benötigt modulspezifische Anweisungen in jeder .md-Datei des Unterordners","Entworfen für Gründer, die öffentlich aufbauen, Content-Ersteller und technisch affine Fachleute"],"pt":["Requer instruções específicas de módulo em cada arquivo .md do subdiretório","Projetado para fundadores que constroem em público, criadores de conteúdo e profissionais tecnicamente qualificados"],"ru":["Требует модульных инструкций в каждом файле .md подкаталога","Предназначен для основателей, строящих публично, создателей контента и технически грамотных специалистов"],"ar":["يتطلب تعليمات محددة للمكون الإضافي في كل ملف .md من المجلد الفرعي","مصمم للمؤسسين الذين يبنيون علنا، وواضعي المحتوى والمختصين الفنيين المهرة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"39ed6cd20dd787b6c71397aa0f75619887ed774c0fd390439d8e535f54bb3544","qualityScore":60}');
