戏化","社交学习","FastAPI、React、PostgreSQL和Docker构建"],"ja":["7つのAIエージェント","適応学習","安全なコード実行","ゲーム化","ソーシャルラーニング","FastAPI、React、PostgreSQL、Dockerで構築"],"ko":["7개의 AI 에이전트","적응형 학습","보안 코드 실행","게임화","사회적 학습","FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL, Docker로 구축"],"es":["7 agentes de IA para educación personalizada","Aprendizaje adaptativo","Ejecución de código seguro","Gamificación","Aprendizaje social","Desarrollado con FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL y Docker"],"fr":["7 agents IA pour l''éducation personnalisée","Apprentissage adaptatif","Exécution de code sécurisée","Gamification","Apprentissage social","Développé avec FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL et Docker"],"de":["7 KI-Agents für personalisierte Bildung","Adaptives Lernen","Sichere Code-Ausführung","Gamification","Soziales Lernen","Entwickelt mit FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL und Docker"],"pt":["7 agentes de IA para aprendizado personalizado","Aprendizado adaptativo","Execução de código seguro","Gamificação","Aprendizado social","Desenvolvido com FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL e Docker"],"ru":["7 ИИ агентов для персонализированного обучения","Адаптивное обучение","Безопасная ejecução кода","Геймификация","Социальное обучение","Разработано с FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL и Docker"],"ar":["7 وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للتعليم الشخصي","التعلم التكيفي","تنفيذ kode آمن","لامثيل","التعلم الاجتماعي","تم تطويره مع FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL و Docker"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","个性化编码教育","FastAPI","React","PostgreSQL","Docker","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","個別化コーディング教育","FastAPI","React","PostgreSQL","Docker","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","개인화된 코딩 교육","FastAPI","React","PostgreSQL","Docker","AI 에이전트를 사용하는 방법","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de IA","qué es un agente de IA","herramientas de agentes de IA","alternativas a los agentes de IA","agentes de IA vs herramientas de codificación","instalación de agentes de IA","guía de configuración de agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","outils d''agents IA","alternatives aux agents IA","agents IA vs outils de codage","installation des agents IA","guide de configuration des agents IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","KI-Agenten-Tools","Alternativen zu KI-Agenten","KI-Agents vs Codier-Tools","Installation von KI-Agenten","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Agents"],"pt":["como usar agentes de IA","o que são agentes de IA","alternativas para agentes de IA","agentes de IA vs outros ferramentas","instalar agentes de IA","guia de configuração de agentes de IA","desenvolvimento de agentes de IA","aprendizado de codificação com agentes de IA"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агенты","что такое ИИ агенты","альтернативы ИИ агентам","ИИ агенты vs другие инструменты","установка ИИ агентов","руководство по настройке ИИ агентов","разработка ИИ агентов","обучение кодированию с ИИ агентами"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديلات لأدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي vs أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تعلم البرمجة مع أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"khushparag","repo":"agentic_learning_coach","repoPath":"khushparag/agentic_learning_coach","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.874Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"browser-use","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with browser-use CLI\n\nThe `browser-use` command provides fast, persistent browser automation. It maintains browser sessions across commands, enabling complex multi-step workflows.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Run without installing (recommended for one-off use)\nuvx browser-use[cli] open https://example.com\n\n# Or install permanently\nuv pip install browser-use[cli]\n\n# Install browser dependencies (Chromium)\nbrowser-use install\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nbrowser-use open https","body":"# Browser Automation with browser-use CLI\n\nThe `browser-use` command provides fast, persistent browser automation. It maintains browser sessions across commands, enabling complex multi-step workflows.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Run without installing (recommended for one-off use)\nuvx browser-use[cli] open https://example.com\n\n# Or install permanently\nuv pip install browser-use[cli]\n\n# Install browser dependencies (Chromium)\nbrowser-use install\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nbrowser-use open https://example.com           # Navigate to URL\nbrowser-use state                              # Get page elements with indices\nbrowser-use click 5                            # Click element by index\nbrowser-use type \"Hello World\"                 # Type text\nbrowser-use screenshot                         # Take screenshot\nbrowser-use close                              # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Navigate**: `browser-use open <url>` - Opens URL (starts browser if needed)\n2. **Inspect**: `browser-use state` - Returns clickable elements with indices\n3. **Interact**: Use indices from state to interact (`browser-use click 5`, `browser-use input 3 \"text\"`)\n4. **Verify**: `browser-use state` or `browser-use screenshot` to confirm actions\n5. **Repeat**: Browser stays open between commands\n\n## Browser Modes\n\n```bash\nbrowser-use --browser chromium open <url>      # Default: headless Chromium\nbrowser-use --browser chromium --headed open <url>  # Visible Chromium window\nbrowser-use --browser real open <url>          # User''s Chrome with login sessions\nbrowser-use --browser remote open <url>        # Cloud browser (requires API key)\n```\n\n- **chromium**: Fast, isolated, headless by default\n- **real**: Uses your Chrome with cookies, extensions, logged-in sessions\n- **remote**: Cloud-hosted browser with proxy support (requires BROWSER_USE_API_KEY)\n\n## Commands\n\n### Navigation\n```bash\nbrowser-use open <url>                    # Navigate to URL\nbrowser-use back                          # Go back in history\nbrowser-use scroll down                   # Scroll down\nbrowser-use scroll up                     # Scroll up\n```\n\n### Page State\n```bash\nbrowser-use state                         # Get URL, title, and clickable elements\nbrowser-use screenshot                    # Take screenshot (outputs base64)\nbrowser-use screenshot path.png           # Save screenshot to file\nbrowser-use screenshot --full path.png    # Full page screenshot\n```\n\n### Interactions (use indices from `browser-use state`)\n```bash\nbrowser-use click <index>                 # Click element\nbrowser-use type \"text\"                   # Type text into focused element\nbrowser-use input <index> \"text\"          # Click element, then type text\nbrowser-use keys \"Enter\"                  # Send keyboard keys\nbrowser-use keys \"Control+a\"              # Send key combination\nbrowser-use select <index> \"option\"       # Select dropdown option\n```\n\n### Tab Management\n```bash\nbrowser-use switch <tab>                  # Switch to tab by index\nbrowser-use close-tab                     # Close current tab\nbrowser-use close-tab <tab>               # Close specific tab\n```\n\n### JavaScript & Data\n```bash\nbrowser-use eval \"document.title\"         # Execute JavaScript, return result\nbrowser-use extract \"all product prices\"  # Extract data using LLM (requires API key)\n```\n\n### Python Execution (Persistent Session)\n```bash\nbrowser-use python \"x = 42\"               # Set variable\nbrowser-use python \"print(x)\"             # Access variable (outputs: 42)\nbrowser-use python \"print(browser.url)\"   # Access browser object\nbrowser-use python --vars                 # Show defined variables\nbrowser-use python --reset                # Clear Python namespace\nbrowser-use python --file script.py       # Execute Python file\n```\n\nThe Python session maintains state across commands. The `browser` object provides:\n- `browser.url` - Current page URL\n- `browser.title` - Page title\n- `browser.goto(url)` - Navigate\n- `browser.click(index)` - Click element\n- `browser.type(text)` - Type text\n- `browser.screenshot(path)` - Take screenshot\n- `browser.scroll()` - Scroll page\n- `browser.html` - Get page HTML\n\n### Agent Tasks (Requires API Key)\n```bash\nbrowser-use run \"Fill the contact form with test data\"    # Run AI agent\nbrowser-use run \"Extract all product prices\" --max-steps 50\n```\n\nAgent tasks use an LLM to autonomously complete complex browser tasks. Requires `BROWSER_USE_API_KEY` or configured LLM API key (OPENAI_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, etc).\n\n### Session Management\n```bash\nbrowser-use sessions                      # List active sessions\nbrowser-use close                         # Close current session\nbrowser-use close --all                   # Close all sessions\n```\n\n### Server Control\n```bash\nbrowser-use server status                 # Check if server is running\nbrowser-use server stop                   # Stop server\nbrowser-use server logs                   # View server logs\n```\n\n### Setup\n```bash\nbrowser-use install                       # Install Chromium and system dependencies\n```\n\n## Global Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--session NAME` | Use named session (default: \"default\") |\n| `--browser MODE` | Browser mode: chromium, real, remote |\n| `--headed` | Show browser window (chromium mode) |\n| `--profile NAME` | Chrome profile (real mode only) |\n| `--json` | Output as JSON |\n| `--api-key KEY` | Override API key |\n\n**Session behavior**: All commands without `--session` use the same \"default\" session. The browser stays open and is reused across commands. Use `--session NAME` to run multiple browsers in parallel.\n\n## API Key Configuration\n\nSome features (`run`, `extract`, `--browser remote`) require an API key. The CLI checks these locations in order:\n\n1. `--api-key` command line flag\n2. `BROWSER_USE_API_KEY` environment variable\n3. `~/.config/browser-use/config.json` file\n\nTo configure permanently:\n```bash\nmkdir -p ~/.config/browser-use\necho ''{\"api_key\": \"your-key-here\"}'' > ~/.config/browser-use/config.json\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Form Submission\n```bash\nbrowser-use open https://example.com/contact\nbrowser-use state\n# Shows: [0] input \"Name\", [1] input \"Email\", [2] textarea \"Message\", [3] button \"Submit\"\nbrowser-use input 0 \"John Doe\"\nbrowser-use input 1 \"john@example.com\"\nbrowser-use input 2 \"Hello, this is a test message.\"\nbrowser-use click 3\nbrowser-use state  # Verify success\n```\n\n### Multi-Session Workflows\n```bash\nbrowser-use --session work open https://work.example.com\nbrowser-use --session personal open https://personal.example.com\nbrowser-use --session work state    # Check work session\nbrowser-use --session personal state  # Check personal session\nbrowser-use close --all             # Close both sessions\n```\n\n### Data Extraction with Python\n```bash\nbrowser-use open https://example.com/products\nbrowser-use python \"\nproducts = []\nfor i in range(20):\n    browser.scroll(''down'')\nbrowser.screenshot(''products.png'')\n\"\nbrowser-use python \"print(f''Captured {len(products)} products'')\"\n```\n\n### Using Real Browser (Logged-In Sessions)\n```bash\nbrowser-use --browser real open https://gmail.com\n# Uses your actual Chrome with existing login sessions\nbrowser-use state  # Already logged in!\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Always run `browser-use state` first** to see available elements and their indices\n2. **Use `--headed` for debugging** to see what the browser is doing\n3. **Sessions persist** - the browser stays open between commands\n4. **Use `--json` for parsing** output programmatically\n5. **Python variables persist** across `browser-use python` commands within a session\n6. **Real browser mode** preserves your login sessions and extensions\n7. **CLI aliases**: `bu`, `browser`, and `browseruse` all work identically to `browser-use`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Browser won''t start?**\n```bash\nbrowser-use install                   # Install/reinstall Chromium\nbrowser-use server stop               # Stop any stuck server\nbrowser-use --headed open <url>       # Try with visible window\n```\n\n**Element not found?**\n```bash\nbrowser-use state                     # Check current elements\nbrowser-use scroll down               # Element might be below fold\nbrowser-use state                     # Check again\n```\n\n**Session issues?**\n```bash\nbrowser-use sessions                  # Check active sessions\nbrowser-use close --all               # Clean slate\nbrowser-use open <url>                # Fresh start\n```\n\n## Cleanup\n\n**Always close the browser when done.** Run this after completing browser automation:\n\n```bash\nbrowser-use close\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:51:42.281Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring persistent browser sessions and multi-step workflow capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要持久浏览器会话和多步骤工作流能力的自动化代理。","ja":"永続的なブラウザセッションとマルチステップのワークフロー機能を必要とする自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"지속적인 브라우저 세션과 다중 단계 워크플로우 능력이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización que requieren sesiones de navegador persistentes y capacidades de flujo de trabajo multietapa.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant des sessions de navigateur persistantes et des capacités de workflow multietapa.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die persistente Browser-Sitzungen und Multischritt-Workflow-Fähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que exigem sessões de navegador persistentes e capacidades de fluxo de trabalho de vários passos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, требующих постоянных сессий браузера и возможностей многэтапного рабочего процесса.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التخصيص الذي يتطلب جلسات متصفح متواصلة وقدرات سير عمل متعددة الخطوات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate complex browser interactions using FastAPI and Docker, while maintaining sessions across commands with the browser-use CLI, enabling seamless execution of workflows involving Chromium browser dependencies.","zh":"通过FastAPI和Docker赋予代理自动化复杂浏览器交互的能力，同时使用浏览器使用CLI维持命令之间的会话，实现涉及Chromium浏览器依赖项的工作流的无缝执行。","ja":"FastAPIとDockerを使用して、エージェントに複雑なブラウザーの相互作用を自動化する能力を与え、ブラウザ使用CLIを使用してコマンド間のセッションを維持し、Chromiumブラウザーの依存関係を含むワークフローのシームレスな実行を可能にします。","ko":"FastAPI와 Docker를 사용하여 에이전트가 복잡한 브라우저 상호 작용을 자동화하도록 하며, 브라우저 사용 CLI를 사용하여 명령 사이의 세션을 유지하여 Chromium 브라우저 종속성을 포함하는 워크플로우의 무중단 실행을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para automatizar interacciones de navegador complejas utilizando FastAPI y Docker, manteniendo sesiones a través de comandos con la CLI browser-use, lo que permite la ejecución sin problemas de flujos de trabajo que involucran dependencias del navegador Chromium.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser des interactions de navigateur complexes en utilisant FastAPI et Docker, tout en maintenant les sessions à travers les commandes avec la CLI browser-use, ce qui permet l''exécution sans problème de flux de travail impliquant des dépendances de navigateur Chromium.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Browser-Interaktionen mit FastAPI und Docker zu automatisieren, während Sitzungen über Befehle mit der browser-use-CLI aufrechterhalten werden, was eine reibungslose Ausführung von Workflows ermöglicht, die Chromium-Browser-Abhängigkeiten beinhalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações complexas de navegador usando FastAPI e Docker, mantendo sessões ao longo dos comandos com o CLI browser-use, permitindo a execução sem problemas de fluxos de trabalho que envolvem dependências do navegador Chromium.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать сложные взаимодействия браузера с помощью FastAPI и Docker, сохраняя сессии на протяжении команд с помощью CLI browser-use, обеспечивая бесперебойную выполнение рабочих процессов, включающих зависимости браузера Chromium.","ar":"يعزز الوكيل القدرة على تحويل التفاعلات المعقدة للمتصفح إلى تطبيق تلقائي باستخدام FastAPI و Docker، مع الحفاظ على الجلسات عبر الأوامر باستخدام CLI browser-use، وتمكين تنفيذ سلاسل العمل دون انقطاع التي تتضمن اعتماديات متصفح Chromium."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating multi-step browser workflows","Debugging browser-based applications with persistent sessions","Generating browser automation scripts for Chromium"],"zh":["自动化多步骤浏览器工作流","使用持久会话调试基于浏览器的应用程序","为Chromium生成浏览器自动化脚本"],"ja":["マルチステップブラウザワークフローを自動化する","永続的なセッションを使用してブラウザーベースのアプリケーションをデバッグする","Chromium用のブラウザ自動化スクリプトを生成する"],"ko":["다중 단계 브라우저 워크플로우 자동화","지속적인 세션을 사용하여 브라우저 기반 애플리케이션 디버깅","Chromium을 위한 브라우저 자동화 스크립트 생성"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de navegador multietapa","Depuración de aplicaciones basadas en navegador con sesiones persistentes","Generación de scripts de automatización de navegador para Chromium"],"fr":["Automatisation de flux de travail de navigateur multietapa","Débogage d''applications basées sur navigateur avec sessions persistantes","Génération de scripts d''automatisation de navigateur pour Chromium"],"de":["Automatisierung von Browser-Workflows mit mehreren Schritten","Fehlerbehebung bei browserbasierten Anwendungen mit persistenten Sitzungen","Generierung von Browser-Automatisierungsskripten für Chromium"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de navegador de vários passos","Depurar aplicações baseadas em navegador com sessões persistentes","Gerar scripts de automação de navegador para Chromium"],"ru":["Автоматизация многэтапных рабочих процессов браузера","Отладка приложений на основе браузера с постоянными сессиями","Генерация скриптов автоматизации браузера для Chromium"],"ar":["تخصيص سلاسل العمل المتعددة الخطوات للمتصفح","تصحيح الأعطال لتطبيقات المتصفح التي تعتمد على الجلسات المتواصلة","إنشاء نصوص برمجية لتحويل المتصفح تلقائيًا لبرنامج Chromium"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of browser dependencies (Chromium)","Dependent on uvx and pip for installation and execution"],"zh":["需要安装浏览器依赖项（Chromium）","依赖于uvx和pip进行安装和执行"],"ja":["ブラウザーの依存関係（Chromium）のインストールが必要","インストールと実行にはuvxとpipに依存する"],"ko":["브라우저 종속성（Chromium） 설치 필요","설치 및 실행에는 uvx 및 pip에 종속"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de dependencias de navegador (Chromium)","Dependiente de uvx y pip para la instalación y ejecución"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de dépendances de navigateur (Chromium)","Dépend de uvx et pip pour l''installation et l''exécution"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Browser-Abhängigkeiten (Chromium)","Abhängig von uvx und pip für Installation und Ausführung"],"pt":["Exige a instalação de dependências de navegador (Chromium)","Depende de uvx e pip para instalação e execução"],"ru":["Требует установки зависимостей браузера (Chromium)","Зависит от uvx и pip для установки и выполнения"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت зависимости المتصفح (Chromium)","يعتمد على uvx و pip من أجل التثبيت والتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"44c7977eaa481427ddbeb7f84d72e36b06d457901cb195f4d9d90a8846bae5a8","qualityScore":60}');
