tion은 유연하고 강력한 Python 패키지로 MLOps 프로젝트를 시작하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"MLOps Validation es un paquete de Python flexible y robusto para iniciar tus iniciativas de MLOps","fr":"MLOps Validation est un package Python flexible et robuste pour lancer vos initiatives MLOps","de":"MLOps Validation ist ein flexibles und robustes Python-Paket, um Ihre MLOps-Initiativen zu starten","pt":"O MLOps Validation é um pacote Python flexível e robusto para iniciar sua iniciativa de MLOps de forma produtiva","ru":"MLOps Validation - это гибкий и надежный пакет Python для запуска вашей инициативы MLOps","ar":"تحقق MLOps هو حزمة بايثون مرنة وقوية لبدء مبادرة MLOps بكفاءة","en":"Kickstart your MLOps initiative with a flexible, robust, and productive Python package."},"definition":{"en":"Kickstart your MLOps initiative with a flexible, robust, and productive Python package."},"features":{"zh":["灵活的Python包","强大的MLOps功能","提高生产力","易于使用","高性能"],"ja":["柔軟なPythonパッケージ","強力なMLOps機能","生産性の向上","使いやすさ","高パフォーマンス"],"ko":["유연한 Python 패키지","강력한 MLOps 기능","생산성 향상","쉽게 사용","고성능"],"es":["Paquete de Python para MLOps","Validación y mejora de operaciones de machine learning","Flexible y robusto","Productivo y eficiente","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Package Python pour MLOps","Validation et amélioration des opérations de machine learning","Flexible et robuste","Productif et efficace","Intégration avec les outils de développement"],"de":["Python-Paket für MLOps","Validierung und Verbesserung von Machine-Learning-Operationen","Flexibel und robust","Produktiv und effizient","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Pacote Python flexível e robusto","Iniciação de MLOps de forma produtiva","Validação de operações de aprendizado de máquina","Integração com outras ferramentas de IA","Suporte a desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Гибкий и надежный пакет Python","Запуск MLOps с гибкостью и надежностью","Валидация операций машинного обучения","Интеграция с другими инструментами ИИ","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["حزمة بايثون مرنة وقوية","بدء مبادرة MLOps بكفاءة","تحقق من عمليات التعلم الآلي","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","دعم المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MLOps工具","AI智能工具","Python包","机器学习模型","模型验证","MLOps Validation安装","MLOps Validation教程","MLOps Validation替代品"],"ja":["MLOpsツール","AIエージェント","Pythonパッケージ","機械学習モデル","モデル検証","MLOps Validationのインストール","MLOps Validationのチュートリアル","MLOps Validationの代替"],"ko":["MLOps 도구","AI 에이전트","Python 패키지","기계 학습 모델","모델 검증","MLOps Validation 설치","MLOps Validation 사용법","MLOps Validation 대안"],"es":["herramientas de AI","MLOps Validation","paquete de Python","operaciones de machine learning","validación y mejora","cómo usar MLOps","MLOps alternativa","MLOps vs otras herramientas","instalación de MLOps","guía de configuración de MLOps"],"fr":["outils d''IA","MLOps Validation","package Python","opérations de machine learning","validation et amélioration","comment utiliser MLOps","MLOps alternative","MLOps vs autres outils","installation de MLOps","guide de configuration de MLOps"],"de":["KI-Tools","MLOps Validation","Python-Paket","Machine-Learning-Operationen","Validierung und Verbesserung","wie man MLOps verwendet","MLOps-Alternative","MLOps vs andere Tools","Installation von MLOps","Konfigurationsanleitung für MLOps"],"pt":["como usar MLOps Validation","o que é MLOps","ferramentas de IA para MLOps","MLOps Validation alternativa","MLOps Validation vs outras ferramentas","instalar MLOps Validation","guia de configuração do MLOps Validation"],"ru":["как использовать MLOps Validation","что такое MLOps","инструменты ИИ для MLOps","альтернативы MLOps Validation","MLOps Validation vs другие инструменты","установка MLOps Validation","руководство по настройке MLOps Validation"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام تحقق MLOps","ما هو تحقق MLOps","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحقق MLOps","بديل تحقق MLOps","تحقق MLOps مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت تحقق MLOps","دليل إعداد تحقق MLOps"]}},"owner":"fmind","repo":"mlops-python-package","repoPath":"fmind/mlops-python-package","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.889Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"MLOps Validation","description":"Guide to implement rigorous validation layers including static analysis, automated testing, structured logging, and security scanning.","bodyPreview":"# MLOps Validation\n\n## Goal\n\nTo ensure software quality, reliability, and security through automated validation layers. This skill enforces **Strict Typing** (`ty`), **Unified Linting** (`ruff`), **Comprehensive Testing** (`pytest`), and **Structured Logging** (`loguru`).\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- **Language**: Python\n- **Manager**: `uv`\n- **Context**: Ensuring code quality before merge/deploy.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Static Analysis (Typing & Linting)\n\nCatch errors before they run.\n\n1. **Typing**:","body":"# MLOps Validation\n\n## Goal\n\nTo ensure software quality, reliability, and security through automated validation layers. This skill enforces **Strict Typing** (`ty`), **Unified Linting** (`ruff`), **Comprehensive Testing** (`pytest`), and **Structured Logging** (`loguru`).\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- **Language**: Python\n- **Manager**: `uv`\n- **Context**: Ensuring code quality before merge/deploy.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Static Analysis (Typing & Linting)\n\nCatch errors before they run.\n\n1. **Typing**:\n    - **Tool**: `ty`.\n    - **Rule**: No `Any` (unless absolutely necessary). Fully typed function signatures.\n    - **DataFrames**: Use `pandera` schemas to validate DataFrame structures/types.\n    - **Classes**: Use `pydantic` for data modeling and runtime validation.\n2. **Linting & Formatting**:\n    - **Tool**: `ruff` (replaces black, isort, pylint, flake8).\n    - **Rule**: Zero tolerance for linter errors. Use `noqa` sparingly and with justification.\n    - **Config**: Centralize in `pyproject.toml`.\n\n### 2. Testing Strategy\n\nVerify behavior and prevent regressions.\n\n1. **Tool**: `pytest`.\n2. **Structure**: Mirror `src/` in `tests/`.\n\n    ```text\n    src/pkg/mod.py -> tests/test_mod.py\n    ```\n\n3. **Fixtures**: Use `tests/conftest.py` for shared setup (mock data, temp paths).\n4. **Coverage**: Aim for high coverage (>80%) on core business logic. Use `pytest-cov`.\n5. **Pattern**: Use **Given-When-Then** in comments.\n\n    ```python\n    def test_pipeline_execution(input_data):\n        # Given: Valid input data\n        # When: The pipeline processes the data\n        # Then: The output content matches expectations\n    ```\n\n### 3. Structured Logging\n\nEnable observability and debugging.\n\n1. **Tool**: `loguru` (replacing stdlib `logging`).\n2. **Format**: Use structured logging (JSON) in production for queryability.\n3. **Levels**:\n    - `DEBUG`: Low-level tracing (payloads, internal state).\n    - `INFO`: Key business events (Job started, Model saved).\n    - `ERROR`: Actionable failures (with stack traces).\n4. **Context**: Include context (Job ID, Model Version) in logs.\n\n### 4. Security\n\nProtect the supply chain and runtime.\n\n1. **Dependencies**: Use `GitHub Dependabot` to patch vulnerable packages.\n2. **Code Scanning**: Run `bandit` to detect hardcoded secrets or unsafe patterns (e.g., `eval`, `yaml.load`).\n3. **Secrets**: **NEVER** log secrets. Sanitize outputs.\n\n## Self-Correction Checklist\n\n- [ ] **Type Safety**: Does `ty` pass without errors?\n- [ ] **Lint Cleanliness**: Does `ruff check` pass?\n- [ ] **Test Discovery**: Does `pytest` successfully find modules in `src/`?\n- [ ] **Log Format**: Are production logs serializing to JSON?\n- [ ] **Security**: Has `bandit` scanned the codebase?\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:54:24.506Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing robust code validation and testing through typing, linting, and logging.","zh":"非常适合需要通过类型检查、linting和日志记录进行强大的代码验证和测试的Python分析代理。","ja":"Pythonの分析エージェントに強力なコードの検証とテストが必要な場合に最適です。タイプのチェック、linting、およびログ記録を通じて。","ko":"타입 검사, 린팅 및 로깅을 통해 강력한 코드 검증 및 테스트가 필요한 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan una validación y prueba de código robustas a través de la tipificación, el linting y la registrazione.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python nécessitant une validation et des tests de code robustes via la typage, le linting et la journalisation.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die eine robuste Codevalidierung und -testing durch Typisierung, Linting und Logging benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Python Analysis Agents que precisam de validação de código robusta e testes por meio de tipagem, linting e logging.","ru":"Идеально для Python Analysis Agents, которым требуется надежная проверка кода и тестирование через типизацию, linting и логирование.","ar":"يُفضل Python Analysis Agents الذين يحتاجون إلى اختبار وتصحيح رمز قوي من خلال التوصيل، linting والتسجيل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce strict typing with `ty`, unified linting with `ruff`, comprehensive testing with `pytest`, and structured logging with `loguru`, ensuring high-quality code before deployment.","zh":"赋予代理执行严格的类型检查，统一的linting，全面测试和结构化日志记录，确保在部署之前具有高质量的代码。","ja":"`ty`を使用した厳格な型チェック、`ruff`を使用した統一されたlinting、`pytest`を使用した包括的なテスト、および`loguru`を使用した構造化ログ記録により、エージェントはデプロイ前に高品質のコードを保証できます。","ko":"`ty`를 사용한 엄격한 유형 검사, `ruff`를 사용한統一된 린팅, `pytest`를 사용한 포괄적인 테스트 및 `loguru`를 사용한 구조화 로깅을 통해 에이전트는 배포 전에 고품질 코드를 보장할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar una tipificación estricta con `ty`, un linting unificado con `ruff`, pruebas integrales con `pytest` y una registrazione estructurada con `loguru`, garantizando un código de alta calidad antes de la implementación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer une typage stricte avec `ty`, un linting unifié avec `ruff`, des tests complets avec `pytest` et une journalisation structurée avec `loguru`, garantissant un code de haute qualité avant le déploiement.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine strenge Typisierung mit `ty`, ein einheitliches Linting mit `ruff`, umfassende Tests mit `pytest` und eine strukturierte Protokollierung mit `loguru` durchzuführen, um einen hochwertigen Code vor der Bereitstellung sicherzustellen.","pt":"Empodera os agentes a impor tipagem estrita com `ty`, linting unificado com `ruff`, testes abrangentes com `pytest` e registro estruturado com `loguru`, garantindo código de alta qualidade antes do deploy.","ru":"Направляет агентов на то, чтобы они обеспечивали строгую типизацию с `ty`, унифицированный linting с `ruff`, всесторонние тесты с `pytest` и структурированный лог с `loguru`, гарантируя высококачественный код перед развертыванием.","ar":"يساعد الوكلاء على فرض التوصيل الصارم مع `ty`، linting الموحد مع `ruff`، الاختبار الشامل مع `pytest` و التسجيل المنظم مع `loguru`، مما ي đảmن代码 عالية الجودة قبل نشرها."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating Python code for errors before merge or deployment","Enforcing consistent coding standards across projects with unified linting","Automating comprehensive testing to catch bugs early in development"],"zh":["在合并或部署之前验证Python代码中的错误","使用统一的linting在项目中执行一致的编码标准","自动执行全面测试以尽早捕获错误"],"ja":["統合またはデプロイ前にPythonコードのエラーを検証する","統一されたlintingを使用してプロジェクト全体で一貫したコード規約を実施する","包括的なテストを自動化して開発の早期にバグを検出する"],"ko":["병합 또는 배포 전에 Python 코드의 오류를 검증","統一된 린팅을 사용하여 프로젝트 전반에 걸쳐 일관된 코딩 표준을 시행","포괄적인 테스트를 자동화하여 개발의 초기에 버그를検出"],"es":["Validar el código Python para errores antes de la combinación o implementación","Aplicar normas de codificación coherentes en proyectos con linting unificado","Automatizar pruebas integrales para detectar errores temprano en el desarrollo"],"fr":["Valider le code Python pour les erreurs avant la fusion ou le déploiement"," Appliquer des normes de codage cohérentes dans les projets avec un linting unifié","Automatiser les tests complets pour détecter les bogues tôt dans le développement"],"de":["Überprüfen des Python-Codes auf Fehler vor der Zusammenführung oder Bereitstellung","Durchsetzen konsistenter Codierungsstandards in Projekten mit einheitlichem Linting","Automatisieren von umfassenden Tests, um Fehler frühzeitig in der Entwicklung zu erkennen"],"pt":["Validar código Python para erros antes do merge ou deploy","Impor padrões de codificação consistentes em todos os projetos com linting unificado","Automatizar testes abrangentes para capturar bugs cedo no desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Проверить код Python на наличие ошибок перед слиянием или развертыванием","Обеспечить последовательные стандарты кодирования во всех проектах с помощью унифицированного linting","Автоматизировать всесторонние тесты для обнаружения ошибок на ранней стадии разработки"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة رمز Python لخطاء قبل الاندماج أو نشره","فرض معايير الترميز الموحدة عبر جميع المشاريع مع linting الموحد","تشغيل الاختبارات الشاملة لتسجيل الأخطاء مبكرا في مرحلة التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to Python projects","Dependent on `uv` manager"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限Python项目","依赖于`uv`管理器"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Pythonプロジェクトのみ","`uv`マネージャーに依存"],"ko":["Python 환경 필요","Python 프로젝트만","`uv` 매니저에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado a proyectos de Python","Dependiente del administrador `uv`"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité aux projets Python","Dépendant du gestionnaire `uv`"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Python-Projekte","Abhängig vom Manager `uv`"],"pt":["Requer um ambiente Python","Limitado a projetos Python","Dependente do gerenciador `uv`"],"ru":["Требует среды Python","Ограничен проектами Python","Зависит от менеджера `uv`"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى بيئة Python","محدود لمشاريع Python","يت зависим على مدير `uv`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f82efd618caac04d611ddd7caa57996b3856a08e7df8e69c0bc400b076b31fb8","qualityScore":60}');
