nt d''Agents d''IA avec linear-sop"],"de":["wie man linear-sop verwendet","was ist linear-sop","alternativen zu linear-sop","linear-sop vs andere KI-Tools","installation von linear-sop","konfigurationsanleitung für linear-sop","entwicklung von KI-Agents mit linear-sop"],"pt":["como desenvolver agentes de IA","o que é linear-sop","SAFe vs Agile","Claude Code tutorial","desenvolvimento de agentes de IA com SAFe","agentes de IA como membros da equipe","metodologia de desenvolvimento de agentes de IA","linear-sop alternative","instalar linear-sop"],"ru":["как разрабатывать ИИ Агентов","что такое linear-sop","SAFe vs Agile","Claude Code руководство","разработка ИИ Агентов с SAFe","ИИ Агенты как члены команды","методология разработки ИИ Агентов","linear-sop альтернатива","установить linear-sop"],"ar":["كيفية تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو linear-sop","SAFe vs Agile","دليل Claude Code","تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مع SAFe","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي كأعضاء في الفريق","منهجية تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","linear-sop بديل","تثبيت linear-sop"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"safe-agentic-workflow","repoPath":"bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.890Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"linear-sop","description":"Linear ticket management best practices. Use when creating issues, updating status, or attaching evidence. Provides evidence templates for dev/staging/done phases.","bodyPreview":"# Linear SOP Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide consistent Linear ticket management. Provides evidence templates for the mandatory dev/staging/UAT evidence policy.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Creating new Linear issues\n- Updating ticket status\n- Attaching evidence to tickets\n- Parsing acceptance criteria\n- Working with UUIDs and issue IDs\n\n## Linear Operations (Manual Process)\n\nSince Gemini CLI doesn''t have native Linear integration, use the Linear web UI or CLI for these operations:\n\n### Reading Issue","body":"# Linear SOP Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide consistent Linear ticket management. Provides evidence templates for the mandatory dev/staging/UAT evidence policy.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Creating new Linear issues\n- Updating ticket status\n- Attaching evidence to tickets\n- Parsing acceptance criteria\n- Working with UUIDs and issue IDs\n\n## Linear Operations (Manual Process)\n\nSince Gemini CLI doesn''t have native Linear integration, use the Linear web UI or CLI for these operations:\n\n### Reading Issues\n\n```bash\n# Via Linear Web UI\n# Navigate to: https://linear.app/team/{PROJECT_TEAM_NAME}/issue/{TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX\n\n# Or use Linear CLI if installed\nlinear issue view {TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX\n```\n\n### Creating Issues\n\n```bash\n# Via Linear Web UI: Click \"New Issue\" or press C\n# Or use Linear CLI:\nlinear issue create --title \"feat(scope): description\" --team {PROJECT_TEAM_NAME}\n```\n\n### Updating Issues\n\n```bash\n# Via Linear Web UI: Open issue and update status\n# Or use Linear CLI:\nlinear issue update {TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX --state \"Done\"\n```\n\n### Adding Comments\n\n```bash\n# Via Linear Web UI: Open issue and add comment\n# Or use Linear CLI:\nlinear issue comment {TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX \"**Dev Evidence**\\n\\n...\"\n```\n\n## Evidence Policy (MUST)\n\nEvery issue requires evidence at each phase:\n\n| Phase       | Required? | Content                 |\n| ----------- | --------- | ----------------------- |\n| **Dev**     | MUST      | Implementation proof    |\n| **Staging** | MUST      | UAT validation (or N/A) |\n| **Done**    | MUST      | Final verification      |\n\n## Evidence Templates\n\n### Dev Evidence Template\n\n```markdown\n**Dev Evidence**\n\n**PR**: https://github.com/{ORG_NAME}/{REPO_NAME}/pull/XXX\n**Commit**: [short-hash]\n**Branch**: {TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX-description\n\n**Implementation:**\n\n- [x] Feature implemented\n- [x] Tests passing\n- [x] Lint passing\n\n**Verification:**\n\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nyarn ci:validate\n\n# Output: All checks passed\n\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\n### Staging/UAT Evidence Template\n\n```markdown\n**Staging Evidence**\n\n**Environment**: Pop OS dev server\n**URL**: http://pop-os:3000\n\n**Validation Steps:**\n\n1. Deployed to staging: [timestamp]\n2. Smoke test passed: [yes/no]\n3. Feature verified: [description]\n\n**UAT Status:** [Passed/Pending/N/A]\n\nIf N/A, reason: [e.g., \"Dev tooling only - no user-facing changes\"]\n```\n\n### Done Evidence Template\n\n```markdown\n**Done Evidence**\n\n**PR Merged**: https://github.com/{ORG_NAME}/{REPO_NAME}/pull/XXX\n**Merge Commit**: [hash]\n\n**Final Checklist:**\n\n- [x] All acceptance criteria met\n- [x] Documentation updated (if applicable)\n- [x] No regressions detected\n```\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Parsing\n\nWhen reading issue descriptions, extract ACs:\n\n```markdown\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] User can perform action X\n- [ ] System responds with Y\n- [ ] Error handling for Z\n```\n\nConvert to testable checklist:\n\n```typescript\nconst acceptanceCriteria = [\n  { criterion: \"User can perform action X\", verified: false },\n  { criterion: \"System responds with Y\", verified: false },\n  { criterion: \"Error handling for Z\", verified: false },\n];\n```\n\n## Status Workflow\n\n```text\nBacklog -> Ready -> In Progress -> Testing -> Ready for Review -> Done\n```\n\n### Status Update Guidelines\n\n| From             | To               | When                     |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------ |\n| Backlog          | Ready            | Sprint planning          |\n| Ready            | In Progress      | Work starts              |\n| In Progress      | Testing          | PR created               |\n| Testing          | Ready for Review | Tests pass, UAT complete |\n| Ready for Review | Done             | POPM approval            |\n\n## UUID Handling\n\nLinear uses UUIDs internally. When working with APIs:\n\n```typescript\n// Issue identifiers (human-readable)\nconst issueId = \"{TICKET_PREFIX}-459\";\n\n// UUIDs (API operations)\nconst uuid = \"ef6a5fa0-2b46-417f-8266-dea2d187b10a\";\n\n// Get UUID from identifier via Linear web UI or API\n// The issue URL contains the UUID\n```\n\n## Common Operations\n\n### Link PR to Issue\n\nPRs are automatically linked when:\n\n- Branch name contains `{TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX`\n- PR title contains `[{TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX]`\n\n### Create Sub-Issue\n\nUse Linear web UI: Click \"Add sub-issue\" on parent issue\n\n### Query by Label\n\nUse Linear web UI filters:\n1. Open team view\n2. Click \"Filter\"\n3. Select label (e.g., \"sprint-1\")\n\n## Reference\n\n- **Agent Workflow SOP**: `docs/sop/AGENT_WORKFLOW_SOP.md`\n- **Linear Documentation**: https://linear.app/docs\n- **CONTRIBUTING.md**: Workflow documentation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:54:29.504Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined Linear ticket management and SAFe multi-agent development methodology integration.","zh":"非常适合需要简化线性工单管理和SAFe多代理开发方法集成的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが線形チケット管理とSAFeマルチエージェント開発方法論の統合をストリームライン化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"선형 티켓 관리 및 SAFe 멀티 에이전트 개발 방법론 통합을 스트림 라인화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de tickets lineales optimizada y la integración de la metodología de desarrollo multiagente SAFe.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de tickets linéaires rationalisée et d''une intégration de la méthodologie de développement multiagent SAFe.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine optimierte lineare Ticketverwaltung und eine Integration der SAFe-Mehrfachagenten-Entwicklungsmethodik benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de bilhetes lineares simplificado e integração da metodologia de desenvolvimento multiagente SAFe.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходим упрощенный линейный менеджмент тикетов и интеграция многоагентной методологии разработки SAFe.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تحتاج إلى إدارة تذاكر خطية مبسطة وتكامل منهجية تطوير متعددة الوكلاء SAFe."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Linear issue creation, update ticket status, and attach evidence using UUIDs and issue IDs, leveraging Claude Code for production-validated development workflows and native Linear web UI or CLI operations.","zh":"赋予代理人使用UUID和问题ID自动化线性问题创建、更新工单状态、附加证据的能力，利用Claude Code进行生产验证的开发工作流，并支持线性Web UI或CLI操作。","ja":"UUIDと問題IDを使用して線形問題の作成、チケットのステータスの更新、証拠の添付を自動化するエージェントの能力を提供し、Claude Codeを使用して生産検証済みの開発ワークフローと線形Web UIまたはCLI操作を実行します。","ko":"UUID 및 문제 ID를 사용하여 선형 문제 생성, 티켓 상태 업데이트, 증거 첨부를 자동화하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, Claude Code를 사용하여 생산 유효성 검증된 개발 워크플로 및 선형 Web UI 또는 CLI 작동을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la creación de problemas lineales, actualizar el estado del ticket y adjuntar pruebas utilizando UUID y IDs de problemas, aprovechando Claude Code para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo validados en producción y operaciones de la interfaz de usuario web lineal nativa o de la CLI.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la création de problèmes linéaires, de mettre à jour le statut des tickets et d''attacher des preuves en utilisant des UUID et des ID de problèmes, en exploitant Claude Code pour des flux de travail de développement validés en production et des opérations de l''interface utilisateur web linéaire native ou de la CLI.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Erstellung linearer Probleme zu automatisieren, den Ticketstatus zu aktualisieren und Beweise unter Verwendung von UUIDs und Problem-IDs anzuhängen, indem es Claude Code für in der Produktion validierte Entwicklungsworkflows und native Linear-Web-UI- oder CLI-Operationen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a criação de problemas lineares, atualizar o status do ticket e anexar evidências usando UUIDs e IDs de problemas, aproveitando o Claude Code para fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento validados pela produção e operações de interface do usuário web Linear nativa ou CLI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать создание линейных проблем, обновлять статус тикета и прикреплять доказательства, используя UUID и идентификаторы проблем, используя Claude Code для рабочих процессов разработки, проверенных производством, и родные веб-интерфейс Linear или операции CLI.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير آليّة لإنشاء مشاكل خطية و تحديث حالة التذكرة و إرفاق الأدلة باستخدام UUIDs و معرفات المشاكل، و الاستفادة من Claude Code لتدفقات العمل المُثبَتة في الإنتاج و عمليات واجهة المستخدم الويب Lineare الأصلية أو CLI."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Linear issue creation with mandatory dev/staging/UAT evidence","Parsing acceptance criteria for Linear tickets","Updating ticket status with attached evidence using Linear web UI or CLI"],"zh":["使用强制开发/预发/测试证据自动化线性问题创建","解析线性票的接受标准","使用线性Web UI或CLI附加证据更新票状态"],"ja":["強制的な開発/ステージング/テスト証拠を使用して線形問題を作成する自動化","線形チケットの受け入れ基準を解析する","線形Web UIまたはCLIを使用して証拠を添付してチケットのステータスを更新する"],"ko":["강제 개발/스태이징/테스트 증거를 사용하여 선형 문제를 자동으로 생성하는 것","선형 티켓의 수락 기준을 구문 분석하는 것","선형 Web UI 또는 CLI를 사용하여 증거를 첨부하여 티켓 상태를 업데이트하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de problemas lineales con pruebas obligatorias de dev/staging/UAT","Análisis de los criterios de aceptación para los tickets lineales","Actualización del estado del ticket con pruebas adjuntas utilizando la interfaz de usuario web lineal o la CLI"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de problèmes linéaires avec des preuves obligatoires de dev/staging/UAT","Analyse des critères d''acceptation pour les tickets linéaires","Mise à jour du statut des tickets avec des preuves attachées en utilisant l''interface utilisateur web linéaire ou la CLI"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung linearer Probleme mit obligatorischen Entwicklungs-, Staging- und UAT-Tests","Analyse der Akzeptanzkriterien für lineare Tickets","Aktualisierung des Ticketstatus mit angehängten Beweisen unter Verwendung der nativen Linear-Web-UI oder der CLI"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de problemas lineares com evidências obrigatórias de dev/staging/UAT","Analisar critérios de aceitação para tickets lineares","Atualizar o status do ticket com evidências anexas usando a interface do usuário web Linear ou CLI"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание линейных проблем с обязательными доказательствами dev/staging/UAT","Разбирать критерии приемки для линейных тикетов","Обновлять статус тикета с прикрепленными доказательствами, используя веб-интерфейс Linear или CLI"],"ar":["توفير آليّة لإنشاء مشاكل خطية مع أدلة إجبارية من dev/staging/UAT","تحليل معايير القبول لتصاريح الخطية","تحديث حالة التذكرة مع إرفاق الأدلة باستخدام واجهة المستخدم الويب Lineare الأصلية أو CLI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Linear web UI or CLI access due to lack of native Gemini CLI integration","Specific to Linear ticket management and SAFe methodology"],"zh":["由于缺乏原生Gemini CLI集成，需要线性Web UI或CLI访问","特定于线性工单管理和SAFe方法"],"ja":["ネイティブのGemini CLI統合がないため、線形Web UIまたはCLIへのアクセスが必要","線形チケット管理とSAFe方法に特有"],"ko":["원生的 Gemini CLI 통합이 없기 때문에 선형 Web UI 또는 CLI 액세스가 필요합니다","선형 티켓 관리 및 SAFe 방법에 특정"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la interfaz de usuario web lineal o a la CLI debido a la falta de integración nativa de Gemini CLI","Específico para la gestión de tickets lineales y la metodología SAFe"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''interface utilisateur web linéaire ou à la CLI en raison du manque d''intégration native de Gemini CLI","Spécifique à la gestion des tickets linéaires et à la méthodologie SAFe"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die native Linear-Web-UI oder die CLI aufgrund fehlender nativer Gemini-CLI-Integration","Spezifisch für die lineare Ticketverwaltung und die SAFe-Methodik"],"pt":["Exige acesso à interface do usuário web Linear ou CLI devido à falta de integração nativa do CLI Gemini","Específico para gerenciamento de bilhetes lineares e metodologia SAFe"],"ru":["Требует доступа к веб-интерфейсу Linear или CLI из-за отсутствия родной интеграции CLI Gemini","Конкретно для менеджмента линейных тикетов и методологии SAFe"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة المستخدم الويب Lineare الأصلية أو CLI بسبب عدم وجود تكامل CLI Gemini الأصلي","محدد لتدبير تذاكر الخطية ومنهجية SAFe"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e8f5a7060f9a90e005924d62507701f5abe254833032ae3affcf809b1bb86aca","qualityScore":60}');
