tDB","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: مدير حالة AgentDB","en":"agentdb-state-manager"},"description":{"zh":"agentdb-state-manager是一种AI智能代理，能够将自然语言转换为SQL，用于医疗数据管理","ja":"agentdb-state-managerは、ヘルスケアデータ管理用の自然言語をSQLに変換するAIエージェントです","ko":"agentdb-state-manager는 의료 데이터 관리를 위한 자연어를 SQL로 변환하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"AgentDB es una herramienta de estado que permite la conversión de lenguaje natural a SQL en aplicaciones de salud","fr":"AgentDB est un outil d''état qui permet la conversion de langage naturel en SQL pour les applications de santé","de":"AgentDB ist ein Zustandsmanager, der die Konvertierung von Natürlicher Sprache in SQL für Gesundheitsanwendungen ermöglicht","pt":"O AgentDB é uma ferramenta de IA que converte linguagem natural em SQL para a área de saúde, simplificando a análise de dados","ru":"AgentDB - это инструмент ИИ, который преобразует естественный язык в SQL для здравоохранения, упрощая анализ данных","ar":"AgentDB هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تحول اللغة الطبيعية إلى SQL للرعاية الصحية، مما يبسط تحليل البيانات","en":"Natural language to SQL in healthcare"},"definition":{"en":"Natural language to SQL in healthcare"},"features":{"zh":["自然语言到SQL转换","医疗数据管理","AI智能代理","高效数据处理","支持多种数据库"],"ja":["自然言語からSQLへの変換","ヘルスケアデータ管理","AIエージェント","効率的なデータ処理","複数のデータベースをサポート"],"ko":["자연어에서 SQL로의 변환","의료 데이터 관리","AI 에이전트","높은 효율의 데이터 처리","다중 데이터베이스 지원"],"es":["Conversión de lenguaje natural a SQL","Integración con aplicaciones de salud","Soporte para consultas complejas","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva","Compatibilidad con múltiples bases de datos"],"fr":["Conversion de langage naturel en SQL","Intégration avec les applications de santé","Prise en charge des requêtes complexes","Interface utilisateur intuitive","Compatibilité avec plusieurs bases de données"],"de":["Konvertierung von Natürlicher Sprache in SQL","Integration mit Gesundheitsanwendungen","Unterstützung für komplexe Abfragen","Intuitive Benutzeroberfläche","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Datenbanken"],"pt":["Conversão de linguagem natural em SQL","Análise de dados de saúde","Integração com bancos de dados","Suporte a consultas complexas","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Преобразование естественного языка в SQL","Анализ данных здравоохранения","Интеграция с базами данных","Поддержка сложных запросов","Интуитивный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["تحويل اللغة الطبيعية إلى SQL","تحليل بيانات الرعاية الصحية","التكامل مع قواعد البيانات","دعم الاستفسارات المعقدة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用agentdb-state-manager","什么是自然语言SQL转换","agentdb-state-manager替代品","agentdb-state-manager vs 其他AI工具","agentdb-state-manager安装","agentdb-state-manager设置指南","医疗数据管理解决方案"],"ja":["agentdb-state-managerの使い方","自然言語SQL変換とは","agentdb-state-managerの代替","agentdb-state-managerと他のAIツールの比較","agentdb-state-managerのインストール","agentdb-state-managerの設定ガイド","ヘルスケアデータ管理ソリューション"],"ko":["agentdb-state-manager 사용법","자연어 SQL 변환 이란","agentdb-state-manager 대안","agentdb-state-manager와 다른 AI 도구 비교","agentdb-state-manager 설치","agentdb-state-manager 설정 가이드","의료 데이터 관리 솔루션"],"es":["cómo usar AgentDB","herramientas de estado de AgentDB","AgentDB vs SQL","instalación de AgentDB","guía de configuración de AgentDB","aplicaciones de salud con AgentDB"," AgentDB para desarrolladores","tutorial de AgentDB"],"fr":["comment utiliser AgentDB","outils d''état AgentDB","AgentDB vs SQL","installation d''AgentDB","guide de configuration d''AgentDB","applications de santé avec AgentDB","AgentDB pour développeurs","tutoriel AgentDB"],"de":["wie man AgentDB verwendet","AgentDB-Zustandsmanager","AgentDB vs SQL","Installation von AgentDB","Konfigurationsanleitung für AgentDB","Gesundheitsanwendungen mit AgentDB","AgentDB für Entwickler","AgentDB-Tutorial"],"pt":["como usar o AgentDB","o que é AgentDB","ferramentas de IA para saúde","alternativas ao AgentDB","AgentDB vs outros ferramentas","instalar o AgentDB","guia de configuração do AgentDB"],"ru":["как использовать AgentDB","что такое AgentDB","инструменты ИИ для здравоохранения","альтернативы AgentDB","AgentDB vs другие инструменты","установить AgentDB","руководство по настройке AgentDB"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام AgentDB","ما هو AgentDB","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للرعاية الصحية","بدائل AgentDB","AgentDB مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت AgentDB","دليل إعداد AgentDB"]}},"owner":"stharrold","repo":"yuimedi-paper-20250901","repoPath":"stharrold/yuimedi-paper-20250901","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.924Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agentdb-state-manager","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# AgentDB State Manager Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThe AgentDB State Manager provides persistent database storage for workflow state tracking using DuckDB through Gemini Code''s AgentDB integration. This skill enables:\n\n- **Read-only analytics**: Complex queries over workflow history without parsing files\n- **Checkpoint management**: Store/recover context checkpoints at 100K token threshold\n- **Dependency resolution**: Query task dependencies and critical paths\n- **Metrics analysis**: Historical trends,","body":"# AgentDB State Manager Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThe AgentDB State Manager provides persistent database storage for workflow state tracking using DuckDB through Gemini Code''s AgentDB integration. This skill enables:\n\n- **Read-only analytics**: Complex queries over workflow history without parsing files\n- **Checkpoint management**: Store/recover context checkpoints at 100K token threshold\n- **Dependency resolution**: Query task dependencies and critical paths\n- **Metrics analysis**: Historical trends, time-in-phase, bottleneck identification\n\n**Primary source of truth:** TODO_*.md files (AgentDB is an analytics cache)\n\n**Primary purpose:** Data gathering and analysis\n\n**Workflow phase:** Cross-phase (Utilities) - All phases (1-6)\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Querying complex task dependencies or critical paths\n- Analyzing workflow metrics (time-in-phase, completion rates)\n- Storing context checkpoints at 100K tokens\n- Tracking state transitions and historical trends\n- Avoiding repetitive TODO file parsing for analytics\n\n**Triggered by keywords:** \"analyze workflow\", \"query state\", \"checkpoint\", \"workflow metrics\", \"task dependencies\"\n\n## Integration with Workflow\n\n**Phase integration:** Cross-phase (Utilities)\n\nThis skill integrates with all workflow phases:\n\n**Phase 0 (Setup):**\n- Initialize AgentDB schema on first use\n- Load canonical state definitions from workflow-states.json\n\n**Phase 1 (Planning - BMAD):**\n- Track BMAD Q&A responses\n- Store epic definitions and requirements\n\n**Phase 2 (Specification + Implementation):**\n- Sync tasks from TODO_*.md to AgentDB\n- Query task dependencies for parallel execution\n- Track implementation progress\n\n**Phase 3 (Quality):**\n- Store quality gate results\n- Track test coverage trends\n- Historical quality metrics\n\n**Phase 4 (Integration):**\n- Store as-built deviation data\n- Metrics for feedback loop\n- Compare planning vs actual\n\n**Phase 5 (Release):**\n- Release workflow state tracking\n- Final QA checkpoint data\n\n**Phase 6 (Hotfix):**\n- Hotfix-specific state tracking\n- Emergency rollback data\n\n**Context checkpoints (all phases):**\n- Store checkpoint at 100K tokens\n- Faster resume with structured queries vs file parsing\n\n**Orchestrator integration:**\n- workflow-orchestrator optionally calls AgentDB for complex queries\n- Fallback to file parsing if AgentDB unavailable\n- Automatic sync after TODO file updates\n\n## Official Documentation Alignment\n\nThis skill follows the local workflow system patterns which extend official Gemini Code skill specifications:\n\n**Official Gemini Code Skills:**\n- Specification: https://docs.gemini.com/en/docs/agents-and-tools/agent-skills\n- Building Agents: https://docs.gemini.com/en/docs/agents-and-tools/building-agents\n- AgentDB Documentation: (Reference from TODO_agentdb-prompt-template.md)\n\n**Local Pattern Extensions:**\n\n**file_structure:**\n- Local: [''SKILL.md'', ''GEMINI.md'', ''README.md'', ''CHANGELOG.md'', ''ARCHIVED/'', ''scripts/'', ''templates/'']\n- Official: [''skill.md'', ''README.md'']\n- Rationale: Extended structure supports multi-phase workflow with version tracking, context files, and archived materials\n\n**frontmatter:**\n- Local: YAML with ''name'', ''version'', ''description'' fields\n- Official: YAML with ''name'', ''description'' fields only\n- Rationale: ''version'' field enables semantic versioning integration with validate_versions.py and UPDATE_CHECKLIST.md workflow\n\n**directory_organization:**\n- Local: scripts/, templates/ subdirectories\n- Official: Flat structure with skill.md\n- Rationale: Separates Python code (scripts/) from templates (workflow-states.json) for better maintainability\n\nThese extensions support the multi-phase workflow system while maintaining compatibility with core Gemini Code concepts.\n\n## Architecture\n\n### Data Flow (Read-Only Analytics Mode)\n\n```\nTODO_*.md (source of truth)\n    ↓\nsync_todo_to_db.py\n    ↓\nAgentDB (DuckDB)\n    ↓\nquery_state.py / analyze_metrics.py\n    ↓\nAnalytics results\n```\n\n### Session ID Generation\n\nAgentDB requires a session ID for database identification. This skill uses:\n\n**Method: Timestamp-based (reproducible)**\n```python\nfrom datetime import datetime\nimport hashlib\n\n# Generate session ID from current timestamp\ncurrent_time = datetime.utcnow().isoformat()\nsession_id = hashlib.md5(current_time.encode()).hexdigest()[:16]\n# Example: \"f8e7d6c5b4a39281\"\n```\n\n**Rationale:** Provides reproducible session IDs across agent invocations within the same timeframe, balancing uniqueness with reproducibility.\n\n### Schema Design (Immutable Append-Only)\n\n**Core principle:** NEVER UPDATE or DELETE records - always INSERT new records\n\n**Primary table: workflow_records**\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS workflow_records (\n    record_id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid(),\n    record_datetimestamp TIMESTAMP DEFAULT current_timestamp,\n    object_id VARCHAR NOT NULL,     -- Stable ID for workflow object\n    object_type VARCHAR NOT NULL,   -- ''feature'', ''task'', ''epic'', etc.\n    object_state VARCHAR NOT NULL,  -- ''20_in-progress'', ''99_done'', etc.\n    object_metadata JSON             -- Framework, dependencies, etc.\n);\n\nCREATE INDEX idx_records_object\nON workflow_records(object_id, record_datetimestamp DESC);\n```\n\n**Current state query pattern:**\n```sql\n-- Get latest state for each object\nSELECT DISTINCT ON (object_id)\n    object_id, object_type, object_state, object_metadata\nFROM workflow_records\nWHERE object_type = ''task''\nORDER BY object_id, record_datetimestamp DESC;\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n### 1. Initialize AgentDB (First Use)\n\n```bash\n# Initialize database schema and load state definitions\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/init_database.py\n```\n\n**What it does:**\n- Creates workflow_records table\n- Loads workflow-states.json\n- Sets up indexes for efficient queries\n- Stores session metadata\n\n### 2. Sync TODO Files to AgentDB\n\n```bash\n# Sync all TODO_*.md files to database\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/sync_todo_to_db.py\n\n# Sync specific TODO file\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/sync_todo_to_db.py \\\n  TODO_feature_20251023T143000Z_my-feature.md\n```\n\n**What it does:**\n- Parses YAML frontmatter from TODO files\n- Converts to immutable append-only records\n- Stores workflow progress, tasks, quality gates\n- Preserves full state history\n\n### 3. Query Current Workflow State\n\n```bash\n# Get current state of all workflows\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/query_state.py\n\n# Query specific workflow\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/query_state.py \\\n  --slug my-feature\n\n# Query task dependencies\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/query_state.py \\\n  --dependencies --task impl_003\n```\n\n**What it does:**\n- Queries latest state for each object\n- Resolves task dependencies\n- Identifies blocked tasks\n- Shows critical path\n\n### 4. Analyze Workflow Metrics\n\n```bash\n# Generate metrics report\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/analyze_metrics.py\n\n# Historical trends\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/analyze_metrics.py \\\n  --trends --days 30\n\n# Bottleneck analysis\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/analyze_metrics.py \\\n  --bottlenecks\n```\n\n**What it does:**\n- Calculates time-in-phase for workflows\n- Identifies bottlenecks and slow phases\n- Tracks quality gate pass/fail rates\n- Compares planning estimates vs actual\n\n### 5. Context Checkpoint Management\n\n```bash\n# Store checkpoint at 100K tokens\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/checkpoint_manager.py \\\n  store --todo TODO_feature_*.md\n\n# List available checkpoints\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/checkpoint_manager.py list\n\n# Restore from checkpoint\npython .gemini/skills/agentdb-state-manager/scripts/checkpoint_manager.py \\\n  restore --checkpoint-id <uuid>\n```\n\n**What it does:**\n- Stores complete workflow state to AgentDB\n- Records token count, phase, step, last task\n- Provides resume instructions\n- Faster recovery than parsing TODO files\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### 1. AgentDB as Analytics Cache\n\n**✓ DO:** Treat TODO_*.md files as source of truth\n**✗ DON''T:** Modify TODO files based on AgentDB state\n\n**Rationale:** Files are git-tracked and permanent; AgentDB sessions last 24 hours\n\n### 2. Sync After TODO Updates\n\n**✓ DO:** Run sync_todo_to_db.py after every TODO file update\n**✗ DON''T:** Let AgentDB state drift from file state\n\n**Rationale:** AgentDB is a cache - it must stay synchronized\n\n### 3. Use for Complex Queries Only\n\n**✓ DO:** Use AgentDB for dependency graphs, metrics, historical analysis\n**✗ DON''T:** Use for simple current state queries (parse TODO file instead)\n\n**Rationale:** Minimize token overhead - use database for queries that justify the cost\n\n### 4. Immutable Records\n\n**✓ DO:** Always INSERT new records for state changes\n**✗ DON''T:** UPDATE or DELETE existing records\n\n**Rationale:** Preserves full history for temporal analysis\n\n### 5. Session Lifetime Awareness\n\n**✓ DO:** Re-initialize at session start if needed\n**✗ DON''T:** Assume AgentDB persists across days\n\n**Rationale:** 24-hour auto-deletion - treat as ephemeral cache\n\n## Scripts Reference\n\n### init_database.py\n**Purpose:** Initialize AgentDB schema and load state definitions\n**When to run:** First use in a session, or if schema corrupted\n**Token cost:** ~300-400 tokens\n\n### sync_todo_to_db.py\n**Purpose:** Sync TODO_*.md files to AgentDB\n**When to run:** After every TODO file update\n**Token cost:** ~200-300 tokens per TODO file\n\n### query_state.py\n**Purpose:** Query current workflow state and dependencies\n**When to run:** Complex state queries (dependency graphs, critical paths)\n**Token cost:** ~100-200 tokens per query\n\n### analyze_metrics.py\n**Purpose:** Historical metrics and trend analysis\n**When to run:** End of phase, workflow retrospectives\n**Token cost:** ~400-600 tokens (complex queries)\n\n### checkpoint_manager.py\n**Purpose:** Store/restore context checkpoints\n**When to run:** At 100K token threshold, or before context reset\n**Token cost:** ~200-400 tokens (store + verify)\n\n## Token Efficiency\n\n### Before AgentDB (Manual File Parsing)\n\n**Complex dependency query:**\n1. Read TODO_*.md file (~1,500 tokens)\n2. Parse YAML frontmatter (~500 tokens)\n3. Iterate through tasks (~1,000 tokens)\n4. Resolve dependencies (~800 tokens)\n**Total:** ~3,800 tokens\n\n### After AgentDB (Database Query)\n\n**Same query:**\n1. Run query_state.py --dependencies (~200 tokens)\n2. Parse SQL results (~100 tokens)\n**Total:** ~300 tokens\n\n**Savings:** ~3,500 tokens (92% reduction) for complex queries\n\n### Context Checkpoint Recovery\n\n**Before AgentDB:**\n- Parse TODO_*.md (~1,500 tokens)\n- Reconstruct state (~1,000 tokens)\n- Determine next step (~800 tokens)\n**Total:** ~3,300 tokens\n\n**After AgentDB:**\n- Query checkpoint table (~150 tokens)\n- Load resume instructions (~100 tokens)\n**Total:** ~250 tokens\n\n**Savings:** ~3,050 tokens (92% reduction)\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n### workflow-orchestrator\n- Calls query_state.py for complex next-step determination\n- Uses checkpoint_manager.py at 100K tokens\n- Falls back to file parsing if AgentDB unavailable\n\n### workflow-utilities\n- todo_updater.py triggers sync_todo_to_db.py after updates\n- Dual write: update file + sync to database\n\n### speckit-author\n- Uses AgentDB for as-built metrics (update_asbuilt.py)\n- Queries historical planning accuracy\n\n### quality-enforcer\n- Stores quality gate results to AgentDB\n- Tracks coverage trends over time\n\n### bmad-planner\n- Stores BMAD Q&A responses\n- Epic definition tracking\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- **[GEMINI.md](GEMINI.md)** - Gemini Code usage context\n- **[README.md](README.md)** - Human-readable overview\n- **[CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md)** - Version history\n- **[templates/workflow-states.json](templates/workflow-states.json)** - Canonical state definitions\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **workflow-orchestrator** - Calls AgentDB for complex queries\n- **workflow-utilities** - Triggers sync after TODO updates\n- **speckit-author** - Uses for as-built metrics\n- **quality-enforcer** - Stores quality gate results\n- **bmad-planner** - Stores planning data\n\n## Limitations\n\n1. **Session lifetime:** AgentDB persists for 24 hours, then auto-deleted\n2. **Source of truth:** TODO_*.md files remain authoritative\n3. **Sync overhead:** ~200-300 tokens per sync operation\n4. **DuckDB constraints:** Optimized for OLAP (analytics), not OLTP (transactions)\n5. **No vector search:** Unlike PostgreSQL pgvector\n\n## Academic References\n\nThis skill implements the **MIT Agent Synchronization Pattern** based on:\n\n> **Meng, E., & Jackson, D. (2025).** \"What You See Is What It Does: A Structural Pattern for Legible Software.\"\n> *Onward! at SPLASH 2025*. arXiv:2508.14511v1.\n> https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.14511\n\n**Key concepts from the paper:**\n- **Concepts**: Fully independent services (implemented as agents/worktrees)\n- **Synchronizations**: Event-based rules mediating between services (implemented as `agent_synchronizations` table)\n\nThe pattern improves incrementality, integrity, and transparency in multi-agent workflows.\n\n## Version History\n\n**v1.0.0 (2025-11-02):**\n- Initial release\n- Read-only analytics mode\n- Sync from TODO files to AgentDB\n- Complex query support (dependencies, metrics)\n- Context checkpoint storage\n- All phases (1-6) integration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:05:29.550Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Workflow Analysis Agents requiring persistent state tracking and complex historical data queries.","zh":"适用于需要持久状态跟踪和复杂历史数据查询的工作流分析代理。","ja":"ワークフロー分析エージェントが永続的な状態の追跡と複雑な履歴データのクエリーを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"지속적인 상태 추적 및 복잡한 기록 데이터 쿼리가 필요한 워크플로우 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de flujos de trabajo que requieren seguimiento de estado persistente y consultas complejas de datos históricos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de flux de travail nécessitant un suivi d''état persistant et des requêtes complexes sur les données historiques.","de":"Ideal für Workflow-Analyse-Agents, die persistente Zustandsverfolgung und komplexe historische Datenabfragen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Workflow que requerem rastreamento de estado persistente e consultas complexas de dados históricos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа рабочих процессов, требующих постоянного отслеживания состояния и выполнения сложных запросов к историческим данным.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل سير العمل الذين يتطلبون تتبع حالة مستمرة واستعلامات معقدة للبيانات التاريخية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables persistent storage and advanced analytics of workflow states using DuckDB through Gemini Code''s AgentDB integration. Provides checkpoint management at 100K token thresholds and dependency resolution capabilities for complex workflow analysis.","zh":"通过Gemini Code的AgentDB集成，使用DuckDB实现工作流状态的持久存储和高级分析。提供在10万令牌阈值处的检查点管理和复杂工作流分析的依赖解析能力。","ja":"Gemini CodeのAgentDB統合を通じてDuckDBを使用し、ワークフロー状態の永続的なストレージと高度な分析を可能にします。10万トークンのしきい値でのチェックポイント管理と複雑なワークフロー分析の依存解決能力を提供します。","ko":"Gemini Code의 AgentDB 통합을 통해 DuckDB를 사용하여 워크플로우 상태의 지속적인 저장 및 고급 분석을 제공합니다. 10만 토큰 임계값에서의 체크포인트 관리 및 복잡한 워크플로우 분석을 위한 의존성 해결 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite el almacenamiento persistente y el análisis avanzado de los estados del flujo de trabajo utilizando DuckDB a través de la integración AgentDB de Gemini Code. Proporciona gestión de puntos de control en umbrales de 100K tokens y capacidades de resolución de dependencias para el análisis complejo de flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Permet le stockage persistant et l''analyse avancée des états de flux de travail en utilisant DuckDB via l''intégration AgentDB de Gemini Code. Fournit la gestion des points de contrôle à des seuils de 100K tokens et des capacités de résolution des dépendances pour l''analyse complexe des flux de travail.","de":"Ermöglicht persistente Speicherung und erweiterte Analyse von Workflow-Zuständen unter Verwendung von DuckDB durch die AgentDB-Integration von Gemini Code. Bietet Checkpoint-Management bei 100K-Token-Schwellenwerten und Abhängigkeitsauflösungsfähigkeiten für komplexe Workflow-Analysen.","pt":"Permite armazenamento persistente e análise avançada dos estados do workflow usando DuckDB através da integração AgentDB do Gemini Code. Fornece gerenciamento de checkpoint em limites de 100K tokens e capacidades de resolução de dependências para análise complexa de workflow.","ru":"Обеспечивает постоянное хранение и расширенную аналитику состояний рабочих процессов с использованием DuckDB через интеграцию AgentDB в Gemini Code. Предоставляет управление контрольными точками при порогах в 100 тыс. токенов и возможности разрешения зависимостей для сложного анализа рабочих процессов.","ar":"يتيح التخزين المستمر والتحليلات المتقدمة لحالات سير العمل باستخدام DuckDB من خلال تكامل AgentDB في Gemini Code. يوفر إدارة نقاط التفتيش عند عتبات 100 ألف رمزية وإمكانيات حل التبعيات لتحليل سير العمل المعقد."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing complex analytics queries on workflow history","Managing context checkpoints at large token thresholds","Resolving task dependencies and critical paths","Analyzing historical performance metrics and trends"],"zh":["在工作流历史上执行复杂的分析查询","在大型令牌阈值处管理上下文检查点","解析任务依赖和关键路径","分析历史性能指标和趋势"],"ja":["ワークフローの履歴に対して複雑な分析クエリーを実行する","大きなトークンのしきい値でのコンテキストチェックポイントの管理","タスクの依存関係とクリティカルパスの解決","履歴的なパフォーマンスメトリクスと傾向の分析"],"ko":["워크플로우 기록에서 복잡한 분석 쿼리를 실행하는 것","대형 토큰 임계값에서 컨텍스트 체크포인트를 관리하는 것","작업 의존성 및 임계 경로를 해결하는 것","기록적인 성능 지표 및 경향을 분석하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar consultas de análisis complejas sobre el historial de flujos de trabajo","Gestionar puntos de control de contexto en grandes umbrales de tokens","Resolver dependencias de tareas y rutas críticas","Analizar métricas y tendencias de rendimiento históricas"],"fr":["Exécuter des requêtes d''analyse complexes sur l''historique des flux de travail","Gérer les points de contrôle de contexte à de grands seuils de tokens","Résoudre les dépendances des tâches et les chemins critiques","Analyser les métriques de performance historiques et les tendances"],"de":["Ausführen komplexer Analyseabfragen zum Workflow-Verlauf","Verwalten von Kontext-Checkpoints bei großen Token-Schwellenwerten","Auflösen von Aufgabenabhängigkeiten und kritischen Pfaden","Analysieren historischer Leistungskennzahlen und Trends"],"pt":["Execução de consultas analíticas complexas no histórico de workflow","Gerenciamento de checkpoints de contexto em grandes limites de tokens","Resolução de dependências de tarefas e caminhos críticos","Análise de métricas e tendências de desempenho histórico"],"ru":["Выполнение сложных аналитических запросов к истории рабочих процессов","Управление контрольными точками контекста при больших порогах токенов","Разрешение зависимостей задач и критических путей","Анализ исторических метрик производительности и тенденций"],"ar":["تنفيذ استعلامات تحليلية معقدة على تاريخ سير العمل","إدارة نقاط تفتيش السياق عند عتبات الرموز الكبيرة","حل تبعيات المهام والمسارات الحرجة","تحليل مقاييس الأداء والاتجاهات التاريخية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires DuckDB integration through Gemini Code","Checkpoint management limited to 100K token thresholds","Read-only analytics capability only"],"zh":["需要通过Gemini Code集成DuckDB","检查点管理仅限于10万令牌阈值","仅提供只读分析能力"],"ja":["Gemini Codeを通じてDuckDBの統合が必要","チェックポイント管理は10万トークンのしきい値に限定される","読み取り専用の分析機能のみ"],"ko":["Gemini Code를 통해 DuckDB 통합이 필요함","체크포인트 관리는 10만 토큰 임계값으로 제한됨","읽기 전용 분석 기능만 제공"],"es":["Requiere integración de DuckDB a través de Gemini Code","La gestión de puntos de control limitada a umbrales de 100K tokens","Capacidad de análisis de solo lectura únicamente"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de DuckDB via Gemini Code","Gestion des points de contrôle limitée à des seuils de 100K tokens","Capacité d''analyse en lecture seule uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert DuckDB-Integration durch Gemini Code","Checkpoint-Management auf 100K-Token-Schwellenwerte beschränkt","Nur schreibgeschützte Analysefähigkeit"],"pt":["Requer integração com DuckDB através do Gemini Code","Gerenciamento de checkpoints limitado a limites de 100K tokens","Capacidade analítica somente de leitura"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с DuckDB через Gemini Code","Управление контрольными точками ограничено порогом в 100 тыс. токенов","Возможность аналитики только для чтения"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملاً مع DuckDB من خلال Gemini Code","إدارة نقاط التفتيش محدودة بعتبات 100 ألف رمزية","قدرة تحليلية للقراءة فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f05d185e6cf85eac6f0b51ea4a8b5071be8318bbffa34a75a6376d20b3d935f4","qualityScore":60}');
