duktivität","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Análise de histórico de sessões","Otimização de fluxos de trabalho","Ferramenta de meta-cognição","Integração com Claude Code","Melhoria da eficiência"],"ru":["Анализ истории сессий","Оптимизация рабочих процессов","Инструмент метакогнитивного анализа","Интеграция с Claude Code","Повышение эффективности"],"ar":["تحليل تاريخ الجلسات","تحسين تدفقات العمل","أداة تحليل متعاقب","التكامل مع منصة Claude Code","تحسين الكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用测试策略","什么是Meta-Cognition","测试策略替代品","测试策略与竞争对手比较","测试策略安装","测试策略设置指南","AI智能工具","软件开发工作流程优化"],"ja":["テスト戦略の使用方法","Meta-Cognitionとは","テスト戦略の代替","テスト戦略と競合製品の比較","テスト戦略のインストール","テスト戦略の設定ガイド","AIエージェント","ソフトウェア開発ワークフロー最適化"],"ko":["테스트 전략 사용 방법","Meta-Cognition이란","테스트 전략 대체","테스트 전략과 경쟁사 비교","테스트 전략 설치","테스트 전략 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","소프트웨어 개발 워크플ロー 최적화"],"es":["herramientas de IA","estrategia de pruebas","Claude Code","optimización del flujo de trabajo","cómo usar Claude Code","alternativas a Claude Code","instalación de Claude Code","guía de configuración de Claude Code"],"fr":["outils d''IA","stratégie de test","Claude Code","optimisation du flux de travail","comment utiliser Claude Code","alternatives à Claude Code","installation de Claude Code","guide de configuration de Claude Code"],"de":["KI-Tools","Teststrategie","Claude Code","Optimierung des Arbeitsablaufs","wie man Claude Code verwendet","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Installation von Claude Code","Konfigurationsanleitung für Claude Code"],"pt":["como usar estratégia de testes","o que é estratégia de testes","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","alternativas para claude code","guia de instalação da estratégia de testes","configuração da estratégia de testes","estratégia de testes vs outras ferramentas"],"ru":["как использовать стратегию тестирования","что такое стратегия тестирования","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","альтернативы для claude code","руководство по установке стратегии тестирования","настройка стратегии тестирования","стратегия тестирования vs другие инструменты"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام استراتيجية الاختبار","ما هي استراتيجية الاختبار","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديلات لمنصة claude code","دليل تثبيت استراتيجية الاختبار","إعداد استراتيجية الاختبار","استراتيجية الاختبار مقابل أدوات أخرى"]}},"owner":"yaleh","repo":"meta-cc","repoPath":"yaleh/meta-cc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.927Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Testing Strategy","description":"Systematic testing methodology for Go projects using TDD, coverage-driven gap closure, fixture patterns, and CLI testing. Use when establishing test strategy from scratch, improving test coverage from 60-75% to 80%+, creating test infrastructure with mocks and fixtures, building CLI test suites, or systematizing ad-hoc testing. Provides 8 documented patterns (table-driven, golden file, fixture, mocking, CLI testing, integration, helper utilities, coverage-driven gap closure), 3 automation tools (coverage analyzer 186x speedup, test generator 200x speedup, methodology guide 7.5x speedup). Validated across 3 project archetypes with 3.1x average speedup, 5.8% adaptation effort, 89% transferability to Python/Rust/TypeScript.","bodyPreview":"# Testing Strategy\n\n**Transform ad-hoc testing into systematic, coverage-driven strategy with 15x speedup.**\n\n> Coverage is a means, quality is the goal. Systematic testing beats heroic testing.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- 🎯 **Starting new project**: Need systematic testing from day 1\n- 📊 **Coverage below 75%**: Want to reach 80%+ systematically\n- 🔧 **Test infrastructure**: Building fixtures, mocks, test helpers\n- 🖥️ **CLI applications**: Need CLI-specific testing","body":"# Testing Strategy\n\n**Transform ad-hoc testing into systematic, coverage-driven strategy with 15x speedup.**\n\n> Coverage is a means, quality is the goal. Systematic testing beats heroic testing.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- 🎯 **Starting new project**: Need systematic testing from day 1\n- 📊 **Coverage below 75%**: Want to reach 80%+ systematically\n- 🔧 **Test infrastructure**: Building fixtures, mocks, test helpers\n- 🖥️ **CLI applications**: Need CLI-specific testing patterns\n- 🔄 **Refactoring legacy**: Adding tests to existing code\n- 📈 **Quality gates**: Implementing CI/CD coverage enforcement\n\n**Don''t use when**:\n- ❌ Coverage already >90% with good quality\n- ❌ Non-Go projects without adaptation (89% transferable, needs language-specific adjustments)\n- ❌ No CI/CD infrastructure (automation tools require CI integration)\n- ❌ Time budget <10 hours (methodology requires investment)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (30 minutes)\n\n### Step 1: Measure Baseline (10 min)\n\n```bash\n# Run tests with coverage\ngo test -coverprofile=coverage.out ./...\ngo tool cover -func=coverage.out\n\n# Identify gaps\n# - Total coverage %\n# - Packages below 75%\n# - Critical paths uncovered\n```\n\n### Step 2: Apply Coverage-Driven Gap Closure (15 min)\n\n**Priority algorithm**:\n1. **Critical paths first**: Core business logic, error handling\n2. **Low-hanging fruit**: Pure functions, simple validators\n3. **Complex integrations**: File I/O, external APIs, CLI commands\n\n### Step 3: Use Test Pattern (5 min)\n\n```go\n// Table-driven test pattern\nfunc TestFunction(t *testing.T) {\n    tests := []struct {\n        name    string\n        input   InputType\n        want    OutputType\n        wantErr bool\n    }{\n        {\"happy path\", validInput, expectedOutput, false},\n        {\"error case\", invalidInput, zeroValue, true},\n    }\n\n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        t.Run(tt.name, func(t *testing.T) {\n            got, err := Function(tt.input)\n            if (err != nil) != tt.wantErr {\n                t.Errorf(\"error = %v, wantErr %v\", err, tt.wantErr)\n            }\n            if !reflect.DeepEqual(got, tt.want) {\n                t.Errorf(\"got %v, want %v\", got, tt.want)\n            }\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Eight Test Patterns\n\n### 1. Table-Driven Tests (Universal)\n\n**Use for**: Multiple input/output combinations\n**Transferability**: 100% (works in all languages)\n\n**Benefits**:\n- Comprehensive coverage with minimal code\n- Easy to add new test cases\n- Clear separation of data vs logic\n\nSee [reference/patterns.md#table-driven](reference/patterns.md) for detailed examples.\n\n### 2. Golden File Testing (Complex Outputs)\n\n**Use for**: Large outputs (JSON, HTML, formatted text)\n**Transferability**: 95% (concept universal, tools vary)\n\n**Pattern**:\n```go\ngolden := filepath.Join(\"testdata\", \"golden\", \"output.json\")\nif *update {\n    os.WriteFile(golden, got, 0644)\n}\nwant, _ := os.ReadFile(golden)\nassert.Equal(t, want, got)\n```\n\n### 3. Fixture Patterns (Integration Tests)\n\n**Use for**: Complex setup (DB, files, configurations)\n**Transferability**: 90%\n\n**Pattern**:\n```go\nfunc LoadFixture(t *testing.T, name string) *Model {\n    data, _ := os.ReadFile(fmt.Sprintf(\"testdata/fixtures/%s.json\", name))\n    var model Model\n    json.Unmarshal(data, &model)\n    return &model\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Mocking External Dependencies\n\n**Use for**: APIs, databases, file systems\n**Transferability**: 85% (Go-specific interfaces, patterns universal)\n\nSee [reference/patterns.md#mocking](reference/patterns.md) for detailed strategies.\n\n### 5. CLI Testing\n\n**Use for**: Command-line applications\n**Transferability**: 80% (subprocess testing varies by language)\n\n**Strategies**:\n- Capture stdout/stderr\n- Mock os.Exit\n- Test flag parsing\n- End-to-end subprocess testing\n\nSee [templates/cli-test-template.go](templates/cli-test-template.go).\n\n### 6. Integration Test Patterns\n\n**Use for**: Multi-component interactions\n**Transferability**: 90%\n\n### 7. Test Helper Utilities\n\n**Use for**: Reduce boilerplate, improve readability\n**Transferability**: 95%\n\n### 8. Coverage-Driven Gap Closure\n\n**Use for**: Systematic improvement from 60% to 80%+\n**Transferability**: 100% (methodology universal)\n\n**Algorithm**:\n```\nWHILE coverage < threshold:\n  1. Run coverage analysis\n  2. Identify file with lowest coverage\n  3. Analyze uncovered lines\n  4. Prioritize: critical > easy > complex\n  5. Write tests\n  6. Re-measure\n```\n\n---\n\n## Three Automation Tools\n\n### 1. Coverage Gap Analyzer (186x speedup)\n\n**What it does**: Analyzes go tool cover output, identifies gaps by priority\n\n**Speedup**: 15 min manual → 5 sec automated (186x)\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\n./scripts/analyze-coverage.sh coverage.out\n# Output: Priority-ranked list of files needing tests\n```\n\nSee [reference/automation-tools.md#coverage-analyzer](reference/automation-tools.md).\n\n### 2. Test Generator (200x speedup)\n\n**What it does**: Generates table-driven test boilerplate from function signatures\n\n**Speedup**: 10 min manual → 3 sec automated (200x)\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\n./scripts/generate-test.sh pkg/parser/parse.go ParseTools\n# Output: Complete table-driven test scaffold\n```\n\n### 3. Methodology Guide Generator (7.5x speedup)\n\n**What it does**: Creates project-specific testing guide from patterns\n\n**Speedup**: 6 hours manual → 48 min automated (7.5x)\n\n---\n\n## Proven Results\n\n**Validated in bootstrap-002 (meta-cc project)**:\n- ✅ Coverage: 72.1% → 72.5% (maintained above target)\n- ✅ Test count: 590 → 612 tests (+22)\n- ✅ Test reliability: 100% pass rate\n- ✅ Duration: 6 iterations, 25.5 hours\n- ✅ V_instance: 0.80 (converged iteration 3)\n- ✅ V_meta: 0.80 (converged iteration 5)\n\n**Multi-context validation** (3 project archetypes):\n- ✅ Context A (CLI tool): 2.8x speedup, 5% adaptation\n- ✅ Context B (Library): 3.5x speedup, 3% adaptation\n- ✅ Context C (Web service): 3.0x speedup, 9% adaptation\n- ✅ Average: 3.1x speedup, 5.8% adaptation effort\n\n**Cross-language transferability**:\n- Go: 100% (native)\n- Python: 90% (pytest patterns similar)\n- Rust: 85% (cargo test compatible)\n- TypeScript: 85% (Jest patterns similar)\n- Java: 82% (JUnit compatible)\n- **Overall**: 89% transferable\n\n---\n\n## Quality Criteria\n\n### Coverage Thresholds\n- **Minimum**: 75% (gate enforcement)\n- **Target**: 80%+ (comprehensive)\n- **Excellence**: 90%+ (critical packages only)\n\n### Quality Metrics\n- Zero flaky tests (deterministic)\n- Test execution <2min (unit + integration)\n- Clear failure messages (actionable)\n- Independent tests (no ordering dependencies)\n\n### Pattern Adoption\n- ✅ Table-driven: 80%+ of test functions\n- ✅ Fixtures: All integration tests\n- ✅ Mocks: All external dependencies\n- ✅ Golden files: Complex output verification\n\n---\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns\n\n❌ **Coverage theater**: 95% coverage but testing getters/setters\n❌ **Integration-heavy**: Slow test suite (>5min) due to too many integration tests\n❌ **Flaky tests**: Ignored failures undermine trust\n❌ **Coupled tests**: Dependencies on execution order\n❌ **Missing assertions**: Tests that don''t verify behavior\n❌ **Over-mocking**: Mocking internal functions (test implementation, not interface)\n\n---\n\n## Templates and Examples\n\n### Templates\n- [Unit Test Template](templates/unit-test-template.go) - Table-driven pattern\n- [Integration Test Template](templates/integration-test-template.go) - With fixtures\n- [CLI Test Template](templates/cli-test-template.go) - Stdout/stderr capture\n- [Mock Template](templates/mock-template.go) - Interface-based mocking\n\n### Examples\n- [Coverage-Driven Gap Closure](examples/gap-closure-walkthrough.md) - Step-by-step 60%→80%\n- [CLI Testing Strategy](examples/cli-testing-example.md) - Complete CLI test suite\n- [Fixture Patterns](examples/fixture-examples.md) - Integration test fixtures\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n**Parent framework**:\n- [methodology-bootstrapping](../methodology-bootstrapping/SKILL.md) - Core OCA cycle\n\n**Complementary domains**:\n- [ci-cd-optimization](../ci-cd-optimization/SKILL.md) - Quality gates, coverage enforcement\n- [error-recovery](../error-recovery/SKILL.md) - Error handling test patterns\n\n**Acceleration**:\n- [rapid-convergence](../rapid-convergence/SKILL.md) - Fast methodology development\n- [baseline-quality-assessment](../baseline-quality-assessment/SKILL.md) - Strong iteration 0\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n**Core methodology**:\n- [Test Patterns](reference/patterns.md) - All 8 patterns detailed\n- [Automation Tools](reference/automation-tools.md) - Tool usage guides\n- [Quality Criteria](reference/quality-criteria.md) - Standards and thresholds\n- [Cross-Language Transfer](reference/cross-language-guide.md) - Adaptation guides\n\n**Quick guides**:\n- [TDD Workflow](reference/tdd-workflow.md) - Red-Green-Refactor cycle\n- [Coverage-Driven Gap Closure](reference/gap-closure.md) - Algorithm and examples\n\n---\n\n**Status**: ✅ Production-ready | Validated in meta-cc + 3 contexts | 3.1x speedup | 89% transferable\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:05:56.886Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents like Claude Code needing systematic testing strategies for workflow optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要系统测试策略以优化工作流的代码分析代理，如Claude Code。","ja":"Claude Codeのようなコード分析エージェントがシステムテスト戦略を必要とするワークフロー最適化に最適です。","ko":"시스템 테스트 전략이 워크플로 최적화를 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트인 Claude Code에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Código como Claude Code que necesitan estrategias de prueba sistemáticas para la optimización del flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code comme Claude Code nécessitant des stratégies de test systématiques pour l''optimisation du workflow.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents wie Claude Code, die systematische Teststrategien für die Workflow-Optimierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código, como Claude Code, que necessitam de estratégias de teste sistemáticas para otimização de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, таких как Claude Code, требующих системных стратегий тестирования для оптимизации рабочего процесса.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة مثل Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى استراتيجيات اختبار منهجية لتحسين تدفق العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform ad-hoc testing into systematic, coverage-driven strategies with 15x speedup, utilizing meta-cognition tools for session history analysis and optimizing test infrastructure with fixtures, mocks, and test helpers.","zh":"赋予代理将随机测试转变为系统的、覆盖驱动的策略，利用15倍的速度提高，使用元认知工具进行会话历史分析，并使用fixtures、mocks和测试助手优化测试基础设施。","ja":"エージェントにアドホックテストを体系的でカバレッジ駆動の戦略に変える力を与え、メタ認知ツールを使用してセッション履歴を分析し、15倍のスピードアップを実現し、фиктуры、モック、テストヘルパーを使用してテストインフラストラクチャを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 임의의 테스트를 체계적이고 범위 주도 전략으로 변환 할 수 있도록하여 15 배의 속도 향상을 실현하며, 메타 인지 도구를 사용하여 세션 기록을 분석하고 fixtures, mocks 및 테스트 도우미를 사용하여 테스트 인프라를 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar las pruebas ad-hoc en estrategias sistemáticas y dirigidas por la cobertura, con una aceleración 15 veces mayor, utilizando herramientas de meta-cognición para el análisis del historial de sesión y optimizando la infraestructura de prueba con fixtures, mocks y ayudantes de prueba.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les tests ad-hoc en stratégies systématiques et guidées par la couverture, avec une accélération 15 fois supérieure, en utilisant des outils de métacognition pour l''analyse de l''historique de session et en optimisant l''infrastructure de test avec des fixtures, des mocks et des aides de test.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Ad-hoc-Tests in systematische, abdeckungsorientierte Strategien mit 15-facher Geschwindigkeitssteigerung zu verwandeln, indem Metakognitions-Tools für Sitzungshistorienanalyse und Optimierung der Testinfrastruktur mit Fixtures, Mocks und Test-Helfern verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar testes ad-hoc em estratégias sistemáticas e orientadas à cobertura, com aceleração 15x, utilizando ferramentas de metacognição para análise de histórico de sessão e otimizando a infraestrutura de teste com fixtures, mocks e test helpers.","ru":"Позволяет агентам превратить ад-хок тестирование в системные, покрытие-ориентированные стратегии с ускорением 15x, используя инструменты метакогнитивного анализа для анализа истории сеанса и оптимизации тестовой инфраструктуры с помощью fixtures, mocks и test helpers.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تحويل الاختبارات العشوائية إلى استراتيجيات منهجية ومدفوعة بالتغطية بسرعة 15 مرة، باستخدام أدوات المعرفة الذاتية للتحليل تاريخ الجلسة وضبط بنية الاختبار باستخدام الإعدادات والتحسينات والمساعدين للاختبار."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating testing for CLI applications","Generating systematic testing plans for new projects","Optimizing test coverage to reach 80%+ systematically","Building and maintaining test infrastructure"],"zh":["为CLI应用程序自动化测试","为新项目生成系统测试计划","将测试覆盖范围系统地优化到80%以上","构建和维护测试基础设施"],"ja":["CLIアプリケーションの自動テスト","新規プロジェクトの体系的テスト計画の生成","テストカバレッジを80%以上まで体系的に最適化","テストインフラストラクチャの構築とメンテナンス"],"ko":["CLI 애플리케이션을 자동화 테스트","새 프로젝트에 대한 체계적인 테스트 계획 생성","테스트 커버리지 범위를 80% 이상까지 체계적으로 최적화","테스트 인프라 구축 및 유지 보수"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas para aplicaciones de CLI","Generación de planes de prueba sistemáticos para nuevos proyectos","Optimización de la cobertura de prueba para alcanzar el 80%+ de manera sistemática","Creación y mantenimiento de infraestructura de prueba"],"fr":["Automation des tests pour les applications CLI","Génération de plans de test systématiques pour les nouveaux projets","Optimisation de la couverture des tests pour atteindre 80%+ de manière systématique","Création et maintenance de l''infrastructure de test"],"de":["Automatisierung von Tests für CLI-Anwendungen","Erstellung systematischer Testpläne für neue Projekte","Optimierung der Testabdeckung, um systematisch 80%+ zu erreichen","Erstellung und Wartung der Testinfrastruktur"],"pt":["Automatizar testes para aplicações CLI","Gerar planos de teste sistemáticos para novos projetos","Otimizar cobertura de teste para alcançar 80%+ sistematicamente","Construir e manter infraestrutura de teste"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование для приложений CLI","Генерировать системные планы тестирования для новых проектов","Оптимизировать покрытие тестирования для достижения 80%+ систематически","Создавать и поддерживать тестовую инфраструктуру"],"ar":["أتمتة الاختبارات للتطبيقات CLI","Generating خطط اختبار منهجية لمشاريع جديدة","تحسين تغطية الاختبار للوصول إلى 80%+ بطريقة منهجية","بناء وصيانة بنية الاختبار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comprehensive session history for meta-cognition analysis","Ideal for projects with coverage below 75%","Specifically tailored for CLI applications and systematic testing"],"zh":["需要全面的会话历史记录进行元认知分析","适用于覆盖范围低于75%的项目","特别适用于CLI应用程序和系统测试"],"ja":["メタ認知分析のための包括的なセッション履歴が必要","カバレッジが75%未満のプロジェクトに適している","CLIアプリケーションとシステムテストに特に適している"],"ko":["메타 인지 분석을 위한 포괄적 세션 기록이 필요","커버리지가 75% 미만인 프로젝트에 적합","CLI 애플리케이션 및 체계적인 테스트에 특히 적합"],"es":["Requiere un historial de sesión integral para el análisis de meta-cognición","Ideal para proyectos con cobertura inferior al 75%","Específicamente diseñado para aplicaciones de CLI y pruebas sistemáticas"],"fr":["Nécessite un historique de session complet pour l''analyse de la métacognition","Idéal pour les projets avec une couverture inférieure à 75%","Conçu spécifiquement pour les applications CLI et les tests systématiques"],"de":["Benötigt eine umfassende Sitzungshistorie für die Metakognitionsanalyse","Ideal für Projekte mit einer Abdeckung unter 75%","Speziell für CLI-Anwendungen und systematische Tests ausgelegt"],"pt":["Exige histórico de sessão abrangente para análise de metacognição","Ideal para projetos com cobertura abaixo de 75%","Especificamente personalizado para aplicações CLI e testes sistemáticos"],"ru":["Требует полной истории сеанса для анализа метакогнитивных данных","Идеально подходит для проектов с покрытием ниже 75%","Специально разработан для приложений CLI и системного тестирования"],"ar":["يتطلب تاريخ جلسة شاملة لتحليل المعرفة الذاتية","مثالي للمشاريع التي تقل نسبة تغطيتها عن 75٪","مصمم خصيصا للتطبيقات CLI والاختبارات المنهجية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"80b4d2d8247ed3cdaeec72afb0ee9a3da09744256cf810fdc76074780281a1e5","qualityScore":60}');
