","クラウドアーキテクチャ設計","セキュリティ開発実践","nx-workspace-patternsの代替","nx-workspace-patternsのインストール","nx-workspace-patternsのチュートリアル"],"ko":["nx-workspace-patterns소개","AI 에이전트 개발","클라우드 아키텍처 설계","보안 개발 실무","nx-workspace-patterns 대체","nx-workspace-patterns 설치","nx-workspace-patterns 튜토리얼"],"es":["nx-workspace-patterns","herramientas de AI","desarrollo de software","seguridad en la nube","arquitectura en la nube","cómo usar nx-workspace-patterns","alternativas a nx-workspace-patterns","nx-workspace-patterns vs otros"],"fr":["nx-workspace-patterns","outils d''IA","développement de logiciels","sécurité cloud","architecture cloud","comment utiliser nx-workspace-patterns","alternatives à nx-workspace-patterns","nx-workspace-patterns vs autres"],"de":["nx-workspace-patterns","AI-Tools","Softwareentwicklung","Sicherheit in der Cloud","Cloud-Architektur","wie man nx-workspace-patterns verwendet","Alternativen zu nx-workspace-patterns","nx-workspace-patterns vs andere"],"pt":["como usar nx-workspace-patterns","o que é nx-workspace-patterns","nx-workspace-patterns vs outras ferramentas","instalar nx-workspace-patterns","guia de configuração do nx-workspace-patterns","desenvolvimento de software com nx-workspace-patterns","segurança e nuvem com nx-workspace-patterns","nx-workspace-patterns para iniciantes"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты nx-workspace-patterns","что такое ИИ Агенты nx-workspace-patterns","ИИ Агенты nx-workspace-patterns vs другие инструменты","установка ИИ Агентов nx-workspace-patterns","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов nx-workspace-patterns","разработка ПО с ИИ Агентами nx-workspace-patterns","безопасность и облако с ИИ Агентами nx-workspace-patterns","ИИ Агенты nx-workspace-patterns для начинающих"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي nx-workspace-patterns","ما هي أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي nx-workspace-patterns","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي nx-workspace-patterns vs أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي nx-workspace-patterns","دليل إعداد أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي nx-workspace-patterns","تنمية البرمجيات مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي nx-workspace-patterns","أمن المعلومات والهندسة المعمارية للسحابة مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي nx-workspace-patterns","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي nx-workspace-patterns للمبتدئين"]}},"owner":"harshahosur81","repo":"ag-opencode-skills","repoPath":"harshahosur81/ag-opencode-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.940Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nx-workspace-patterns","description":"Configure and optimize Nx monorepo workspaces. Use when setting up Nx, configuring project boundaries, optimizing build caching, or implementing affected commands.","bodyPreview":"# Nx Workspace Patterns\n\nProduction patterns for Nx monorepo management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new Nx workspaces\n- Configuring project boundaries\n- Optimizing CI with affected commands\n- Implementing remote caching\n- Managing dependencies between projects\n- Migrating to Nx\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Nx Architecture\n\n```\nworkspace/\n├── apps/              # Deployable applications\n│   ├── web/\n│   └── api/\n├── libs/              # Shared libraries\n│   ├── shared/\n│   │   ├── ui/","body":"# Nx Workspace Patterns\n\nProduction patterns for Nx monorepo management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new Nx workspaces\n- Configuring project boundaries\n- Optimizing CI with affected commands\n- Implementing remote caching\n- Managing dependencies between projects\n- Migrating to Nx\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Nx Architecture\n\n```\nworkspace/\n├── apps/              # Deployable applications\n│   ├── web/\n│   └── api/\n├── libs/              # Shared libraries\n│   ├── shared/\n│   │   ├── ui/\n│   │   └── utils/\n│   └── feature/\n│       ├── auth/\n│       └── dashboard/\n├── tools/             # Custom executors/generators\n├── nx.json            # Nx configuration\n└── workspace.json     # Project configuration\n```\n\n### 2. Library Types\n\n| Type | Purpose | Example |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| **feature** | Smart components, business logic | `feature-auth` |\n| **ui** | Presentational components | `ui-buttons` |\n| **data-access** | API calls, state management | `data-access-users` |\n| **util** | Pure functions, helpers | `util-formatting` |\n| **shell** | App bootstrapping | `shell-web` |\n\n## Templates\n\n### Template 1: nx.json Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"./node_modules/nx/schemas/nx-schema.json\",\n  \"npmScope\": \"myorg\",\n  \"affected\": {\n    \"defaultBase\": \"main\"\n  },\n  \"tasksRunnerOptions\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"runner\": \"nx/tasks-runners/default\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"cacheableOperations\": [\n          \"build\",\n          \"lint\",\n          \"test\",\n          \"e2e\",\n          \"build-storybook\"\n        ],\n        \"parallel\": 3\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"targetDefaults\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"inputs\": [\"production\", \"^production\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"^production\", \"{workspaceRoot}/jest.preset.js\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"{workspaceRoot}/.eslintrc.json\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"e2e\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"^production\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"namedInputs\": {\n    \"default\": [\"{projectRoot}/**/*\", \"sharedGlobals\"],\n    \"production\": [\n      \"default\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/**/?(*.)+(spec|test).[jt]s?(x)?(.snap)\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/tsconfig.spec.json\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/jest.config.[jt]s\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/.eslintrc.json\"\n    ],\n    \"sharedGlobals\": [\n      \"{workspaceRoot}/babel.config.json\",\n      \"{workspaceRoot}/tsconfig.base.json\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"generators\": {\n    \"@nx/react\": {\n      \"application\": {\n        \"style\": \"css\",\n        \"linter\": \"eslint\",\n        \"bundler\": \"webpack\"\n      },\n      \"library\": {\n        \"style\": \"css\",\n        \"linter\": \"eslint\"\n      },\n      \"component\": {\n        \"style\": \"css\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Template 2: Project Configuration\n\n```json\n// apps/web/project.json\n{\n  \"name\": \"web\",\n  \"$schema\": \"../../node_modules/nx/schemas/project-schema.json\",\n  \"sourceRoot\": \"apps/web/src\",\n  \"projectType\": \"application\",\n  \"tags\": [\"type:app\", \"scope:web\"],\n  \"targets\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/webpack:webpack\",\n      \"outputs\": [\"{options.outputPath}\"],\n      \"defaultConfiguration\": \"production\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"compiler\": \"babel\",\n        \"outputPath\": \"dist/apps/web\",\n        \"index\": \"apps/web/src/index.html\",\n        \"main\": \"apps/web/src/main.tsx\",\n        \"tsConfig\": \"apps/web/tsconfig.app.json\",\n        \"assets\": [\"apps/web/src/assets\"],\n        \"styles\": [\"apps/web/src/styles.css\"]\n      },\n      \"configurations\": {\n        \"development\": {\n          \"extractLicenses\": false,\n          \"optimization\": false,\n          \"sourceMap\": true\n        },\n        \"production\": {\n          \"optimization\": true,\n          \"outputHashing\": \"all\",\n          \"sourceMap\": false,\n          \"extractLicenses\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"serve\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/webpack:dev-server\",\n      \"defaultConfiguration\": \"development\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"buildTarget\": \"web:build\"\n      },\n      \"configurations\": {\n        \"development\": {\n          \"buildTarget\": \"web:build:development\"\n        },\n        \"production\": {\n          \"buildTarget\": \"web:build:production\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/jest:jest\",\n      \"outputs\": [\"{workspaceRoot}/coverage/{projectRoot}\"],\n      \"options\": {\n        \"jestConfig\": \"apps/web/jest.config.ts\",\n        \"passWithNoTests\": true\n      }\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/eslint:lint\",\n      \"outputs\": [\"{options.outputFile}\"],\n      \"options\": {\n        \"lintFilePatterns\": [\"apps/web/**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Template 3: Module Boundary Rules\n\n```json\n// .eslintrc.json\n{\n  \"root\": true,\n  \"ignorePatterns\": [\"**/*\"],\n  \"plugins\": [\"@nx\"],\n  \"overrides\": [\n    {\n      \"files\": [\"*.ts\", \"*.tsx\", \"*.js\", \"*.jsx\"],\n      \"rules\": {\n        \"@nx/enforce-module-boundaries\": [\n          \"error\",\n          {\n            \"enforceBuildableLibDependency\": true,\n            \"allow\": [],\n            \"depConstraints\": [\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:app\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\n                  \"type:feature\",\n                  \"type:ui\",\n                  \"type:data-access\",\n                  \"type:util\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:feature\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\n                  \"type:ui\",\n                  \"type:data-access\",\n                  \"type:util\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:ui\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"type:ui\", \"type:util\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:data-access\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"type:data-access\", \"type:util\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:util\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"type:util\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"scope:web\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"scope:web\", \"scope:shared\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"scope:api\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"scope:api\", \"scope:shared\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"scope:shared\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"scope:shared\"]\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Template 4: Custom Generator\n\n```typescript\n// tools/generators/feature-lib/index.ts\nimport {\n  Tree,\n  formatFiles,\n  generateFiles,\n  joinPathFragments,\n  names,\n  readProjectConfiguration,\n} from ''@nx/devkit'';\nimport { libraryGenerator } from ''@nx/react'';\n\ninterface FeatureLibraryGeneratorSchema {\n  name: string;\n  scope: string;\n  directory?: string;\n}\n\nexport default async function featureLibraryGenerator(\n  tree: Tree,\n  options: FeatureLibraryGeneratorSchema\n) {\n  const { name, scope, directory } = options;\n  const projectDirectory = directory\n    ? `${directory}/${name}`\n    : `libs/${scope}/feature-${name}`;\n\n  // Generate base library\n  await libraryGenerator(tree, {\n    name: `feature-${name}`,\n    directory: projectDirectory,\n    tags: `type:feature,scope:${scope}`,\n    style: ''css'',\n    skipTsConfig: false,\n    skipFormat: true,\n    unitTestRunner: ''jest'',\n    linter: ''eslint'',\n  });\n\n  // Add custom files\n  const projectConfig = readProjectConfiguration(tree, `${scope}-feature-${name}`);\n  const projectNames = names(name);\n\n  generateFiles(\n    tree,\n    joinPathFragments(__dirname, ''files''),\n    projectConfig.sourceRoot,\n    {\n      ...projectNames,\n      scope,\n      tmpl: '''',\n    }\n  );\n\n  await formatFiles(tree);\n}\n```\n\n### Template 5: CI Configuration with Affected\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/ci.yml\nname: CI\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n\nenv:\n  NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}\n\njobs:\n  main:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: 20\n          cache: ''npm''\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Derive SHAs for affected commands\n        uses: nrwl/nx-set-shas@v4\n\n      - name: Run affected lint\n        run: npx nx affected -t lint --parallel=3\n\n      - name: Run affected test\n        run: npx nx affected -t test --parallel=3 --configuration=ci\n\n      - name: Run affected build\n        run: npx nx affected -t build --parallel=3\n\n      - name: Run affected e2e\n        run: npx nx affected -t e2e --parallel=1\n```\n\n### Template 6: Remote Caching Setup\n\n```typescript\n// nx.json with Nx Cloud\n{\n  \"tasksRunnerOptions\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"runner\": \"nx-cloud\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"cacheableOperations\": [\"build\", \"lint\", \"test\", \"e2e\"],\n        \"accessToken\": \"your-nx-cloud-token\",\n        \"parallel\": 3,\n        \"cacheDirectory\": \".nx/cache\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"nxCloudAccessToken\": \"your-nx-cloud-token\"\n}\n\n// Self-hosted cache with S3\n{\n  \"tasksRunnerOptions\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"runner\": \"@nx-aws-cache/nx-aws-cache\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"cacheableOperations\": [\"build\", \"lint\", \"test\"],\n        \"awsRegion\": \"us-east-1\",\n        \"awsBucket\": \"my-nx-cache-bucket\",\n        \"awsProfile\": \"default\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Common Commands\n\n```bash\n# Generate new library\nnx g @nx/react:lib feature-auth --directory=libs/web --tags=type:feature,scope:web\n\n# Run affected tests\nnx affected -t test --base=main\n\n# View dependency graph\nnx graph\n\n# Run specific project\nnx build web --configuration=production\n\n# Reset cache\nnx reset\n\n# Run migrations\nnx migrate latest\nnx migrate --run-migrations\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n- **Use tags consistently** - Enforce with module boundaries\n- **Enable caching early** - Significant CI savings\n- **Keep libs focused** - Single responsibility\n- **Use generators** - Ensure consistency\n- **Document boundaries** - Help new developers\n\n### Don''ts\n- **Don''t create circular deps** - Graph should be acyclic\n- **Don''t skip affected** - Test only what changed\n- **Don''t ignore boundaries** - Tech debt accumulates\n- **Don''t over-granularize** - Balance lib count\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Nx Documentation](https://nx.dev/getting-started/intro)\n- [Module Boundaries](https://nx.dev/core-features/enforce-module-boundaries)\n- [Nx Cloud](https://nx.app/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:09:22.344Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Monorepo Management Agents requiring efficient Nx workspace configuration and optimization.","zh":"适合于需要高效的Nx工作空间配置和优化的Monorepo管理代理。","ja":"Nxワークスペースの構成と最適化を効率的に行う必要があるMonorepo管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"효율적인 Nx 작업공간 구성 및 최적화를 필요로 하는 모노레포 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Monorepo que requieren una configuración y optimización eficientes del espacio de trabajo Nx.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Gestion de Monorepo nécessitant une configuration et une optimisation efficaces de l''espace de travail Nx.","de":"Ideal für Monorepo-Management-Agents, die eine effiziente Nx-Arbeitsbereichskonfiguration und -optimierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Monorepo que exigem configuração e otimização eficientes do espaço de trabalho Nx.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления монорепозиторием, требующих эффективной настройки и оптимизации рабочего пространства Nx.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة مونوريبوس الذين يحتاجون إلى تكوين وتصفية كفؤة لمكان العمل Nx."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline Nx monorepo management by configuring project boundaries, optimizing CI with affected commands, and implementing remote caching using Nx architecture and libraries.","zh":"赋予代理简化Nx单体仓库管理的能力，通过配置项目边界、使用受影响的命令优化CI，并使用Nx架构和库实现远程缓存。","ja":"エージェントにNxモノレポ管理を簡素化する能力を与え、プロジェクトの境界を設定し、影響を受けるコマンドを使用してCIを最適化し、Nxアーキテクチャとライブラリを使用してリモートキャッシュを実装します。","ko":"에이전트가 Nx 모노레포 관리를 간소화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 프로젝트 경계를 구성하고 영향을 받는 명령을 사용하여 CI를 최적화하고 Nx 아키텍처 및 라이브러리를 사용하여 원격 캐싱을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simplificar la gestión de monorepo de Nx configurando límites de proyecto, optimizando la integración continua con comandos afectados e implementando la caché remota mediante la arquitectura y las bibliotecas de Nx.","fr":"Permet aux agents de simplifier la gestion de monorepo Nx en configurant les limites de projet, en optimisant l''intégration continue avec des commandes affectées et en mettant en œuvre un cache distant à l''aide de l''architecture et des bibliothèques Nx.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Nx-Monorepo-Verwaltung zu vereinfachen, indem sie Projektgrenzen konfigurieren, die kontinuierliche Integration mit betroffenen Befehlen optimieren und Remote-Caching mithilfe der Nx-Architektur und -Bibliotheken implementieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem a gestão de monorepo Nx, configurando limites de projeto, otimizando a CI com comandos afetados e implementando cache remoto usando a arquitetura e bibliotecas Nx.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать управление монорепозиторием Nx, настраивая границы проектов, оптимизируя CI с помощью команд, влияющих на результат, и реализуя удаленный кэш с использованием архитектуры и библиотек Nx.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من ضبط إدارة مونوريبوس Nx من خلال تكوين حدود المشروع وضبط سي آي مع أوامر مؤثرة وتنفيذ ذاكرة مؤقتة عن بعد باستخدام هندسة Nx ومكتباتها."},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up new Nx workspaces with optimized project structures","Configuring and managing dependencies between projects in Nx","Migrating existing projects to Nx for improved monorepo management"],"zh":["使用优化的项目结构设置新的Nx工作空间","在Nx中配置和管理项目之间的依赖关系","将现有项目迁移到Nx以改善单体仓库管理"],"ja":["最適化されたプロジェクト構造で新しいNxワークスペースを設定する","Nx内でプロジェクト間の依存関係を構成および管理する","モノレポ管理の改善のために既存のプロジェクトをNxに移行する"],"ko":["최적화된 프로젝트 구조로 새로운 Nx 작업공간 설정하기","Nx에서 프로젝트 간의 의존성을 구성 및 관리하기","모노레포 관리를 개선하기 위해 기존 프로젝트를 Nx로 마이그레이션하기"],"es":["Configuración de nuevos espacios de trabajo Nx con estructuras de proyecto optimizadas","Configuración y gestión de dependencias entre proyectos en Nx","Migración de proyectos existentes a Nx para una mejor gestión de monorepo"],"fr":["Configuration de nouveaux espaces de travail Nx avec des structures de projet optimisées","Configuration et gestion des dépendances entre les projets Nx","Migration de projets existants vers Nx pour une meilleure gestion de monorepo"],"de":["Einrichtung neuer Nx-Arbeitsbereiche mit optimierten Projektstrukturen","Konfiguration und Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten zwischen Nx-Projekten","Migration bestehender Projekte zu Nx für eine verbesserte Monorepo-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Configuração de novos espaços de trabalho Nx com estruturas de projeto otimizadas","Configuração e gerenciamento de dependências entre projetos no Nx","Migração de projetos existentes para o Nx para melhorar a gestão de monorepo"],"ru":["Настройка новых рабочих пространств Nx с оптимизированной структурой проектов","Настройка и управление зависимостями между проектами в Nx","Миграция существующих проектов в Nx для улучшения управления монорепозиторием"],"ar":["ضبط مساحات العمل الجديدة Nx مع هياكل المشروع المثلى","تكوين وإدارة التبعيات بين المشاريع في Nx","هجرة المشاريع الحالية إلى Nx لتحسين إدارة مونوريبوس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nx installation and setup","Limited to Nx monorepo management"],"zh":["需要Nx的安装和设置","仅限于Nx单体仓库管理"],"ja":["Nxのインストールとセットアップが必要","Nxモノレポ管理に限定される"],"ko":["Nx의 설치 및 설정이 필요함","Nx 모노레포 관리에만 국한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de Nx","Limitado a la gestión de monorepo de Nx"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Nx","Limité à la gestion de monorepo Nx"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Einrichtung von Nx","Begrenzt auf die Nx-Monorepo-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do Nx","Limitado à gestão de monorepo Nx"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Nx","Ограничен управлением монорепозиторием Nx"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Nx","محدود بإدارة مونوريبوس Nx"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6286fae01303804282fedd8b858cd8312e0637126abe6b8f3d01eab19e9777a0","qualityScore":60}');
