acciones de GitHub","ThinkFleet","runtime de agentes de IA","creación de acciones personalizadas","Docker","Raspberry Pi","SDK de plugins","cómo usar agentes de IA","qué es un agente de IA"],"fr":["agents IA","générateur d''actions GitHub","ThinkFleet","plateforme de runtime d''agents IA","création d''actions personnalisées","Docker","Raspberry Pi","SDK de plugins","comment utiliser les agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA"],"de":["KI-Agents","GitHub-Action-Generator","ThinkFleet","KI-Agents-Laufzeitplattform","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Aktionen","Docker","Raspberry Pi","Plugin-SDK","wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent"],"pt":["como usar github-action-gen","o que é agente de IA","github-action-gen alternativa","github-action-gen vs Zapier","instalar github-action-gen","guia de configuração do github-action-gen"],"ru":["как использовать github-action-gen","что такое ИИ агент","github-action-gen альтернатива","github-action-gen vs Zapier","установить github-action-gen","руководство по настройке github-action-gen"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام github-action-gen","ما هو وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل github-action-gen","github-action-gen مقابل Zapier","تثبيت github-action-gen","دليل إعداد github-action-gen"]}},"owner":"ThinkfleetAI","repo":"thinkfleet-engine","repoPath":"ThinkfleetAI/thinkfleet-engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.956Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-action-gen","description":"Generate GitHub Actions workflows from plain English. Use when setting up CI.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Action Generator\n\nStop copy-pasting workflow YAML from StackOverflow. Describe what you want and get a working GitHub Actions workflow.\n\n**One command. Zero config. Just works.**\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpx ai-github-action \"test and deploy on push to main\"\n```\n\n## What It Does\n\n- Generates complete GitHub Actions workflow files\n- Handles common patterns like test, build, deploy\n- Includes caching for faster runs\n- Supports multiple deploy targets\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n```bash\n# Test and","body":"# GitHub Action Generator\n\nStop copy-pasting workflow YAML from StackOverflow. Describe what you want and get a working GitHub Actions workflow.\n\n**One command. Zero config. Just works.**\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpx ai-github-action \"test and deploy on push to main\"\n```\n\n## What It Does\n\n- Generates complete GitHub Actions workflow files\n- Handles common patterns like test, build, deploy\n- Includes caching for faster runs\n- Supports multiple deploy targets\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n```bash\n# Test and deploy\nnpx ai-github-action \"test and deploy on push to main\"\n\n# PR checks\nnpx ai-github-action \"run eslint and prettier on PRs\" --install\n\n# Docker workflow\nnpx ai-github-action \"build docker image and push to ECR\" -o deploy.yml\n\n# Scheduled job\nnpx ai-github-action \"run database backup every night at 2am\"\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Use secrets** - never hardcode credentials\n- **Cache dependencies** - saves minutes per run\n- **Fail fast** - run quick checks first\n- **Use matrix builds** - test multiple node versions\n\n## When to Use This\n\n- Setting up CI for a new repo\n- Adding deployment automation\n- Creating custom workflows\n- Learning GitHub Actions syntax\n\n## Part of the LXGIC Dev Toolkit\n\nThis is one of 110+ free developer tools built by LXGIC Studios. No paywalls, no sign-ups, no API keys on free tiers. Just tools that work.\n\n**Find more:**\n- GitHub: https://github.com/LXGIC-Studios\n- Twitter: https://x.com/lxgicstudios\n- Substack: https://lxgicstudios.substack.com\n- Website: https://lxgicstudios.com\n\n## Requirements\n\nNo install needed. Just run with npx. Node.js 18+ recommended. Needs OPENAI_API_KEY environment variable.\n\n```bash\nnpx ai-github-action --help\n```\n\n## How It Works\n\nTakes your plain English description and generates GitHub Actions YAML with the right triggers, jobs, and steps. The AI knows common patterns and best practices for different workflows.\n\n## License\n\nMIT. Free forever. Use it however you want.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:13:12.229Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents needing to generate CI/CD workflows without manual YAML configuration.","zh":"非常适合需要无需手动 YAML 配置即可生成 CI/CD 工作流的 DevOps Automation Agents。","ja":"手動での YAML 設定なしに CI/CD ワークフローを生成する必要がある DevOps Automation Agents に最適です。","ko":"수동 YAML 구성 없이 CI/CD 워크플로우를 생성해야 하는 DevOps Automation Agents에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para los agentes de automatización de DevOps que necesitan generar flujos de trabajo de CI/CD sin configuración manual de YAML.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation DevOps ayant besoin de générer des workflows CI/CD sans configuration manuelle de YAML.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Automatisierungs-Agents, die CI/CD-Workflows ohne manuelle YAML-Konfiguration erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação DevOps que precisam gerar fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD sem configuração manual de YAML.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации DevOps, которым необходимо создавать рабочие процессы CI/CD без ручной конфигурации YAML.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء أتمتة DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء سير عمل CI/CD دون تكوين YAML يدوي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Generates complete GitHub Actions workflow files from natural language descriptions, handling common patterns like testing, building, and deployment with built-in caching for faster runs. Supports multiple deploy targets through zero-config command execution via npx.","zh":"能够根据自然语言描述生成完整的 GitHub Actions 工作流文件，处理测试、构建和部署等常见模式，并具有内置缓存以实现更快的运行。通过 npx 的零配置命令执行支持多部署目标。","ja":"自然言語の記述から完全な GitHub Actions ワークフローファイルを生成し、テスト、ビルド、デプロイといった一般的なパターンを処理し、より高速な実行のための組み込みキャッシュを備えています。npx によるゼロコンフィグレーションコマンド実行を通じて、複数のデプロイターゲットをサポートします。","ko":"자연어 설명으로부터 완전한 GitHub Actions 워크플로우 파일을 생성하며, 테스트, 빌드 및 배포와 같은 일반적인 패턴을 처리하고 더 빠른 실행을 위한 내장 캐싱 기능을 갖추고 있습니다. npx를 통한 제로 구성 명령 실행으로 여러 배포 대상을 지원합니다.","es":"Genera archivos de flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions completos a partir de descripciones en lenguaje natural, manejando patrones comunes como pruebas, compilación e implementación con almacenamiento en caché incorporado para ejecuciones más rápidas. Admite múltiples objetivos de implementación mediante la ejecución de comandos de configuración cero a través de npx.","fr":"Génère des fichiers de workflow GitHub Actions complets à partir de descriptions en langage naturel, gérant des modèles courants comme les tests, la construction et le déploiement avec un cache intégré pour des exécutions plus rapides. Prend en charge plusieurs cibles de déploiement via l''exécution de commandes sans configuration (zero-config) via npx.","de":"Erzeugt vollständige GitHub Actions-Workflow-Dateien aus natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen, behandelt gängige Muster wie Tests, Builds und Deployment mit integriertem Caching für schnellere Durchläufe. Unterstützt mehrere Bereitstellungsziele durch Zero-Config-Befehlsausführung über npx.","pt":"Gera arquivos de fluxo de trabalho completos do GitHub Actions a partir de descrições em linguagem natural, lidando com padrões comuns como testes, compilação e implantação com cache integrado para execuções mais rápidas. Suporta vários destinos de implantação por meio de execução de comando de configuração zero via npx.","ru":"Генерирует полные файлы рабочих процессов GitHub Actions из описаний на естественном языке, обрабатывая общие шаблоны, такие как тестирование, сборка и развертывание со встроенным кэшированием для более быстрого выполнения. Поддерживает несколько целей развертывания через выполнение команд с нулевой конфигурацией с помощью npx.","ar":"يولد ملفات سير عمل GitHub Actions كاملة من الأوصاف باللغة الطبيعية، ويتعامل مع الأنماط الشائعة مثل الاختبار والبناء والنشر مع ذاكرة تخزين مؤقت مدمجة لتشغيل أسرع. يدعم أهداف نشر متعددة من خلال تنفيذ أوامر بدون إعداد عبر npx."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating CI/CD pipeline creation","Generating test and deployment workflows","Implementing caching strategies for workflow optimization","Creating multi-target deployment configurations"],"zh":["自动化 CI/CD 流水线创建","生成测试和部署工作流","实施缓存策略以优化工作流","创建多目标部署配置"],"ja":["CI/CD パイプライン作成の自動化","テストおよびデプロイワークフローの生成","ワークフロー最適化のためのキャッシュ戦略の実装","マルチターゲットデプロイ構成の作成"],"ko":["CI/CD 파이프라인 생성 자동화","테스트 및 배포 워크플로우 생성","워크플로우 최적화를 위한 캐싱 전략 구현","다중 대상 배포 구성 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de pipelines de CI/CD","Generación de flujos de trabajo de pruebas e implementación","Implementación de estrategias de almacenamiento en caché para la optimización del flujo de trabajo","Creación de configuraciones de implementación para múltiples objetivos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de pipelines CI/CD","Génération de workflows de test et de déploiement","Mise en œuvre de stratégies de cache pour l''optimisation des workflows","Création de configurations de déploiement multi-cibles"],"de":["Automatisierung der CI/CD-Pipeline-Erstellung","Generierung von Test- und Bereitstellungsworkflows","Implementierung von Caching-Strategien zur Workflow-Optimierung","Erstellung von Multi-Target-Bereitstellungskonfigurationen"],"pt":["Automatização da criação de pipeline de CI/CD","Geração de fluxos de trabalho de teste e implantação","Implementação de estratégias de cache para otimização de fluxo de trabalho","Criação de configurações de implantação para vários destinos"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания конвейера CI/CD","Генерация рабочих процессов тестирования и развертывания","Реализация стратегий кэширования для оптимизации рабочих процессов","Создание конфигураций развертывания для нескольких целей"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء خط أنابيب CI/CD","إنشاء سير عمل الاختبار والنشر","تنفيذ استراتيجيات التخزين المؤقت لتحسين سير العمل","إنشاء تكوينات النشر متعددة الأهداف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npx execution environment","GitHub Actions specific syntax only","Limited to supported common patterns mentioned"],"zh":["需要 npx 执行环境","仅支持 GitHub Actions 特定语法","仅限于支持的常见模式"],"ja":["npx 実行環境が必要","GitHub Actions 固有の構文のみ対応","サポートされている一般的なパターンに限定"],"ko":["npx 실행 환경이 필요함","GitHub Actions 전용 구문만 지원","지원되는 일반적인 패턴으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de ejecución npx","Sintaxis específica solo para GitHub Actions","Limitado a los patrones comunes admitidos mencionados"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement d''exécution npx","Syntaxe spécifique à GitHub Actions uniquement","Limité aux modèles communs pris en charge mentionnés"],"de":["Erfordert eine npx-Ausführungsumgebung","Nur GitHub Actions-spezifische Syntax","Beschränkt auf die erwähnten unterstützten gängigen Muster"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de execução npx","Apenas sintaxe específica do GitHub Actions","Limitado aos padrões comuns suportados mencionados"],"ru":["Требует среду выполнения npx","Только синтаксис, специфичный для GitHub Actions","Ограничено упомянутыми поддерживаемыми общими шаблонами"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تنفيذ npx","بناء جملة GitHub Actions المحدد فقط","مقتصر على الأنماط الشائعة المدعومة المذكورة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"702367d412e26389bc4d35ec43bdecb6f104066af8929564c14b51cae4c4fde5","qualityScore":60}');
