anding page vs competidores","instalación de herramientas de landing page","guía de configuración de herramientas de landing page"],"fr":["outils de page de destination","intelligence artificielle dans le marketing","comment utiliser des outils de page de destination","alternatives aux outils de page de destination","outils de page de destination vs concurrents","installation d''outils de page de destination","guide de configuration des outils de page de destination"],"de":["AI-gestützte Landingpage-Tools","Künstliche Intelligenz im Marketing","wie man AI-gestützte Landingpage-Tools verwendet","Alternativen zu AI-gestützten Landingpage-Tools","AI-gestützte Landingpage-Tools vs Wettbewerber","Installation von AI-gestützten Landingpage-Tools","Einrichtungsanleitung für AI-gestützte Landingpage-Tools"],"pt":["ferramentas de Inteligência Artificial para marketing","quizzes de marketing de página de destino","como usar Inteligência Artificial no marketing","o que é Inteligência Artificial no marketing","ferramentas de marketing de página de destino","alternativas para quizzes de marketing","guia de instalação de ferramentas de Inteligência Artificial"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для маркетинга","викторины для маркетинга лэндингов","как использовать ИИ в маркетинге","что такое ИИ в маркетинге","инструменты маркетинга лэндингов","альтернативы для викторинов маркетинга","руководство по установке ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتسويق","استبيانات التسويق لصفحة الهبوط","كيفية استخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي في التسويق","ما هي أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي في التسويق","أدوات تسويقية لصفحة الهبوط","بديلات لاستبيانات التسويق","دليل تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"vitorsilva","repo":"saberloop","repoPath":"vitorsilva/saberloop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.690Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"landing-page-marketing","description":"Automate landing page updates and marketing asset capture following established patterns","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Landing Page Marketing Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill automates the complete workflow for updating the Saberloop landing page and capturing marketing assets. It consolidates screenshot capture, image processing, HTML updates, and deployment into a standardized process.\n\n## Landing Page Architecture\n\n```\nsaberloop.com/\n├── index.html          # Landing page (from ./landing/)\n├── app/                # PWA application\n├── app-staging/        # Staging PWA\n└── [other endpoints]\n\n./landing/\n├── ind","body":"# Landing Page Marketing Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill automates the complete workflow for updating the Saberloop landing page and capturing marketing assets. It consolidates screenshot capture, image processing, HTML updates, and deployment into a standardized process.\n\n## Landing Page Architecture\n\n```\nsaberloop.com/\n├── index.html          # Landing page (from ./landing/)\n├── app/                # PWA application\n├── app-staging/        # Staging PWA\n└── [other endpoints]\n\n./landing/\n├── index.html          # Main landing page HTML\n├── images/             # Landing page images (304x584 for mobile screenshots)\n│   ├── demo.webm\n│   ├── landing-*.png\n│   └── party-demo.webm\n└── [deployed to root]\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when ANY of these are true:\n- [ ] Adding a new feature to showcase on landing page\n- [ ] Updating marketing copy or CTAs\n- [ ] Capturing new app screenshots\n- [ ] Creating demo videos\n- [ ] Refreshing existing screenshots after UI changes\n- [ ] Deploying landing page updates\n\n## Landing Page Sections\n\n| Section | Location (lines) | Purpose |\n|---------|------------------|---------|\n| Hero | ~668-694 | Main headline, video demo, primary CTAs |\n| Features | ~697-733 | Feature cards grid (6-7 cards) |\n| Party Mode | ~736-759 | Dedicated party mode section |\n| How It Works | ~762-788 | 4-step process explanation |\n| Screenshots | ~791-803 | App screenshot gallery |\n| Share Section | ~806-819 | Social sharing preview |\n| CTA | ~822-848 | Final call-to-action columns |\n| Footer | ~851-862 | Links and copyright |\n\n## Complete Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Screenshot Capture\n\n#### Step 1.1: Create Capture Script\n\n**File:** `tests/e2e/capture-[feature]-screenshots.spec.js`\n\n```javascript\nimport { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';\nimport { setupAuthenticatedState, clearSessions } from ''./helpers.js'';\n\nconst MOBILE_VIEWPORT = { width: 375, height: 667 };\nconst SCREENSHOT_DIR = ''landing/images'';\n\ntest.use({ viewport: MOBILE_VIEWPORT });\n\ntest.describe(''Capture [Feature] Screenshots'', () => {\n\n  test(''[Feature] screenshot'', async ({ page }) => {\n    // Setup authenticated state if needed\n    await setupAuthenticatedState(page);\n    await clearSessions(page);\n    await page.reload();\n    await page.waitForSelector(''[data-testid=\"welcome-heading\"]'', { timeout: 10000 });\n\n    // Navigate to the screen to capture\n    await page.goto(''/#/[route]'');\n    await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n\n    // Setup the UI state (scroll, open modals, etc.)\n    // ...\n\n    // Capture screenshot\n    await page.screenshot({\n      path: `${SCREENSHOT_DIR}/landing-[feature-name].png`,\n      fullPage: false\n    });\n\n    console.log(''✓ Captured: [Feature] screenshot'');\n  });\n\n});\n```\n\n#### Step 1.2: Run Capture Script\n\n```bash\n# Run with visible browser\nnpx playwright test tests/e2e/capture-[feature]-screenshots.spec.js --headed\n\n# Or run all capture scripts\nnpm run test:e2e:capture\n```\n\n#### Step 1.3: Process Images\n\n```bash\n# Resize to landing page dimensions (304x584)\n# Option 1: Using Sharp CLI\nnpx sharp-cli landing/images/landing-[feature].png -o landing/images/landing-[feature].png resize 304 584\n\n# Option 2: Using ImageMagick\nconvert landing/images/landing-[feature].png -resize 304x584 landing/images/landing-[feature].png\n\n# Verify file size (should be <50KB for fast loading)\nls -la landing/images/landing-[feature].png\n```\n\n### Phase 2: HTML Updates\n\n#### Step 2.1: Add Feature Card\n\n**Location:** Features grid in `landing/index.html` (~line 700)\n\n```html\n<!-- Add after existing feature cards -->\n<div class=\"feature-card\">\n    <div class=\"feature-icon\">[EMOJI]</div>\n    <h3>[Feature Name]</h3>\n    <p>[Short description - 1-2 sentences]</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n**Available emojis for consistency:**\n- 🧠 AI/Learning\n- 🌍 Languages/Global\n- 🎓 Education/Levels\n- 📱 Mobile/Offline\n- 🔒 Privacy/Security\n- 🎉 Social/Party\n- 🤖 AI Models/Tech\n- ⚡ Performance\n- 💰 Pricing/Value\n\n#### Step 2.2: Update CTA Section\n\n**Location:** CTA columns in `landing/index.html` (~line 822)\n\n```html\n<div class=\"cta-column\">\n    <h3>[Column Title]</h3>\n    <ul>\n        <li>[Benefit 1]</li>\n        <li>[Benefit 2]</li>\n        <li>[Benefit 3]</li>\n        <li>[Benefit 4]</li>\n    </ul>\n    <a href=\"[URL]\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-track=\"[tracking_id]\">[Button Text]</a>\n</div>\n```\n\n#### Step 2.3: Add Screenshot to Gallery\n\n**Location:** Screenshots grid in `landing/index.html` (~line 794)\n\n```html\n<img src=\"images/landing-[feature].png\"\n     alt=\"[Descriptive alt text]\"\n     width=\"304\" height=\"584\"\n     loading=\"lazy\">\n```\n\n#### Step 2.4: Update Structured Data\n\n**Location:** JSON-LD in `<head>` (~line 52)\n\n```json\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"SoftwareApplication\",\n    \"name\": \"Saberloop\",\n    \"description\": \"[Updated description including new feature]\",\n    \"featureList\": [\n        \"AI-powered quiz generation\",\n        \"[New feature description]\",\n        \"Multi-language support\",\n        \"Offline mode\",\n        \"Party Mode multiplayer\"\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Testing\n\n#### Step 3.1: Local Preview\n\n```bash\n# Serve landing page locally\nnpx serve landing -p 8080\n\n# Or use Python\ncd landing && python -m http.server 8080\n```\n\n#### Step 3.2: Responsive Testing\n\nTest at these breakpoints:\n- Mobile: 375px (primary)\n- Tablet: 768px\n- Desktop: 1200px+\n\n```bash\n# Use Playwright for responsive screenshots\nnpx playwright test tests/e2e/capture-landing-responsive.spec.js\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Deployment\n\n#### Step 4.1: Deploy to Staging\n\n```bash\n# Build and deploy to staging first\nnpm run deploy:landing -- --staging\n\n# Staging URL: https://saberloop.com/staging/ (if configured)\n# Or test via: https://saberloop.com/app-staging/\n```\n\n#### Step 4.2: Verify Staging\n\nChecklist:\n- [ ] All images load correctly\n- [ ] Feature cards display properly\n- [ ] CTA buttons work\n- [ ] Mobile layout is correct\n- [ ] No console errors\n- [ ] Tracking events fire (check GA)\n\n#### Step 4.3: Deploy to Production\n\n```bash\n# Deploy landing page to production\nnpm run deploy:landing\n\n# Production URL: https://saberloop.com/\n```\n\n#### Step 4.4: Post-Deploy Verification\n\n```bash\n# Clear CDN cache if needed (depends on hosting)\n# Verify in incognito/private browsing\n# Test on actual mobile device\n```\n\n## Templates\n\n### Feature Card Template\n\n```html\n<div class=\"feature-card\">\n    <div class=\"feature-icon\">🤖</div>\n    <h3>Feature Name</h3>\n    <p>Brief description of the feature benefit to users. Keep it to 1-2 sentences.</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Hero Button Template\n\n```html\n<a href=\"/app/\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-track=\"[tracking_id]\">\n    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <!-- SVG path here -->\n    </svg>\n    Button Text\n</a>\n```\n\n### Screenshot Capture Script Template\n\n```javascript\nimport { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';\nimport { setupAuthenticatedState, clearSessions } from ''./helpers.js'';\n\nconst MOBILE_VIEWPORT = { width: 375, height: 667 };\nconst SCREENSHOT_DIR = ''landing/images'';\n\ntest.use({ viewport: MOBILE_VIEWPORT });\n\ntest.describe(''Capture Screenshots for Landing Page'', () => {\n\n  test.beforeEach(async ({ page }) => {\n    await setupAuthenticatedState(page);\n    await clearSessions(page);\n    await page.reload();\n    await page.waitForSelector(''[data-testid=\"welcome-heading\"]'', { timeout: 10000 });\n  });\n\n  test(''Screenshot 1: [Description]'', async ({ page }) => {\n    await page.goto(''/#/[route]'');\n    await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n\n    // Setup UI state...\n\n    await page.screenshot({\n      path: `${SCREENSHOT_DIR}/landing-[name].png`,\n      fullPage: false\n    });\n    console.log(''✓ Captured: [Description]'');\n  });\n\n});\n```\n\n## CSS Reference\n\n### Feature Card Styles\n\n```css\n.feature-card {\n    background: var(--background-light);  /* #252542 */\n    padding: 32px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n.feature-icon {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.feature-card h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.feature-card p {\n    color: var(--text-muted);  /* #a0a0b0 */\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n```\n\n### Button Styles\n\n```css\n.btn {\n    padding: 16px 32px;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n    background: var(--primary);  /* #FF6B35 */\n    color: white;\n}\n\n.btn-secondary {\n    background: var(--background-light);\n    color: var(--text);\n    border: 2px solid var(--background-light);\n}\n```\n\n### Color Variables\n\n```css\n:root {\n    --primary: #FF6B35;\n    --primary-dark: #e55a2b;\n    --background: #1a1a2e;\n    --background-light: #252542;\n    --text: #ffffff;\n    --text-muted: #a0a0b0;\n}\n```\n\n## Tracking Events\n\nAll clickable elements should have `data-track` attribute:\n\n```html\n<a href=\"/app/\" data-track=\"web_app_hero\">Try in Browser</a>\n```\n\nEvents are automatically tracked via the script at the bottom of the landing page:\n\n```javascript\ndocument.addEventListener(''click'', function(e) {\n    const trackable = e.target.closest(''[data-track]'');\n    if (trackable && typeof gtag === ''function'') {\n        gtag(''event'', trackable.dataset.track, {\n            ''event_category'': ''engagement'',\n            ''event_label'': trackable.dataset.track\n        });\n    }\n});\n```\n\n## Image Specifications\n\n| Type | Dimensions | Format | Max Size | Location |\n|------|------------|--------|----------|----------|\n| App Screenshot | 304x584 | PNG | 50KB | `landing/images/` |\n| Demo Video | 375x667 | WebM | 500KB | `landing/images/` |\n| Hero Video | 300x600 | WebM | 500KB | `landing/images/` |\n\n## Deployment Commands\n\n```bash\n# Landing page only\nnpm run deploy:landing\n\n# With staging flag (if configured)\nnpm run deploy:landing -- --staging\n\n# Full app + landing\nnpm run deploy && npm run deploy:landing\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Images Not Loading\n1. Check file path is correct (relative to landing/index.html)\n2. Verify file was uploaded (FTP deployment)\n3. Clear browser cache\n4. Check file permissions on server\n\n### Layout Issues\n1. Test at all breakpoints (375, 768, 1200)\n2. Check CSS grid/flexbox rules\n3. Verify image dimensions match expected\n4. Check for overflow issues\n\n### Tracking Not Working\n1. Verify `data-track` attribute exists\n2. Check GA is loaded (no ad blockers)\n3. Verify gtag function is available\n4. Check browser console for errors\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\nThis skill integrates with:\n- **testing-suite-management** - For E2E capture scripts\n- **cicd-pipeline-management** - For deployment workflows\n- **documentation-generation** - For marketing docs\n\n## References\n\n### Developer Guides\n- [E2E Testing Guide](../../../docs/developer-guide/E2E_TESTING.md)\n- [Deployment Guide](../../../docs/architecture/DEPLOYMENT.md)\n- [Staging Deployment](../../../docs/developer-guide/STAGING_DEPLOYMENT.md)\n\n### Existing Capture Scripts\n- `tests/e2e/capture-landing-assets.spec.js`\n- `tests/e2e/capture-playstore-screenshots.spec.js`\n- `tests/e2e/capture-party-demo.spec.js`\n\n### Previous Landing Updates\n- [Epic 6: Party Mode Update](../../../docs/learning/epic06_sharing/LANDING_PAGE_PARTY_UPDATE.md)\n- [Epic 11 Phase 6: Multi-Provider](../../../docs/learning/epic11_llm_support/PHASE6_MARKETING_UPDATE.md)\n\n---\n\n**Version:** 1.0.0\n**Last Updated:** 2026-01-23\n**Compatible with:** Saberloop v2.0.0+\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:32:35.629Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing automated landing page updates and HTML deployment capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动更新着陆页和HTML部署功能的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが自動化されたランディングページの更新とHTMLのデプロイ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 랜딩 페이지 업데이트와 HTML 배포 기능이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 최적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan actualizaciones de página de aterrizaje automatizadas y capacidades de implementación de HTML.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin de mises à jour de page de destination automatisées et de capacités de déploiement HTML.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die automatisierte Updates für Landeseiten und HTML-Bereitstellungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que precisam de atualizações de página de destino automatizadas e capacidades de implantação de HTML.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы автоматические обновления целевой страницы и возможности развертывания HTML.","ar":"مثالي ليعملاء التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى تحديثات صفحة الهبوط الآلية وقدرات النشر HTML."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline screenshot capture, image processing, and HTML updates using standardized workflows, leveraging PWA technology with offline support and deploying to specific endpoints like index.html and app-staging.","zh":"赋予代理人使用标准化工作流来简化截图捕获、图像处理和HTML更新的能力，利用PWA技术的离线支持，并部署到特定的端点，如index.html和app-staging。","ja":"エージェントが標準化されたワークフローを使用してスクリーンショットのキャプチャ、画像処理、HTMLの更新を簡素化する能力を提供し、PWAテクノロジーのオフラインサポートを利用し、特定のエンドポイントsuch as index.htmlとapp-stagingにデプロイします。","ko":"에이전트가 표준화된 워크플로를 사용하여 스크린샷 캡처, 이미지 처리, HTML 업데이트를 간소화할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, PWA 기술의 오프라인 지원을 활용하여 특정 엔드포인트(index.html 및 app-staging)에 배포합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simplificar la captura de pantalla, el procesamiento de imágenes y las actualizaciones de HTML utilizando flujos de trabajo estandarizados, aprovechando la tecnología PWA con soporte sin conexión y desplegando en puntos de conexión específicos como index.html y app-staging.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser la capture d''écran, le traitement d''images et les mises à jour HTML en utilisant des flux de travail standardisés, en exploitant la technologie PWA avec prise en charge hors ligne et en déployant sur des points de terminaison spécifiques comme index.html et app-staging.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Screenshot-Erfassung, Bildverarbeitung und HTML-Updates mithilfe standardisierter Workflows zu rationalisieren, die PWA-Technologie mit Offline-Unterstützung nutzt und auf bestimmte Endpunkte wie index.html und app-staging bereitstellt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem a captura de tela, o processamento de imagens e as atualizações de HTML usando fluxos de trabalho padronizados, aproveitando a tecnologia PWA com suporte offline e implantando em pontos de extremidade específicos como index.html e app-staging.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать захват экрана, обработку изображений и обновления HTML, используя стандартизированные рабочие процессы, использующие технологию PWA с поддержкой офлайн-режима и развертывая на конкретные конечные точки, такие как index.html и app-staging.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تبسيط التقاط الشاشة ومعالجة الصور وتحديثات HTML باستخدام سير عمل معيارية، مع الاستفادة من تقنية PWA مع دعم عدم الاتصال وتنفيذها إلى نقاط نهاية محددة مثل index.html و app-staging."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating landing page updates with AI-generated content","Generating and processing marketing screenshots for PWA applications","Deploying HTML updates to staging and production environments"],"zh":["使用AI生成内容自动更新着陆页","为PWA应用程序生成和处理营销截图","将HTML更新部署到预发和生产环境"],"ja":["AI生成コンテンツを使用してランディングページを自動更新する","PWAアプリケーションのマーケティングスクリーンショットを生成して処理する","HTMLの更新をステージングおよび生産環境にデプロイする"],"ko":["AI 생성 콘텐츠를 사용하여 랜딩 페이지를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","PWA 애플리케이션의 마케팅 스크린샷을 생성하고 처리하는 것","HTML 업데이트를 스테이징 및 프로덕션 환경에 배포하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de página de aterrizaje con contenido generado por IA","Generar y procesar capturas de pantalla de marketing para aplicaciones PWA","Implementar actualizaciones de HTML en entornos de staging y producción"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de page de destination avec du contenu généré par IA","Générer et traiter les captures d''écran de marketing pour les applications PWA","Déployer les mises à jour HTML dans les environnements de staging et de production"],"de":["Automatisieren von Landeseiten-Updates mit künstlich generiertem Inhalt","Generieren und Verarbeiten von Marketing-Screenshots für PWA-Anwendungen","Bereitstellen von HTML-Updates in Staging- und Produktionsumgebungen"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de página de destino com conteúdo gerado por IA","Gerar e processar capturas de tela de marketing para aplicativos PWA","Implantar atualizações de HTML em ambientes de staging e produção"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления целевой страницы с контентом, сгенерированным ИИ","Генерировать и обрабатывать маркетинговые скриншоты для приложений PWA","Развертывать обновления HTML в средах подготовки и производства"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في تحديثات صفحة الهبوط مع المحتوى الذي تم إنشاؤه بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء ومعالجة لقطات شاشة التسويق لتطبيقات PWA","نشر تحديثات HTML في بيئات الإعداد والانتاج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Saberloop landing page infrastructure","Limited to HTML and PWA application updates","Dependent on specific directory structure like ./landing/ and ./app-staging/"],"zh":["需要访问Saberloop着陆页基础设施","仅限HTML和PWA应用程序更新","依赖于特定的目录结构，如./landing/和./app-staging/"],"ja":["Saberloopランディングページインフラストラクチャへのアクセスが必要","HTMLおよびPWAアプリケーションの更新のみ","特定のディレクトリ構造（例： ./landing/および./app-staging/）に依存"],"ko":["Saberloop 랜딩 페이지 인프라에 접근할 수 있어야 함","HTML 및 PWA 애플리케이션 업데이트만 가능","특정 디렉토리 구조(예: ./landing/ 및 ./app-staging/)에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la infraestructura de página de aterrizaje de Saberloop","Limitado a actualizaciones de aplicaciones HTML y PWA","Dependiente de una estructura de directorio específica como ./landing/ y ./app-staging/"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''infrastructure de page de destination Saberloop","Limité aux mises à jour d''applications HTML et PWA","Dépend d''une structure de répertoire spécifique comme ./landing/ et ./app-staging/"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Landeseiten-Infrastruktur von Saberloop","Begrenzt auf HTML- und PWA-Anwendungs-Updates","Abhängig von einer bestimmten Verzeichnisstruktur wie ./landing/ und ./app-staging/"],"pt":["Requer acesso à infraestrutura de página de destino Saberloop","Limitado a atualizações de aplicativos HTML e PWA","Dependente de estrutura de diretório específica como ./landing/ e ./app-staging/"],"ru":["Требует доступа к инфраструктуре целевой страницы Saberloop","Ограничен обновлениями приложений HTML и PWA","Зависит от конкретной структуры директорий, такой как ./landing/ и ./app-staging/"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بنية تحتية لصفحة الهبوط Saberloop","محدود بتحديثات تطبيقات HTML و PWA","يعتمد على هيكل دليل معين مثل ./landing/ و ./app-staging/"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"97a15d22f3c14015cdcb1a239bdfc99c976c58ea91af90e95f92a95871682b31","qualityScore":59}');
