vestigación en paralelo con múltiples agentes","Mejora de la productividad y la eficiencia"],"fr":["Exécution parallèle des recherches","Audits pour garantir l''efficacité","Planification de flux de travail structurés","Recherche en parallèle avec plusieurs agents","Amélioration de la productivité et de l''efficacité"],"de":["Parallele Ausführung von Forschungen","Audits zur Gewährleistung der Effizienz","Planung strukturierter Workflows","Parallele Forschung mit mehreren Agenten","Verbesserung der Produktivität und Effizienz"],"pt":["Execução paralela de investigações","Auditorias para garantir a eficiência","Planejamento de fluxo de trabalho integrado","Suporte a investigações estruturadas","Análise de dados em tempo real","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Параллельное выполнение исследований","Аудиты для обеспечения эффективности","Планирование рабочего процесса","Поддержка структурированных исследований","Анализ данных в реальном времени","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["التنفيذ الموازي للتحقيقات","التدقيق لضمان الفعالية","تخطيط سير العمل المتكامل","دعم التحقيقات المنظمة","تحليل البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Multi-Agent-Researcher","什么是多智能体研究","Multi-Agent-Researcher替代品","Multi-Agent-Researcher安装","Multi-Agent-Researcher设置指南","AI智能体开发"],"ja":["マルチエージェント研究の方法","マルチエージェント研究とは","AIエージェントの代替品","マルチエージェント研究の実装","マルチエージェント研究の設定ガイド","AIエージェント開発"],"ko":["다중 에이전트 연구 방법","다중 에이전트 연구란","AI 에이전트 대체品","다중 에이전트 연구 설치","다중 에이전트 연구 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발"],"es":["cómo usar multi-agent-researcher","herramientas de AI para investigación","multi-agent-researcher alternativa","multi-agent-researcher vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de multi-agent-researcher","guía de configuración de multi-agent-researcher","investigación en paralelo con Python","auditorías de investigación con Node.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser multi-agent-researcher","outils d''IA pour la recherche","alternative à multi-agent-researcher","multi-agent-researcher vs autres outils d''IA","installation de multi-agent-researcher","guide de configuration de multi-agent-researcher","recherche en parallèle avec Python","audits de recherche avec Node.js"],"de":["wie man multi-agent-researcher verwendet","KI-Tools für die Forschung","Alternative zu multi-agent-researcher","multi-agent-researcher vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von multi-agent-researcher","Konfigurationshandbuch für multi-agent-researcher","parallele Forschung mit Python","Forschungsaudits mit Node.js"],"pt":["como usar multi-agent-researcher","o que é multi-agent-researcher","ferramentas de ia para investigações","multi-agent-researcher vs outras ferramentas","instalar multi-agent-researcher","guia de configuração do multi-agent-researcher","desenvolvimento de investigações com multi-agent-researcher","exemplos de uso do multi-agent-researcher"],"ru":["как использовать multi-agent-researcher","что такое multi-agent-researcher","инструменты ИИ для исследований","multi-agent-researcher vs другие инструменты","установка multi-agent-researcher","руководство по настройке multi-agent-researcher","разработка исследований с помощью multi-agent-researcher","примеры использования multi-agent-researcher"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام multi-agent-researcher","ما هو multi-agent-researcher","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتحقيقات","multi-agent-researcher مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت multi-agent-researcher","دليل إعداد multi-agent-researcher","تنمية التحقيقات باستخدام multi-agent-researcher","أمثلة على استخدام multi-agent-researcher"]}},"owner":"zubayer0077","repo":"Claude-Multi-Agent-Research-System-Skill","repoPath":"zubayer0077/Claude-Multi-Agent-Research-System-Skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.731Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"multi-agent-researcher","description":"Conduct comprehensive research on any topic by coordinating 2-4 specialized researcher agents in parallel, then synthesizing findings into a detailed report via mandatory report-writer agent delegation","version":"2.1.2","bodyPreview":"# Multi-Agent Research Coordinator\n\n## Purpose\n\nTransform complex research questions into comprehensive reports by:\n1. Decomposing broad topics into 2-4 focused subtopics\n2. Spawning specialized researcher agents in parallel\n3. Synthesizing findings into cohesive final report\n4. Saving structured outputs for reference\n\n## When to Use\n\nAuto-invoke when user asks:\n- **Search/Discovery**: \"Search what is [topic]\", \"Find information about [subject]\", \"Look up [technology]\", \"Discover [patterns]\"\n- *","body":"# Multi-Agent Research Coordinator\n\n## Purpose\n\nTransform complex research questions into comprehensive reports by:\n1. Decomposing broad topics into 2-4 focused subtopics\n2. Spawning specialized researcher agents in parallel\n3. Synthesizing findings into cohesive final report\n4. Saving structured outputs for reference\n\n## When to Use\n\nAuto-invoke when user asks:\n- **Search/Discovery**: \"Search what is [topic]\", \"Find information about [subject]\", \"Look up [technology]\", \"Discover [patterns]\"\n- **Investigation**: \"Research [topic]\", \"Investigate [subject]\", \"Analyze [phenomenon]\", \"Study [field]\", \"Explore [domain]\"\n- **Collection**: \"Gather information about [subject]\", \"Collect data on [topic]\", \"Compile resources for [area]\"\n- **Learning**: \"Learn about [subject]\", \"Tell me about [topic]\", \"Dig into [technology]\", \"Delve into [concept]\"\n- **Contextual**: \"What are the latest developments in [field]?\", \"Comprehensive analysis of [topic]\", \"Deep dive into [subject]\", \"State of the art in [domain]\", \"Best practices for [area]\"\n\nDo NOT invoke for:\n- Simple factual questions (\"What is the capital of France?\")\n- Decision evaluation (\"Should I use X or Y?\")\n- Code-related tasks (\"Debug this function\", \"Write a script\")\n\n## Orchestration Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Query Analysis & Decomposition\n\n**Step 1.1: Understand the Research Question**\nAnalyze user''s query to identify core topic, scope, and intent.\n\n**Step 1.2: Decompose into Subtopics**\nBreak topic into 2-4 focused subtopics that are:\n- Mutually exclusive (minimal overlap)\n- Collectively exhaustive (cover whole topic)\n- Independently researchable\n- Together provide comprehensive coverage\n\n**Decomposition Patterns:**\n\n**Temporal**: Past → Current → Future\n**Categorical**: Category 1, 2, 3\n**Stakeholder**: Technical → Business → Policy → User\n**Problem-Solution**: Problem → Solutions → Gaps → Future\n**Geographic**: Region A → Region B → Comparison\n\n**Step 1.3: Create Research Plan**\nUse TodoWrite to track:\n```\n- [ ] Decompose query into subtopics\n- [ ] Spawn researcher 1: [subtopic]\n- [ ] Spawn researcher 2: [subtopic]\n- [ ] Spawn researcher 3: [subtopic]\n- [ ] Synthesize findings\n- [ ] Save final report\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 2: Parallel Research Execution\n\n**Step 2.1: Spawn Researcher Agents in Parallel**\n\nFor each subtopic, create a Task tool call with:\n```\nsubagent_type: \"researcher\"\ndescription: \"Research {subtopic name}\"\nprompt: \"Research the following subtopic in depth:\n\n**Subtopic**: {Subtopic name}\n**Context**: Part of research on ''{original topic}''\n**Focus**: {Specific guidance}\n\nConduct thorough web research, gather authoritative sources, extract key findings, and save results to files/research_notes/{subtopic-slug}.md\"\n```\n\n**Critical**: Spawn ALL researchers in parallel (multiple Task calls in same message), not sequentially.\n\n**Step 2.2: Monitor Completion**\nUpdate TodoWrite as researchers complete.\n\n**Step 2.3: Verify All Complete**\nUse Glob to confirm all files exist: `files/research_notes/*.md`\n\n---\n\n### Phase 3: Synthesis & Report Generation\n\n**⚠️ CRITICAL: ARCHITECTURAL ENFORCEMENT ACTIVE ⚠️**\n\n**YOU DO NOT HAVE WRITE TOOL ACCESS** when this skill is active. The `allowed-tools` frontmatter explicitly EXCLUDES the Write tool to enforce proper workflow delegation.\n\n**YOU CANNOT**:\n- ❌ Write synthesis reports yourself\n- ❌ Create files in files/reports/ directory\n- ❌ Bypass the report-writer agent\n\n**YOU MUST**:\n- ✅ Spawn report-writer agent via Task tool\n- ✅ Delegate all synthesis and report writing to the agent\n- ✅ Read the completed report and deliver to user\n\n---\n\n**Step 3.1: Verify Research Completion**\n\n1. Use Glob to confirm all research notes exist: `files/research_notes/*.md`\n2. Verify count matches number of spawned researchers\n3. If any missing: investigate and complete before synthesis\n\n**Step 3.2: Spawn Report-Writer Agent (MANDATORY)**\n\n**This is the ONLY synthesis approach** - there is no \"Option A\" or \"Option B\". You MUST use the report-writer agent because you lack Write tool permissions.\n\n```\nTask:\nsubagent_type: \"report-writer\"\ndescription: \"Synthesize research findings into comprehensive report\"\nprompt: \"Synthesize research into comprehensive report:\n\n**Original Question**: {user query}\n**Subtopics Researched**: {list all subtopics}\n**Notes Location**: files/research_notes/\n\n## Your Tasks:\n1. Read ALL research notes from files/research_notes/\n2. Identify themes, patterns, and contradictions across notes\n3. Synthesize findings into cohesive narrative\n4. Cite sources from research notes\n5. Add cross-cutting insights beyond individual notes\n6. Save comprehensive report to files/reports/{topic-slug}_{timestamp}.md\n\n## Report Structure:\n- Executive Summary\n- Key Findings (with evidence from research notes)\n- Detailed Analysis by subtopic\n- Cross-Cutting Themes\n- Contradictions and Debates\n- Gaps and Limitations\n- Source Bibliography\n\nUse the timestamp format: $(date +\\\"%Y%m%d-%H%M%S\\\") for the filename.\"\n```\n\n**Step 3.3: Monitor Agent Completion**\n\nAfter spawning report-writer agent, wait for completion. The agent will:\n- Read all research notes\n- Synthesize findings\n- Write comprehensive report to files/reports/\n- Return completion message with file path\n\n---\n\n### Phase 4: Deliver Results\n\n**Step 4.1: Create User Summary**\n```markdown\n# Research Complete: {Topic}\n\nComprehensive research completed with {N} specialized researchers.\n\n## Key Findings\n1. {Finding 1}\n2. {Finding 2}\n3. {Finding 3}\n\n## Research Scope\n{N} subtopics investigated:\n- {Subtopic 1}\n- {Subtopic 2}\n- {Subtopic 3}\n\n## Files Generated\n**Research Notes**: `files/research_notes/`\n- {file1}.md\n- {file2}.md\n- {file3}.md\n\n**Final Report**: `files/reports/{filename}.md`\n\n## Next Steps\n{Optional suggestions}\n```\n\n**Step 4.2: Update TodoWrite**\nMark all items complete.\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Good Decomposition\n✅ 2-4 subtopics (sweet spot: 3)\n✅ Distinct but related\n✅ Comprehensive coverage\n✅ Independently researchable\n\n❌ Too many (>5)\n❌ Too few (1)\n❌ Significant overlap\n❌ Too narrow or too broad\n\n### Parallel Execution\n- Always spawn researchers simultaneously\n- Never sequential unless dependent\n- Provide context to each researcher\n- Reasonable scope (10-15 min each)\n\n### Synthesis Quality\n- Read ALL notes\n- Find connections across subtopics\n- Note contradictions explicitly\n- Cite sources\n- Add insights beyond individual notes\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n**Researcher Fails**: Try replacement, proceed with others, note gap\n**No Results Found**: Accept partial, note limitation\n**Contradictory Findings**: Document all perspectives explicitly\n**Unclear Query**: Ask clarifying questions first\n\n---\n\n## Examples\n\n**Query**: \"Research quantum error correction\"\n**Decomposition**:\n1. Theoretical foundations\n2. Hardware implementations\n3. Commercial viability\n**Researchers**: 3 parallel\n**Synthesis**: report-writer agent (MANDATORY)\n\n**Query**: \"Investigate cryptocurrency market 2025\"\n**Decomposition**:\n1. Market metrics & players\n2. Regulatory landscape\n3. Technology evolution\n4. Institutional trends\n**Researchers**: 4 parallel\n**Synthesis**: report-writer agent (MANDATORY)\n\n---\n\n**Remember**: Quality depends on good decomposition, thorough researchers, insightful synthesis, and clear user communication.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:00:24.447Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring parallel execution and audits for efficient research investigations","zh":"适用于像 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 这样的高级 AI Agent，需要并行执行和审计以进行高效的研究调查","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの高度な AI エージェントに適しており、並行実行と監査が必要な効率的な研究調査に使用される","ko":"Claude Code와 AutoGPT 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 효율적인 연구 조사에 병렬 실행과 감사가 필요함","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avanzados como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren ejecución paralela y auditorías para investigaciones de investigación eficientes","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA avancés comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant une exécution parallèle et des audits pour des enquêtes de recherche efficaces","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die eine parallele Ausführung und Audits für effiziente Forschungsuntersuchungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como Claude Code e AutoGPT que exigem execução paralela e auditorias para investigações de pesquisa eficientes","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих параллельного выполнения и аудитов для эффективных исследовательских расследований","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذي يتطلب تنفيذا متوازيا وتدقيقات لتحقيقات البحث الفعالة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate multi-agent research with parallel execution, decompose broad topics into focused subtopics, and synthesize findings into cohesive reports using structured workflow planning and audits, leveraging protocols like parallel processing and data synthesis","zh":"能够使代理人编排多代理人研究以进行并行执行，将广泛的主题分解为集中子主题，并使用结构化工作流规划和审计将发现结果合成为连贯的报告，利用像并行处理和数据合成这样的协议","ja":"エージェントがマルチエージェントの研究を並行実行で行い、広範なトピックを集中したサブトピックに分解し、構造化されたワークフロー計画と監査を使用して複数のエージェントからの発見を統合して一貫性のあるレポートを生成することを可能にし、並行処理やデータ合成などのプロトコルを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 다중 에이전트 연구를 병렬 실행으로 수행하고, 광범위한 주제를 집중된 하위 주제로 분해하며, 구조화된 워크플로 계획과 감사를 사용하여 여러 에이전트의 발견을 통합하여 일관된 보고서를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 병렬 처리나 데이터 합성 같은 프로토콜을 활용함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a orquestar investigaciones de multiagentes con ejecución paralela, descomponer temas amplios en subtemas enfocados y sintetizar hallazgos en informes cohesivos utilizando la planificación de flujos de trabajo estructurada y auditorías, aprovechando protocolos como el procesamiento paralelo y la síntesis de datos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer des recherches multi-agents avec exécution parallèle, de décomposer des sujets larges en sous-sujets ciblés et de synthétiser les résultats en rapports cohérents en utilisant une planification de flux de travail structurée et des audits, en exploitant des protocoles tels que le traitement parallèle et la synthèse de données","de":"Ermöglich es Agents, Multi-Agenten-Forschung mit paralleler Ausführung zu orchestrieren, breite Themen in fokussierte Unterthemen zu zerlegen und Ergebnisse in kohärente Berichte zu synthetisieren, indem sie eine strukturierte Workflow-Planung und Audits unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie parallelem Verarbeiten und Daten-Synthese nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orquestrar pesquisas de multi-agente com execução paralela, decompor tópicos amplos em subtópicos focados e sintetizar descobertas em relatórios coesos usando planejamento de fluxo de trabalho estruturado e auditorias, aproveitando protocolos como processamento paralelo e síntese de dados","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестрировать исследование с помощью нескольких агентов и параллельного выполнения, разбивать широкие темы на сосредоточенные подсубъекты и синтезировать результаты в связные отчеты, используя структурированное планирование рабочего процесса и аудиты, используя протоколы, такие как параллельная обработка и синтез данных","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تنسيق بحوث متعددة الوكلاء مع التنفيذ الموازي، وفكّ تجميع الموضوعات الواسعة إلى مواضيع فرعية محددة، ودمج النتائج في تقارير منسقة باستخدام تخطيط تدفق العمل المنظم والتدقيقات، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل المعالجة الموازية ودمج البيانات"},"useCases":{"en":["Decomposing complex research questions into manageable subtopics","Automating the spawning of specialized researcher agents for parallel investigation","Generating comprehensive reports by synthesizing findings from multiple agents"],"zh":["将复杂的研究问题分解为可管理的子主题","自动化专用研究者代理人的创建以进行并行调查","通过合成多个代理人的发现结果生成综合报告"],"ja":["複雑な研究問題を管理可能なサブトピックに分解する","並行調査のための専用研究者エージェントの生成を自動化する","複数のエージェントからの発見を統合して包括的なレポートを生成する"],"ko":["복잡한 연구 질문을 관리 가능한 하위 주제로 분해하는 것","병렬 조사를 위한 전문 연구자 에이전트의 생성을 자동화하는 것","여러 에이전트의 발견을 합성하여 종합적인 보고서를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Descomponer preguntas de investigación complejas en subtemas manejables","Automatizar la generación de agentes de investigador especializados para investigación paralela","Generar informes comprehensivos sintetizando hallazgos de múltiples agentes"],"fr":["Décomposer des questions de recherche complexes en sous-sujets gérables","Automatiser la création d''agents de recherche spécialisés pour investigation parallèle","Générer des rapports complets en synthétisant les résultats de plusieurs agents"],"de":["Komplexe Forschungsfragen in handhabbare Unterthemen zerlegen","Automatisieren des Spawnens von spezialisierten Forscher-Agents für parallele Untersuchung","Erstellen von umfassenden Berichten durch Synthese von Ergebnissen aus mehreren Agents"],"pt":["Decompor perguntas de pesquisa complexas em subtópicos gerenciáveis","Automatizar o surgimento de agentes de pesquisador especializados para investigação paralela","Gerar relatórios abrangentes sintetizando descobertas de vários agentes"],"ru":["Разбить сложные исследовательские вопросы на управляемые подсубъекты","Автоматизировать появление специализированных агентов-исследователей для параллельного расследования","Генерировать всесторонние отчеты, синтезируя результаты из нескольких агентов"],"ar":["تجزئة أسئلة البحث المعقدة إلى مواضيع فرعية قابلة للإدارة","تحسين ظهور وكلاء باحثين متخصصين للتحقيق الموازي","إنتاج تقارير شاملة من خلال دمج النتائج من عدة وكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires multi-agent capability","Needs structured workflow planning and audit functionality"],"zh":["需要多代理人功能","需要结构化工作流规划和审计功能"],"ja":["マルチエージェント機能が必要","構造化されたワークフロー計画と監査機能が必要"],"ko":["다중 에이전트 기능이 필요함","구조화된 워크플로우 계획과 감사 기능이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere capacidad multiagente","Necesita planificación de flujo de trabajo estructurada y funcionalidad de auditoría"],"fr":["Nécessite une capacité multi-agent","A besoin d''une planification de flux de travail structurée et d''une fonctionnalité d''audit"],"de":["Benötigt Multi-Agenten-Fähigkeit","Benötigt strukturierte Workflow-Planung und Audit-Funktion"],"pt":["Exige capacidade de multi-agente","Necessita de planejamento de fluxo de trabalho estruturado e funcionalidade de auditoria"],"ru":["Требует возможности многогентного взаимодействия","Требует структурированного планирования рабочего процесса и функциональности аудита"],"ar":["يتطلب القدرة على تشغيل عدة وكلاء","يحتاج إلى تخطيط تدفق العمل المنظم ووظيفة التدقيق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c6ccf8b31eb436ebba19c2b88d6168915a7e2f627f686b37799d44cdc91f184b","qualityScore":59}');
