chnique","guide de configuration d''outils d''ingénierie géotechnique"],"de":["Geotechnik-Tools","GitHub-Repository-Verwaltung","modulares Aufbau","Geotechnik für die Lösung von Problemen","wie man Geotechnik-Tools verwendet","Alternativen zu Geotechnik-Tools","Geotechnik vs Ingenieurbau","Installation von Geotechnik-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für Geotechnik-Tools"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para engenharia geotécnica","geotechnical-engineering","gestão de repositórios GitHub","organização modular","integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","como usar geotechnical-engineering","geotechnical-engineering vs git"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для геотехнической инженерии","геотехническая инженерия","управление репозиториями GitHub","модульная организация","интеграция с инструментами разработки","как использовать геотехническую инженерию","геотехническая инженерия vs git"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للهندسة الجيوتكنيكية","الهندسة الجيوتكنيكية","إدارة مستودعات جيثب","تنظيم موديولار","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","كيفية استخدام الهندسة الجيوتكنيكية","الهندسة الجيوتكنيكية vs جيت"]}},"owner":"vamseeachanta","repo":"workspace-hub","repoPath":"vamseeachanta/workspace-hub","stars":3,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T18:00:58Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"geotechnical-engineering","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","tags":["geotechnical","soil","foundation","pile","anchor","scour","offshore"],"bodyPreview":"# Geotechnical Engineering Skill\n\nOffshore geotechnical analysis domain expertise for planning soil\ninvestigations, selecting foundation design methods, and sizing geotechnical\nelements (piles, anchors, mudmats, scour protection).\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Planning a geotechnical analysis campaign\n- Selecting bearing capacity or pile capacity methods\n- Choosing anchor type for given soil and loading conditions\n- Reviewing soil parameter derivation from CPT or borehole data\n- Mapping standard","body":"# Geotechnical Engineering Skill\n\nOffshore geotechnical analysis domain expertise for planning soil\ninvestigations, selecting foundation design methods, and sizing geotechnical\nelements (piles, anchors, mudmats, scour protection).\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Planning a geotechnical analysis campaign\n- Selecting bearing capacity or pile capacity methods\n- Choosing anchor type for given soil and loading conditions\n- Reviewing soil parameter derivation from CPT or borehole data\n- Mapping standards coverage for geotechnical calculations\n\n## Soil Classification Systems\n\n### USCS (Unified Soil Classification System)\n| Symbol | Description | Typical su (kPa) | Typical φ'' (°) |\n|--------|-------------|-------------------|-----------------|\n| CH | Fat clay | 20–200 | — |\n| CL | Lean clay | 10–100 | — |\n| ML | Silt | 5–50 | 25–30 |\n| SM | Silty sand | — | 28–34 |\n| SP | Poorly graded sand | — | 30–36 |\n| SW | Well graded sand | — | 33–40 |\n| GP | Poorly graded gravel | — | 35–42 |\n\n### Robertson CPT Classification (1990/2009)\n| Zone | Ic Range | Soil Behaviour Type |\n|------|----------|---------------------|\n| 1 | — | Sensitive fine grained |\n| 2 | > 3.60 | Organic soils / peat |\n| 3 | 2.95–3.60 | Clays (clay to silty clay) |\n| 4 | 2.60–2.95 | Silt mixtures |\n| 5 | 2.05–2.60 | Sand mixtures |\n| 6 | 1.31–2.05 | Sands (clean to silty) |\n| 7 | < 1.31 | Gravelly sand to dense sand |\n\n## Method Selection Decision Tree\n\n### Bearing Capacity\n```\nUndrained (clay)?\n  ├── Yes → Brinch Hansen general formula (DNV-RP-C212 Sec 5)\n  │         Nc = 5.14 for strip, shape/depth/inclination factors\n  └── No (sand) → Terzaghi/Meyerhof drained bearing capacity\n                   Nq, Nγ from friction angle\n```\n\n### Pile Capacity\n```\nSoil type?\n  ├── Clay → Alpha method (API RP 2GEO Sec 6.4)\n  │          f = α × su; α from su/σ''v ratio\n  ├── Sand → Beta method (API RP 2GEO Sec 6.5)\n  │          f = K × σ''v × tan(δ); K from Table 6.5.3-1\n  └── Layered → Sum unit shaft resistance per layer\n```\n\n### Anchor Type Selection\n| Soil Type | Load Direction | Recommended Anchor | Standard |\n|-----------|---------------|-------------------|----------|\n| Soft clay | Catenary | Drag (Stevpris/Vryhof) | DNVGL-RP-E301 |\n| Soft clay | Vertical/taut | Suction caisson | DNV-RP-E303 |\n| Stiff clay | Catenary | Drag (high capacity) | DNVGL-RP-E301 |\n| Sand | Catenary | Drag anchor | DNVGL-RP-E301 |\n| Any | Vertical (TLP) | Suction/driven pile | API RP 2GEO |\n| Deep water | Taut leg | Torpedo/SEPLA | project-specific |\n\n## Typical Parameter Ranges\n\n| Parameter | Symbol | Soft Clay | Stiff Clay | Sand |\n|-----------|--------|-----------|------------|------|\n| Undrained shear strength | su | 5–25 kPa | 50–250 kPa | — |\n| Friction angle | φ'' | — | — | 28–40° |\n| Submerged unit weight | γ'' | 4–7 kN/m³ | 7–10 kN/m³ | 8–11 kN/m³ |\n| OCR | OCR | 1–3 | 3–20 | 1–5 |\n| CPT cone factor | Nkt | 10–18 | 15–25 | — |\n| su/σ''v (NC clay) | — | 0.20–0.30 | — | — |\n\n## Standard Reference Map\n\n| Standard | Key Sections | Topic |\n|----------|-------------|-------|\n| API RP 2GEO | Sec 6 (piles), Sec 8 (foundations) | Pile + foundation design |\n| DNV-RP-C212 | Sec 5 (bearing), Sec 6 (piles) | Soil mechanics |\n| DNV-RP-E303 | Sec 4–7 | Suction anchor capacity |\n| DNVGL-RP-E301 | Sec 3–5 | Drag/fluke anchor design |\n| DNV-RP-F109 | Sec 3 | Pipeline on-bottom stability |\n| DNV-RP-F107 | Sec 5 | Scour assessment |\n| ISO 19901-4 | Sec 7–10 | Foundation design |\n| API RP 2SK | Sec 6 | Mooring anchor requirements |\n\n## Module Import Paths\n\n```python\nfrom digitalmodel.geotechnical.soil_models import SoilProfile, SoilLayer\nfrom digitalmodel.geotechnical.piles import PileCapacityAnalysis\nfrom digitalmodel.geotechnical.foundations import ShallowFoundation\nfrom digitalmodel.geotechnical.anchors import AnchorCapacity\nfrom digitalmodel.geotechnical.on_bottom_stability import OnBottomStability\nfrom digitalmodel.geotechnical.scour import ScourPrediction\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `mooring-analysis` — mooring system design consuming anchor capacity\n- `structural-analysis` — structural loads feeding foundation design\n- `marine-offshore-engineering` — general offshore engineering context\n\n## Version History\n\n| Version | Date | Changes |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| 1.0.0 | 2026-02-26 | Initial skill — method selection, parameter ranges, standards map |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T01:57:06.621Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Offshore Engineering Agents requiring specialized geotechnical analysis capabilities.","zh":"对于需要专门的地质技术分析能力的海上工程代理来说是必不可少的。","ja":"専門的な地質技術分析機能を必要とするオフショアエンジニアリングエージェントには不可欠です。","ko":"전문적인 지질 기술 분석 능력이 필요한 해상 공학 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de ingeniería offshore que requieren capacidades especializadas de análisis geotécnico.","fr":"Essentielle pour les agents d''ingénierie offshore nécessitant des capacités spécialisées d''analyse géotechnique.","de":"Essenziell für Offshore Engineering Agents, die spezialisierte geotechnische Analysefähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Engenharia Offshore que requerem capacidades especializadas de análise geotécnica.","ru":"Необходим для агентов оффшорной инженерии, требующих специализированных возможностей геотехнического анализа.","ar":"أساسي لوكلاء الهندسة البحرية التي تتطلب قدرات متخصصة في التحليل الجيوتقني."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables comprehensive offshore geotechnical analysis including soil investigation planning, foundation design method selection, and geotechnical element sizing for piles, anchors, and mudmats. Provides domain expertise in CPT/borehole data interpretation and standard mapping for bearing capacity calculations.","zh":"能够进行全面性的海上地质技术分析，包括土壤调查规划、基础设计方法选择和桩、锚和泥板的几何技术元件尺寸。提供CPT/钻孔数据解释和标准映射用于承载力计算的领域专业知识。","ja":"総合的なオフショア地質技術分析を可能にし、土壌調査計画、基礎設計方法の選択、および杭、錨、泥板の地質技術要素のサイズ設定を含みます。CPT/ボーリングデータの解釈と標準マッピングによる耐荷計算のドメインエキスパートを提供します。","ko":"전반적인 해상 지질 기술 분석을 가능하게 하며, 토양 조사 계획, 기초 설계 방법 선택 및 말뚝, 닻, 점토판의 지질 기술 요소 크기 조정 등을 포함합니다. CPT/보링 데이터 해석 및 표준 매핑을 통한 지지력 계산의 도메인 전문 지식을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite un análisis geotécnico offshore integral que incluye la planificación de investigaciones de suelo, la selección de métodos de diseño de cimentaciones y el dimensionamiento de elementos geotécnicos para pilotes, anclas y mudmats. Proporciona experiencia de dominio en la interpretación de datos de CPT/sondeos y el mapeo de estándares para cálculos de capacidad de carga.","fr":"Permet une analyse géotechnique offshore complète incluant la planification des investigations des sols, la sélection des méthodes de conception des fondations et le dimensionnement des éléments géotechniques pour les pieux, ancres et mudmats. Fournit une expertise du domaine dans l''interprétation des données CPT/forages et le mappage des normes pour les calculs de capacité portante.","de":"Ermöglicht eine umfassende offshore geotechnische Analyse, einschließlich der Planung von Bodenuntersuchungen, der Auswahl von Gründungsbemessungsmethoden und der Dimensionierung geotechnischer Elemente für Pfähle, Anker und Mudmats. Bietet Domain-Expertise in der Interpretation von CPT/Bohrlochdaten und im Standard-Mapping für Tragfähigkeitsberechnungen.","pt":"Permite uma análise geotécnica offshore abrangente, incluindo planeamento de investigação do solo, seleção de métodos de dimensionamento de fundações e dimensionamento de elementos geotécnicos para estacas, âncoras e mudmats. Fornece expertise de domínio na interpretação de dados de CPT/sondagens e mapeamento de normas para cálculos de capacidade de carga.","ru":"Обеспечивает комплексный оффшорный геотехнический анализ, включая планирование исследования грунта, выбор методов проектирования фундаментов и определение размеров геотехнических элементов для свай, якорей и опорных плит. Предоставляет предметные знания в интерпретации данных CPT/скважин и стандартного картирования для расчетов несущей способности.","ar":"يمكن من إجراء تحليل جيوتقني بحري شامل يشمل تخطيط تحريات التربة، واختيار طرق تصميم الأساسات، وتحديد أحجام العناصر الجيوتقنية للخوازيق والمراسي والألواح القاعدية. يوفر خبرة متخصصة في مجال تفسير بيانات CPT / الجسات ورسم الخرائط المعيارية لحسابات قدرة التحمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Planning geotechnical analysis campaigns","Selecting pile capacity methods","Choosing anchor types based on soil conditions","Deriving soil parameters from CPT data","Mapping geotechnical standards for compliance"],"zh":["规划地质技术分析活动","选择桩容量方法","根据土壤条件选择锚类型","从CPT数据中推导土壤参数","映射地质技术标准以确保合规性"],"ja":["地質技術分析キャンペーンの計画","杭容量法の選択","土壌状態に基づく錨の種類の選択","CPTデータから土壌パラメータの導出","地質技術基準のマッピングによるコンプライアンス"],"ko":["지질 기술 분석 캠페인 계획","말뚝容량 방법 선택","토양 상태에 따른 닻 유형 선택","CPT 데이터로부터 토양 매개변수 도출","지질 기술 표준 매핑을 통한 준수"],"es":["Planificación de campañas de análisis geotécnico","Selección de métodos de capacidad de pilotes","Elección de tipos de anclas basada en las condiciones del suelo","Derivación de parámetros del suelo a partir de datos CPT","Mapeo de estándares geotécnicos para cumplimiento normativo"],"fr":["Planification des campagnes d''analyse géotechnique","Sélection des méthodes de capacité des pieux","Choix des types d''ancres basé sur les conditions du sol","Dérivation des paramètres du sol à partir des données CPT","Cartographie des normes géotechniques pour la conformité"],"de":["Planung von geotechnischen Analysekampagnen","Auswahl von Pfähltragfähigkeitsmethoden","Auswahl von Ankertypen basierend auf Bodenbedingungen","Ableitung von Bodenparametern aus CPT-Daten","Mapping von geotechnischen Standards für Compliance"],"pt":["Planeamento de campanhas de análise geotécnica","Seleção de métodos de capacidade de carga de estacas","Escolha de tipos de âncora com base nas condições do solo","Derivação de parâmetros do solo a partir de dados CPT","Mapeamento de normas geotécnicas para conformidade"],"ru":["Планирование кампаний геотехнического анализа","Выбор методов определения несущей способности свай","Выбор типов якорей на основе условий грунта","Определение параметров грунта из данных CPT","Картирование геотехнических стандартов для соответствия требованиям"],"ar":["تخطيط حملات التحليل الجيوتقني","اختيار طرق قدرة تحمل الخوازيق","اختيار أنواع المراسي بناءً على ظروف التربة","اشتقاق معاملات التربة من بيانات CPT","رسم خرائط المعايير الجيوتقنية للامتثال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires geotechnical engineering domain knowledge","Dependent on soil investigation data quality","Specialized for offshore applications"],"zh":["需要地质技术工程领域知识","依赖于土壤调查数据质量","专门用于海上应用"],"ja":["地質技術エンジニアリングのドメイン知識が必要","土壌調査データの品質に依存","オフショアアプリケーション専用"],"ko":["지질 기술 공학 분야 지식이 필요","토양 조사 데이터 품질에 의존","해상 응용 프로그램専用"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del dominio de ingeniería geotécnica","Depende de la calidad de los datos de investigación del suelo","Especializado para aplicaciones offshore"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du domaine de l''ingénierie géotechnique","Dépend de la qualité des données d''investigation des sols","Spécialisé pour les applications offshore"],"de":["Erfordert Domänenwissen in der Geotechnik","Abhängig von der Qualität der Bodenuntersuchungsdaten","Spezialisiert auf Offshore-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de domínio de engenharia geotécnica","Dependente da qualidade dos dados de investigação do solo","Especializado para aplicações offshore"],"ru":["Требует знаний в области геотехнической инженерии","Зависит от качества данных исследования грунта","Специализирован для оффшорных применений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة متخصصة في مجال الهندسة الجيوتقنية","يعتمد على جودة بيانات تحريات التربة","متخصص للتطبيقات البحرية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4c126158c2c102f70f4bf775b3b3bdb947bd4b2378768cf5f148bd47b6386530","qualityScore":58}');
