ion graphique en temps réel avec SDL","Tutoriels et exemples de code pour apprendre","API GPU pour jeux et applications","Support pour SDL3","Code ouvert et communautaire","Documentation détaillée et support"],"de":["Echtzeit-Grafikprogrammierung mit SDL","Tutorials und Codebeispiele zum Lernen","GPU-API für Spiele und Anwendungen","Unterstützung für SDL3","Offener Code und Community","Detaillierte Dokumentation und Support"],"pt":["Aprenda programação gráfica em tempo real com SDL","Crie jogos incríveis com a API do GPU","Tutoriais e exemplos de código para começar","Desenvolva habilidades em C e gamedev","Aproveite a documentação e a comunidade SDL"],"ru":["Учитесь программированию графики в реальном времени с SDL","Создавайте удивительные игры с помощью API GPU","Уроки и примеры кода для начала работы","Развивайте навыки в C и gamedev","Используйте документацию и сообщество SDL"],"ar":["تعلم برمجة الرسومات في الوقت الفعلي مع SDL","أنشئ ألعاب رائعة باستخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للوحدة المركزية للرسومات","دروس و أمثلة من الكود لبدء العمل","تطوير مهارات في سي و gamedev","استفد من وثائق و مجتمع SDL"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用SDL的GPU API","什么是实时图形编程","SDL3教程","SDL-GPU示例","游戏开发框架","图形编程语言","C语言学习","forge-mesh-loading安装","SDL-GPU vs OpenGL"],"ja":["SDLのGPU APIの使用方法","リアルタイムグラフィックスプログラミングとは","SDL3チュートリアル","SDL-GPUの例","ゲーム開発フレームワーク","グラフィックスプログラミング言語","C言語の学習","forge-mesh-loadingのインストール","SDL-GPU vs OpenGL"],"ko":["SDL의 GPU API를 사용하는 방법","실시간 그래픽스 프로그래밍이란","SDL3 튜토리얼","SDL-GPU 예시","게임 개발 프레임워크","그래픽스 프로그래밍 언어","C 언어 학습","forge-mesh-loading 설치","SDL-GPU vs OpenGL"],"es":["cómo usar SDL para programación gráfica","qué es la programación gráfica en tiempo real","SDL vs OpenGL","instalación de SDL","guía de configuración de SDL","tutoriales de programación gráfica","ejemplos de código de SDL","alternativas a SDL","programación de juegos con SDL"],"fr":["comment utiliser SDL pour la programmation graphique","quoi est la programmation graphique en temps réel","SDL vs OpenGL","installation de SDL","guide de configuration de SDL","tutoriels de programmation graphique","exemples de code de SDL","alternatives à SDL","programmation de jeux avec SDL"],"de":["wie man SDL für die Grafikprogrammierung verwendet","was ist die Echtzeit-Grafikprogrammierung","SDL vs OpenGL","Installation von SDL","Konfigurationsanleitung für SDL","Tutorials für die Grafikprogrammierung","Codebeispiele für SDL","Alternativen zu SDL","Spieleprogrammierung mit SDL"],"pt":["programação gráfica em tempo real","SDL","API do GPU","gamedev","C","tutoriais de programação","exemplos de código","desenvolvimento de jogos","como usar SDL","o que é programação gráfica em tempo real"],"ru":["программирование графики в реальном времени","SDL","API GPU","gamedev","C","уроки программирования","примеры кода","разработка игр","как использовать SDL","что такое программирование графики в реальном времени"],"ar":["برمجة الرسومات في الوقت الفعلي","SDL","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للوحدة المركزية للرسومات","gamedev","سي","دروس برمجة","أمثلة من الكود","تطوير الألعاب","كيفية استخدام SDL","ما هي برمجة الرسومات في الوقت الفعلي"]}},"owner":"RosyGameStudio","repo":"forge-gpu","repoPath":"RosyGameStudio/forge-gpu","stars":20,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T00:33:19Z","topics":["c","gamedev","graphics-programming","learn","sdl","sdl-gpu","sdl-gpu-tutorial","sdl3","tutorial"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"forge-mesh-loading","description":"Load a 3D model from an OBJ file, create a textured mesh with mipmaps, and render with a fly-around camera. Use when someone needs to load geometry from a file, parse OBJ models, or render textured 3D meshes in SDL3 GPU.","bodyPreview":"# Mesh Loading — OBJ Parsing, Textured Rendering, Camera\n\nThis skill teaches how to load and render 3D models from Wavefront OBJ files.\nIt builds on `textures-and-samplers` (Lesson 04), `mipmaps` (Lesson 05),\n`depth-and-3d` (Lesson 06), and `camera-and-input` (Lesson 07).\n\n## When to use\n\n- Loading 3D models from OBJ files\n- Rendering textured meshes with a camera\n- Parsing vertex positions, normals, and UV coordinates from files\n- Setting up non-indexed rendering (de-indexed vertices)\n- Combini","body":"# Mesh Loading — OBJ Parsing, Textured Rendering, Camera\n\nThis skill teaches how to load and render 3D models from Wavefront OBJ files.\nIt builds on `textures-and-samplers` (Lesson 04), `mipmaps` (Lesson 05),\n`depth-and-3d` (Lesson 06), and `camera-and-input` (Lesson 07).\n\n## When to use\n\n- Loading 3D models from OBJ files\n- Rendering textured meshes with a camera\n- Parsing vertex positions, normals, and UV coordinates from files\n- Setting up non-indexed rendering (de-indexed vertices)\n- Combining texture loading + mipmaps + depth testing + camera in one app\n\n## Key API calls (ordered)\n\n1. `forge_obj_load(path, &mesh)` — parse OBJ into de-indexed vertex array\n2. `SDL_CreateGPUBuffer` + transfer upload — upload vertices to GPU\n3. `SDL_LoadSurface` + `SDL_ConvertSurface` — load PNG texture\n4. `SDL_CreateGPUTexture` with `SAMPLER | COLOR_TARGET` — mipmapped texture\n5. `SDL_GenerateMipmapsForGPUTexture` — auto-generate mip chain\n6. `SDL_CreateGPUSampler` — trilinear, REPEAT address mode\n7. `SDL_CreateGPUGraphicsPipeline` — 3 vertex attributes, depth test, back-face cull\n8. `SDL_BindGPUFragmentSamplers` — bind diffuse texture + sampler\n9. `SDL_DrawGPUPrimitives` — non-indexed draw (de-indexed vertices)\n\n## Libraries\n\n```c\n#include \"obj/forge_obj.h\"     /* OBJ parser */\n#include \"math/forge_math.h\"   /* vectors, matrices, quaternions */\n```\n\n## Code template\n\n### Loading the mesh\n\n```c\n/* Build path relative to executable */\nconst char *base_path = SDL_GetBasePath();\nchar obj_path[512];\nSDL_snprintf(obj_path, sizeof(obj_path), \"%smodels/model.obj\", base_path);\n\nForgeObjMesh mesh;\nif (!forge_obj_load(obj_path, &mesh)) {\n    SDL_Log(\"Failed to load model\");\n    return SDL_APP_FAILURE;\n}\n\n/* Upload to GPU vertex buffer via transfer buffer */\nUint32 vertex_data_size = mesh.vertex_count * (Uint32)sizeof(ForgeObjVertex);\n/* ... standard transfer buffer pattern from Lesson 02 ... */\n\nUint32 mesh_vertex_count = mesh.vertex_count;\nforge_obj_free(&mesh);  /* CPU-side data no longer needed */\n```\n\n### Loading texture with mipmaps\n\n```c\nSDL_Surface *surface = SDL_LoadSurface(tex_path);\nSDL_Surface *converted = SDL_ConvertSurface(surface, SDL_PIXELFORMAT_ABGR8888);\nSDL_DestroySurface(surface);\n\nint num_levels = (int)forge_log2f((float)converted->w) + 1;\n\nSDL_GPUTextureCreateInfo tex_info;\nSDL_zero(tex_info);\ntex_info.type     = SDL_GPU_TEXTURETYPE_2D;\ntex_info.format   = SDL_GPU_TEXTUREFORMAT_R8G8B8A8_UNORM_SRGB;\ntex_info.usage    = SDL_GPU_TEXTUREUSAGE_SAMPLER | SDL_GPU_TEXTUREUSAGE_COLOR_TARGET;\ntex_info.width    = converted->w;\ntex_info.height   = converted->h;\ntex_info.num_levels = num_levels;\n/* ... upload base level, then: */\nSDL_GenerateMipmapsForGPUTexture(cmd, texture);\n```\n\n### Vertex layout (3 attributes)\n\n```c\n/* ForgeObjVertex: position (float3) + normal (float3) + uv (float2) */\n\nvertex_attributes[0].location = 0;  /* TEXCOORD0 = position */\nvertex_attributes[0].format   = SDL_GPU_VERTEXELEMENTFORMAT_FLOAT3;\nvertex_attributes[0].offset   = offsetof(ForgeObjVertex, position);\n\nvertex_attributes[1].location = 1;  /* TEXCOORD1 = normal */\nvertex_attributes[1].format   = SDL_GPU_VERTEXELEMENTFORMAT_FLOAT3;\nvertex_attributes[1].offset   = offsetof(ForgeObjVertex, normal);\n\nvertex_attributes[2].location = 2;  /* TEXCOORD2 = uv */\nvertex_attributes[2].format   = SDL_GPU_VERTEXELEMENTFORMAT_FLOAT2;\nvertex_attributes[2].offset   = offsetof(ForgeObjVertex, uv);\n```\n\n### Rendering (non-indexed)\n\n```c\nSDL_BindGPUVertexBuffers(pass, 0, &vertex_binding, 1);\n\nSDL_GPUTextureSamplerBinding tex_binding;\nSDL_zero(tex_binding);\ntex_binding.texture = diffuse_texture;\ntex_binding.sampler = sampler;\nSDL_BindGPUFragmentSamplers(pass, 0, &tex_binding, 1);\n\n/* Non-indexed draw — de-indexed vertices, every 3 form a triangle */\nSDL_DrawGPUPrimitives(pass, mesh_vertex_count, 1, 0, 0);\n```\n\n### HLSL shaders\n\n**Vertex shader:**\n\n```hlsl\ncbuffer Uniforms : register(b0, space1) { column_major float4x4 mvp; };\n\nstruct VSInput {\n    float3 position : TEXCOORD0;\n    float3 normal   : TEXCOORD1;\n    float2 uv       : TEXCOORD2;\n};\n\nstruct VSOutput {\n    float4 position : SV_Position;\n    float2 uv       : TEXCOORD0;\n};\n\nVSOutput main(VSInput input) {\n    VSOutput output;\n    output.position = mul(mvp, float4(input.position, 1.0));\n    output.uv = input.uv;\n    return output;\n}\n```\n\n**Fragment shader:**\n\n```hlsl\nTexture2D    diffuse_tex : register(t0, space2);\nSamplerState smp         : register(s0, space2);\n\nfloat4 main(float4 pos : SV_Position, float2 uv : TEXCOORD0) : SV_Target {\n    return diffuse_tex.Sample(smp, uv);\n}\n```\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n1. **Forgetting UV flip** — OBJ uses V=0 at bottom; GPU uses V=0 at top.\n   The `forge_obj.h` parser handles this automatically (`1.0 - v`).\n\n2. **Using indexed draw for de-indexed mesh** — Use `SDL_DrawGPUPrimitives`,\n   not `SDL_DrawGPUIndexedPrimitives`, since vertices are already expanded.\n\n3. **Wrong pixel format** — `SDL_LoadSurface` may return any format.\n   Always convert to `SDL_PIXELFORMAT_ABGR8888` for GPU `R8G8B8A8`.\n\n4. **Missing `COLOR_TARGET` usage** — Required for mipmap generation.\n   Without it, `SDL_GenerateMipmapsForGPUTexture` silently fails.\n\n5. **Not copying model files in CMake** — The OBJ and texture must be next\n   to the executable. Use `add_custom_command(POST_BUILD ...)` to copy them.\n\n6. **Loading JPG** — `SDL_LoadSurface` only supports BMP and PNG.\n   Convert JPG textures to PNG first (e.g. with Python Pillow).\n\n## CMakeLists.txt pattern\n\n```cmake\n# Copy model files next to executable\nadd_custom_command(TARGET my-target POST_BUILD\n    COMMAND ${CMAKE_COMMAND} -E make_directory\n        $<TARGET_FILE_DIR:my-target>/models/model-name\n    COMMAND ${CMAKE_COMMAND} -E copy_if_different\n        ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/models/model-name/model.obj\n        $<TARGET_FILE_DIR:my-target>/models/model-name/model.obj\n    COMMAND ${CMAKE_COMMAND} -E copy_if_different\n        ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/models/model-name/texture.png\n        $<TARGET_FILE_DIR:my-target>/models/model-name/texture.png\n)\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [GPU Lesson 08 — Loading a Mesh](../../../lessons/gpu/08-mesh-loading/)\n- [GPU Lesson 04 — Textures & Samplers](../../../lessons/gpu/04-textures-and-samplers/)\n- [GPU Lesson 05 — Mipmaps](../../../lessons/gpu/05-mipmaps/)\n- [GPU Lesson 07 — Camera & Input](../../../lessons/gpu/07-camera-and-input/)\n- [OBJ Parser Library](../../../common/obj/forge_obj.h)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T01:58:14.435Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Graphics Agents needing advanced 3D model rendering capabilities with SDL''s GPU API and Wavefront OBJ files.","zh":"适合需要高级 3D 模型渲染能力的 Graphics Agents，使用 SDL 的 GPU API 和 Wavefront OBJ 文件。","ja":"SDL の GPU API と Wavefront OBJ ファイルを使用して高度な 3D モデルレンダリング機能を必要とする Graphics Agents に最適です。","ko":"SDL의 GPU API와 Wavefront OBJ 파일을 사용하여 고급 3D 모델 렌더링 기능을 필요한 Graphics Agents에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes gráficos que necesitan capacidades de renderizado de modelos 3D avanzados con la API de GPU de SDL y archivos Wavefront OBJ.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents graphiques ayant besoin de capacités de rendu de modèles 3D avancées avec l''API de GPU de SDL et les fichiers Wavefront OBJ.","de":"Perfekt für Grafikagenten, die erweiterte 3D-Modell-Renderfunktionen mit der GPU-API von SDL und Wavefront-OBJ-Dateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Gráficos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de renderização de modelos 3D com a API GPU da SDL e arquivos Wavefront OBJ.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Графических Агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности рендеринга 3D-моделей с помощью API GPU от SDL и файлов Wavefront OBJ.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الرسومية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تقديم نموذج 3D متقدمة مع API GPU من SDL وملفات Wavefront OBJ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to load and render textured 3D meshes with camera support, parsing vertex positions, normals, and UV coordinates from OBJ files using real-time graphics programming techniques.","zh":"赋予代理加载和渲染带纹理的 3D 网格的能力，具有相机支持，使用实时图形编程技术从 OBJ 文件中解析顶点位置、法线和 UV 坐标。","ja":"エージェントに、OBJ ファイルから頂点位置、法線、UV 座標を解析し、リアルタイム グラフィックス プログラミング技術を使用してテクスチャ化された 3D メッシュをロードしてレンダリングする機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 OBJ 파일에서顶点 위치, 법선, UV 좌표를 파싱하여 실시간 그래픽스 프로그래밍 기술을 사용하여 텍스처가 있는 3D 메시를 로드하고 렌더링하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cargar y renderizar mallas 3D texturizadas con soporte de cámara, analizando posiciones de vértices, normales y coordenadas UV desde archivos OBJ utilizando técnicas de programación de gráficos en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents de charger et de rendre des maillages 3D texturisés avec un support de caméra, en analysant les positions de sommets, les normales et les coordonnées UV à partir de fichiers OBJ en utilisant des techniques de programmation de graphiques en temps réel.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, texturierte 3D-Netze mit Kameraunterstützung zu laden und zu rendern, indem sie Vertexpositionen, Normale und UV-Koordinaten aus OBJ-Dateien mithilfe von Echtzeit-Grafikprogrammierungstechniken analysieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a carregar e renderizar malhas 3D texturizadas com suporte a câmera, analisando posições de vértices, normais e coordenadas UV a partir de arquivos OBJ usando técnicas de programação gráfica em tempo real.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью загружать и рендерить текстурированные 3D-сетки с поддержкой камеры, парсируя позиции вершин, нормалей и координат UV из файлов OBJ с помощью техник программирования графики в реальном времени.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحميل وتصيير شبكات 3D متعددة الأبعاد بدعم للكاميرا، وتنقيح مواقع الرؤوس ومتجهات العادي والتنسيق UV من ملفات OBJ باستخدام تقنيات برمجة الرسومات في الوقت الفعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Loading 3D models from OBJ files for interactive simulations","Rendering textured meshes with camera support for immersive experiences","Parsing 3D model data for physics engine integration"],"zh":["从 OBJ 文件加载 3D 模型以进行交互式模拟","使用相机支持渲染带纹理的网格以实现沉浸式体验","解析 3D 模型数据以进行物理引擎集成"],"ja":["OBJ ファイルから 3D モデルをロードしてインタラクティブ シミュレーションを実行する","カメラ サポートを使用してテクスチャ化されたメッシュをレンダリングし、没入感のある体験を提供する","3D モデル データを解析して物理エンジンを統合する"],"ko":["OBJ 파일에서 3D 모델을 로드하여 상호작용 시뮬레이션을 수행하는 것","카메라 지원을 사용하여 텍스처화된 메시를 렌더링하여 몰입감 있는 경험을 제공하는 것","3D 모델 데이터를 파싱하여 물리 엔진을 통합하는 것"],"es":["Carga de modelos 3D desde archivos OBJ para simulaciones interactivas","Renderizado de mallas texturizadas con soporte de cámara para experiencias inmersivas","Análisis de datos de modelos 3D para integración con motores de física"],"fr":["Chargement de modèles 3D à partir de fichiers OBJ pour des simulations interactives","Rendu de maillages texturisés avec un support de caméra pour des expériences immersives","Analyse de données de modèles 3D pour une intégration avec des moteurs de physique"],"de":["Laden von 3D-Modellen aus OBJ-Dateien für interaktive Simulationen","Rendern von texturierten Netzen mit Kameraunterstützung für immersive Erfahrungen","Analyse von 3D-Modell-Daten für die Integration mit Physik-Engines"],"pt":["Carregando modelos 3D de arquivos OBJ para simulações interativas","Renderizando malhas texturizadas com suporte a câmera para experiências imersivas","Analysando dados de modelos 3D para integração com mecanismo de física"],"ru":["Загрузка 3D-моделей из файлов OBJ для интерактивных симуляций","Рендеринг текстурированных сеток с поддержкой камеры для иммерсивных опытов","Парсинг данных 3D-моделей для интеграции с физическим движком"],"ar":["تحميل نماذج 3D من ملفات OBJ للتحاكي التفاعلي","تصيير شبكات متعددة الأبعاد ذات دعم للكاميرا لتجارب غامرة","فحص بيانات نموذج 3D لتكامل المحرك الفيزيائي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SDL''s GPU API and Wavefront OBJ file support","Builds on prior knowledge of textures, mipmaps, depth, and camera handling"],"zh":["需要 SDL 的 GPU API 和 Wavefront OBJ 文件支持","需要对纹理、mipmaps、深度和相机处理有先前的知识"],"ja":["SDL の GPU API と Wavefront OBJ ファイルのサポートが必要","テクスチャ、mipmaps、深度、カメラ ハンドリングに関する事前の知識が必要"],"ko":["SDL의 GPU API와 Wavefront OBJ 파일 지원이 필요","텍스처, 미ップ 맵, 깊이, 카메라 처리에 대한 이전 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere soporte de la API de GPU de SDL y archivos Wavefront OBJ","Se basa en conocimientos previos de texturas, mipmaps, profundidad y manejo de cámara"],"fr":["Nécessite un support de l''API de GPU de SDL et des fichiers Wavefront OBJ","S''appuie sur des connaissances antérieures en matière de textures, de mipmaps, de profondeur et de gestion de caméra"],"de":["Benötigt Unterstützung für die GPU-API von SDL und Wavefront-OBJ-Dateien","Baut auf vorherigem Wissen über Texturen, Mipmaps, Tiefe und Kamerahandling auf"],"pt":["Requer suporte à API GPU da SDL e arquivos Wavefront OBJ","Constrói sobre conhecimento prévio de texturas, mipmaps, profundidade e tratamento de câmera"],"ru":["Требует поддержки API GPU от SDL и файлов Wavefront OBJ","Строится на предварительных знаниях текстур, mipmaps, глубины и обработки камеры"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم API GPU من SDL وملفات Wavefront OBJ","يبني على معرفة سابقة للنسيج، وخرائط المipmap، والعمق ومعالجة الكاميرا"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d51cc4235885ba5ca680317b887bd7d7858dc9cd904a2a277f3b6f6453c202db","qualityScore":57}');
