x para una mayor seguridad","Soporte para múltiples proveedores de LLM","Compatibilidad con plataformas como Discord y Telegram","Integración con lenguajes de programación como Python","Panel de control visual para una fácil gestión"],"fr":["Vue d''ensemble de vos bots","Exécution sandbox pour une sécurité accrue","Prise en charge de plusieurs fournisseurs de LLM","Compatibilité avec des plateformes comme Discord et Telegram","Intégration avec des langages de programmation comme Python","Tableau de bord visuel pour une gestion facile"],"de":["Überblick über Ihre Bots","Sandbox-Ausführung für eine höhere Sicherheit","Unterstützung für mehrere LLM-Anbieter","Kompatibilität mit Plattformen wie Discord und Telegram","Integration mit Programmiersprachen wie Python","Visuelles Dashboard für eine einfache Verwaltung"],"pt":["Dashboard visual para monitorar agentes de IA","Execução sandboxed para garantir a segurança","Suporte a múltiplos provedores de LLM","Integração com plataformas de chatbot","Suporte a linguagens de programação como Python"],"ru":["Визуальная панель для мониторинга ИИ Агентов","Sandbox-исполнение для обеспечения безопасности","Поддержка多их провайдеров LLM","Интеграция с платформами чат-ботов","Поддержка языков программирования như Python"],"ar":["لوحة تحكم بصرية لمراقبة وحدات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنفيذ محوسب لضمان الأمان","دعم لمزودي LLM المتعددين","التكامل مع منصات البوتات المحادثية","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل Python"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","AI工具","机器学习","深度学习","自然语言处理","Python机器学习","AI模型优化","AI安全","Telegram机器人","Discord机器人"],"ja":["AIエージェント","AIツール","機械学習","ディープラーニング","自然言語処理","Python機械学習","AIモデル最適化","AIセキュリティ","Telegramボット","Discordボット"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","AI 도구","기계 학습","딥 러닝","자연어 처리","Python 기계 학습","AI 모델 최적화","AI 보안","Telegram 봇","Discord 봇"],"es":["cómo utilizar agentes AI","qué es un agente AI","alternativas a Armored AI","Armored AI vs competidores","instalación de Armored AI","guía de configuración de Armored AI","desarrollo de bots con Python","integración de LLM en bots"],"fr":["comment utiliser des agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","alternatives à Armored AI","Armored AI vs concurrents","installation d''Armored AI","guide de configuration d''Armored AI","développement de bots avec Python","intégration de LLM dans les bots"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu Armored AI","Armored AI vs Wettbewerber","Installation von Armored AI","Einrichtungsanleitung für Armored AI","Entwicklung von Bots mit Python","Integration von LLM in Bots"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","agentes de IA","chatbot","LLM","Python","como usar review-fix","o que é review-fix","review-fix vs concorrentes","instalar review-fix","guia de configuração do review-fix"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","инструменты ИИ","чат-боты","LLM","Python","как использовать review-fix","что такое review-fix","review-fix vs конкуренты","установить review-fix","руководство по настройке review-fix"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","وحدات الذكاء الاصطناعي","البوتات المحادثية","LLM","Python","كيفية استخدام review-fix","ما هو review-fix","review-fix مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت review-fix","دليل إعداد review-fix"]}},"owner":"jhd3197","repo":"CachiBot","repoPath":"jhd3197/CachiBot","stars":6,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T20:46:18Z","topics":["ai","ai-agents","chatbot","claude","discord-bot","llm","prompture","python","telegram-bot"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-fix","description":"Read the latest code review, plan fixes for all findings, then execute the fixes — all in one command. Produces a dated plan and execution log in .reviews/.","bodyPreview":"# Review Fix — Plan & Execute from Last Review\n\nRead the most recent `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md`, plan fixes for all findings\ngrouped by priority, then execute every planned fix with atomic commits. Produces\ntwo artifacts: a **review-plan** and a **review-execution** log.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Phase 0 — Find the Latest Review\n\n1. Glob for `.reviews/*-review.md` and pick the most recent file by date.\n2. Read the full review file. Parse every finding into a list of\n   `{ severity, reviewer, fi","body":"# Review Fix — Plan & Execute from Last Review\n\nRead the most recent `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md`, plan fixes for all findings\ngrouped by priority, then execute every planned fix with atomic commits. Produces\ntwo artifacts: a **review-plan** and a **review-execution** log.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Phase 0 — Find the Latest Review\n\n1. Glob for `.reviews/*-review.md` and pick the most recent file by date.\n2. Read the full review file. Parse every finding into a list of\n   `{ severity, reviewer, file, line, description }` entries.\n3. If no review file exists, tell the user to run `/code-review` first and stop.\n\n### Phase 1 — Plan\n\nSpawn **4 parallel planning agents** (Task tool, `subagent_type: Plan`) that each\nreceive the full findings list filtered to their scope. Each agent returns a\nstructured list of fix actions.\n\n#### Agent scopes\n\n| Agent         | Scope                                                  |\n|---------------|--------------------------------------------------------|\n| **backend**   | Findings from Tina, Marcus, Priya, Carlos, Oscar that touch `cachibot/` |\n| **frontend**  | Findings from Tina, Zoe, Luna that touch `frontend/src/` |\n| **data**      | Findings from Carlos (storage/db layer)                |\n| **tests**     | Findings from Derek (test coverage gaps)               |\n\n> Findings that span multiple scopes go to every relevant agent.\n\nEach planning agent must:\n\n- Group related findings that can be fixed together (same file, same pattern).\n- For each group, produce:\n  - **What**: one-line summary of the change\n  - **Files**: list of files to modify\n  - **How**: 2-3 sentence implementation approach\n  - **Severity**: highest severity in the group (Fix > Improve > Note)\n  - **Risk**: Low / Medium / High (does this change behavior or just style?)\n  - **Depends on**: other group IDs this group must wait for (if any)\n- Order groups by: Fix severity first, then by dependency order.\n- Skip any finding rated **Note** — notes are informational only.\n\nAfter all 4 agents return, compile results into `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review-plan.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Review Fix Plan — YYYY-MM-DD\n\n**Source review:** `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md`\n**Generated:** YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\n\n## Stats\n\n| Severity | Findings | Planned groups |\n|----------|----------|----------------|\n| Fix      | N        | N              |\n| Improve  | N        | N              |\n| Note     | N        | (skipped)      |\n\n## Execution Waves\n\nWave 1 (no dependencies):\n- [B1] Backend: <summary>\n- [F1] Frontend: <summary>\n\nWave 2 (depends on wave 1):\n- [B2] Backend: <summary> (depends on B1)\n\n...\n\n## Detailed Plan\n\n### [B1] <Summary>\n- **Severity:** Fix\n- **Risk:** Low\n- **Files:** `path/to/file.py`\n- **How:** Description of the fix approach\n- **Findings addressed:**\n  - Tina: `path/to/file.py:42` — original finding text\n  - Marcus: `path/to/file.py:50` — original finding text\n```\n\nPrint the plan summary (wave count, group count, severity breakdown) to the user,\nthen **immediately proceed to Phase 2** without waiting for approval.\n\n### Phase 2 — Execute\n\nRead the plan file. Execute fixes **wave by wave** — all groups in a wave run in\nparallel, but waves run sequentially (wave 2 waits for wave 1 to finish).\n\nFor each group, spawn a Task agent (`subagent_type: general-purpose`) with:\n\n- The group''s detailed plan (What, Files, How)\n- The original finding text for context\n- Instruction to read each file before editing\n- Instruction to make the minimal change that addresses the finding\n- Instruction to run `ruff check --fix` and `ruff format` on any modified Python file\n- Instruction to run `npm run lint -- --fix` on any modified TypeScript file (from `frontend/`)\n- Instruction to NOT create new files unless the plan explicitly says to\n- Instruction to NOT add tests (Derek findings are tracked but test writing is a separate task)\n\nAfter each wave completes:\n\n1. Verify no lint errors remain (`ruff check cachibot/` and `cd frontend && npm run lint`).\n2. If lint fails, spawn a fix agent for the failing files before continuing.\n3. Stage all changed files and create one commit per wave:\n   ```\n   Review fixes wave N: <comma-separated group IDs>\n\n   Addresses findings from YYYY-MM-DD code review.\n   Groups: [B1] summary, [F2] summary, ...\n\n   Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n   ```\n\nAfter all waves complete, write `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review-execution.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Review Fix Execution — YYYY-MM-DD\n\n**Plan:** `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review-plan.md`\n**Source review:** `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md`\n\n## Results\n\n| Wave | Groups | Status  | Commit  |\n|------|--------|---------|---------|\n| 1    | B1, F1 | Done    | abc1234 |\n| 2    | B2     | Done    | def5678 |\n\n## Findings Addressed\n\n| Severity | Planned | Fixed | Skipped | Reason          |\n|----------|---------|-------|---------|-----------------|\n| Fix      | N       | N     | N       |                 |\n| Improve  | N       | N     | N       |                 |\n\n## Group Details\n\n### [B1] <Summary> — Done\n- **Commit:** abc1234\n- **Files changed:** `path/to/file.py`\n- **Findings fixed:**\n  - Tina: `path/to/file.py:42` — fixed\n  - Marcus: `path/to/file.py:50` — fixed\n\n### [F1] <Summary> — Skipped\n- **Reason:** File was recently refactored, finding no longer applies\n- **Findings skipped:**\n  - Zoe: `frontend/src/Component.tsx:100` — N/A after refactor\n\n## Remaining Work\n\n- Derek''s test coverage findings were not addressed (test writing is separate)\n- N findings skipped due to: ...\n```\n\n### Phase 3 — Summary\n\nPrint a final summary to the user:\n\n```\nReview fix complete.\n\nWaves executed: N\nCommits created: N\nFindings fixed: N / M planned (X Fix, Y Improve)\nSkipped: N (reasons listed in execution log)\n\nPlan:      .reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review-plan.md\nExecution: .reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review-execution.md\n```\n\n## Important Rules\n\n- **Never skip a Fix-severity finding** without logging a clear reason.\n- **Read before edit** — every agent must read the target file before modifying it.\n- **Minimal changes** — fix exactly what the finding describes, nothing more.\n- **No new features** — this is a fix pass, not a feature pass.\n- **No test writing** — Derek''s findings are logged as \"remaining work\" but not executed\n  here. Test creation deserves its own focused session.\n- **Preserve behavior** — if a fix would change external API behavior, mark it as\n  Risk: High in the plan and add a note in the execution log.\n- If the review file has a \"Previous Reviews\" section noting still-open findings from\n  prior reviews, include those in the plan too.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T01:55:14.690Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents needing automated fix planning and execution with multi-provider LLM support.","zh":"适用于需要自动化修复规划和执行的代码审查代理，支持多提供商LLM。","ja":"コードレビュー代理が自動化された修復計画と実行を必要とする場合に最適です。マルチプロバイダLLMをサポートします。","ko":"자동화된 수정 계획 및 실행이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합하며 다중 공급자 LLM을 지원합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una planificación y ejecución de correcciones automatizadas con soporte de LLM multi-proveedor.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une planification et une exécution de corrections automatisées avec un support LLM multi-fournisseur.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die eine automatisierte Planung und Ausführung von Korrekturen mit Unterstützung für mehrere LLM-Anbieter benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de planejamento e execução de correções automatizadas com suporte a vários provedores de LLM.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, которым требуется автоматизированное планирование и выполнение исправлений с поддержкой нескольких поставщиков LLM.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعنيين بمراجعة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى تخطيط وتنفيذ إصلاحات أوتوماتيكية بدعم من عدة مزودين لبرامج اللغة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to parse review findings from `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md` files, plan fixes grouped by priority, and execute them with atomic commits, producing review-plan and review-execution logs using markdown file parsing and version control systems like Git.","zh":"赋予代理从`.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md`文件解析审查结果，根据优先级分组计划修复，并使用原子提交执行修复，使用markdown文件解析和版本控制系统（如Git）生成审查计划和审查执行日志。","ja":"代理が`.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md`ファイルのレビュー結果を解析し、優先順位別に修復を計画して原子コミットで実行し、Markdownファイルの解析とバージョン管理システム（例：Git）を使用してレビュープランとレビュー実行ログを生成することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md` 파일의 리뷰 결과를 해석하고, 우선순위별로 수정을 계획하여 원자적 커밋으로 실행하며, Markdown 파일 해석과 버전 관리 시스템(Git과 유사한 시스템)을 사용하여 리뷰 계획 및 리뷰 실행 로그를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar los resultados de la revisión de `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md` archivos, planificar las correcciones agrupadas por prioridad y ejecutarlas con confirmaciones atómicas, produciendo registros de planificación y ejecución de revisiones utilizando el análisis de archivos markdown y sistemas de control de versiones como Git.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les résultats de la révision des fichiers `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md`, de planifier les corrections regroupées par priorité et de les exécuter avec des validations atomiques, produisant des journaux de planification et d''exécution de révision en utilisant l''analyse de fichiers markdown et des systèmes de contrôle de version comme Git.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Ergebnisse der Code-Überprüfung aus Dateien `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md` zu analysieren, die Korrekturen nach Priorität zu gruppieren und auszuführen, mit atomaren Commits und der Erstellung von Überprüfungsplänen und -protokollen unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dateianalyse und Versionskontrollsystemen wie Git.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar as descobertas de revisão de arquivos `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md`, planejar correções agrupadas por prioridade e executá-las com commits atômicos, produzindo logs de plano de revisão e logs de execução de revisão usando análise de arquivos markdown e sistemas de controle de versão como o Git.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать результаты обзора из файлов `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md`, планировать исправления, сгруппированные по приоритету, и выполнять их с атомарными коммитами, производя журналы плана обзора и журналы выполнения обзора с помощью разбора файлов markdown и систем контроля версий, таких как Git.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحليل نتائج المراجعة من الملفات `.reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md`، وتخطيط الإصلاحات المجموعة حسب الأولوية، وتنفيذها باستخدام تعهدات ذرية، وإنتاج سجلات خطة المراجعة وسجلات تنفيذ المراجعة باستخدام تحليل الملفات markdown ونظم التحكم في الإصدار مثل Git."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating review fix planning based on severity and reviewer feedback","Executing fixes with atomic commits for version control","Generating review-plan and review-execution logs for auditing and transparency"],"zh":["根据严重性和审查者反馈自动化审查修复计划","使用原子提交进行修复以进行版本控制","生成审查计划和审查执行日志以进行审计和透明度"],"ja":["심각도とレビューアーのフィードバックに基づいてレビュー修正計画を自動化する","バージョン管理のために原子コミットで修正を実行する","監査と透明性のためにレビュープランとレビュー実行ログを生成する"],"ko":["심각도 및 리뷰어의 피드백을 기반으로 리뷰 수정 계획을 자동화합니다","버전 관리를 위해 원자적 커밋으로 수정을 실행합니다","감사 및 투명성을 위해 리뷰 계획 및 리뷰 실행 로그를 생성합니다"],"es":["Automatización de la planificación de correcciones de revisión en función de la gravedad y los comentarios del revisor","Ejecución de correcciones con confirmaciones atómicas para el control de versiones","Generación de registros de planificación y ejecución de revisiones para auditorías y transparencia"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification des corrections de révision en fonction de la gravité et des commentaires du réviseur","Exécution des corrections avec des validations atomiques pour le contrôle de version","Génération de journaux de planification et d''exécution de révision pour les audits et la transparence"],"de":["Automatisierung der Planung von Korrekturen bei der Code-Überprüfung basierend auf Schweregrad und Rückmeldung des Überprüfers","Ausführung von Korrekturen mit atomaren Commits für die Versionskontrolle","Erstellung von Überprüfungsplänen und -protokollen für Audits und Transparenz"],"pt":["Automatizar o planejamento de correções de revisão com base na gravidade e no feedback do revisor","Executar correções com commits atômicos para controle de versão","Gerar logs de plano de revisão e logs de execução de revisão para auditoria e transparência"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование исправлений обзора на основе тяжести и обратной связи рецензента","Выполнять исправления с атомарными коммитами для контроля версий","Генерировать журналы плана обзора и журналы выполнения обзора для аудита и прозрачности"],"ar":["تأتمتة تخطيط إصلاحات المراجعة على أساس الخطورة وآراء المراجع","تنفيذ الإصلاحات باستخدام التعهدات الذرية لنظام التحكم في الإصدار","إنتاج سجلات خطة المراجعة وسجلات تنفيذ المراجعة للتدقيق والشفافية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to `.reviews/` directory with review files in markdown format","Needs Git or similar version control system for atomic commits"],"zh":["需要访问`.reviews/`目录，其中包含markdown格式的审查文件","需要Git或类似的版本控制系统来进行原子提交"],"ja":["Markdown形式のレビュー文件が含まれる`.reviews/`ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","原子コミットを実行するためにGitまたは同等のバージョン管理システムが必要"],"ko":["Markdown 형식의 리뷰 파일이 포함된 `.reviews/` 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","원자적 커밋을 수행하려면 Git 또는 유사한 버전 관리 시스템이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `.reviews/` con archivos de revisión en formato markdown","Necesita Git o un sistema de control de versiones similar para confirmaciones atómicas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `.reviews/` avec des fichiers de révision au format markdown","Nécessite Git ou un système de contrôle de version similaire pour les validations atomiques"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `.reviews/` mit Überprüfungsdateien im Markdown-Format","Benötigt Git oder ein ähnliches Versionskontrollsystem für atomare Commits"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `.reviews/` com arquivos de revisão no formato markdown","Necessita de Git ou sistema de controle de versão semelhante para commits atômicos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу `.reviews/` с файлами обзора в формате markdown","Требует Git или аналогичной системы контроля версий для атомарных коммитов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `.reviews/` مع الملفات المراجعة بترميز markdown","يحتاج إلى Git أو نظام تحكم في الإصدار المماثل للتعهدات الذرية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e92ccf01fd6b23257fc3e02dce31811c12101c3668f482818e17baf792e22a81","qualityScore":57}');
