":"Управление Работой с Помощью ИИ Агентов - VibeFlow","ar":"إدارة العمل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي - VibeFlow","en":"manage-work"},"description":{"zh":"VibeFlow提供Claude Code技能和钩子，实现AI-assisted开发的docs-before-code纪律","ja":"VibeFlowはClaude Codeスキルとフックを提供し、AIアシスト開発のdocs-before-codeの規律を実施","ko":"VibeFlow는 Claude Code 기술과 훅을 제공하여 AI 지원 개발의 docs-before-code 규율을 시행","es":"VibeFlow proporciona Claude Code skills y hooks para un flujo de trabajo completo con checkpoint gates y branch-locked enforcement","fr":"VibeFlow fournit des compétences et des hooks Claude Code pour un flux de travail complet avec des portes de contrôle et une mise en application verrouillée ...","de":"VibeFlow bietet Claude Code-Fähigkeiten und Hooks für einen vollständigen Arbeitsfluss mit Checkpoint-Gates und branch-verriegelten Enforcement","pt":"O agente de IA VibeFlow ajuda a impor a disciplina de documentos antes de código, melhorando o fluxo de trabalho com Claude Code","ru":"ИИ Агент VibeFlow помогает внедрить дисциплину документации перед кодированием, улучшая рабочий процесс с Claude Code","ar":"وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي VibeFlow يساعد على فرض الانضباط في وثائق قبل الكود، مما يحسن تدفق العمل مع Claude Code","en":"Enforce docs-before-code discipline in AI-assisted development. VibeFlow provides Claude Code skills and hooks for a full workflow with checkpoint gates and ..."},"definition":{"en":"Enforce docs-before-code discipline in AI-assisted development. VibeFlow provides Claude Code skills and hooks for a full workflow with checkpoint gates and branch-locked enforcement."},"features":{"zh":["docs-before-code 纪律","Claude Code 技能和钩子","VibeFlow 集成","AI-assisted 开发","checkpoint gates 和 branch-locked 强制"],"ja":["docs-before-code の規律","Claude Code スキルとフック","VibeFlow 統合","AIアシスト開発","チェックポイントゲートとブランチロック強制"],"ko":["docs-before-code 규율","Claude Code 기술과 훅","VibeFlow 통합","AI 지원 개발","체크포인트 게이트와 브랜치 잠금 강제"],"es":["Disciplina docs-before-code","Checkpoint gates","Branch-locked enforcement","Integración con Claude Code","Flujo de trabajo completo","Guardrails para el desarrollo"],"fr":["Discipline docs-before-code","Portes de contrôle","Mise en application verrouillée de branche","Intégration avec Claude Code","Flux de travail complet","Guardrails pour le développement"],"de":["Disziplin docs-before-code","Checkpoint-Gates","Branch-verriegelte Enforcement","Integration mit Claude Code","Vollständiger Arbeitsfluss","Guardrails für die Entwicklung"],"pt":["Disciplina de documentos antes de código","Melhoria do fluxo de trabalho com Claude Code","Integração com VibeFlow","Suporte a guardrails","Enforcement de branch-locked"],"ru":["Дисциплина документации перед кодированием","Улучшение рабочего процесса с Claude Code","Интеграция с VibeFlow","Поддержка guardrails","Внедрение branch-locked"],"ar":["انضباط وثائق قبل الكود","تحسين تدفق العمل مع Claude Code","التكامل مع VibeFlow","دعم guardrails","تنفيذ branch-locked"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","docs-before-code","Claude Code","VibeFlow","AI-assisted 开发","如何使用VibeFlow","VibeFlow替代品","VibeFlow安装","VibeFlow设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","docs-before-code","Claude Code","VibeFlow","AIアシスト開発","VibeFlowの使用方法","VibeFlowの代替","VibeFlowのインストール","VibeFlowの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","docs-before-code","Claude Code","VibeFlow","AI 지원 개발","VibeFlow 사용 방법","VibeFlow 대체","VibeFlow 설치","VibeFlow 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar VibeFlow","qué es Claude Code","alternativas a Claude Code","VibeFlow vs Claude Code","instalación de VibeFlow","guía de configuración de VibeFlow","desarrollo de software con AI","herramientas de desarrollo de software","gestión de trabajo con AI"],"fr":["comment utiliser VibeFlow","quoi est Claude Code","alternatives à Claude Code","VibeFlow vs Claude Code","installation de VibeFlow","guide de configuration de VibeFlow","développement de logiciels avec l''IA","outils de développement de logiciels","gestion de travail avec l''IA"],"de":["wie man VibeFlow verwendet","was ist Claude Code","Alternativen zu Claude Code","VibeFlow vs Claude Code","Installation von VibeFlow","Konfigurationsanleitung für VibeFlow","Software-Entwicklung mit KI","Software-Entwicklungstools","Arbeitsverwaltung mit KI"],"pt":["agente de ia","como usar vibe flow","o que é claude code","vibe flow alternative","claude code vs competitor","instalar vibe flow","guia de configuração vibe flow"],"ru":["ИИ Агент","как использовать vibe flow","что такое claude code","варианты vibe flow","claude code vs конкурент","установка vibe flow","руководство по настройке vibe flow"],"ar":["وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام vibe flow","ما هو claude code","بديل vibe flow","claude code vs منافس","تثبيت vibe flow","دليل إعداد vibe flow"]}},"owner":"hardness1020","repo":"VibeFlow","repoPath":"hardness1020/VibeFlow","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T21:25:47Z","topics":["agent","claude-code","claude-skills","guardrails","vibe-coding"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"manage-work","description":"Register work items, create feature branches, track and advance stages, close work items in the VibeFlow docs-first development workflow","bodyPreview":"# manage-work\n\nRegister work items, create feature branches, track and advance stages, close work items in the VibeFlow docs-first development workflow.\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill tracks multiple work items through the VibeFlow workflow by:\n- Registering work items with their workflow track and creating `feat/<slug>` branches\n- Tracking each work item''s current stage independently\n- Advancing work items through stages and routing to the appropriate skill\n- Closing work items as DONE after Checkpoin","body":"# manage-work\n\nRegister work items, create feature branches, track and advance stages, close work items in the VibeFlow docs-first development workflow.\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill tracks multiple work items through the VibeFlow workflow by:\n- Registering work items with their workflow track and creating `feat/<slug>` branches\n- Tracking each work item''s current stage independently\n- Advancing work items through stages and routing to the appropriate skill\n- Closing work items as DONE after Checkpoint #4 (release is optional)\n- Providing a dashboard view of all in-flight work items\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nRegister Work Item\n    │\n    ├── Assign ID, generate slug from description, and assign track\n    ├── Create entry in docs/workflow-state.yaml (with branch field)\n    ├── Create git branch: feat/<slug>\n    └── Determine starting stage from track\n    │\n    ▼\nTrack Progress\n    │\n    ├── Show status dashboard (all work items)\n    ├── Show detailed status (single work item)\n    └── Cross-check manifest against artifacts\n    │\n    ▼\nAdvance & Route\n    │\n    ├── Mark work item as advancing to next stage\n    ├── Recommend the appropriate skill command\n    └── Update manifest with new stage\n    │\n    ▼\nClose Work Item (after Checkpoint #4)\n    │\n    ├── Mark stage as DONE (terminal state)\n    ├── Branch ready for merge to main\n    └── Alternative: advance to Stage I for release track\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n### Register a New Work Item\n\n```\n/manage-work register \"<description>\" <ID> <track>\n```\n\nRegisters a work item in `docs/workflow-state.yaml`, determines the starting stage, and creates a git branch `feat/<slug>`.\n\nSteps:\n1. Generate kebab-case slug from description\n2. Add entry to manifest with `branch: feat/<slug>`\n3. Create and checkout git branch: `git checkout -b feat/<slug>`\n\nExample:\n```\n/manage-work register \"Add anti-hallucination guardrails\" 030 medium\n# Creates branch: feat/add-anti-hallucination-guardrails\n\n/manage-work register \"Export data to CSV\" 031 small\n# Creates branch: feat/export-data-to-csv\n```\n\n### Status Dashboard\n\n```\n/manage-work status\n```\n\nShows all registered work items with their current stage, track, and last checkpoint.\n\nExample output:\n```\nWork Item                          Track    Stage  Checkpoint  Started\nadd-anti-hallucination-guardrails  Medium   G      3           2025-02-20\nexport-data-to-csv                 Small    E      2           2025-02-22\n```\n\n### Detailed Work Item Status\n\n```\n/manage-work status <ID>\n```\n\nShows detailed status for one work item including:\n- Current stage and description\n- Completed and remaining stages for its track\n- Last checkpoint passed\n- Artifact verification (cross-check with `detect_track.py --workitem <ID>`)\n\n### Advance a Work Item\n\n```\n/manage-work advance <ID>\n```\n\nMarks a work item as advancing to the next stage in its track:\n- Validates checkpoint if at a checkpoint boundary (blocks if failed)\n- Updates `stage` in `docs/workflow-state.yaml`\n- Updates `checkpoint` if a checkpoint boundary was crossed\n- Updates `docs` paths with any documents produced at the completed stage\n- Shows what the next stage requires\n- **After Checkpoint #4 (Stage H):** Offers two paths:\n  - `advance` → proceed to Stage I (release track)\n  - `close` → mark as DONE (see Close command below)\n\n### Close a Work Item\n\n```\n/manage-work close <ID>\n```\n\nMarks a work item as DONE after passing Checkpoint #4 (Implementation Complete):\n- Validates Checkpoint #4 if not yet passed (runs `validate_checkpoint.py 4 --json --project-root <root>`)\n- Requires work item to be at stage H or later with checkpoint >= 4\n- Sets `stage: DONE` in `docs/workflow-state.yaml`\n- Branch `feat/<slug>` is ready for merge to main\n- Blocked if Checkpoint #4 validation fails\n\nExample:\n```\n/manage-work close 030\n# Sets stage: DONE, branch feat/add-anti-hallucination-guardrails ready for merge\n```\n\n### Next Steps for a Work Item\n\n```\n/manage-work next <ID>\n```\n\nShows the recommended next action for a work item:\n- What the current stage requires\n- Which skill command to run\n- Whether a checkpoint validation is needed first\n\n## Workflow Tracks\n\n| Track | Scope | Stages | Release | Example |\n|-------|-------|--------|---------|---------|\n| **Micro** | Bug fix, typo, small refactor | F → G → DONE | No | Fix typo, update config |\n| **Small** | Single feature, no contracts | E → F → G → H → DONE | Optional (I-L) | Add form field, UI polish |\n| **Medium** | Multi-component, no new services | B → C → D → E → F → G → H → DONE | Optional (I-L) | New API endpoint |\n| **Large** | System change, new contracts/services | A → B → C → D → E → F → G → H → DONE | Optional (I-L) | New LLM integration |\n\n## Stage Overview\n\n### Planning Stages (A-D)\n- **A — Initiate**: Create/update PRD\n- **B — Discovery**: Analyze codebase (Medium/Large)\n- **C — Specify**: Create/update Tech Specs\n- **D — Decide**: Create ADRs for decisions\n\n**Checkpoint #1: Planning Complete**\n\n### Design Stage (E)\n- **E — Plan**: Create Feature Spec with API Design\n\n**Checkpoint #2: Design Complete**\n\n### Implementation Stages (F-H)\n- **F — RED**: Write failing unit tests + stubs\n- **G — GREEN**: Implement to pass tests\n- **H — REFACTOR**: Integration tests + quality validation\n\n**Checkpoint #3: Tests Complete** (after F)\n**Checkpoint #4: Implementation Complete** (after H)\n\n### Release Stages (I-L)\n- **I — Reconcile**: Update specs if implementation deviated\n- **J — Prepare**: Write OP-NOTE\n- **K — Deploy**: Follow OP-NOTE, verify\n- **L — Close**: Update indices, tag release\n\n**Checkpoint #5: Release Ready** (after J)\n**Checkpoint #6: Deployed** (after L)\n\n## Manifest Format\n\nThe manifest file `docs/workflow-state.yaml` is the single source of truth for work item lifecycle state:\n\n```yaml\nworkitems:\n  add-anti-hallucination-guardrails:\n    id: 030\n    description: \"Add anti-hallucination guardrails\"\n    track: medium        # micro | small | medium | large\n    stage: G             # current stage letter (A-L) or DONE\n    branch: feat/add-anti-hallucination-guardrails  # git branch\n    started: 2025-02-20  # date work item was registered\n    checkpoint: 3        # last checkpoint passed (1-6)\n    docs:\n      prd: docs/prds/prd.md\n      discovery: docs/discovery/disco-030.md\n      specs:\n        - docs/specs/spec-llm.md\n      adrs:\n        - docs/adrs/adr-030-prompt-strategy.md\n      feature: docs/features/ft-030-anti-hallucination.md\n      opnote: null\n  export-data-to-csv:\n    id: 031\n    description: \"Export data to CSV\"\n    track: small\n    stage: E\n    branch: feat/export-data-to-csv  # git branch\n    started: 2025-02-22\n    checkpoint: 2\n    docs:\n      prd: null\n      discovery: null\n      specs: []\n      adrs: []\n      feature: docs/features/ft-031-export-csv.md\n      opnote: null\n```\n\nWhen registering a new work item:\n1. Create `docs/workflow-state.yaml` if it doesn''t exist (use `assets/workflow-state-template.yaml`)\n2. Generate a kebab-case slug from the description (e.g., \"Add anti-hallucination guardrails\" → `add-anti-hallucination-guardrails`)\n3. Add the work item entry with `id`, `description`, `track`, `stage` (first stage for the track), `branch` (`feat/<slug>`), `started` (today), `checkpoint: 0`, and empty `docs` hierarchy\n4. Create and checkout git branch: `git checkout -b feat/<slug>`\n\nWhen advancing a work item:\n1. Read `docs/workflow-state.yaml`\n2. Check if current stage is a checkpoint boundary (D→E=CP#1, E→F=CP#2, F→G=CP#3, H→I=CP#4, J→K=CP#5, L→done=CP#6)\n3. If checkpoint boundary: run `python3 .claude/skills/validate-checkpoint/scripts/validate_checkpoint.py <N> --json --project-root <root>`\n   - If exit code 1 (failed): STOP. Report errors. Do NOT update manifest.\n   - If exit code 0 or 2 (passed/warnings): proceed\n4. Update `stage` field to the next stage in the track\n5. Update `checkpoint` if a checkpoint boundary was crossed\n6. Update `docs` with any document paths produced at the completed stage\n\n## Skill Routing\n\nEach stage maps to a specific skill. After determining the current stage for a work item, recommend the appropriate command:\n\n| Stage | Skill | Recommended Command |\n|-------|-------|--------------------|\n| A | define-prd | `/define-prd` |\n| B | analyze-codebase | `/analyze-codebase <ID>` |\n| C | define-tech-spec | `/define-tech-spec <name>` |\n| D | record-decision | `/record-decision <ID> <slug>` |\n| E | create-feature-spec | `/create-feature-spec <ID> <slug>` |\n| F | run-tdd | `/run-tdd red` |\n| G | run-tdd | `/run-tdd green` |\n| H | run-tdd | `/run-tdd refactor` |\n| I | prepare-release | `/prepare-release reconcile <ID>` |\n| J | prepare-release | `/prepare-release opnote <slug>` |\n| K | prepare-release | `/prepare-release check` |\n| L | prepare-release | `/prepare-release check` |\n\n**Checkpoint boundaries** — recommend `/validate-checkpoint <N>` before advancing past:\n- Stage D → E (Checkpoint #1)\n- Stage E → F (Checkpoint #2)\n- Stage F → G (Checkpoint #3)\n- Stage H → I (Checkpoint #4)\n- Stage J → K (Checkpoint #5)\n- Stage L → done (Checkpoint #6)\n\n## Artifact Verification\n\nUse `detect_track.py` to cross-check the manifest against actual artifacts:\n\n```bash\n# Verify a specific work item''s artifacts match its manifest stage\npython scripts/detect_track.py --workitem <ID> --verify\n\n# Detect artifacts for a specific work item\npython scripts/detect_track.py --workitem <ID>\n\n# Detect artifacts for all registered work items\npython scripts/detect_track.py --all-workitems\n```\n\nThis catches drift between the manifest and actual project state.\n\n## References\n\nSee `references/workflow-summary.md` for a condensed workflow overview.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T01:58:11.187Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring structured workflow management and docs-before-code discipline in AI-assisted development.","zh":"适用于需要结构化工作流管理和先文档后代码纪律的 AI 开发代理的开发代理。","ja":"構造化されたワークフローの管理とドキュメント優先の開発ディシプリンを必要とする開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"구조화된 워크플로우 관리와 문서 우선 개발 규율이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren una gestión de flujo de trabajo estructurada y una disciplina de documentación antes de código en el desarrollo asistido por IA.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement nécessitant une gestion de flux de travail structurée et une discipline de documentation avant le code dans le développement assisté par IA.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel benötigende strukturierte Arbeitsablaufverwaltung und Dokumentation-vor-Code-Diziplin in der künstlichen Intelligenzunterstützten Entwicklung.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem gestão de fluxo de trabalho estruturada e disciplina de documentação antes de código no desenvolvimento assistido por IA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих структурированного управления рабочим процессом и дисциплины документации до кода в разработке с помощью ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعمelezات التطوير التي تتطلب إدارة تدفق عمل منظمًا وتنظيم الوثائق قبل الكود في التطوير المدعوم بالذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce checkpoint gates and branch-locked enforcement, utilizing VibeFlow''s docs-first development workflow with Claude Code skills and hooks, enabling efficient tracking and advancement of work items through stages.","zh":"赋予代理人执行检查点门和分支锁定执行的能力，利用 VibeFlow 的文档优先开发工作流和 Claude Code 技能和钩子，实现高效的跟踪和工作项的推进。","ja":"チェックポイントゲートとブランチロックの適用を可能にし、VibeFlow のドキュメント優先開発ワークフローと Claude Code スキルおよびフックを利用して、ワークアイテムの効率的な追跡と進捗を可能にします。","ko":"체크포인트 게이트와 브랜치 잠금 적용을 가능하게 하며 VibeFlow의 문서 우선 개발 워크플로와 Claude Code 스킬 및 훅을 활용하여 워크 아이템의 효율적인 추적 및 진행을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar controles de puntos de referencia y ejecución de bloqueo de ramas, utilizando el flujo de trabajo de documentación primero de VibeFlow con habilidades y ganchos de Claude Code, lo que permite un seguimiento y avance eficientes de los elementos de trabajo a través de las etapas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des contrôles de points de référence et d''exécution de verrouillage de branches, en utilisant le flux de travail de documentation première de VibeFlow avec des compétences et des crochets de Claude Code, permettant un suivi et une progression efficaces des éléments de travail à travers les étapes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Prüfpunkte und Verzweigungs-Sperren durchzusetzen, indem sie den Dokumentation-vor-Code-Arbeitsablauf von VibeFlow mit Claude Code-Fähigkeiten und Haken nutzen, wodurch eine effiziente Nachverfolgung und Weiterentwicklung von Arbeitsposten durch die Phasen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor portões de verificação e aplicação de restrições de ramificação, utilizando o fluxo de trabalho de VibeFlow com habilidades e ganchos de Claude Code, permitindo o acompanhamento eficiente e o avanço de itens de trabalho por estágios.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать контрольные точки и применение ограничений ветвления, используя рабочий процесс VibeFlow с навыками и крючками Claude Code, что позволяет эффективно отслеживать и продвигать элементы работы на разных стадиях.","ar":"يمكن للعمelezات فرض بوابات التحقق وتطبيق التقييدات الفرعية، باستخدام تدفق عمل VibeFlow مع مهارات Claude Code وأدوات التثبيت، مما يسمح بالتتبع الفعال والتقدم في عناصر العمل عبر المراحل."},"useCases":{"en":["Registering work items with workflow tracks and creating feature branches","Tracking and advancing work items through independent stages","Closing work items as DONE after checkpoint validation"],"zh":["注册工作项以跟踪工作流并创建功能分支","跟踪和推进工作项通过独立阶段","在检查点验证后将工作项关闭为完成"],"ja":["ワークフローの追跡と機能ブランチの作成のためにワークアイテムを登録する","独立した段階を通じてワークアイテムを追跡および進める","チェックポイントの検証後、ワークアイテムを完了として閉じる"],"ko":["워크플로우 추적 및 기능 브랜치 생성을 위해 워크 아이템 등록","독립적인 단계를 통해 워크 아이템 추적 및 진행","체크포인트 검증 후 워크 아이템을 완료로 닫기"],"es":["Registrar elementos de trabajo con pistas de flujo de trabajo y crear ramas de características","Seguimiento y avance de elementos de trabajo a través de etapas independientes","Cerrar elementos de trabajo como HECHO después de la validación del punto de referencia"],"fr":["Enregistrer des éléments de travail avec des pistes de flux de travail et créer des branches de fonctionnalités","Suivi et progression des éléments de travail à travers des étapes indépendantes","Fermer des éléments de travail comme FAIT après validation du point de référence"],"de":["Arbeitsposten mit Arbeitsablaufverfolgung und Erstellung von Funktionszweigen registrieren","Arbeitsposten durch unabhängige Phasen nachverfolgen und weiterentwickeln","Arbeitsposten als ERLEDIGT schließen nach Prüfpunktsvalidierung"],"pt":["Registrar itens de trabalho com faixas de fluxo de trabalho e criar branches de recursos","Acompanhar e avançar itens de trabalho por estágios independentes","Fechar itens de trabalho como CONCLUÍDO após validação de ponto de verificação"],"ru":["Регистрация элементов работы с отслеживанием рабочего процесса и создание фич-ветвей","Отслеживание и продвижение элементов работы через независимые этапы","Закрытие элементов работы как ГОТОВО после проверки контрольной точки"],"ar":["تسجيل عناصر العمل مع مسارات تدفق العمل وإنشاء فروع الميزات","تتبع وتمكين عناصر العمل عبر مراحل مستقلة","إغلاق عناصر العمل كمنتهية بعد التحقق من نقطة التحقق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires VibeFlow workflow integration","Claude Code skills and hooks necessary","Docs-before-code discipline enforcement"],"zh":["需要 VibeFlow 工作流集成","Claude Code 技能和钩子是必要的","先文档后代码纪律的执行"],"ja":["VibeFlow ワークフローの統合が必要","Claude Code スキルおよびフックが必要","ドキュメント優先の開発ディシプリンの適用"],"ko":["VibeFlow 워크플로우 통합이 필요","Claude Code 스킬 및 훅이 필요","문서 우선 개발 규율의 적용"],"es":["Requiere integración de flujo de trabajo de VibeFlow","Se necesitan habilidades y ganchos de Claude Code","Aplicación de disciplina de documentación antes de código"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration de flux de travail de VibeFlow","Compétences et crochets de Claude Code nécessaires","Application de la discipline de documentation avant le code"],"de":["Benötigt VibeFlow-Arbeitsablauf-Integration","Claude Code-Fähigkeiten und Haken erforderlich","Durchsetzung der Dokumentation-vor-Code-Diziplin"],"pt":["Requer integração do fluxo de trabalho do VibeFlow","Habilidades e ganchos de Claude Code necessários","Aplicação da disciplina de documentação antes de código"],"ru":["Требуется интеграция рабочего процесса VibeFlow","Необходимы навыки и крючки Claude Code","Применение дисциплины документации до кода"],"ar":["يتطلب إدماج تدفق عمل VibeFlow","مهارات Claude Code وأدوات التثبيت ضرورية","تطبيق الانضباط الوثائقي قبل الكود"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6bf825b1c96958750d143ed657d93a2b1fe39960c6117b6481f9ce7cbad7dfea","qualityScore":57}');
