 a web-based interface for version control, environment m..."},"definition":{"en":" full-stack application for provisioning and managing Ignition development environments. It provides a web-based interface for version control, environment management, automation gateway configuration, device management, Vision client testing with QF-Test automation, gateway health monitoring, and real-time terminal access to containers via WebSkt"},"features":{"zh":["版本控制","环境管理","自动化网关配置","设备管理","Vision客户端测试"],"ja":["バージョン管理","環境管理","自動化ゲートウェイ構成","デバイス管理","Visionクライアントテスト"],"ko":["버전 관리","환경 관리","자동화 게이트웨이 구성","디바이스 관리","Vision 클라이언트 테스트"],"es":["Interfaz web para control de versiones","Gestión de entornos de desarrollo","Configuración de puerta de enlace de automatización","Gestión de dispositivos","Pruebas de cliente de Vision con automatización QF-Test","Acceso a terminal en tiempo real a contenedores vía WebSkt"],"fr":["Interface web pour le contrôle de version","Gestion des environnements de développement","Configuration de la passerelle d''automatisation","Gestion des appareils","Tests de client Vision avec automatisation QF-Test","Accès en temps réel au terminal des conteneurs via WebSkt"],"de":["Web-Oberfläche für Versionskontrolle","Verwaltung von Entwicklungsumgebungen","Konfiguration des Automation-Gateways","Geräteverwaltung","Vision-Client-Tests mit QF-Test-Automatisierung","Echtzeit-Zugriff auf Container-Terminal über WebSkt"],"pt":["Interface web para controle de versão","Gerenciamento de ambientes de desenvolvimento","Configuração de gateway de automação","Monitoramento de saúde do gateway","Acesso em tempo real a contêineres via WebSkt"],"ru":["Веб-интерфейс для контроля версий","Управление средами разработки","Настройка шлюза автоматизации","Мониторинг здоровья шлюза","Реальное время доступа к контейнерам через WebSkt"],"ar":["واجهة ويب للتحكم في الإصدار","إدارة بيئات التطوير","تكوين بوابة التحكم الآلي","مراقبة صحة البوابة","دخول في وقت حقيقي إلى الحاويات عبر WebSkt"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用pm-audit","什么是Ignition开发环境","pm-audit替代品","pm-audit安装","pm-audit设置指南","AI智能代理工具"],"ja":["pm-auditの使用方法","Ignition開発環境とは","pm-auditの代替品","pm-auditのインストール","pm-auditの設定ガイド","AIエージェントツール"],"ko":["pm-audit 사용법","Ignition 개발 환경이란","pm-audit 대체품","pm-audit 설치","pm-audit 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 도구"],"es":["cómo usar pm-audit","qué es pm-audit","alternativas a pm-audit","pm-audit vs herramientas de desarrollo","instalación de pm-audit","guía de configuración de pm-audit","herramientas de IA para desarrollo","entornos de desarrollo Ignition","control de versiones en línea"],"fr":["comment utiliser pm-audit","qu''est-ce que pm-audit","alternatives à pm-audit","pm-audit vs outils de développement","installation de pm-audit","guide de configuration de pm-audit","outils d''IA pour le développement","environnements de développement Ignition","contrôle de version en ligne"],"de":["wie man pm-audit verwendet","was ist pm-audit","Alternativen zu pm-audit","pm-audit vs Entwicklungstools","Installation von pm-audit","Konfigurationsanleitung für pm-audit","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","Ignition-Entwicklungsumgebungen","Versionskontrolle online"],"pt":["como usar pm-audit","o que é pm-audit","alternativas para pm-audit","pm-audit vs outras ferramentas","instalar pm-audit","guia de configuração do pm-audit"],"ru":["как использовать pm-audit","что такое pm-audit","альтернативы pm-audit","pm-audit vs другие инструменты","установить pm-audit","руководство по настройке pm-audit"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام pm-audit","ما هو pm-audit","بديلات ل pm-audit","pm-audit مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت pm-audit","دليل إعداد pm-audit"]}},"owner":"LopeWale","repo":"dev_ignition","repoPath":"LopeWale/dev_ignition","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-21T01:23:21Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pm-audit","description":"System-wide structural audit of the entire PM knowledge system. Checks orphans, broken links, register coverage, schema violations across all decisions, and vault health metrics. Slower and deeper than /pm-review. Triggers on /pm-audit, system audit, vault health, find orphans, check broken links.","bodyPreview":"## Runtime Configuration (Step 0)\n\nRead `ops/derivation-manifest.md` for vocabulary mapping.\nRead `ops/config.yaml` for all maintenance thresholds.\n\n---\n\n## EXECUTE NOW\n\n**Target: $ARGUMENTS**\n\nParse immediately:\n- If empty: run full audit (all checks)\n- If \"orphans\": find orphan decisions only\n- If \"links\": check broken wiki-links only\n- If \"schema\": validate schema compliance across all decisions\n- If \"registers\": audit decision register coverage and completeness\n\n**START NOW.**\n\n---\n\n## Philo","body":"## Runtime Configuration (Step 0)\n\nRead `ops/derivation-manifest.md` for vocabulary mapping.\nRead `ops/config.yaml` for all maintenance thresholds.\n\n---\n\n## EXECUTE NOW\n\n**Target: $ARGUMENTS**\n\nParse immediately:\n- If empty: run full audit (all checks)\n- If \"orphans\": find orphan decisions only\n- If \"links\": check broken wiki-links only\n- If \"schema\": validate schema compliance across all decisions\n- If \"registers\": audit decision register coverage and completeness\n\n**START NOW.**\n\n---\n\n## Philosophy\n\n**A knowledge system that cannot audit itself will rot.**\n\nIndividual /pm-review checks decisions for quality. /pm-audit checks the system for structural integrity. These are different problems. A system can contain individually high-quality decisions that are nevertheless disconnected, uncategorized, and inaccessible — effectively invisible to future coordination.\n\n/pm-audit is the health scan. It finds the issues that individual review misses: decisions no register points to, wiki-links to files that were deleted or renamed, registers that grew too large to navigate, schema drift where fields added in new templates haven''t been backfilled into old decisions.\n\nRun /pm-audit when the vault feels slow or when coordination starts feeling inefficient — that inefficiency often has a structural cause.\n\n---\n\n## Audit Checks\n\n### Check 1: Orphan Decisions\n\nA decision not referenced by any decision register is an orphan. Orphans exist in the vault but cannot be discovered through normal navigation.\n\n```bash\n# Get all decision filenames\nls decisions/*.md | grep -v \"index.md\" | grep -v \"-register.md\"\n\n# For each decision, check if it appears in any register\nfor f in decisions/*.md; do\n  basename=$(basename \"$f\" .md)\n  count=$(rg \"$basename\" decisions/*-register.md decisions/index.md --count 2>/dev/null | grep -v \":0\" | wc -l)\n  if [ \"$count\" -eq 0 ]; then\n    echo \"ORPHAN: $basename\"\n  fi\ndone\n```\n\n### Check 2: Broken Wiki-Links\n\nWiki-links pointing to non-existent files.\n\n```bash\n# Extract all [[links]] from decisions/\nrg \"\\[\\[([^\\]]+)\\]\\]\" decisions/ --include=\"*.md\" -o --no-filename | sort -u\n\n# Cross-reference against actual files\n# Flag any [[link]] where the target file doesn''t exist\n```\n\n### Check 3: Schema Violations\n\n```bash\n# Missing required fields\nrg \"^description: \\\"\\\"\" decisions/ --include=\"*.md\" -l\nrg \"last_reviewed: YYYY-MM-DD\" decisions/ --include=\"*.md\" -l\nrg \"^type: $\" decisions/ --include=\"*.md\" -l\n\n# Invalid enum values\nrg \"^type:\" decisions/ --include=\"*.md\" -h | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn\nrg \"^status:\" decisions/ --include=\"*.md\" -h | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn\nrg \"^meta_state:\" decisions/ --include=\"*.md\" -h | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn\n```\n\n### Check 4: Register Size and Coverage\n\n```bash\n# Count decisions in each register\nfor f in decisions/*-register.md; do\n  count=$(rg \"\\[\\[\" \"$f\" | wc -l)\n  echo \"$f: $count references\"\ndone\n\n# Check for registers approaching the split threshold (35 decisions)\n```\n\nRegisters approaching 35 decisions should be flagged for split consideration.\n\n### Check 5: Stale Decisions\n\n```bash\n# Find decisions by last_reviewed date\n# Flag any older than stale_issue_days from config.yaml\nrg \"^last_reviewed:\" decisions/ --include=\"*.md\" -h | sort | head -20\n```\n\n### Check 6: Pending Observations and Tensions Backlog\n\n```bash\n# Count pending observations\nrg \"^status: pending\" ops/observations/ --include=\"*.md\" -l | wc -l\n\n# Count pending tensions\nrg \"^status: pending\" ops/tensions/ --include=\"*.md\" -l | wc -l\n```\n\nIf pending observations > threshold (from config.yaml), flag for /pm-retrospect.\nIf pending tensions > threshold, flag for /pm-retrospect.\n\n### Check 7: Inbox Pressure\n\n```bash\nls inbox/ | wc -l\n```\n\nIf inbox has items, flag for /pm-document processing.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```\n## Audit Complete — YYYY-MM-DD\n\n### System Metrics\n- Total decisions: N\n- Total decision registers: N\n- Total observations (pending/total): N/N\n- Total tensions (pending/total): N/N\n- Inbox items awaiting processing: N\n\n### Check 1: Orphan Decisions\n- Orphans found: N\n- [[decision-a]], [[decision-b]] — not referenced by any register\n\n### Check 2: Broken Wiki-Links\n- Broken links found: N\n- In [[decision-x]]: [[nonexistent-decision]] — target file missing\n\n### Check 3: Schema Violations\n- Violations found: N\n- [[decision-y]] — missing last_reviewed date\n- [[decision-z]] — description is empty\n\n### Check 4: Register Coverage\n- [[qftest-register]]: 12 decisions (healthy)\n- [[architecture-register]]: 28 decisions (approaching split threshold — flag)\n- [[sprint-register]]: 5 decisions (healthy)\n\n### Check 5: Stale Decisions\n- Stale decisions (>14 days): N\n- [[decision-a]] — last reviewed 21 days ago\n\n### Check 6: Pending Backlog\n- Pending observations: N [TRIGGER: /pm-retrospect] if > threshold\n- Pending tensions: N [TRIGGER: /pm-retrospect] if > threshold\n\n### Check 7: Inbox\n- Inbox items: N [TRIGGER: /pm-document] if > 0\n\n---\n\n### Priority Actions\n1. [CRITICAL] Fix N orphan decisions — assign to registers\n2. [HIGH] Process N pending observations — run /pm-retrospect\n3. [MEDIUM] Update N stale decisions\n4. [LOW] Review N schema violations\n\n### Vault Health Score: N/100\n[Breakdown: orphans -Xpts, schema violations -Xpts, stale decisions -Xpts, broken links -Xpts]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Vault Health Scoring\n\n| Issue | Penalty per instance |\n|-------|---------------------|\n| Orphan decision | -3 pts |\n| Broken wiki-link | -2 pts |\n| Schema violation | -2 pts |\n| Stale decision (>14 days) | -1 pt |\n| Pending observation >threshold | -5 pts flat |\n| Pending tension >threshold | -5 pts flat |\n\nStarting from 100. Report final score.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:41:58.849Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing comprehensive audit and compliance analysis for Ignition development environments.","zh":"非常适合需要对 Ignition 开发环境进行全面审计和合规性分析的项目管理代理。","ja":"Ignition 開発環境の包括的な監査とコンプライアンス分析が必要なプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適。","ko":"Ignition 개발 환경에 대한 종합적인 감사 및 준수 분석이 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de proyectos que necesitan un análisis de auditoría y cumplimiento integral para entornos de desarrollo de Ignition.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une analyse d''audit et de conformité complète pour les environnements de développement Ignition.","de":"Perfekt für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die eine umfassende Prüfung und Konformitätsanalyse für Ignition-Entwicklungsumgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de análise de auditoria e conformidade abrangente para ambientes de desenvolvimento Ignition.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению проектами, которым необходима комплексная проверка и анализ соответствия требованиям для среды разработки Ignition.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المشاريع الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل شاملا للتفتيش والامتثال للبيئات التطويرية ل Ignition."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform full-stack audits, including version control, environment management, and gateway health monitoring, using configuration data from ops/config.yaml and vocabulary mapping from ops/derivation-manifest.md.","zh":"赋予代理执行全栈审计的能力，包括版本控制、环境管理和网关健康监控，使用 ops/config.yaml 和 ops/derivation-manifest.md 中的配置数据和词汇映射。","ja":"エージェントに全スタック監査を実行する能力を与え、バージョン管理、環境管理、ゲートウェイのヘルスモニタリングを実行します。ops/config.yaml と ops/derivation-manifest.md の構成データと語彙マッピングを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 전체 스택 감사를 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며 버전 제어, 환경 관리 및 게이트웨이 건강 상태 모니터링을 수행합니다. ops/config.yaml 및 ops/derivation-manifest.md의 구성 데이터 및 어휘 매핑을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de pilas completas, incluyendo control de versiones, administración de entornos y monitoreo de la salud de la puerta de enlace, utilizando datos de configuración de ops/config.yaml y mapeo de vocabulario de ops/derivation-manifest.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits de pile complète, y compris la gestion de version, la gestion de l''environnement et la surveillance de la santé de la passerelle, en utilisant les données de configuration de ops/config.yaml et le mappage du vocabulaire de ops/derivation-manifest.md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, vollständige Stack-Audits durchzuführen, einschließlich Versionskontrolle, Umgebungsverwaltung und Gateway-Health-Monitoring, unter Verwendung von Konfigurationsdaten aus ops/config.yaml und Vokabularzuordnung aus ops/derivation-manifest.md.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de pilha completa, incluindo controle de versão, gerenciamento de ambiente e monitoramento de saúde de gateway, usando dados de configuração do ops/config.yaml e mapeamento de vocabulário do ops/derivation-manifest.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять аудит полного стека, включая контроль версий, управление окружением и мониторинг состояния шлюза, используя конфигурационные данные из ops/config.yaml и словарное отображение из ops/derivation-manifest.md.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إجراء فحص شامل للكامل، بما في ذلك التحكم في الإصدار و إدارة البيئة ومراقبة صحة البوابة، باستخدام بيانات التكوين من ops/config.yaml وتصيير المفردات من ops/derivation-manifest.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating audits for decision register coverage and completeness","Validating schema compliance across all decisions","Identifying orphan decisions and broken wiki-links","Running full audits for all checks"],"zh":["自动执行决策注册覆盖范围和完整性的审计","验证所有决策的模式合规性","识别孤立决策和破损的 wiki 链接","运行所有检查的完整审计"],"ja":["意思決定レジスタのカバレッジと完全性の監査を自動化する","すべての意思決定に対するスキーマのコンプライアンスを検証する","孤立した意思決定と破損した Wiki リンクを識別する","すべてのチェックの完全な監査を実行する"],"ko":["의사 결정 등록 범위 및 완전성에 대한 감사를 자동화하는 것","모든 의사 결정에 대한 스키마 준수성을 검증하는 것","고아된 의사 결정 및 고장난 위키 링크를 식별하는 것","모든 점검에 대한 전체 감사를 실행하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar auditorías para la cobertura y la integridad del registro de decisiones","Validar la conformidad del esquema en todas las decisiones","Identificar decisiones huérfanas y enlaces de wiki rotos","Ejecutar auditorías completas para todas las comprobaciones"],"fr":["Automatiser les audits pour la couverture et l''exhaustivité du registre des décisions","Valider la conformité du schéma pour toutes les décisions","Identifier les décisions orphelines et les liens wiki cassés","Exécuter des audits complets pour toutes les vérifications"],"de":["Automatisieren von Audits für die Abdeckung und Vollständigkeit des Entscheidungsregisters","Überprüfen der Konformität des Schemas für alle Entscheidungen","Identifizieren von Waisenentscheidungen und gebrochenen Wiki-Links","Durchführen von vollständigen Audits für alle Prüfungen"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias para cobertura e completude do registro de decisões","Validar conformidade de esquema em todas as decisões","Identificar decisões órfãs e links de wiki quebrados","Executar auditorias completas para todos os controles"],"ru":["Автоматизировать аудиты для покрытия и полноты реестра решений","Проверять соответствие схемы во всех решениях","Определять сиротские решения и сломанные ссылки wiki","Выполнять полные аудиты для вс