LazyVim設定","AIエージェント","開発効率向上","Goテストガイド","AIエージェント入門","LazyVimプラグイン","Go開発ツール"],"ko":["Go 테스팅 구성","LazyVim 설정","AI 에이전트","개발 효율성 향상","Go 테스팅 가이드","AI 에이전트 소개","LazyVim 플러그인","Go 개발 도구"],"es":["herramientas de pruebas Go","configuración personalizada para LazyVim","Agentes de IA para pruebas","cómo usar herramientas de pruebas Go","LazyVim alternativa","instalación de herramientas de pruebas Go","guía de configuración para LazyVim","pruebas Go con inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["outils de test Go","configuration personnelle pour LazyVim","agents d''IA pour les tests","comment utiliser des outils de test Go","LazyVim alternative","installation d''outils de test Go","guide de configuration pour LazyVim","tests Go avec intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Go-Testtools","persönliche Konfiguration für LazyVim","KI-Agents für Tests","wie man Go-Testtools verwendet","LazyVim-Alternative","Installation von Go-Testtools","Konfigurationsanleitung für LazyVim","Go-Tests mit künstlicher Intelligenz"],"pt":["como usar LazyVim","o que é teste em Go","ferramentas de teste em Go","LazyVim alternativa","LazyVim vs Vim","instalar LazyVim","guia de configuração LazyVim"],"ru":["как использовать LazyVim","что такое тестирование на Go","инструменты тестирования на Go","ИИ Агенты для тестирования","LazyVim альтернатива","LazyVim vs Vim","установить LazyVim","руководство по конфигурации LazyVim"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام LazyVim","ما هو اختبار جو","أدوات اختبار جو","أدوات اختبار جو مخصصة","LazyVim بديل","LazyVim مقابل Vim","تثبيت LazyVim","دليل إعدادات LazyVim"]}},"owner":"Gentleman-Programming","repo":"Gentleman.Dots","repoPath":"Gentleman-Programming/Gentleman.Dots","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.672Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"go-testing","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Writing Go unit tests\n- Testing Bubbletea TUI components\n- Creating table-driven tests\n- Adding integration tests\n- Using golden file testing\n\n---\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Table-Driven Tests\n\nStandard Go pattern for multiple test cases:\n\n```go\nfunc TestSomething(t *testing.T) {\n    tests := []struct {\n        name     string\n        input    string\n        expected string\n        wantErr  bool\n    }{\n        {\n            name:     \"valid input","body":"## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Writing Go unit tests\n- Testing Bubbletea TUI components\n- Creating table-driven tests\n- Adding integration tests\n- Using golden file testing\n\n---\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Table-Driven Tests\n\nStandard Go pattern for multiple test cases:\n\n```go\nfunc TestSomething(t *testing.T) {\n    tests := []struct {\n        name     string\n        input    string\n        expected string\n        wantErr  bool\n    }{\n        {\n            name:     \"valid input\",\n            input:    \"hello\",\n            expected: \"HELLO\",\n            wantErr:  false,\n        },\n        {\n            name:     \"empty input\",\n            input:    \"\",\n            expected: \"\",\n            wantErr:  true,\n        },\n    }\n\n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        t.Run(tt.name, func(t *testing.T) {\n            result, err := ProcessInput(tt.input)\n\n            if (err != nil) != tt.wantErr {\n                t.Errorf(\"error = %v, wantErr %v\", err, tt.wantErr)\n                return\n            }\n\n            if result != tt.expected {\n                t.Errorf(\"got %q, want %q\", result, tt.expected)\n            }\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Bubbletea Model Testing\n\nTest Model state transitions directly:\n\n```go\nfunc TestModelUpdate(t *testing.T) {\n    m := NewModel()\n\n    // Simulate key press\n    newModel, _ := m.Update(tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyEnter})\n    m = newModel.(Model)\n\n    if m.Screen != ScreenMainMenu {\n        t.Errorf(\"expected ScreenMainMenu, got %v\", m.Screen)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Teatest Integration Tests\n\nUse Charmbracelet''s teatest for TUI testing:\n\n```go\nfunc TestInteractiveFlow(t *testing.T) {\n    m := NewModel()\n    tm := teatest.NewTestModel(t, m)\n\n    // Send keys\n    tm.Send(tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyEnter})\n    tm.Send(tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyDown})\n    tm.Send(tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyEnter})\n\n    // Wait for model to update\n    tm.WaitFinished(t, teatest.WithDuration(time.Second))\n\n    // Get final model\n    finalModel := tm.FinalModel(t).(Model)\n\n    if finalModel.Screen != ExpectedScreen {\n        t.Errorf(\"wrong screen: got %v\", finalModel.Screen)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Golden File Testing\n\nCompare output against saved \"golden\" files:\n\n```go\nfunc TestOSSelectGolden(t *testing.T) {\n    m := NewModel()\n    m.Screen = ScreenOSSelect\n    m.Width = 80\n    m.Height = 24\n\n    output := m.View()\n\n    golden := filepath.Join(\"testdata\", \"TestOSSelectGolden.golden\")\n\n    if *update {\n        os.WriteFile(golden, []byte(output), 0644)\n    }\n\n    expected, _ := os.ReadFile(golden)\n    if output != string(expected) {\n        t.Errorf(\"output doesn''t match golden file\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nTesting a function?\n├── Pure function? → Table-driven test\n├── Has side effects? → Mock dependencies\n├── Returns error? → Test both success and error cases\n└── Complex logic? → Break into smaller testable units\n\nTesting TUI component?\n├── State change? → Test Model.Update() directly\n├── Full flow? → Use teatest.NewTestModel()\n├── Visual output? → Use golden file testing\n└── Key handling? → Send tea.KeyMsg\n\nTesting system/exec?\n├── Mock os/exec? → Use interface + mock\n├── Real commands? → Integration test with --short skip\n└── File operations? → Use t.TempDir()\n```\n\n---\n\n## Code Examples\n\n### Example 1: Testing Key Navigation\n\n```go\nfunc TestCursorNavigation(t *testing.T) {\n    tests := []struct {\n        name       string\n        startPos   int\n        key        string\n        endPos     int\n        numOptions int\n    }{\n        {\"down from 0\", 0, \"j\", 1, 5},\n        {\"up from 1\", 1, \"k\", 0, 5},\n        {\"down at bottom\", 4, \"j\", 4, 5}, // stays at bottom\n        {\"up at top\", 0, \"k\", 0, 5},       // stays at top\n    }\n\n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        t.Run(tt.name, func(t *testing.T) {\n            m := NewModel()\n            m.Cursor = tt.startPos\n            // Set up options...\n\n            newModel, _ := m.Update(tea.KeyMsg{\n                Type:  tea.KeyRunes,\n                Runes: []rune(tt.key),\n            })\n            m = newModel.(Model)\n\n            if m.Cursor != tt.endPos {\n                t.Errorf(\"cursor = %d, want %d\", m.Cursor, tt.endPos)\n            }\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Example 2: Testing Screen Transitions\n\n```go\nfunc TestScreenTransitions(t *testing.T) {\n    tests := []struct {\n        name         string\n        startScreen  Screen\n        action       tea.Msg\n        expectScreen Screen\n    }{\n        {\n            name:         \"welcome to main menu\",\n            startScreen:  ScreenWelcome,\n            action:       tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyEnter},\n            expectScreen: ScreenMainMenu,\n        },\n        {\n            name:         \"escape from OS select\",\n            startScreen:  ScreenOSSelect,\n            action:       tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyEsc},\n            expectScreen: ScreenMainMenu,\n        },\n    }\n\n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        t.Run(tt.name, func(t *testing.T) {\n            m := NewModel()\n            m.Screen = tt.startScreen\n\n            newModel, _ := m.Update(tt.action)\n            m = newModel.(Model)\n\n            if m.Screen != tt.expectScreen {\n                t.Errorf(\"screen = %v, want %v\", m.Screen, tt.expectScreen)\n            }\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Example 3: Testing Trainer Exercises\n\n```go\nfunc TestExerciseValidation(t *testing.T) {\n    exercise := &Exercise{\n        Solutions: []string{\"w\", \"W\", \"e\"},\n        Optimal:   \"w\",\n    }\n\n    tests := []struct {\n        input   string\n        valid   bool\n        optimal bool\n    }{\n        {\"w\", true, true},\n        {\"W\", true, false},\n        {\"e\", true, false},\n        {\"x\", false, false},\n    }\n\n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        t.Run(tt.input, func(t *testing.T) {\n            valid := ValidateAnswer(exercise, tt.input)\n            optimal := IsOptimalAnswer(exercise, tt.input)\n\n            if valid != tt.valid {\n                t.Errorf(\"valid = %v, want %v\", valid, tt.valid)\n            }\n            if optimal != tt.optimal {\n                t.Errorf(\"optimal = %v, want %v\", optimal, tt.optimal)\n            }\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Example 4: Mocking System Info\n\n```go\nfunc TestWithMockedSystem(t *testing.T) {\n    m := NewModel()\n\n    // Mock system info for testing\n    m.SystemInfo = &system.SystemInfo{\n        OS:       system.OSMac,\n        IsARM:    true,\n        HasBrew:  true,\n        HomeDir:  t.TempDir(),\n    }\n\n    // Now test with controlled environment\n    m.SetupInstallSteps()\n\n    // Verify expected steps\n    hasHomebrew := false\n    for _, step := range m.Steps {\n        if step.ID == \"homebrew\" {\n            hasHomebrew = true\n        }\n    }\n\n    if hasHomebrew {\n        t.Error(\"should not have homebrew step when HasBrew=true\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Test File Organization\n\n```\ninstaller/internal/tui/\n├── model.go\n├── model_test.go           # Model tests\n├── update.go\n├── update_test.go          # Update handler tests\n├── view.go\n├── view_test.go            # View rendering tests\n├── teatest_test.go         # Teatest integration tests\n├── comprehensive_test.go   # Full flow tests\n├── testdata/\n│   ├── TestOSSelectGolden.golden\n│   └── TestViewGolden.golden\n└── trainer/\n    ├── types.go\n    ├── types_test.go\n    ├── exercises.go\n    ├── exercises_test.go\n    └── simulator_test.go\n```\n\n---\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\ngo test ./...                           # Run all tests\ngo test -v ./internal/tui/...          # Verbose TUI tests\ngo test -run TestNavigation             # Run specific test\ngo test -cover ./...                    # With coverage\ngo test -update ./...                   # Update golden files\ngo test -short ./...                    # Skip integration tests\n```\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- **TUI Tests**: See `installer/internal/tui/*_test.go`\n- **Trainer Tests**: See `installer/internal/tui/trainer/*_test.go`\n- **System Tests**: See `installer/internal/system/*_test.go`\n- **Golden Files**: See `installer/internal/tui/testdata/`\n- **Teatest Docs**: https://github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea/tree/master/teatest\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:02.796Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Go-focused AI Agents requiring comprehensive unit testing and validation capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要全面单元测试和验证功能的 Go 专注 AI 代理。","ja":"Go に重点を置いた AI エージェントが包括的なユニットテストと検証機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"포괄적인 단위 테스트 및 검증 기능이 필요한 Go 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en Go que requieren capacidades de prueba y validación de unidad comprehensivas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Go nécessitant des capacités de test et de validation d''unités complètes.","de":"Ideal für Go-fokussierte KI-Agents, die umfassende Einheitentest- und Validierungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em Go que exigem capacidades de teste e validação unitários abrangentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Go, требующих всесторонних возможностей для модульного тестирования и проверки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على Go يتطلب khảیات اختبار و تحقق وحدات شاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write robust Go unit tests, leveraging table-driven tests, integration tests, and golden file testing, utilizing the Go testing library and Bubbletea TUI components.","zh":"赋予代理编写强大的 Go 单元测试的能力，利用表驱动测试、集成测试和金文件测试，使用 Go 测试库和 Bubbletea TUI 组件。","ja":"エージェントが強力な Go ユニットテストを記述できるようにし、表駆動テスト、統合テスト、ゴールドファイルテストを利用し、Go テストライブラリと Bubbletea TUI コンポーネントを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 강력한 Go 단위 테스트를 작성할 수 있도록 하며, 테이블 주도 테스트, 통합 테스트 및 골든 파일 테스트를 활용하며, Go 테스트 라이브러리 및 Bubbletea TUI 컴포넌트를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes escribir pruebas de unidad robustas de Go, aprovechando pruebas impulsadas por tabla, pruebas de integración y pruebas de archivo dorado, utilizando la biblioteca de pruebas de Go y los componentes de la interfaz de usuario de Bubbletea TUI.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests d''unité robustes Go, en exploitant les tests pilotés par tableau, les tests d''intégration et les tests de fichier doré, en utilisant la bibliothèque de test Go et les composants de l''interface utilisateur de Bubbletea TUI.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, robuste Go-Einheitentests zu schreiben, indem es table-getriebene Tests, Integrationstests und Golden-File-Tests nutzt, unter Verwendung der Go-Testbibliothek und der Bubbletea-TUI-Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes escrevam testes unitários robustos em Go, aproveitando testes orientados por tabela, testes de integração e testes de arquivos de ouro, utilizando a biblioteca de testes do Go e componentes de interface do usuário Bubbletea TUI.","ru":"Позволяет агентам писать прочные модульные тесты на Go, используя таблицо-ориентированные тесты, тесты интеграции и тестирование файлов-золотого стандарта, используя библиотеку тестирования Go и компоненты Bubbletea TUI.","ar":"يمكن للعميل من كتابة اختبارات وحدات قوية في Go، مستفيدا من اختبارات المواجهة بواسطة الجدول و اختبارات التكامل و اختبارات الملفات الذهبية، باستخدام مكتبة اختبار Go و مكونات واجهة المستخدم Bubbletea TUI."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing Go unit tests for critical components","Testing Bubbletea TUI components for user interface validation","Creating table-driven tests for multiple test cases","Adding integration tests for complex system interactions"],"zh":["为关键组件编写 Go 单元测试","测试 Bubbletea TUI 组件以进行用户界面验证","为多个测试用例创建表驱动测试","为复杂系统交互添加集成测试"],"ja":["重要なコンポーネントの Go ユニットテストを記述する","Bubbletea TUI コンポーネントをテストしてユーザーインターフェイスを検証する","複数のテストケースの表駆動テストを作成する","複雑なシステムの相互作用の統合テストを追加する"],"ko":["중요한 구성 요소에 대한 Go 단위 테스트 작성","Bubbletea TUI 구성 요소를 테스트하여 사용자 인터페이스 검증","다중 테스트 케이스에 대한 테이블 주도 테스트 생성","복잡한 시스템 상호 작용에 대한 통합 테스트 추가"],"es":["Escribir pruebas de unidad de Go para componentes críticos","Probar componentes de la interfaz de usuario de Bubbletea TUI para la validación de la interfaz de usuario","Crear pruebas impulsadas por tabla para múltiples casos de prueba","Agregar pruebas de integración para interacciones de sistema complejas"],"fr":["Écrire des tests d''unité Go pour les composants critiques","Tester les composants de l''interface utilisateur de Bubbletea TUI pour la validation de l''interface utilisateur","Créer des tests pilotés par tableau pour de multiples cas de test","Ajouter des tests d''intégration pour des interactions de système complexes"],"de":["Schreiben von Go-Einheitentests für kritische Komponenten","Testen von Bubbletea-TUI-Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für die Benutzeroberflächenvalidierung","Erstellen von table-getriebenen Tests für mehrere Testfälle","Hinzufügen von Integrationstests für komplexe Systeminteraktionen"],"pt":["Escrever testes unitários em Go para componentes críticos","Testar componentes de interface do usuário Bubbletea TUI para validação de interface do usuário","Criar testes orientados por tabela para vários casos de teste","Adicionar testes de integração para interações de sistema complexas"],"ru":["Написание модульных тестов на Go для критических компонентов","Тестирование компонентов интерфейса пользователя Bubbletea TUI для проверки интерфейса пользователя","Создание таблицо-ориентированных тестов для нескольких случаев тестирования","Добавление тестов интеграции для сложных взаимодействий системы"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات وحدات في Go للعناصر الحرجة","اختبار مكونات واجهة المستخدم Bubbletea TUI للتحقق من واجهة المستخدم","إنشاء اختبارات مواجهة بواسطة الجدول لعدة حالات اختبار","إضافة اختبارات التكامل للتفاعلات المعقدة للنظام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go programming language environment","Specific to Go unit testing and Bubbletea TUI components"],"zh":["需要 Go 编程语言环境","仅限于 Go 单元测试和 Bubbletea TUI 组件"],"ja":["Go プログラミング言語環境が必要","Go ユニットテストと Bubbletea TUI コンポーネントに限られる"],"ko":["Go 프로그래밍 언어 환경이 필요함","Go 단위 테스트 및 Bubbletea TUI 컴포넌트에만 국한됨"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de lenguaje de programación Go","Específico para pruebas de unidad de Go y componentes de la interfaz de usuario de Bubbletea TUI"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de langage de programmation Go","Spécifique aux tests d''unité Go et aux composants de l''interface utilisateur de Bubbletea TUI"],"de":["Benötigt eine Go-Programmiersprachen-Umgebung","Spezifisch für Go-Einheitentests und Bubbletea-TUI-Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de linguagem de programação Go","Específico para testes unitários em Go e componentes Bubbletea TUI"],"ru":["Требует среды программирования на языке Go","Относится конкретно к модульным тестам на Go и компонентам Bubbletea TUI"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة لغة برمجة Go","محدد لاختبارات الوحدات في Go و مكونات Bubbletea TUI"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"eacbe9a7dbfabf1a9eb39522d812670f73ffc5b8e1bb62f60412f3c18261aaea","qualityScore":57}');
