ur Agent IA","Amélioration du flux de travail de développement","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Automatisation de tâches","Amélioration de la productivité"],"de":["KI-Tools von Claude Code","Verbesserung des Entwicklungsworkflows","Integration mit Entwicklertools","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Steigerung der Produktivität"],"pt":["Automação de tarefas de desenvolvimento","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Comandos de barra de ferramentas personalizados","Prompts para melhorar a produtividade"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач разработки","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Пользовательские команды слэш","Промпты для повышения производительности"],"ar":["تأتيير مهام التطوير","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","أوامر شريط أدوات مخصصة","المحفزات لتحسين الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 readme-updater","什么是 AI 工具","readme-updater 替代品","readme-updater 安装指南","开发工作流自动化","提高开发效率","AI 工具比较"],"ja":["readme-updater の使用方法","AI エージェントとは","readme-updater の代替品","readme-updater のインストールガイド","開発ワークフローの自動化","開発効率の向上","AI エージェントの比較"],"ko":["readme-updater 사용법","AI 도구란","readme-updater 대체품","readme-updater 설치 가이드","개발 워크플ロー 자동화","개발 효율성 향상","AI 도구 비교"],"es":["cómo usar readme-updater","qué es un Agente de IA","readme-updater alternativa","readme-updater vs GitHub","instalar readme-updater","guía de configuración de readme-updater"],"fr":["comment utiliser readme-updater","qu''est-ce qu''un Agent IA","readme-updater alternative","readme-updater vs GitHub","installer readme-updater","guide de configuration de readme-updater"],"de":["wie man readme-updater verwendet","was ist ein KI-Tool","readme-updater Alternative","readme-updater vs GitHub","readme-updater installieren","Anleitung zur Konfiguration von readme-updater"],"pt":["como usar o readme-updater","o que é um Agente de IA","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","readme-updater vs competitors","instalar o readme-updater","guia de configuração do readme-updater"],"ru":["как использовать readme-updater","что такое ИИ Агент","инструменты разработки","readme-updater vs конкуренты","установить readme-updater","руководство по настройке readme-updater"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام readme-updater","ما هي أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات التطوير","readme-updater مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت readme-updater","دليل إعداد readme-updater"]}},"owner":"alirezarezvani","repo":"claude-code-tresor","repoPath":"alirezarezvani/claude-code-tresor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.673Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"readme-updater","description":"Keep README files current with project changes. Use when project structure changes, features added, or setup instructions modified. Suggests README updates based on code changes. Triggers on significant project changes, new features, dependency changes.","bodyPreview":"# README Updater Skill\n\nKeep your README current with project changes.\n\n## When I Activate\n\n- ✅ New features added\n- ✅ Project structure changes\n- ✅ Dependencies added/removed\n- ✅ Setup instructions change\n- ✅ User mentions README or documentation\n- ✅ Configuration files modified\n\n## What I Update\n\n### README Sections\n\n**Installation:**\n- New dependencies\n- Setup steps\n- Prerequisites\n- Environment variables\n\n**Features:**\n- New capabilities\n- Functionality changes\n- Feature deprecation\n\n**Usage","body":"# README Updater Skill\n\nKeep your README current with project changes.\n\n## When I Activate\n\n- ✅ New features added\n- ✅ Project structure changes\n- ✅ Dependencies added/removed\n- ✅ Setup instructions change\n- ✅ User mentions README or documentation\n- ✅ Configuration files modified\n\n## What I Update\n\n### README Sections\n\n**Installation:**\n- New dependencies\n- Setup steps\n- Prerequisites\n- Environment variables\n\n**Features:**\n- New capabilities\n- Functionality changes\n- Feature deprecation\n\n**Usage:**\n- API changes\n- New examples\n- Updated screenshots\n\n**Configuration:**\n- New options\n- Environment variables\n- Config file changes\n\n## Examples\n\n### New Feature Addition\n\n```bash\n# You add authentication:\ngit diff\n# + auth.service.ts\n# + login.component.tsx\n# + JWT middleware\n\n# I suggest README update:\n## Features\n- ✨ User authentication with JWT  # NEW\n- 🔐 Role-based access control    # NEW\n- User management\n- Dashboard\n```\n\n### New Dependency\n\n```bash\n# You add: npm install stripe\n\n# I suggest:\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm install stripe  # Added for payment processing\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n```bash\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=your_stripe_key  # Required for payments\n```\n```\n\n### Setup Instructions\n\n```bash\n# You modify docker-compose.yml\n\n# I update README:\n## Development Setup\n\n```bash\n# 1. Clone repository\ngit clone [url]\n\n# 2. Install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# 3. Start services (UPDATED)\ndocker-compose up -d  # Now includes Redis cache\n\n# 4. Run migrations\nnpm run migrate\n```\n```\n\n## Detection Logic\n\n### Change Analysis\n\nI detect these changes automatically:\n- **package.json** → Update dependencies section\n- **New routes** → Update API documentation\n- **.env.example** → Update environment variables\n- **docker-compose.yml** → Update setup instructions\n- **New features** → Update features list\n\n### Section Mapping\n\n```yaml\nCode Change → README Section:\n  - New API endpoint → Usage / API Reference\n  - New dependency → Installation\n  - New env var → Configuration\n  - New feature → Features list\n  - Architecture change → Architecture section\n```\n\n## Intelligent Updates\n\n### Keep Structure\n\nI maintain your README structure:\n- Preserve emoji style\n- Keep formatting consistent\n- Maintain tone and voice\n- Respect existing organization\n\n### Add Missing Sections\n\n```markdown\n# Suggested additions:\n\n## Prerequisites\n- Node.js 18+\n- Docker (for development)\n- PostgreSQL 14+\n\n## Environment Variables\n```bash\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://localhost/mydb\nAPI_KEY=your_api_key\n```\n\n## Testing\n```bash\nnpm test\n```\n```\n\n### Update Examples\n\n```markdown\n# Before:\n```javascript\nconst result = api.getUsers();\n```\n\n# After (API changed):\n```javascript\nconst result = await api.getUsers({ page: 1, limit: 10 });\n```\n```\n\n## Version Compatibility\n\nI track version-specific documentation:\n\n```markdown\n## Requirements\n\n- Node.js 18+ (updated from 16+)\n- TypeScript 5.0+ (new requirement)\n- React 18+ (unchanged)\n```\n\n## Changelog Integration\n\nI can sync with CHANGELOG.md:\n\n```markdown\n## Recent Changes\n\nSee [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) for detailed version history.\n\n### Latest (v2.1.0)\n- ✨ Added user authentication\n- 🔧 Fixed memory leak in data processing\n- 📝 Updated API documentation\n```\n\n## Screenshot Management\n\n```markdown\n# I suggest when UI changes:\n## Screenshots\n\n![Dashboard](screenshots/dashboard.png)\n*Updated: 2025-10-24 - New authentication panel*\n\n![User Profile](screenshots/profile.png)\n*New feature - user profile management*\n```\n\n## Relationship with @docs-writer\n\n**Me (Skill):** Keep README current with code changes\n**@docs-writer (Sub-Agent):** Comprehensive documentation strategy\n\n### Workflow\n1. I detect changes\n2. I suggest README updates\n3. For full docs → Invoke **@docs-writer** sub-agent\n4. Sub-agent creates complete documentation\n\n## Sandboxing Compatibility\n\n**Works without sandboxing:** ✅ Yes\n**Works with sandboxing:** ✅ Yes\n\n- **Filesystem**: Writes to README.md\n- **Network**: None required\n- **Configuration**: None required\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Keep it current** - Update README with every feature\n2. **Be specific** - Include version numbers, prerequisites\n3. **Add examples** - Show actual usage, not just API\n4. **Include troubleshooting** - Common issues and solutions\n5. **Badge status** - Keep build/coverage badges current\n\n## README Templates\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n# Project Name\n\nBrief description\n\n## Features\n- Feature 1\n- Feature 2\n\n## Installation\n```bash\nnpm install\n```\n\n## Usage\n```javascript\n// Example\n```\n\n## Configuration\nEnvironment variables needed\n\n## Contributing\nHow to contribute\n\n## License\nMIT\n```\n\n### Comprehensive Structure\n\n```markdown\n# Project Name\n> Tagline\n\n[Badges]\n\n## Table of Contents\n- Features\n- Installation\n- Usage\n- API Reference\n- Configuration\n- Development\n- Testing\n- Deployment\n- Contributing\n- License\n\n[Sections with detailed content]\n```\n\n## Integration\n\n### With /docs-gen Command\n\n```bash\n/docs-gen --format markdown\n\n# Generates:\n# 1. README.md (via me)\n# 2. Full documentation site (via @docs-writer)\n# 3. API reference (via api-documenter)\n```\n\n### With CI/CD\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/docs.yml\n- name: Update README\n  run: |\n    # Skill suggests updates based on changes\n    # Review and commit\n```\n\n## Customization\n\nAdd company-specific README standards:\n\n```bash\ncp -r ~/.claude/skills/documentation/readme-updater \\\n      ~/.claude/skills/documentation/company-readme-updater\n\n# Edit to add:\n# - Company README template\n# - Required sections\n# - Badge standards\n```\n\n## Related Tools\n\n- **api-documenter skill**: API documentation\n- **@docs-writer sub-agent**: Comprehensive docs\n- **git-commit-helper skill**: Commit messages for updates\n- **/docs-gen command**: Full documentation generation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:18.013Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated documentation updates for project README files.","zh":"适合需要自动更新项目 README 文件文档的开发代理。","ja":"プロジェクトのREADMEファイルの自動ドキュメント更新が必要な開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"프로젝트 README 파일의 자동 문서 업데이트가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan actualizaciones automatizadas de documentación para archivos README de proyectos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de mises à jour automatiques de documentation pour les fichiers README de projet.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die automatisierte Dokumentationsaktualisierungen für Projekt-README-Dateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de atualizações automatizadas de documentação para arquivos README de projetos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы автоматические обновления документации для файлов README проектов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تحديثات خودية للوثائق لملفات README لمشاريع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to keep project READMEs up-to-date with the latest features, dependencies, and setup instructions, ensuring accurate documentation using Markdown formatting and configuration files.","zh":"赋予代理更新项目 README 以跟踪最新功能、依赖项和设置说明，确保使用 Markdown 格式和配置文件的准确文档。","ja":"エージェントに最新の機能、依存関係、設定手順を追跡するためのプロジェクトのREADMEを更新する力を与え、Markdown形式と設定ファイルを使用した正確なドキュメントを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 최신 기능, 종속성 및 설정 지침을 추적하여 프로젝트 README를 업데이트할 수 있도록 하며, Markdown 형식 및 구성 파일을 사용하여 정확한 문서를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener los archivos README del proyecto actualizados con las últimas características, dependencias e instrucciones de configuración, garantizando una documentación precisa utilizando formato Markdown y archivos de configuración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de garder les fichiers README de projet à jour avec les dernières fonctionnalités, dépendances et instructions de configuration, en garantissant une documentation précise en utilisant le formatage Markdown et les fichiers de configuration.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Projekt-README-Dateien mit den neuesten Funktionen, Abhängigkeiten und Einrichtungsanweisungen auf dem neuesten Stand zu halten, indem sie eine genaue Dokumentation unter Verwendung von Markdown-Formatierung und Konfigurationsdateien gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter os arquivos README do projeto atualizados com os recursos mais recentes, dependências e instruções de configuração, garantindo documentação precisa usando formatação Markdown e arquivos de configuração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать файлы README проекта в актуальном состоянии с последними функциями, зависимостями и инструкциями по настройке, обеспечивая точную документацию с использованием форматирования Markdown и файлов конфигурации.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على ملفات README لمشاريعهم محدثة مع أحدث الميزات والاعتماديات وإرشادات الإعداد، وضمان توثيق دقيق باستخدام تنسيق Markdown وملفات التكوين."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating README updates after new feature additions","Generating documentation for project structure changes","Updating setup instructions and dependency lists"],"zh":["在新功能添加后自动更新 README","为项目结构更改生成文档","更新设置说明和依赖项列表"],"ja":["新しい機能追加後のREADMEの自動更新","プロジェクト構造変更のドキュメントの生成","設定手順と依存関係リストの更新"],"ko":["새로운 기능 추가 후 README 자동 업데이트하기","프로젝트 구조 변경에 대한 문서 생성하기","설정 지침 및 종속성 목록 업데이트하기"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de README después de agregar nuevas características","Generar documentación para cambios en la estructura del proyecto","Actualizar instrucciones de configuración y listas de dependencias"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de README après l''ajout de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Générer la documentation pour les changements de structure de projet","Mettre à jour les instructions de configuration et les listes de dépendances"],"de":["Automatisieren von README-Aktualisierungen nach dem Hinzufügen neuer Funktionen","Generieren von Dokumentation für Änderungen an der Projektstruktur","Aktualisieren von Einrichtungsanweisungen und Abhängigkeitslisten"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de README após adições de novos recursos","Gerar documentação para alterações na estrutura do projeto","Atualizar instruções de configuração e listas de dependências"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления README после добавления новых функций","Генерировать документацию для изменений в структуре проекта","Обновлять инструкции по настройке и списки зависимостей"],"ar":["تحديث خودي لملفات README بعد إضافة ميزات جديدة","توليد توثيق لتحديثات هيكل المشروع","تحديث إرشادات الإعداد وقوائم الاعتماديات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project configuration files","Limited to Markdown-based README files"],"zh":["需要访问项目配置文件","仅限于基于 Markdown 的 README 文件"],"ja":["プロジェクトの設定ファイルへのアクセスが必要","MarkdownベースのREADMEファイルのみ"],"ko":["프로젝트 구성 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요함","Markdown 기반의 README 파일만 지원"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de configuración del proyecto","Limitado a archivos README basados en Markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de configuration du projet","Limité aux fichiers README basés sur Markdown"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Projekt-Konfigurationsdateien","Begrenzt auf Markdown-basierte README-Dateien"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de configuração do projeto","Limitado a arquivos README baseados em Markdown"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам конфигурации проекта","Ограничен файлами README на основе Markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات تكوين المشروع","محدود بملفات README المستندة إلى Markdown"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"173a3ffbb6684b7c19e2203915b91c51724abc9aca007f05d2c72f31a16299f7","qualityScore":57}');
