ción pública sobre robots de entrega en aceras","Código de ejemplo para implementación","Análisis de datos con bibliotecas de Python"],"fr":["Analyse de sentiments avec Python","Modélisation de sujets dans les commentaires YouTube","Perception publique sur les robots de livraison sur les trottoirs","Exemple de code pour mise en œuvre","Analyse de données avec des bibliothèques Python"],"de":["Sentimentanalyse mit Python","Themenerkennung in YouTube-Kommentaren","Öffentliche Wahrnehmung von Lieferrobotern auf Gehwegen","Beispielcode für Implementierung","Datenanalyse mit Python-Bibliotheken"],"pt":["Análise de sentimentos em comentários do YouTube","Modelagem de tópicos com Python","Integração com a biblioteca TRR 2025","Suporte a ambientes de desenvolvimento Python","Fácil instalação e configuração"],"ru":["Анализ настроений в комментариях YouTube","Моделирование тем с помощью Python","Интеграция с библиотекой TRR 2025","Поддержка сред разработки Python","Легкая установка и настройка"],"ar":["تحليل المشاعر في تعليقات يوتيوب","نمذجة المواضيع باستخدام بايثون","التكامل مع مكتبة TRR 2025","دعم بيئات التطوير بايثون","تثبيت وضبط سهل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AIエージェント","Python环境管理","情感分析","主题建模","YouTube评论分析","人行道送货机器人","公众看法分析","如何使用AIエージェント","AIエージェント安装","Python开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Python環境管理","感性分析","テーマモデリング","YouTubeのコメント分析","人行道配達ロボット","公共の認識分析","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","Python開発"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","파이썬 환경 관리","감성 분석","주제 모델링","YouTube 댓글 분석","보행로 배달 로봇","대중의 인식 분석","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 설치","파이썬 개발"],"es":["cómo utilizar Python para análisis de sentimiento","herramientas AI para análisis de sentimiento","análisis de sentimiento en comentarios de YouTube","modelado de temas con Python","percepción pública sobre robots de entrega en aceras","instalación de Python para análisis de sentimiento","guía de configuración para análisis de sentimiento con Python"],"fr":["comment utiliser Python pour l''analyse de sentiments","outils IA pour l''analyse de sentiments","analyse de sentiments dans les commentaires YouTube","modélisation de sujets avec Python","perception publique sur les robots de livraison sur les trottoirs","installation de Python pour l''analyse de sentiments","guide de configuration pour l''analyse de sentiments avec Python"],"de":["wie man Python für die Sentimentanalyse verwendet","KI-Tools für die Sentimentanalyse","Sentimentanalyse in YouTube-Kommentaren","Themenerkennung mit Python","öffentliches Bild von Lieferrobotern auf Gehwegen","Installation von Python für die Sentimentanalyse","Einrichtungsanleitung für die Sentimentanalyse mit Python"],"pt":["como usar o agente manage-python-env","o que é análise de sentimentos","alternativas ao manage-python-env","manage-python-env vs outros agentes de IA","instalar o manage-python-env","guia de configuração do manage-python-env","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com Python","análise de dados com Python"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент manage-python-env","что такое анализ настроений","альтернативы manage-python-env","manage-python-env vs другие ИИ Агенты","установить manage-python-env","руководство по настройке manage-python-env","разработка приложений на Python","анализ данных на Python"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي manage-python-env","ما هو تحليل المشاعر","بديلات أداة manage-python-env","manage-python-env مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","تثبيت أداة manage-python-env","دليل إعداد أداة manage-python-env","تطوير التطبيقات باستخدام بايثون","تحليل البيانات باستخدام بايثون"]}},"owner":"dudusoar","repo":"sdr-sentiment-analysis","repoPath":"dudusoar/sdr-sentiment-analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.698Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"manage-python-env","description":"Python virtual environment management using uv for fast and reliable environment setup. Create, maintain, and manage Python virtual environments with dependency management. Use uv for environment creation, package installation, dependency resolution, and project configuration. Use when setting up new Python projects, managing dependencies, troubleshooting environment issues, or ensuring reproducible development environments.","bodyPreview":"# Python Environment Management Skill\n\nThis skill provides tools and workflows for managing Python virtual environments using uv, a fast Python package installer and resolver.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Install uv**: Ensure uv is installed on your system\n2. **Create environment**: Use uv to create a new virtual environment\n3. **Install dependencies**: Add packages from requirements.txt or pyproject.toml\n4. **Manage environment**: Update, freeze, or clean up dependencies\n5. **Troubleshoot**: Resolve c","body":"# Python Environment Management Skill\n\nThis skill provides tools and workflows for managing Python virtual environments using uv, a fast Python package installer and resolver.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Install uv**: Ensure uv is installed on your system\n2. **Create environment**: Use uv to create a new virtual environment\n3. **Install dependencies**: Add packages from requirements.txt or pyproject.toml\n4. **Manage environment**: Update, freeze, or clean up dependencies\n5. **Troubleshoot**: Resolve common environment issues\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### 1. Environment Setup\n```bash\n# Initialize project with uv\nuv init project-name\ncd project-name\n\n# Create virtual environment\nuv venv\n\n# Activate environment\n# On Windows:\n.venv\\Scripts\\activate\n# On Unix/Mac:\nsource .venv/bin/activate\n```\n\n### 2. Dependency Management\n```bash\n# Install packages\nuv add package-name\nuv add \"package-name>=1.0.0\"\nuv add \"package-name[extra]\"\n\n# Install from requirements.txt\nuv pip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# Install with development dependencies\nuv add --dev pytest black\n```\n\n### 3. Project Configuration\n```bash\n# Generate requirements.txt\nuv pip freeze > requirements.txt\n\n# Sync environment\nuv sync\n\n# Update packages\nuv update\nuv update package-name\n```\n\n## uv vs Traditional Tools\n\n### Advantages of uv\n- **Speed**: 10-100x faster than pip\n- **Reliability**: Better dependency resolution\n- **Unified tool**: Replaces pip, venv, pip-tools\n- **Cross-platform**: Consistent behavior across systems\n- **Modern features**: Built-in virtual environments, lock files\n\n### Command Comparison\n| Task | uv Command | Traditional Command |\n|------|------------|---------------------|\n| Create venv | `uv venv` | `python -m venv .venv` |\n| Install package | `uv add package` | `pip install package` |\n| Install dev package | `uv add --dev package` | `pip install package` |\n| Freeze deps | `uv pip freeze` | `pip freeze` |\n| Sync env | `uv sync` | `pip install -r requirements.txt` |\n| Update package | `uv update package` | `pip install --upgrade package` |\n\n## Environment Types\n\n### Development Environment\n```bash\n# Complete development setup\nuv venv\nuv add --dev pytest black flake8 mypy\nuv add pandas numpy matplotlib\nuv sync\n```\n\n### Production Environment\n```bash\n# Production-ready with pinned versions\nuv venv --python 3.11\nuv add \"package==1.2.3\"  # Pin exact versions\nuv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt\n```\n\n### CI/CD Environment\n```bash\n# Minimal environment for CI\nuv venv --python 3.11\nuv add --no-dev package-name\nuv sync --frozen\n```\n\n## Project Structure\n\n### Recommended Layout\n```\nproject/\n├── .venv/                 # Virtual environment (gitignored)\n├── src/                   # Source code\n├── tests/                 # Test files\n├── pyproject.toml         # Project configuration\n├── requirements.txt       # Pinned dependencies\n├── requirements-dev.txt   # Development dependencies\n└── .python-version       # Python version specification\n```\n\n### Configuration Files\n\n#### pyproject.toml\n```toml\n[project]\nname = \"my-project\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\ndescription = \"My project description\"\nrequires-python = \">=3.8\"\ndependencies = [\n    \"requests>=2.28.0\",\n    \"pandas>=1.5.0\",\n]\n\n[project.optional-dependencies]\ndev = [\n    \"pytest>=7.0.0\",\n    \"black>=23.0.0\",\n    \"flake8>=6.0.0\",\n]\n\n[tool.uv]\n# uv-specific settings\n```\n\n#### requirements.txt\n```\n# Pinned dependencies\nrequests==2.28.2\npandas==1.5.3\nnumpy==1.24.3\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### New Project Setup\n```bash\n# 1. Create project directory\nmkdir my-project && cd my-project\n\n# 2. Initialize with uv\nuv init\n\n# 3. Create virtual environment\nuv venv\n\n# 4. Activate environment\nsource .venv/bin/activate  # or .venv\\Scripts\\activate on Windows\n\n# 5. Add initial dependencies\nuv add requests pandas\nuv add --dev pytest black\n\n# 6. Create basic project structure\nmkdir src tests\ntouch src/__init__.py tests/__init__.py\n\n# 7. Create .gitignore\necho \".venv/\" >> .gitignore\necho \"__pycache__/\" >> .gitignore\necho \"*.pyc\" >> .gitignore\n```\n\n### Existing Project Setup\n```bash\n# 1. Clone repository\ngit clone https://github.com/user/project.git\ncd project\n\n# 2. Create environment with specific Python version\nuv venv --python 3.11\n\n# 3. Install dependencies\nuv sync\n\n# 4. Activate environment\nsource .venv/bin/activate\n```\n\n**Real-world example**: The YouTube-SC project includes complete setup scripts (`setup-environment.bat` and `setup-environment.sh`) and a comprehensive `requirements.txt` file. See `examples/youtube-sc/` for details.\n\n### Dependency Updates\n```bash\n# Check for updates\nuv update --outdated\n\n# Update all packages\nuv update\n\n# Update specific package\nuv update package-name\n\n# Update with constraints\nuv update --pre  # Include pre-release versions\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n#### 1. Environment Activation Fails\n**Symptoms**: `source .venv/bin/activate` doesn''t work\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Check if .venv exists\nls -la .venv/\n\n# Try alternative activation\n. .venv/bin/activate  # Note the space after the dot\n\n# On Windows, use:\n.venv\\Scripts\\activate\n```\n\n#### 2. Package Installation Failures\n**Symptoms**: `uv add package` fails with errors\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Clear uv cache\nuv cache clean\n\n# Try with verbose output\nuv add package -v\n\n# Check Python version compatibility\npython --version\n\n# Try different package version\nuv add \"package>=1.0.0,<2.0.0\"\n```\n\n#### 3. Dependency Conflicts\n**Symptoms**: `uv sync` fails with resolution errors\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Use resolution strategy\nuv sync --resolution=highest\nuv sync --resolution=lowest-direct\n\n# Check existing dependencies\nuv pip list\n\n# Remove conflicting package\nuv remove conflicting-package\n```\n\n#### 4. Slow Package Installation\n**Symptoms**: uv is slow (unusual)\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Use uv''s native resolver (already fast)\n# Check network connection\n\n# Use mirror or local cache\nuv config set global.index-url \"https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple\"\n\n# Pre-download packages\nuv pip download package -d ./packages\n```\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n### Lock Files\n```bash\n# Generate lock file\nuv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt\n\n# Install from lock file\nuv sync --frozen\n```\n\n### Multiple Python Versions\n```bash\n# Create environment with specific Python version\nuv venv --python 3.11\nuv venv --python 3.10\nuv venv --python 3.9\n\n# List available Python versions\nuv python list\n```\n\n### Environment Isolation\n```bash\n# Create isolated environment\nuv venv --isolated\n\n# Copy existing environment\nuv venv --copies\n```\n\n### Cross-Platform Compatibility\n```bash\n# Generate platform-specific requirements\nuv pip compile requirements.in --platform linux --platform macos --platform windows\n\n# Install platform-specific packages\nuv add \"package; sys_platform == ''linux''\"\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Tools\n\n### IDE Integration\n**VS Code**: Add to settings.json:\n```json\n{\n    \"python.defaultInterpreterPath\": \".venv/bin/python\",\n    \"terminal.integrated.env.windows\": {\n        \"VIRTUAL_ENV\": \"${workspaceFolder}/.venv\"\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**PyCharm**: \n- File → Settings → Project → Python Interpreter\n- Add → Existing environment → Select .venv/bin/python\n\n### Docker Integration\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.11-slim\n\n# Install uv\nRUN pip install uv\n\n# Copy project files\nCOPY . /app\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Create virtual environment and install dependencies\nRUN uv venv && uv sync --frozen\n\n# Use the virtual environment\nENV PATH=\"/app/.venv/bin:$PATH\"\n\nCMD [\"python\", \"main.py\"]\n```\n\n### CI/CD Integration\n```yaml\n# GitHub Actions example\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: astral-sh/setup-uv@v3\n      - run: uv sync --frozen\n      - run: uv run pytest\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### 1. Version Pinning\n- Pin exact versions in production (`==`)\n- Use ranges in development (`>=`)\n- Maintain separate requirements files for dev/prod\n\n### 2. Environment Management\n- Keep `.venv` in project directory (not global)\n- Include `.venv` in `.gitignore`\n- Document Python version requirement\n\n### 3. Dependency Hygiene\n- Regularly update dependencies\n- Remove unused packages\n- Audit for security vulnerabilities\n\n### 4. Reproducibility\n- Use lock files for exact reproducibility\n- Document environment setup in README\n- Test across Python versions\n\n## Resources\n\n- **uv Documentation**: See `references/uv-docs.md` for complete uv reference\n- **Common Recipes**: See `references/recipes.md` for common environment setups\n- **Troubleshooting Guide**: See `references/troubleshooting.md` for solving common issues\n- **Migration Guide**: See `references/migration.md` for migrating from pip/venv\n- **Project Examples**: See `examples/youtube-sc/` for real-world configuration files from the YouTube-SC project\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Setting up new Python projects\n- Managing dependencies for existing projects\n- Troubleshooting environment issues\n- Creating reproducible environments\n- Migrating from pip/venv to uv\n- Setting up CI/CD pipelines\n- Managing multiple Python versions\n- Ensuring cross-platform compatibility"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:38:20.638Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing efficient virtual environment management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效虚拟环境管理功能的Python开发代理。","ja":"Python開発エージェントが効率的な仮想環境管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"파이썬 개발 에이전트가 효율적인 가상 환경 관리 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Python que necesitan capacidades de gestión de entornos virtuales eficientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Python ayant besoin de capacités de gestion d''environnements virtuels efficaces.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die effiziente virtuelle Umgebungsverwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que precisam de capacidades de gerenciamento de ambiente virtual eficientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Python, которым необходимы эффективные возможности управления виртуальной средой.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير البايثون الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة بيئة افتراضية فعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Python virtual environments using uv, a fast Python package installer and resolver, streamlining dependency installation, updates, and troubleshooting with requirements.txt or pyproject.toml.","zh":"使代理能够使用uv（一种快速的Python包安装器和解析器）管理Python虚拟环境，从而简化依赖项安装、更新和使用requirements.txt或pyproject.toml进行故障排除。","ja":"エージェントがuv（高速Pythonパッケージインストーラーおよび解決策）を使用してPython仮想環境を管理できるようにし、requirements.txtまたはpyproject.tomlを使用した依存関係のインストール、更新、およびトラブルシューティングを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 uv（빠른 파이썬 패키지 설치 프로그램 및 해결책）를 사용하여 파이썬 가상 환경을 관리할 수 있도록 하여 requirements.txt 또는 pyproject.toml을 사용한 종속성 설치, 업데이트 및 문제 해결을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar entornos virtuales de Python utilizando uv, un instalador y resolutor de paquetes de Python rápido, que simplifica la instalación de dependencias, las actualizaciones y la depuración con requirements.txt o pyproject.toml.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les environnements virtuels Python en utilisant uv, un installateur et résolveur de packages Python rapide, qui simplifie l''installation des dépendances, les mises à jour et le débogage avec requirements.txt ou pyproject.toml.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Python-Virtualumgebungen mit uv, einem schnellen Python-Paket-Installer und -Auflöser, zu verwalten, was die Installation von Abhängigkeiten, Updates und Fehlersuche mit requirements.txt oder pyproject.toml vereinfacht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar ambientes virtuais Python usando uv, um instalador e resolvedor de pacotes Python rápido, simplificando a instalação de dependências, atualizações e solução de problemas com requirements.txt ou pyproject.toml.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять виртуальными средами Python с помощью uv, быстрого инсталлятора и разрешающего пакеты Python, упрощая установку зависимостей, обновления и устранение проблем с requirements.txt или pyproject.toml.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية إدارة بيئات البايثون الافتراضية باستخدام uv، وهو مثبت وحلّ مقاطع البايثون السريع، مبسطًا تركيب الإعتماديات وتحديثها ومعالجة المشاكل مع requirements.txt أو pyproject.toml."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating isolated environments for sentiment analysis and topic modeling projects","Automating dependency management for data science workflows","Debugging package conflicts in Python applications"],"zh":["为情感分析和主题建模项目创建隔离环境","自动化数据科学工作流的依赖管理","调试Python应用程序中的包冲突"],"ja":["感情分析およびトピックモデリングプロジェクトのための隔離環境を作成する","データサイエンスワークフローでの依存関係管理の自動化","Pythonアプリケーションのパッケージの競合をデバッグする"],"ko":["감성 분석 및 주제 모델링 프로젝트를 위한 격리 환경 생성","데이터 과학 워크플로의 종속성 관리 자동화","파이썬 애플리케이션의 패키지 충돌 디버깅"],"es":["Crear entornos aislados para proyectos de análisis de sentimiento y modelado de temas","Automatizar la gestión de dependencias para flujos de trabajo de ciencia de datos","Depurar conflictos de paquetes en aplicaciones de Python"],"fr":["Créer des environnements isolés pour les projets d''analyse de sentiments et de modelisation de sujets","Automatiser la gestion des dépendances pour les flux de travail de science des données","Déboguer les conflits de packages dans les applications Python"],"de":["Erstellen von isolierten Umgebungen für Sentiment-Analyse- und Topic-Modellierungsprojekte","Automatisieren der Abhängigkeitsverwaltung für Data-Science-Workflows","Fehlersuche von Paketkonflikten in Python-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de ambientes isolados para projetos de análise de sentimento e modelagem de tópicos","Automação de gerenciamento de dependências para fluxos de trabalho de ciência de dados","Depuração de conflitos de pacotes em aplicativos Python"],"ru":["Создание изолированных сред для проектов анализа настроений и моделирования тем","Автоматизация управления зависимостями для рабочих процессов数据 науки","Отладка конфликтов пакетов в приложениях Python"],"ar":["إنشاء بيئات معزولة لمشاريع تحليل المشاعر ونمذجة المواضيع","آليّة إدارة الإعتماديات لمسارات العمل من علوم البيانات","تصحيح أخطاء الصراعات الحزمة في تطبيقات البايثون"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires uv installation","Python environment management only","Limited to uv-compatible package managers"],"zh":["需要uv安装","仅限Python环境管理","仅限uv兼容包管理器"],"ja":["uvのインストールが必要","Python環境管理のみ","uvと互換性のあるパッケージマネージャーのみ"],"ko":["uv 설치가 필요함","파이썬 환경 관리만 지원","uv와 호환되는 패키지 관리자만 지원"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de uv","Gestión de entornos de Python solo","Limitado a administradores de paquetes compatibles con uv"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de uv","Gestion d''environnements Python uniquement","Limité aux gestionnaires de packages compatibles avec uv"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von uv","Nur Python-Umgebungsverwaltung","Begrenzt auf uv-kompatible Paketverwalter"],"pt":["Requer instalação do uv","Gerenciamento de ambiente Python apenas","Limitado a gerentes de pacotes compatíveis com uv"],"ru":["Требует установки uv","Управление средой Python только","Ограниченный менеджерами пакетов, совместимыми с uv"],"ar":["يتطلب تركيب uv","إدارة بيئة البايثون فقط","محدود بمديري الحزم المتوافقة مع uv"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2ca3988cee7b315ae30cb0cd10808290c162aa937a272fcda4e3ee419bd043aa","qualityScore":57}');
