"코드 유지 보수","Create-PRD 사용법","Create-PRD 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de ai","arquitectura de contexto universal","asistentes de codificación de ia","cursor","claude code","github copilot","cómo crear prd","prd para desarrolladores"],"fr":["outils d''ia","architecture de contexte universel","assistants de codage ia","cursor","claude code","github copilot","comment créer prd","prd pour développeurs"],"de":["ai-tools","universelle kontextarchitektur","ai-coding-assistenten","cursor","claude code","github copilot","wie erstelle ich prd","prd für entwickler"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","assistente de codificação","arquitetura de contexto universal","prm vs prd","como usar prd","guias de instalação de prd","alternativas para github copilot"],"ru":["инструменты ии","помощник кодирования","универсальная архитектура контекста","prm vs prd","как использовать prd","руководства по установке prd","альтернативы github copilot"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مساعد في الترميز","هندسة سياق عالمي","prm vs prd","كيفية استخدام prd","دليل تثبيت prd","بديل لجيثب كوبيلوت"]}},"owner":"yokharian","repo":"AIBoilerplate","repoPath":"yokharian/AIBoilerplate","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.705Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-prd","description":"Creates detailed Product Requirements Documents (PRDs) in Markdown format. Use when the user asks to create a PRD, write product requirements, document a feature specification, or needs a structured requirements document for development.","bodyPreview":"# Creating Product Requirements Documents (PRD)\n\n## Goal\n\nTo guide the creation of a detailed Product Requirements Document (PRD) in Markdown format, based on an initial user prompt. The PRD should be clear, actionable, and suitable for a junior developer to understand and implement the feature.\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Receive Initial Prompt:** The user provides a brief description or request for a new feature or functionality.\n2. **Ask Clarifying Questions:** Before writing the PRD, you *must* ask on","body":"# Creating Product Requirements Documents (PRD)\n\n## Goal\n\nTo guide the creation of a detailed Product Requirements Document (PRD) in Markdown format, based on an initial user prompt. The PRD should be clear, actionable, and suitable for a junior developer to understand and implement the feature.\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Receive Initial Prompt:** The user provides a brief description or request for a new feature or functionality.\n2. **Ask Clarifying Questions:** Before writing the PRD, you *must* ask only the most essential clarifying questions needed to write a clear PRD. Limit questions to 3-5 critical gaps in understanding. The goal is to understand the \"what\" and \"why\" of the feature, not necessarily the \"how\" (which the developer will figure out). Make sure to provide options in letter/number lists so the user can respond easily with their selections.\n3. **Generate PRD:** Based on the initial prompt and the user''s answers to the clarifying questions, generate a PRD using the structure outlined below.\n4. **Save PRD:** Save the generated document as `prd.md` inside `.specify/features/[feature-name]/` directory. Create the feature directory if it doesn''t exist.\n\n## Clarifying Questions (Guidelines)\n\nAsk only the most critical questions needed to write a clear PRD. Focus on areas where the initial prompt is ambiguous\nor missing essential context. Common areas that may need clarification:\n\n* **Problem/Goal:** If unclear - \"What problem does this feature solve for the user?\"\n* **Core Functionality:** If vague - \"What are the key actions a user should be able to perform?\"\n* **Scope/Boundaries:** If broad - \"Are there any specific things this feature *should not* do?\"\n* **Success Criteria:** If unstated - \"How will we know when this feature is successfully implemented?\"\n\n**Important:** Only ask questions when the answer isn''t reasonably inferable from the initial prompt. Prioritize\nquestions that would significantly impact the PRD''s clarity.\n\n### Formatting Requirements\n\n* **Number all questions** (1, 2, 3, etc.)\n* **List options for each question as A, B, C, D, etc.** for easy reference\n* Make it simple for the user to respond with selections like \"1A, 2C, 3B\"\n\n### Example Format\n\n```text\n1. What is the primary goal of this feature?\n   A. Improve user onboarding experience\n   B. Increase user retention\n   C. Reduce support burden\n   D. Generate additional revenue\n\n2. Who is the target user for this feature?\n   A. New users only\n   B. Existing users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Admin users only\n\n3. What is the expected timeline for this feature?\n   A. Urgent (1-2 weeks)\n   B. High priority (3-4 weeks)\n   C. Standard (1-2 months)\n   D. Future consideration (3+ months)\n```\n\n## PRD Structure\n\nThe generated PRD should include the following sections:\n\n1. **Introduction/Overview:** Briefly describe the feature and the problem it solves. State the goal.\n2. **Goals:** List the specific, measurable objectives for this feature.\n3. **User Stories:** Detail the user narratives describing feature usage and benefits.\n4. **Functional Requirements:** List the specific functionalities the feature must have. Use clear, concise language (\n   e.g., \"The system must allow users to upload a profile picture.\"). Number these requirements.\n5. **Non-Goals (Out of Scope):** Clearly state what this feature will *not* include to manage scope.\n6. **Design Considerations (Optional):** Link to mockups, describe UI/UX requirements, or mention relevant\n   components/styles if applicable.\n7. **Technical Considerations (Optional):** Mention any known technical constraints, dependencies, or suggestions (\n   e.g., \"Should integrate with the existing Auth module\").\n8. **Success Metrics:** How will the success of this feature be measured? (e.g., \"Increase user engagement by 10%\", \"\n   Reduce support tickets related to X\").\n9. **Open Questions:** List any remaining questions or areas needing further clarification.\n\n## Target Audience\n\nAssume the primary reader of the PRD is a **junior developer**. Therefore, requirements should be explicit, unambiguous,\nand avoid jargon where possible. Provide enough detail for them to understand the feature''s purpose and core logic.\n\n## Output\n\n* **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n* **Location:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/`\n* **Filename:** `prd.md`\n* **Full Path:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/prd.md`\n\n## Final instructions\n\n1. Do NOT start implementing the PRD\n2. Make sure to ask the user clarifying questions\n3. Take the user''s answers to the clarifying questions and improve the PRD\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:42:00.827Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Writing Agents requiring structured product development documentation in Markdown format.","zh":"适合需要结构化产品开发文档的技术写作代理，特别是Markdown格式。","ja":"技術文書化エージェントが構造化された製品開発文書をMarkdown形式で必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"구조화된 제품 개발 문서가 Markdown 형식으로 필요하는 기술 작성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Escritura Técnica que requieren documentación de desarrollo de productos estructurada en formato Markdown.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de rédaction technique nécessitant une documentation de développement de produits structurée au format Markdown.","de":"Ideal für technische Schreibagenten, die eine strukturierte Produktentwicklungs-Dokumentation im Markdown-Format benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que exigem documentação de desenvolvimento de produtos estruturada no formato Markdown.","ru":"Идеально для технических писателей, требующих структурированной документации по разработке продукта в формате Markdown.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النصوص الفنية الذين يتطلبون توثيق تطوير المنتجات المنظم في تنسيق Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate clear, actionable Product Requirements Documents (PRD) using Universal Context Architecture, compatible with multiple AI coding assistants like Cursor, Claude Code, and GitHub Copilot, and supporting Markdown format for easy implementation and understanding.","zh":"赋予代理生成清晰、可执行的产品需求文档（PRD），使用通用上下文架构，兼容多个AI编码助手，如Cursor、Claude Code和GitHub Copilot，并支持Markdown格式以便于实施和理解。","ja":"エージェントが明確で実行可能な製品要件文書（PRD）を生成できるようにし、Universal Context Architectureを使用し、Cursor、Claude Code、GitHub Copilotなどの複数のAIコーディングアシスタントと互換性があり、実装と理解を容易にするためにMarkdown形式をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 명확하고 실행 가능한 제품 요구 사항 문서(PRD)를 생성할 수 있도록 해 주며, Universal Context Architecture를 사용하며, Cursor, Claude Code 및 GitHub Copilot와 같은 여러 AI 코딩 도우미와 호환되며, 구현 및 이해를 쉽게 하기 위해 Markdown 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentos de requisitos de producto (PRD) claros y actuables utilizando la Arquitectura de Contexto Universal, compatible con múltiples asistentes de codificación de IA como Cursor, Claude Code y GitHub Copilot, y que admite el formato Markdown para una fácil implementación y comprensión.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des documents de spécifications de produit (PRD) clairs et actionnables en utilisant l''Architecture de Contexte Universel, compatible avec plusieurs assistants de codage IA tels que Cursor, Claude Code et GitHub Copilot, et prenant en charge le format Markdown pour une mise en œuvre et une compréhension faciles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, klare, umsetzbare Produktanforderungsdokumente (PRD) unter Verwendung der Universal Context Architecture zu generieren, die mit mehreren künstlicher Intelligenz-Codierassistenten wie Cursor, Claude Code und GitHub Copilot kompatibel sind und das Markdown-Format für eine einfache Implementierung und Verständnis unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentos de requisitos de produto (PRD) claros e executáveis usando a Arquitetura de Contexto Universal, compatível com vários assistentes de codificação de IA, como Cursor, Claude Code e GitHub Copilot, e suporta o formato Markdown para implementação e compreensão fáceis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать четкие и действенные документы требований продукта (PRD) с использованием Универсальной Архитектуры Контекста, совместимой с несколькими помощниками кодирования ИИ, такими как Cursor, Claude Code и GitHub Copilot, и поддерживающей формат Markdown для легкой реализации и понимания.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من生成 وثائق متطلبات المنتج (PRD) واضحة وقابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام هندسة السياق الشامل، متوافقة مع مساعدي الترميز الذكي المتعددين مثل Cursor و Claude Code و GitHub Copilot، وداعمة لتنسيق Markdown من أجل التنفيذ والفهم السهلين."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating detailed product specifications","Generating PRDs for junior developers","Streamlining feature development with clarifying questions"],"zh":["创建详细的产品规格","为初级开发人员生成PRD","通过澄清问题简化功能开发"],"ja":["詳細な製品仕様を生成する","ジュニア開発者向けのPRDを生成する","機能開発を明確化する質問で簡素化する"],"ko":["상세한 제품 사양 생성","주니어 개발자를 위한 PRD 생성","클arsimp 질문으로 기능 개발 단순화"],"es":["Crear especificaciones de producto detalladas","Generar PRD para desarrolladores junior","Optimizar el desarrollo de funciones con preguntas aclaratorias"],"fr":["Créer des spécifications de produit détaillées","Générer des PRD pour les développeurs junior","Optimiser le développement de fonctionnalités avec des questions clarificatrices"],"de":["Erstellen detaillierter Produktspezifikationen","Generieren von PRD für Junior-Entwickler","Optimieren der Funktionsentwicklung mit Klarstellungsfagen"],"pt":["Criar especificações de produto detalhadas","Gerar PRDs para desenvolvedores júnior","Otimizar o desenvolvimento de recursos com perguntas esclarecedoras"],"ru":["Создание подробных спецификаций продукта","Генерация PRD для младших разработчиков","Оптимизация разработки функций с помощью уточняющих вопросов"],"ar":["إنشاء مواصفات منتج مفصلة","توليد وثائق متطلبات المنتج (PRD) لمطوري البرمجيات الجدد","تحسين تطوير الميزات باستخدام أسئلة توضيحية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires initial user prompt","Limited to Markdown format output","Dependent on user input for clarifying questions"],"zh":["需要初始用户提示","仅限Markdown格式输出","依赖于用户输入以澄清问题"],"ja":["初期のユーザー入力を必要とする","出力はMarkdown形式のみ","明確化する質問のためにユーザー入力に依存する"],"ko":["초기 사용자 입력이 필요","출력은 Markdown 형식만","명확한 질문을 위한 사용자 입력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una llamada de usuario inicial","Limitado a la salida en formato Markdown","Dependiente de la entrada del usuario para preguntas aclaratorias"],"fr":["Nécessite une invite de l''utilisateur initial","Limité à la sortie au format Markdown","Dépendant de la saisie de l''utilisateur pour les questions clarificatrices"],"de":["Benötigt eine anfängliche Benutzereingabe","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Format-Ausgabe","Abhängig von der Benutzereingabe für Klarstellungsfragen"],"pt":["Exige um prompt inicial do usuário","Limitado à saída no formato Markdown","Dependente da entrada do usuário para perguntas esclarecedoras"],"ru":["Требует начального приглашения пользователя","Ограничен выводом в формате Markdown","Зависит от ввода пользователя для уточняющих вопросов"],"ar":["يتطلب إشارة مستخدم أولية","محدود بالخرج في تنسيق Markdown","يعتمد على مدخلات المستخدم للأسئلة التوضيحية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c0799587f13a9a53931a392da87318ddbe3c0bd75a71dff3c7d17e2d063ec6f0","qualityScore":57}');
