,"ソフトウェア要件分析の効率を向上","多種のソフトウェア開発方法論をサポート"],"ko":["요구사항의 품질을 평가","모호성을检测","구조화된 개선提案","소프트웨어 요구사항 분석의 효율을 향상","다양한 소프트웨어 개발 방법론을 지원"],"es":["Análisis de requisitos de software con IA","Detección de ambigüedades y sugerencias de mejoras","Evaluación de la calidad de los requisitos","Mejoras estructuradas para documentos de especificación de software","Integración con Supabase para una mayor eficiencia"],"fr":["Analyse de besoins logiciels avec l''IA","Détection d''ambiguïtés et suggestions d''améliorations","Évaluation de la qualité des besoins","Améliorations structurées pour les documents de spécification de logiciel","Intégration avec Supabase pour une plus grande efficacité"],"de":["Analyse von Software-Anforderungen mit KI","Erkennung von Mehrdeutigkeiten und Vorschläge für Verbesserungen","Bewertung der Qualität der Anforderungen","Strukturierte Verbesserungen für Software-Spezifikationsdokumente","Integration mit Supabase für eine höhere Effizienz"],"pt":["Análise de requisitos de software","Detecção de ambiguidades","Sugestão de melhorias estruturadas","Melhoria da qualidade dos requisitos","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Анализ требований программного обеспечения","Обнаружение неоднозначностей","Предложение структурированных улучшений","Улучшение качества требований","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["تحليل متطلبات البرمجيات","اكتشاف الغموض","اقتراح تحسينات منظمة","تحسين جودة المتطلبات","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Supabase Expert AI","什么是软件需求分析","Supabase Expert AI替代品","Supabase Expert AI与竞争对手的比较","Supabase Expert AI安装","Supabase Expert AI设置指南","AI驱动软件需求分析","软件需求分析工具"],"ja":["Supabase Expert AIエージェントの使用方法","ソフトウェア要件分析とは","Supabase Expert AIエージェントの代替品","Supabase Expert AIエージェントと競合製品の比較","Supabase Expert AIエージェントのインストール","Supabase Expert AIエージェントの設定ガイド","AI駆動ソフトウェア要件分析","ソフトウェア要件分析ツール"],"ko":["Supabase Expert AI 에이전트 사용법","소프트웨어 요구사항 분석이란","Supabase Expert AI 에이전트 대체품","Supabase Expert AI 에이전트와 경쟁사 제품 비교","Supabase Expert AI 에이전트 설치","Supabase Expert AI 에이전트 설정 가이드","AI 구동 소프트웨어 요구사항 분석","소프트웨어 요구사항 분석 도구"],"es":["cómo usar Supabase","qué es el análisis de requisitos de software","Supabase alternativa","Supabase vs otras herramientas","instalación de Supabase","guía de configuración de Supabase","análisis de requisitos de software con IA","mejora de la calidad de los requisitos"],"fr":["comment utiliser Supabase","quoi est l''analyse de besoins logiciels","Supabase alternative","Supabase vs autres outils","installation de Supabase","guide de configuration de Supabase","analyse de besoins logiciels avec l''IA","amélioration de la qualité des besoins"],"de":["wie man Supabase verwendet","was ist die Analyse von Software-Anforderungen","Supabase-Alternative","Supabase vs andere Tools","Installation von Supabase","Konfigurationsanleitung für Supabase","Analyse von Software-Anforderungen mit KI","Verbesserung der Qualität der Anforderungen"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","análise de requisitos","supabase expert","melhoria da qualidade","desenvolvimento de software","como usar supabase expert","o que é supabase expert"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","анализ требований","supabase expert","улучшение качества","разработка программного обеспечения","как использовать supabase expert","что такое supabase expert"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحليل المتطلبات","خبير Supabase","تحسين الجودة","تطوير البرمجيات","كيفية استخدام خبير Supabase","ما هو خبير Supabase"]}},"owner":"Aniket-a14","repo":"SRA","repoPath":"Aniket-a14/SRA","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.713Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"supabase-expert","description":"Expert guide for Supabase integration - database schemas, RLS policies, auth, Edge Functions, and real-time subscriptions. Use when working with Supabase backend features.","bodyPreview":"# Supabase Integration Expert Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you build secure, scalable Supabase integrations. Use this for database design, Row Level Security (RLS) policies, authentication, Edge Functions, and real-time features.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Security First\n- Always enable RLS on tables with user data\n- Use service role key only in secure server contexts\n- Use anon key for client-side operations\n- Test policies thoroughly\n\n### 2. Type Safety\n- Generate TypeScript types fro","body":"# Supabase Integration Expert Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you build secure, scalable Supabase integrations. Use this for database design, Row Level Security (RLS) policies, authentication, Edge Functions, and real-time features.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Security First\n- Always enable RLS on tables with user data\n- Use service role key only in secure server contexts\n- Use anon key for client-side operations\n- Test policies thoroughly\n\n### 2. Type Safety\n- Generate TypeScript types from schema\n- Use generated types in application\n- Keep types in sync with schema changes\n\n### 3. Performance\n- Use indexes for frequently queried columns\n- Implement pagination for large datasets\n- Use select() to limit returned fields\n- Cache when appropriate\n\n## Database Schema Design\n\n### Basic Table Creation\n\n```sql\n-- Create a table with standard fields\ncreate table public.items (\n  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,\n  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone(''utc''::text, now()) not null,\n  updated_at timestamp with time zone default timezone(''utc''::text, now()) not null,\n  user_id uuid references auth.users(id) on delete cascade not null,\n  title text not null,\n  description text,\n  status text default ''draft'' check (status in (''draft'', ''published'', ''archived''))\n);\n\n-- Create updated_at trigger\ncreate or replace function public.handle_updated_at()\nreturns trigger as $$\nbegin\n  new.updated_at = now();\n  return new;\nend;\n$$ language plpgsql;\n\ncreate trigger set_updated_at\n  before update on public.items\n  for each row\n  execute function public.handle_updated_at();\n\n-- Create index\ncreate index items_user_id_idx on public.items(user_id);\ncreate index items_status_idx on public.items(status);\n```\n\n### Foreign Keys & Relations\n\n```sql\n-- One-to-many relationship\ncreate table public.comments (\n  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,\n  created_at timestamp with time zone default now() not null,\n  item_id uuid references public.items(id) on delete cascade not null,\n  user_id uuid references auth.users(id) on delete cascade not null,\n  content text not null\n);\n\n-- Many-to-many relationship\ncreate table public.item_tags (\n  item_id uuid references public.items(id) on delete cascade,\n  tag_id uuid references public.tags(id) on delete cascade,\n  primary key (item_id, tag_id)\n);\n```\n\n## Row Level Security (RLS)\n\n### Basic RLS Patterns\n\n```sql\n-- Enable RLS\nalter table public.items enable row level security;\n\n-- Users can read their own items\ncreate policy \"Users can read own items\"\n  on public.items for select\n  using (auth.uid() = user_id);\n\n-- Users can insert their own items\ncreate policy \"Users can insert own items\"\n  on public.items for insert\n  with check (auth.uid() = user_id);\n\n-- Users can update their own items\ncreate policy \"Users can update own items\"\n  on public.items for update\n  using (auth.uid() = user_id)\n  with check (auth.uid() = user_id);\n\n-- Users can delete their own items\ncreate policy \"Users can delete own items\"\n  on public.items for delete\n  using (auth.uid() = user_id);\n```\n\n### Advanced RLS Patterns\n\n```sql\n-- Public read, authenticated write\ncreate policy \"Anyone can read published items\"\n  on public.items for select\n  using (status = ''published'');\n\ncreate policy \"Authenticated users can insert\"\n  on public.items for insert\n  to authenticated\n  with check (true);\n\n-- Role-based access\ncreate policy \"Admins can do everything\"\n  on public.items for all\n  using (\n    exists (\n      select 1 from public.user_roles\n      where user_id = auth.uid()\n      and role = ''admin''\n    )\n  );\n\n-- Shared access\ncreate policy \"Users can read shared items\"\n  on public.items for select\n  using (\n    auth.uid() = user_id\n    or exists (\n      select 1 from public.item_shares\n      where item_id = items.id\n      and shared_with = auth.uid()\n    )\n  );\n```\n\n### Anonymous/Guest Access\n\n```sql\n-- Allow anonymous reads\ncreate policy \"Anonymous can read public content\"\n  on public.items for select\n  to anon\n  using (status = ''published'');\n\n-- Allow anonymous inserts (for guest mode)\ncreate policy \"Anonymous can create items\"\n  on public.items for insert\n  to anon\n  with check (true);\n```\n\n## Client Integration\n\n### Setup Client (Next.js)\n\n```typescript\n// lib/supabase/client.ts\nimport { createBrowserClient } from ''@supabase/ssr''\n\nexport function createClient() {\n  return createBrowserClient(\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL!,\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY!\n  )\n}\n\n// lib/supabase/server.ts\nimport { createServerClient } from ''@supabase/ssr''\nimport { cookies } from ''next/headers''\n\nexport function createServerClient() {\n  const cookieStore = cookies()\n\n  return createServerClient(\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL!,\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY!,\n    {\n      cookies: {\n        get(name: string) {\n          return cookieStore.get(name)?.value\n        },\n      },\n    }\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### CRUD Operations\n\n```typescript\n// Query data\nconst { data, error } = await supabase\n  .from(''items'')\n  .select(''*'')\n  .eq(''status'', ''published'')\n  .order(''created_at'', { ascending: false })\n  .limit(10)\n\n// Insert data\nconst { data, error } = await supabase\n  .from(''items'')\n  .insert({ title: ''New Item'', user_id: userId })\n  .select()\n  .single()\n\n// Update data\nconst { data, error } = await supabase\n  .from(''items'')\n  .update({ title: ''Updated Title'' })\n  .eq(''id'', itemId)\n  .select()\n  .single()\n\n// Delete data\nconst { error } = await supabase\n  .from(''items'')\n  .delete()\n  .eq(''id'', itemId)\n\n// Complex joins\nconst { data, error } = await supabase\n  .from(''items'')\n  .select(`\n    *,\n    comments (\n      id,\n      content,\n      user:user_id (\n        email\n      )\n    )\n  `)\n  .eq(''user_id'', userId)\n```\n\n### Real-time Subscriptions\n\n```typescript\n// Subscribe to changes\nconst channel = supabase\n  .channel(''items-changes'')\n  .on(\n    ''postgres_changes'',\n    {\n      event: ''*'',\n      schema: ''public'',\n      table: ''items'',\n      filter: `user_id=eq.${userId}`,\n    },\n    (payload) => {\n      console.log(''Change received!'', payload)\n      // Update local state\n    }\n  )\n  .subscribe()\n\n// Cleanup\nchannel.unsubscribe()\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Email/Password Auth\n\n```typescript\n// Sign up\nconst { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signUp({\n  email: ''user@example.com'',\n  password: ''password123'',\n  options: {\n    data: {\n      display_name: ''User Name'',\n    },\n  },\n})\n\n// Sign in\nconst { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithPassword({\n  email: ''user@example.com'',\n  password: ''password123'',\n})\n\n// Sign out\nconst { error } = await supabase.auth.signOut()\n\n// Get current user\nconst { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()\n```\n\n### OAuth Providers\n\n```typescript\n// Google OAuth\nconst { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithOAuth({\n  provider: ''google'',\n  options: {\n    redirectTo: `${window.location.origin}/auth/callback`,\n  },\n})\n\n// Handle callback\n// app/auth/callback/route.ts\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const { searchParams } = new URL(request.url)\n  const code = searchParams.get(''code'')\n\n  if (code) {\n    const supabase = createServerClient()\n    await supabase.auth.exchangeCodeForSession(code)\n  }\n\n  return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(''/dashboard'', request.url))\n}\n```\n\n### Auth Middleware\n\n```typescript\n// middleware.ts\nimport { createServerClient } from ''@supabase/ssr''\nimport { NextResponse } from ''next/server''\nimport type { NextRequest } from ''next/server''\n\nexport async function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\n  const response = NextResponse.next()\n\n  const supabase = createServerClient(\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL!,\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY!,\n    {\n      cookies: {\n        get(name: string) {\n          return request.cookies.get(name)?.value\n        },\n        set(name: string, value: string, options: any) {\n          response.cookies.set(name, value, options)\n        },\n        remove(name: string, options: any) {\n          response.cookies.set(name, '''', { ...options, maxAge: 0 })\n        },\n      },\n    }\n  )\n\n  const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()\n\n  // Redirect to login if not authenticated\n  if (!user && request.nextUrl.pathname.startsWith(''/dashboard'')) {\n    return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(''/login'', request.url))\n  }\n\n  return response\n}\n\nexport const config = {\n  matcher: [''/dashboard/:path*''],\n}\n```\n\n## Edge Functions\n\n### Basic Edge Function\n\n```typescript\n// supabase/functions/hello/index.ts\nimport { serve } from ''https://deno.land/std@0.168.0/http/server.ts''\nimport { createClient } from ''https://esm.sh/@supabase/supabase-js@2''\n\nserve(async (req) => {\n  try {\n    // Get Supabase client\n    const supabase = createClient(\n      Deno.env.get(''SUPABASE_URL'') ?? '''',\n      Deno.env.get(''SUPABASE_ANON_KEY'') ?? '''',\n      {\n        auth: {\n          autoRefreshToken: false,\n          persistSession: false,\n        },\n      }\n    )\n\n    // Get user from auth header\n    const authHeader = req.headers.get(''Authorization'')\n    const token = authHeader?.replace(''Bearer '', '''')\n    const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser(token)\n\n    if (!user) {\n      return new Response(\n        JSON.stringify({ error: ''Unauthorized'' }),\n        { status: 401, headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' } }\n      )\n    }\n\n    // Your logic here\n    const { data, error } = await supabase\n      .from(''items'')\n      .select(''*'')\n      .eq(''user_id'', user.id)\n\n    return new Response(\n      JSON.stringify({ data }),\n      { headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' } }\n    )\n  } catch (error) {\n    return new Response(\n      JSON.stringify({ error: error.message }),\n      { status: 500, headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' } }\n    )\n  }\n})\n```\n\n## Type Generation\n\n```bash\n# Generate TypeScript types\nnpx supabase gen types typescript --project-id your-project-id > types/supabase.ts\n\n# Use in code\nimport { Database } from ''@/types/supabase''\n\ntype Item = Database[''public''][''Tables''][''items''][''Row'']\ntype ItemInsert = Database[''public''][''Tables''][''items''][''Insert'']\ntype ItemUpdate = Database[''public''][''Tables''][''items''][''Update'']\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Soft Deletes\n\n```sql\nalter table public.items add column deleted_at timestamp with time zone;\n\ncreate policy \"Users cannot see deleted items\"\n  on public.items for select\n  using (deleted_at is null);\n\n-- Soft delete function\ncreate or replace function soft_delete_item(item_id uuid)\nreturns void as $$\nbegin\n  update public.items\n  set deleted_at = now()\n  where id = item_id;\nend;\n$$ language plpgsql security definer;\n```\n\n### Audit Logs\n\n```sql\ncreate table public.audit_logs (\n  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,\n  created_at timestamp with time zone default now() not null,\n  user_id uuid references auth.users(id),\n  table_name text not null,\n  record_id uuid not null,\n  action text not null,\n  changes jsonb\n);\n\n-- Trigger function\ncreate or replace function public.audit_trigger()\nreturns trigger as $$\nbegin\n  insert into public.audit_logs (user_id, table_name, record_id, action, changes)\n  values (\n    auth.uid(),\n    TG_TABLE_NAME,\n    NEW.id,\n    TG_OP,\n    to_jsonb(NEW) - to_jsonb(OLD)\n  );\n  return NEW;\nend;\n$$ language plpgsql security definer;\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n1. **401 Errors**: Check RLS policies, ensure user is authenticated\n2. **403 Errors**: RLS policy blocking operation\n3. **Row not found**: Policy may be filtering it out\n4. **Connection issues**: Check URL and API keys\n5. **Type mismatches**: Regenerate types after schema changes\n\n### Debugging RLS\n\n```sql\n-- Test as specific user\nset request.jwt.claims = ''{\"sub\": \"user-uuid-here\"}'';\n\n-- Check what policies apply\nselect * from pg_policies where tablename = ''items'';\n\n-- Disable RLS temporarily (for testing only!)\nalter table public.items disable row level security;\n```\n\n## Best Practices Checklist\n\n- [ ] Enable RLS on all tables with user data\n- [ ] Create indexes for foreign keys and frequently queried columns\n- [ ] Use UUID for primary keys\n- [ ] Add created_at and updated_at timestamps\n- [ ] Implement soft deletes for important data\n- [ ] Use check constraints for enum-like fields\n- [ ] Generate and use TypeScript types\n- [ ] Test RLS policies thoroughly\n- [ ] Use service role key only server-side\n- [ ] Implement proper error handling\n- [ ] Add audit logs for sensitive operations\n- [ ] Use transactions for multi-step operations\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n- Designing database schemas\n- Creating or debugging RLS policies\n- Setting up authentication\n- Building Edge Functions\n- Implementing real-time features\n- Troubleshooting Supabase issues\n- Optimizing database queries\n- Setting up type generation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:45:30.221Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing secure and scalable Supabase integrations with advanced features like Row Level Security and Edge Functions.","zh":"适合需要安全且可扩展的Supabase集成的云代理，具有高级功能，如行级安全性和边缘函数。","ja":"セキュアでスケーラブルなSupabase統合が必要なクラウドエージェントに適しています。行レベルのセキュリティやエッジ関数などの高度な機能が備わっています。","ko":"보안이 뛰어난 확장 가능한 Supabase 통합이 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 행 수준 보안 및 에지 함수와 같은 고급 기능이 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes en la nube que necesitan integraciones de Supabase seguras y escalables con características avanzadas como Seguridad de nivel de fila y Funciones de Edge.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud ayant besoin d''intégrations Supabase sécurisées et évolutives avec des fonctionnalités avancées comme la sécurité au niveau des lignes et les fonctions Edge.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die sichere und skalierbare Supabase-Integrationen mit erweiterten Funktionen wie Zeilensicherheit und Edge-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que precisam de integrações Supabase seguras e escaláveis com recursos avançados como Segurança de Nível de Linha e Funções de Borda.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым необходимы безопасные и масштабируемые интеграции Supabase с продвинутыми функциями, такими как Безопасность на уровне строк и Функции края.","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذي يحتاج إلى تكاملات Supabase آمنة ومرنة مع ميزات متقدمة مثل أمان مستوى الصف ووظائف الحافة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design secure databases with Row Level Security policies, implement authentication and authorization using service role keys and anon keys, and develop real-time features with Edge Functions, all while ensuring type safety with generated TypeScript types.","zh":"赋予代理设计安全数据库的能力，使用行级安全策略，使用服务角色密钥和匿名密钥实现身份验证和授权，并使用边缘函数开发实时功能，同时使用生成的TypeScript类型确保类型安全。","ja":"エージェントにセキュアなデータベースを設計する能力を与え、行レベルのセキュリティポリシーを使用し、サービスロールキーや匿名キーを使用して認証および認可を実装し、エッジ関数を使用してリアルタイム機能を開発します。生成されたTypeScriptタイプを使用して、タイプセーフティを確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 행 수준 보안 정책을 사용하여 보안 데이터베이스를 설계하고 서비스 역할 키 및 匿名 키를 사용하여 인증 및 권한 부여를 구현하며 에지 함수를 사용하여 실시간 기능을 개발할 수 있도록 합니다. 생성된 TypeScript 유형을 사용하여 유형 안전성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar bases de datos seguras con políticas de Seguridad de nivel de fila, implementar autenticación y autorización utilizando claves de rol de servicio y claves anónimas, y desarrollar características en tiempo real con Funciones de Edge, todo mientras se garantiza la seguridad de los tipos con tipos de TypeScript generados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des bases de données sécurisées avec des politiques de sécurité au niveau des lignes, de mettre en œuvre l''authentification et l''autorisation à l''aide de clés de rôle de service et de clés anonymes, et de développer des fonctionnalités en temps réel avec des fonctions Edge, le tout en garantissant la sécurité des types avec des types TypeScript générés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, sichere Datenbanken mit Zeilensicherheitsrichtlinien zu entwerfen, Authentifizierung und Autorisierung mithilfe von Dienstrollenschlüsseln und Anonschlüsseln zu implementieren und Echtzeitfunktionen mit Edge-Funktionen zu entwickeln, während die Typsicherheit mit generierten TypeScript-Typen gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem bancos de dados seguros com políticas de Segurança de Nível de Linha, implementar autenticação e autorização usando chaves de papel de serviço e chaves anônimas, e desenvolver recursos em tempo real com Funções de Borda, garantindo a segurança do tipo com tipos TypeScript gerados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать безопасные базы данных с политиками Безопасности на уровне строк, реализовывать аутентификацию и авторизацию с помощью ключей ролей службы и анонимных ключей, а также разрабатывать функции реального времени с помощью Функций края, обеспечивая безопасность типов с помощью сгенерированных типов TypeScript.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تصميم قواعد بيانات آمنة مع سياسات أمان مستوى الصف وتطبيق المصادقة والتحقق باستخدام مفتاح دور الخدمة ومفتاح مجهول، وتطوير ميزات في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام وظائف الحافة، مع ضمان سلامة النوع مع أنواع TypeScript المولدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing secure and scalable Supabase databases with Row Level Security","Implementing authentication and authorization for Supabase integrations","Developing real-time features using Edge Functions and Supabase","Generating TypeScript types for secure and maintainable Supabase integrations"],"zh":["使用行级安全设计安全且可扩展的Supabase数据库","使用服务角色密钥和匿名密钥为Supabase集成实现身份验证和授权","使用边缘函数和Supabase开发实时功能","为安全且可维护的Supabase集成生成TypeScript类型"],"ja":["行レベルのセキュリティを使用してセキュアでスケーラブルなSupabaseデータベースを設計する","サービスロールキーや匿名キーを使用してSupabase統合の認証および認可を実装する","エッジ関数とSupabaseを使用してリアルタイム機能を開発する","セキュアでメンテナンス可能なSupabase統合のためのTypeScriptタイプを生成する"],"ko":["행 수준 보안을 사용하여 보안이 뛰어난 확장 가능한 Supabase 데이터베이스를 설계합니다.","서비스 역할 키 및 匿名 키를 사용하여 Supabase 통합의 인증 및 권한 부여를 구현합니다.","에지 함수 및 Supabase를 사용하여 실시간 기능을 개발합니다.","보안이 뛰어난 유지 보수가 가능한 Supabase 통합을 위한 TypeScript 유형을 생성합니다."],"es":["Diseñar bases de datos de Supabase seguras y escalables con Seguridad de nivel de fila","Implementar autenticación y autorización para integraciones de Supabase","Desarrollar características en tiempo real utilizando Funciones de Edge y Supabase","Generar tipos de TypeScript para integraciones de Supabase seguras y mantenibles"],"fr":["Concevoir des bases de données Supabase sécurisées et évolutives avec une sécurité au niveau des lignes","Mettre en œuvre l''authentification et l''autorisation pour les intégrations Supabase","Développer des fonctionnalités en temps réel en utilisant des fonctions Edge et Supabase","Générer des types TypeScript pour des intégrations Supabase sécurisées et maintenables"],"de":["Sichere und skalierbare Supabase-Datenbanken mit Zeilensicherheit entwerfen","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung für Supabase-Integrationen implementieren","Echtzeitfunktionen mit Edge-Funktionen und Supabase entwickeln","TypeScript-Typen für sichere und wartbare Supabase-Integrationen generieren"],"pt":["Projetar bancos de dados Supabase seguros e escaláveis com Segurança de Nível de Linha","Implementar autenticação e autorização para integrações Supabase","Desenvolver recursos em tempo real usando Funções de Borda e Supabase","Gerar tipos TypeScript para integrações Supabase seguras e mantidas"],"ru":["Проектировать безопасные и масштабируемые базы данных Supabase с Безопасностью на уровне строк","Реализовывать аутентификацию и авторизацию для интеграций Supabase","Разрабатывать функции реального времени с помощью Функций края и Supabase","Генерировать типы TypeScript для безопасных и поддерживаемых интеграций Supabase"],"ar":["تصميم قواعد بيانات Supabase آمنة ومرنة مع أمان مستوى الصف","تطبيق المصادقة والتحقق لمكاملات Supabase","تطوير ميزات في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام وظائف الحافة و Supabase","توليد أنواع TypeScript لمكاملات Supabase الآمنة والقابلة للصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Supabase account and instance setup","Limited to Supabase-specific features and integrations","Needs thorough testing of Row Level Security policies for secure data access"],"zh":["需要Supabase账户和实例设置","仅限Supabase特定功能和集成","需要对行级安全策略进行彻底测试以确保安全数据访问"],"ja":["Supabaseアカウントとインスタンスの設定が必要","Supabase固有の機能と統合のみに限定される","セキュアなデータアクセスを確保するために行レベルのセキュリティポリシーの徹底的なテストが必要"],"ko":["Supabase 계정 및 인스턴스 설정이 필요합니다.","Supabase 특정 기능 및 통합에만 제한됩니다.","보안 데이터 액세스를 보장하기 위해 행 수준 보안 정책에 대한 철저한 테스트가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y configuración de instancia de Supabase","Limitado a características y integraciones específicas de Supabase","Necesita una prueba exhaustiva de las políticas de Seguridad de nivel de fila para un acceso de datos seguro"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et une configuration d''instance Supabase","Limité aux fonctionnalités et intégrations spécifiques à Supabase","Nécessite un test approfondi des politiques de sécurité au niveau des lignes pour un accès aux données sécurisé"],"de":["Benötigt ein Supabase-Konto und eine Instanzkonfiguration","Begrenzt auf Supabase-spezifische Funktionen und Integrationen","Benötigt eine gründliche Überprüfung der Zeilensicherheitsrichtlinien für einen sicheren Datenzugriff"],"pt":["Exige conta e configuração de instância Supabase","Limitado a recursos e integrações específicos do Supabase","Necessita de testes rigorosos de políticas de Segurança de Nível de Linha para acesso de dados seguro"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи и настройки экземпляра Supabase","Ограничен функциями и интеграциями, специфичными для Supabase","Требует тщательного тестирования политик Безопасности на уровне строк для безопасного доступа к данным"],"ar":["يتطلب حسابًا وضبطًا لمثيل Supabase","محدود بميزات وتكاملات Supabase الخاصة","يتطلب اختبارات شاملة لسياسات أمان مستوى الصف من أجل الوصول الآمن إلى البيانات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fdc2de96f887a4049c73760241b0831ce3285b0b26cb12f1653c305cfbbb64bf","qualityScore":57}');
