":"Herramientas de AI: Opener-Variator para Pipelines de Inv...","fr":"Outils d''IA: Opener-Variator pour les Pipelines de Recherche","de":"KI-Tools: Opener-Variator für Forschungspipelines","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Opener-Variator para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Opener-Variator для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Opener-Variator لل مطورين","en":"opener-variator"},"description":{"zh":"opener-variator AI智能代理是一种研究管道和语义执行单位，通过输入/输出、接受标准和防护栏来声明","ja":"AIエージェントopener-variatorは、研究パイプラインとセマンティック実行ユニットを提供します。入力/出力、受け入れ基準、ガードレールを宣言します","ko":"opener-variator AI 에이전트는 연구 파이프라인과 의미 실행 단위를 제공합니다. 입력/출력, 수락 기준, 가드레일을 선언합니다","es":"Opener-Variator es una habilidad de AI que optimiza las pipelines de investigación mediante la declaración de entradas y salidas, criterios de aceptación y g...","fr":"Opener-Variator est une compétence d''IA qui optimise les pipelines de recherche en déclarant les entrées et les sorties, les critères d''acceptation et les ga...","de":"Opener-Variator ist eine KI-Fähigkeit, die Forschungspipelines durch die Deklaration von Eingaben und Ausgaben, Annahmekriterien und Schutzvorkehrungen optim...","pt":"O Opener-Variator é uma skill de IA que trata pipelines de pesquisa como unidades de execução semântica","ru":"Opener-Variator - это навык ИИ, который рассматривает исследовательские трубопроводы как семантические единицы выполнения","ar":"Opener-Variator هو مهارة ذكاء اصطناعي يتعامل مع خطوط أنابيب البحث كوحدات تنفيذ دلالي","en":"Research pipelines as semantic execution units: each skill declares inputs/outputs, acceptance criteria, and guardrails. Evidence-first methodology prevents ..."},"definition":{"en":"Research pipelines as semantic execution units: each skill declares inputs/outputs, acceptance criteria, and guardrails. Evidence-first methodology prevents hollow writing through structured intermediate artifacts."},"features":{"zh":["研究管道和语义执行单位","输入/输出声明","接受标准和防护栏","结构化中间件","证据优先方法"],"ja":["研究パイプラインとセマンティック実行ユニット","入力/出力の宣言","受け入れ基準とガードレール","構造化中間アーティファクト","エビデンスファースト方法"],"ko":["연구 파이프라인과 의미 실행 단위","입력/출력 선언","수락 기준과 가드레일","구조화된 중간 아티팩트","증거 우선 방법"],"es":["Declaración de entradas y salidas","Criterios de aceptación y guardrails","Metodología de evidencia","Artefactos intermedios estructurados","Mejora de las pipelines de investigación"],"fr":["Déclaration des entrées et des sorties","Critères d''acceptation et gardes","Méthodologie basée sur les preuves","Artéfacts intermédiaires structurés","Amélioration des pipelines de recherche"],"de":["Deklaration von Eingaben und Ausgaben","Annahmekriterien und Schutzvorkehrungen","Evidenzbasierte Methodik","Strukturierte Zwischenartefakte","Verbesserung von Forschungspipelines"],"pt":["Declarar entradas e saídas","Definir critérios de aceitação","Implementar guardrails","Melhorar a execução semântica em pipelines de pesquisa"],"ru":["Объявить входные и выходные данные","Определить критерии принятия","Реализовать ограничители","Улучшить семантическую выполнение в исследовательских трубопроводах"],"ar":["إعلان المدخلات و المخارج","تحديد معايير القبول","تنفيذ حواجز أمان","تحسين التنفيذ الدلالي في خطوط أنابيب البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用opener-variator","什么是AI智能代理","opener-variator安装","opener-variator设置指南","opener-variator替代品","opener-variator vs 其他AI工具"],"ja":["AIエージェントopener-variatorの使い方","AIエージェントとは","opener-variatorのインストール","opener-variatorの設定ガイド","opener-variatorの代替品","opener-variator vs その他のAIツール"],"ko":["opener-variator 사용법","AI 에이전트란","opener-variator 설치","opener-variator 설정 가이드","opener-variator 대체품","opener-variator vs 다른 AI 도구"],"es":["cómo usar Opener-Variator","qué es Opener-Variator","herramientas de AI para investigación","Opener-Variator vs otras herramientas de AI","instalación de Opener-Variator","guía de configuración de Opener-Variator","pipelines de investigación","metodología de evidencia"],"fr":["comment utiliser Opener-Variator","qu''est-ce qu''Opener-Variator","outils d''IA pour la recherche","Opener-Variator vs autres outils d''IA","installation d''Opener-Variator","guide de configuration d''Opener-Variator","pipelines de recherche","méthodologie basée sur les preuves"],"de":["wie man Opener-Variator verwendet","was ist Opener-Variator","KI-Tools für Forschung","Opener-Variator vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von Opener-Variator","Konfigurationsanleitung für Opener-Variator","Forschungspipelines","evidenzbasierte Methodik"],"pt":["como usar Opener-Variator","o que é Opener-Variator","Opener-Variator vs outros","guia de instalação do Opener-Variator","Opener-Variator para desenvolvedores","ferramentas de IA para pesquisa"],"ru":["как использовать Opener-Variator","что такое Opener-Variator","Opener-Variator vs другие","руководство по установке Opener-Variator","Opener-Variator для разработчиков","инструменты ИИ для исследования"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Opener-Variator","ما هي Opener-Variator","Opener-Variator مقابل أخرى","دليل تثبيت Opener-Variator","Opener-Variator للمطورين","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للبحث"]}},"owner":"WILLOSCAR","repo":"research-units-pipeline-skills","repoPath":"WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.741Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"opener-variator","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Opener Variator (H3 first paragraph rewrite)\n\nPurpose: fix a high-signal automation tell that survives structural gates:\n- many H3s begin with the same rhetorical shape\n- \\\"overview\\\" narration replaces content-bearing framing\n\nThis skill is intentionally narrow:\n- only rewrite the first paragraph (or first 2–4 sentences) of the flagged H3 files\n- keep the argument moves and citations intact\n\n## Inputs\n\nRequired:\n- `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` (Style Smells section)\n- the referenced `secti","body":"# Opener Variator (H3 first paragraph rewrite)\n\nPurpose: fix a high-signal automation tell that survives structural gates:\n- many H3s begin with the same rhetorical shape\n- \\\"overview\\\" narration replaces content-bearing framing\n\nThis skill is intentionally narrow:\n- only rewrite the first paragraph (or first 2–4 sentences) of the flagged H3 files\n- keep the argument moves and citations intact\n\n## Inputs\n\nRequired:\n- `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` (Style Smells section)\n- the referenced `sections/S<sub_id>.md` files\n\nOptional (helps you stay aligned):\n- `outline/writer_context_packs.jsonl` (use `opener_mode`, `tension_statement`, `thesis`)\n\n## Outputs\n\nNote: keep this as an openers-last pass. Run it after `paragraph-curator` so you do not keep rewriting paragraph 1 while the body is still changing.\n\n- Updated `sections/S<sub_id>.md` files (still body-only; no headings)\n\n## Workflow (route from the self-loop report)\n\n1) Open `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` and locate `## Style Smells`.\n2) Treat the flagged `sections/S*.md` list as the *only* scope for this pass.\n3) For each flagged file:\n   - Optional: look up its entry in `outline/writer_context_packs.jsonl` and read `opener_mode` / `tension_statement` / `thesis` to stay aligned.\n   - Rewrite only the opener paragraph (or first 2-4 sentences). Preserve meaning and citation keys.\n   - Best-of-3 opener sampling (recommended): draft 2-3 candidate opener paragraphs (different opener modes), then keep the one that is most content-bearing and least repetitive across H3s.\n4) Rerun `writer-selfloop` and confirm the Style Smells list shrinks.\n\n## Role prompt: Opener Editor (paper voice)\n\n```text\nYou are rewriting the opening paragraph of a survey subsection.\n\nGoal:\n- replace narration/overview openers with a content-bearing framing\n- vary opener cadence across subsections so the paper reads authored\n\nConstraints:\n- do not invent facts\n- do not add/remove/move citation keys\n- do not change the subsection’s thesis\n\nChecklist:\n- sentence 1 is content-bearing (tension/decision/failure/protocol/contrast), not “what we do in this section”\n- paragraph 1 ends with a clear thesis/takeaway\n- no slide navigation (“Next, we…”, “In this subsection…”, “This section provides an overview…“)\n```\n\n## What to delete (high-signal narration)\n\nRewrite immediately if the opener contains any of:\n- “This section/subsection provides an overview …”\n- “In this section/subsection, we …”\n- “This subsection surveys/argues …”\n- “Next, we move/turn …”\n- repeated opener labels (“Key takeaway:” spam)\n\n## What to replace with (opener moves)\n\nPick one opener mode per H3 (the writer pack may suggest `opener_mode`).\nDo not copy labels; write as natural prose.\n\nAllowed opener moves (choose 1; keep it concrete):\n- **Tension-first**: state the real trade-off; why it matters; end with thesis.\n- **Decision-first**: frame the builder’s choice under constraints; end with thesis.\n- **Failure-first**: start from a failure mode that motivates the lens; end with thesis.\n- **Protocol-first**: start from comparability constraints (budget/tool access); end with thesis.\n- **Contrast-first**: open with an A-vs-B sentence, then explain why; end with thesis.\n- **Lens-first**: state the chapter lens and narrow to this subsection’s question.\n\n## Mini examples (paraphrase; do not copy)\n\nBad (overview narration):\n- `This subsection provides an overview of tool interfaces for agents.`\n\nBetter (content-bearing):\n- `Tool interfaces define what actions are executable; interface contracts therefore determine which evaluation claims transfer across environments.`\n\nBad (process narration):\n- `In this subsection, we discuss memory mechanisms and then review retrieval methods.`\n\nBetter (tension-first):\n- `Memory improves long-horizon coherence, but it also expands the failure surface: retrieval can be stale, wrong, or adversarial, and agents rarely know which.`\n\n## Done checklist\n\n- [ ] No flagged file starts with “overview/narration” stems.\n- [ ] Paragraph 1 ends with a thesis/takeaway (same meaning).\n- [ ] Citation keys are unchanged (no adds/removes/moves).\n- [ ] `writer-selfloop` still PASSes and Style Smells shrink.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:05:49.695Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT requiring advanced content rewriting capabilities to fix high-signal automation tells in H3 files.","zh":"适合于需要高级内容重写能力来修复H3文件中的高信号自动化告知的语言代理，如Claude Code或AutoGPT。","ja":"Claude CodeやAutoGPTのような、高信号自動化通知をH3ファイルで修正するための高度なコンテンツ書き換え機能を必要とするLanguage Agentsに適しています。","ko":"Claude Code 또는 AutoGPT와 같은 언어 에이전트에게 적합하며, 고신호 자동화 통지를 H3 파일에서 수정하기 위한 고급 콘텐츠 재작성 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje como Claude Code o AutoGPT que requieren capacidades de reescritura de contenido avanzadas para corregir señales de automatización de alta intensidad en archivos H3.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de langage comme Claude Code ou AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités de réécriture de contenu avancées pour corriger les signaux d''automatisation à haute intensité dans les fichiers H3.","de":"Ideal für Sprachagenten wie Claude Code oder AutoGPT, die erweiterte Inhalts-Neuschreibfunktionen benötigen, um Hochsignal-Automatisierungshinweise in H3-Dateien zu korrigieren.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de linguagem como Claude Code ou AutoGPT que exigem capacidades avançadas de reescrita de conteúdo para corrigir tells de automação de alta prioridade em arquivos H3.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, таких как Claude Code или AutoGPT, требующих продвинутых возможностей переписывания контента для исправления сигналов высокого приоритета в файлах H3.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات اللغة مثل Claude Code أو AutoGPT التي تتطلب قدرات متقدمة لتعديل المحتوى لتصحيح إشارات التأمل التلقائي عالية الإشارة في ملفات H3."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to rewrite the first paragraph of flagged H3 files using evidence-first methodology, preserving argument moves and citations, and integrating with semantic execution units like research pipelines, while preventing hollow writing through structured intermediate artifacts in Markdown files.","zh":"赋予代理重写被标记的H3文件的第一段内容，使用基于证据的方法，保留论证步骤和引用，并与语义执行单元（如研究流水线）集成，同时通过在Markdown文件中使用结构化中间件防止空洞写作。","ja":"フラグ付けされたH3ファイルの最初の段落を、エビデンスファーストの方法で書き換え、議論の動きと引用を保持し、研究パイプラインのようなセマンティック実行ユニットと統合し、Markdownファイルの中間アーティファクトを構造化することで、空洞な文章を防ぎます。","ko":"에이전트에게 플래그가 설정된 H3 파일의 첫 번째段落를 증거 우선 방식으로 다시 작성하도록 하는데, 이는 논증 이동과 인용문을 보존하고, 연구 파이프라인과 같은 의미적 실행 단위와 통합하면서, 마크다운 파일의 구조화된 중간체를 통해 공허한 글쓰기를 방지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes reescribir el primer párrafo de los archivos H3 marcados utilizando la metodología de evidencia primera, preservando los movimientos de argumentación y las citas, e integrándose con unidades de ejecución semántica como pipelines de investigación, mientras se evita la escritura hueca a través de artefactos intermedios estructurados en archivos Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réécrire le premier paragraphe des fichiers H3 signalés en utilisant la méthodologie de preuve première, en préservant les mouvements d''argumentation et les citations, et en s''intégrant avec des unités d''exécution sémantique comme les pipelines de recherche, tout en évitant l''écriture creuse à travers des artefacts intermédiaires structurés dans les fichiers Markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den ersten Absatz der markierten H3-Dateien mithilfe der evidenzbasierten Methodik neu zu schreiben, wobei Argumentationsbewegungen und Zitate erhalten bleiben und sich in semantische Ausführungseinheiten wie Forschungspipelines integrieren, während hohle Schreibweise durch strukturierte Zwischenartefakte in Markdown-Dateien verhindert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a reescrever o primeiro parágrafo de arquivos H3 sinalizados usando a metodologia baseada em evidências, preservando movimentos de argumentação e citações, e integrando com unidades de execução semântica, como pipelines de pesquisa, enquanto impede a escrita oca por meio de artefatos intermediários estruturados em arquivos Markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью переписать первый абзац помеченных файлов H3, используя методологию, основанную на доказательствах, сохраняя движения аргументации и цитаты, и интегрируя с семантическими блоками выполнения, такими как исследовательские конвейеры, при этом предотвращая пустую писанину посредством структурированных промежуточных артефактов в файлах Markdown.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من переписة الفقرة الأولى من ملفات H3 المُشار إليها باستخدام منهجية مبنية على الأدلة، مع الحفاظ على تحركات الحجة والاقتباسات، وتكاملها مع وحدات التنفيذ الدلالي، مثل خطوط أنابيب البحث، بينما يمنع الكتابة الفارغة من خلال هياكل وسيطة منظمة في ملفات Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Rewriting overview narrations to content-bearing framing in H3 sections","Automating the revision of rhetorical shapes in high-signal H3 files","Generating rewritten first paragraphs for flagged H3 files while keeping citations intact"],"zh":["将概述叙述重写为H3部分的内容承载框架","自动修订高信号H3文件中的修辞形状","为被标记的H3文件生成重写的第一段落，同时保持引用完整"],"ja":["H3セクションのコンテンツベアリングフレーミングへの概要の再構成","高信号H3ファイルの修辞的形状の自動修正","フラグ付けされたH3ファイルの最初の段落の再構成による生成、引用を保持したまま"],"ko":["H3 섹션의 콘텐츠 베어링 프레임워크로 요약된 서술을 다시 작성","고신호 H3 파일의 수사적 모양을 자동으로 수정","플래그가 설정된 H3 파일의 첫 번째段落를 다시 작성하여 생성하고, 인용문을保持"],"es":["Reescribir narraciones de sobre vistas a enmarcado de contenido en secciones H3","Automatizar la revisión de formas retóricas en archivos H3 de alta intensidad","Generar primeros párrafos reescritos para archivos H3 marcados, manteniendo intactas las citas"],"fr":["Réécrire les narrations de survol à la mise en page de contenu dans les sections H3","Automatiser la révision des formes rhétoriques dans les fichiers H3 à haute intensité","Générer des premiers paragraphes réécrits pour les fichiers H3 signalés, en gardant les citations intactes"],"de":["Übersichtserzählungen in inhaltsorientierte Einrahmung in H3-Abschnitten neu schreiben","Die Überarbeitung rhetorischer Formen in H3-Dateien mit hoher Intensität automatisieren","Erstelle neu geschriebene erste Absätze für markierte H3-Dateien, wobei Zitate erhalten bleiben"],"pt":["Reescrever narrações de visão geral para estruturação de conteúdo em seções H3","Automatizar a revisão de formas retóricas em arquivos H3 de alta prioridade","Gerar parágrafos reescritos para arquivos H3 sinalizados, mantendo as citações intactas"],"ru":["Переписать повествования обзора для содержательной структуры в разделах H3","Автоматизировать пересмотр риторических форм в файлах H3 высокого приоритета","Генерировать переписанные первые абзацы для помеченных файлов H3, сохраняя цитаты целыми"],"ar":["إعادة كتابة روايات العرض العام لتحديد الهيكل المحتوى في أقسام H3","تحسينائية لمراجعة الأشكال البلاغية في ملفات H3 ذات الإشارة العالية","توليد الفقرات المُعاد كتابة لها ملفات H3 المُشار إليها، مع الحفاظ على الاقتباسات سليمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Only rewrites the first paragraph or first 2-4 sentences of flagged H3 files","Requires input from `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` and referenced sections","Preserves existing argument moves and citations, limiting the scope of rewriting"],"zh":["仅重写被标记的H3文件的第一段落或前2-4个句子","需要来自`output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md`和引用部分的输入","保留现有的论证步骤和引用，限制重写的范围"],"ja":["フラグ付けされたH3ファイルの最初の段落または最初の2-4文のみを書き換え","`output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md`および参照セクションからの入力が必要","既存の議論の動きと引用を保持し、書き換えの範囲を制限"],"ko":["플래그가 설정된 H3 파일의 첫 번째段落 또는 첫 2-4개의 문장만 다시 작성","`output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` 및 참조 섹션에서 입력이 필요","既存의 논증 이동과 인용문을 보존하며, 다시 작성할 범위를 제한"],"es":["Solo reescribe el primer párrafo o las primeras 2-4 oraciones de los archivos H3 marcados","Requiere entrada de `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` y secciones referenciadas","Preserva los movimientos de argumentación y las citas existentes, limitando el alcance de la reescritura"],"fr":["Nécessite uniquement la réécriture du premier paragraphe ou des 2-4 premières phrases des fichiers H3 signalés","Requiert une entrée de `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` et des sections référencées","Préserve les mouvements d''argumentation et les citations existantes, limitant la portée de la réécriture"],"de":["Schreibt nur den ersten Absatz oder die ersten 2-4 Sätze der markierten H3-Dateien neu","Benötigt Eingaben von `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` und referenzierten Abschnitten","Bewahrt bestehende Argumentationsbewegungen und Zitate, wodurch der Umfang der Neuschreibung begrenzt wird"],"pt":["Reescreve apenas o primeiro parágrafo ou as primeiras 2-4 frases de arquivos H3 sinalizados","Exige entrada de `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` e seções referenciadas","Preserva movimentos de argumentação e citações existentes, limitando o escopo da reescrita"],"ru":["Переписывает только первый абзац или первые 2-4 предложения помеченных файлов H3","Требует ввода из `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` и ссылочных разделов","Сохраняет существующие движения аргументации и цитаты, ограничивая объем переписывания"],"ar":["إعادة كتابة الفقرة الأولى فقط أو الجمل 2-4 الأولى من ملفات H3 المُشار إليها","يتطلب إدخال من `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` والأقسام المرجعية","الحفاظ على تحركات الحجة والاقتباسات الحالية، مما يحدد نطاق إعادة الكتابة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1b9d1f621fb927d64017735830188018a85cd76ff88c0ad824fb9489715e06bf","qualityScore":57}');
