LaTeX","Vérification des citations BibTeX","Compatibilité avec la plate-forme .codex","End-to-end pour les articles de revue","Support pour ML/IA","Intégration avec les outils de développement"],"de":["Erstellung von ML/KI-Überprüfungsartikeln mit LaTeX","Verifizierung von BibTeX-Zitaten","Kompatibilität mit der .codex-Plattform","End-to-end für Überprüfungsartikel","Unterstützung für ML/KI","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Criação de artigos de revisão com LaTeX","Verificação de citações BibTeX","Suporte a formatos de publicação","Integração com ferramentas de edição","Suporte a colaboração em equipe"],"ru":["Создание статей обзора с помощью LaTeX","Проверка цитат BibTeX","Поддержка форматов публикаций","Интеграция с инструментами редактирования","Поддержка командной работы"],"ar":["كتابة الأبحاث باستخدام LaTeX","مراجعة المراجع BibTeX","دعم صيغ النشر","التكامل مع أدوات التحرير","دعم العمل الجماعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用arxiv-paper-writer","什么是LaTeX论文","BibTeX引用验证工具","arxiv-paper-writer安装指南","LaTeX论文写作技巧","arxiv-paper-writer和其他工具的比较","研究论文写作工具","AI工具在研究中的应用"],"ja":["arxiv-paper-writerの使い方","LaTeX論文とは","BibTeX引用を検証するツール","arxiv-paper-writerのインストールガイド","LaTeX論文作成のテクニック","arxiv-paper-writerと他のツールの比較","研究論文作成ツール","AIツールの研究への応用"],"ko":["arxiv-paper-writer 사용법","LaTeX 논문이란","BibTeX 참조를 검증하는 도구","arxiv-paper-writer 설치 안내","LaTeX 논문 작성 기술","arxiv-paper-writer와 다른 도구의 비교","연구 논문 작성 도구","AI 도구의 연구에 대한 적용"],"es":["herramientas de AI","arxiv-paper-writer","ML/AI","LaTeX","BibTeX","cómo usar arxiv-paper-writer","alternativas a arxiv-paper-writer","guía de instalación de arxiv-paper-writer","arxiv-paper-writer vs otros tools","desarrollo de ML/AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA","arxiv-paper-writer","ML/IA","LaTeX","BibTeX","comment utiliser arxiv-paper-writer","alternatives à arxiv-paper-writer","guide d''installation d''arxiv-paper-writer","arxiv-paper-writer vs autres outils","développement de ML/IA"],"de":["KI-Tools","arxiv-paper-writer","ML/KI","LaTeX","BibTeX","wie man arxiv-paper-writer verwendet","Alternativen zu arxiv-paper-writer","Installationsanleitung für arxiv-paper-writer","arxiv-paper-writer vs andere Tools","Entwicklung von ML/KI"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para escrita acadêmica","como usar arxiv-paper-writer","o que é arxiv-paper-writer","arxiv-paper-writer vs outras ferramentas","instalar arxiv-paper-writer","guia de configuração do arxiv-paper-writer"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для академического письма","как использовать ИИ Агент arxiv-paper-writer","что такое ИИ Агент arxiv-paper-writer","ИИ Агент arxiv-paper-writer vs другие инструменты","установка ИИ Агента arxiv-paper-writer","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента arxiv-paper-writer"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لكتابة الأبحاث","كيفية استخدام أداة arxiv-paper-writer","ما هي أداة arxiv-paper-writer","أداة arxiv-paper-writer مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أداة arxiv-paper-writer","دليل إعداد أداة arxiv-paper-writer"]}},"owner":"renocrypt","repo":"latex-arxiv-SKILL","repoPath":"renocrypt/latex-arxiv-SKILL","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.744Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"arxiv-paper-writer","description":">","bodyPreview":"# ML/AI Review Paper Workflow (IEEEtran template)\n\n## When to Use\n- ML/AI review papers for arXiv (main text ~6-10 pages; references excluded)\n- LaTeX + BibTeX workflow with verified citations\n- Citation validation/repair on existing LaTeX projects\n\n## When NOT to Use\n- Novel experimental research papers (this is a review workflow)\n- Non-academic documents\n\n## Inputs\n- Topic description (required)\n- Constraints: venue, page limit, author/affiliations (optional)\n- Existing project path for citati","body":"# ML/AI Review Paper Workflow (IEEEtran template)\n\n## When to Use\n- ML/AI review papers for arXiv (main text ~6-10 pages; references excluded)\n- LaTeX + BibTeX workflow with verified citations\n- Citation validation/repair on existing LaTeX projects\n\n## When NOT to Use\n- Novel experimental research papers (this is a review workflow)\n- Non-academic documents\n\n## Inputs\n- Topic description (required)\n- Constraints: venue, page limit, author/affiliations (optional)\n- Existing project path for citation validation (optional)\n\n## Outputs\n- `main.tex` (LaTeX source)\n- `ref.bib` (verified BibTeX entries)\n- `IEEEtran.cls`\n- `plan/<timestamp>-<slug>.md`, `issues/<timestamp>-<slug>.csv`\n- Figures/tables; `main.pdf`\n- `notes/literature-notes.md` (optional per-citation notes)\n- `notes/arxiv-registry.sqlite3` (arXiv metadata/BibTeX cache)\n\n**Conventions**: run `python3 scripts/...` from this skill folder (where `scripts/` lives); `<paper_dir>` is the paper/project root (contains `main.tex`, `ref.bib`, `plan/`, `issues/`, `notes/`). Paths like `plan/...` are under `<paper_dir>`. For arXiv discovery/metadata/BibTeX, use `scripts/arxiv_registry.py` (no ad-hoc curl/wget).\n\n---\n\n## Gated Workflow\n\n> Tip: Run `python3 scripts/<script>.py --help` before use.\n> Open reference files only when a step calls them out.\n\n### Non-Negotiable Rules\n1. **No prose in `main.tex`** until plan approved AND issues CSV exists.\n2. First deliverable: research snapshot + outline + clarification questions + draft plan.\n3. **Use plan + issues tracking for all new papers; do not opt out.**\n4. Issues CSV is the execution contract; update `Status` and `Verified_Citations` per issue, and add/split/insert issue rows when scope grows (do not do untracked work).\n5. **Template is fixed**: use IEEEtran two-column layout (`assets/template/IEEEtran.cls`).\n   Treat two-column width as a layout constraint (use two-column floats when needed).\n\n### Gate 0: Research Snapshot + Draft Plan\n1. Confirm constraints (venue, page limit, author block, date range).\n2. Translate the topic into search keywords and run a light discovery pass:\n   10-20 key papers (see `references/research-workflow.md`). After step 4 (once `<paper_dir>` exists), cache arXiv discovery with `arxiv_registry.py search`.\n3. Propose 2-4 candidate titles aligned to the topic.\n4. Scaffold the project folder and draft plan:\n   ```bash\n   python3 scripts/bootstrap_ieee_review_paper.py --stage kickoff --topic \"<topic>\"\n   ```\n   This copies LaTeX templates from `assets/template/`; plan/issues are generated from templates in `assets/`.\n   Initialize arXiv registry (once): `python3 scripts/arxiv_registry.py --project-dir <paper_dir> init`.\n5. Create a **framework skeleton** in `main.tex`\n   (section headings + 2-4 bullets per section + seed citations; **no prose**).\n6. Update the plan file to reflect the framework, proposed titles, and section/subsection plan.\n7. Compile early: `python3 scripts/compile_paper.py --project-dir <paper_dir>`\n   Fix any `Overfull \\hbox` warnings (see Layout Hygiene below).\n8. Return to user:\n    - Proposed outline (5-8 sections, 2-4 bullets each)\n    - Planned visualizations (5+) mapped to sections (see `references/visual-templates.md`)\n    - Clarification questions\n9. **STOP** until user approves.\n\n### Gate 1: Create Issues CSV (after approval)\n1. Check kickoff gate in plan: `- [x] User confirmed scope + outline in chat`.\n2. Create issues CSV (script refuses if gate unchecked):\n   ```bash\n   python3 scripts/bootstrap_ieee_review_paper.py --stage issues --topic \"<topic>\" --with-literature-notes\n   ```\n3. Validate:\n   ```bash\n   python3 scripts/validate_paper_issues.py <paper_dir>/issues/<timestamp>-<slug>.csv\n   ```\n4. If literature notes are enabled, keep short summaries and (optional) abstract snippets to avoid re-search.\n5. The plan may evolve; add/split/insert issues as needed, re‑validate after edits, and keep going until all issues (including inserted ones) are `DONE` or `SKIP` (when feasible, in the same run).\n\n### Phase 2: Per-Issue Writing Loop\nFor each writing issue in the CSV:\n- If an issue balloons (new figure, new subsection, new benchmark set, or a large QA fix), split/insert new issue row(s) (e.g., `W6a`, `Q5`) before proceeding; re-run `python3 scripts/validate_paper_issues.py <issues.csv>`; keep going until all issues are `DONE`/`SKIP`.\n1. **Research**: 8-12 section-specific papers.\n2. **Write**: Never 3 sentences without citations; varied paragraph rhythm\n   (see `references/writing-style.md`).\n   For section intent and structure, use `references/template-usage.md`.\n3. **Visualize**: Match content triggers (see `references/visual-templates.md`).\n   Prioritize single-column sizing; use double-column spans only when necessary (see Layout Hygiene).\n   Cite externally sourced figure content.\n4. **Verify**: Web search + open source page (and PDF if available) before adding to `ref.bib`.\n   For arXiv entries, append BibTeX via `python3 scripts/arxiv_registry.py --project-dir <paper_dir> export-bibtex <arxiv_id> --out-bib <paper_dir>/ref.bib`.\n5. **Update**: Mark issue `DONE` with `Verified_Citations` count.\n6. Compile after meaningful changes; fix `Overfull \\hbox` before marking `DONE`.\n\n### Phase 2.5: Rhythm Refinement\nAfter all writing issues are `DONE`, refine prose section-by-section using the `latex-rhythm-refiner` skill. This step varies sentence/paragraph lengths and removes filler phrases while preserving all citations.\n\n### Phase 3: QA Gate\n1. Run internal QA checklist (see `references/quality-report.md`).\n2. Compile; ensure no `Overfull \\hbox` warnings in `main.log`.\n3. Deliver `main.tex`, `ref.bib`, figures, and `main.pdf`.\n\n---\n\n## Existing Paper Workflow (No Re-Scaffold)\nIf a paper folder already exists, do NOT rerun scaffold:\n```bash\n# Create plan\npython3 scripts/create_paper_plan.py --topic \"<topic>\" --stage plan --output-dir <paper_dir>\n# STOP for approval, then check kickoff gate box\n# Create issues (use timestamp/slug from plan filename/frontmatter)\npython3 scripts/create_paper_plan.py --topic \"<topic>\" --stage issues --timestamp \"<TS>\" --slug \"<slug>\" --output-dir <paper_dir> --with-literature-notes\n```\n\n## Citation-Validation Variant\n1. Treat provided path as LaTeX project root.\n2. Follow `references/citation-workflow.md`.\n3. Use `references/bibtex-guide.md` for BibTeX rules if entries need repair.\n4. Deliver validation report and corrected `ref.bib` if requested.\n\n---\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n**Compilation**: `python3 scripts/compile_paper.py --project-dir <paper_dir>` (exit 0, no \"Citation undefined\" warnings). Use `--report-page-counts` for main-text page count.\n\n**Quality Metrics**:\n- 6-10 pages of main text (references excluded)\n- 60-80 total citations (8+ per section)\n- 100% citation verification rate\n- 70%+ citations from last 3 years\n- 5+ visualization types\n- All issues `DONE` or `SKIP`\n\n---\n\n## Safety & Guardrails\n- **Never fabricate** citations or results; add TODO and ask user if evidence missing.\n- **Verify every citation** via web search + source page (and PDF if available) before adding to `ref.bib`.\n- **Confirm before** large literature searches.\n- **Do not overwrite** user files without confirmation.\n- **Issues CSV** is the contract; mark `DONE` only when criteria met.\n- **No submission bundles** unless user requests.\n\n## Layout Hygiene\nFix `Overfull \\hbox` warnings before marking issues `DONE`:\n- Figures: start with `figure` + `\\columnwidth`; switch to `figure*` + `\\textwidth` if needed\n- Tables: prefer `p{...}` column widths / `\\tabcolsep` over `\\resizebox`\n- Equations: use `split`, `multline`, `aligned`, or `IEEEeqnarray` for line-breaking\n\n---\n\n## Issues CSV Schema\n| Phase | Issues |\n|-------|--------|\n| Research | Rx: discovery, scaffolding, framework, viz planning |\n| Writing | Wx: each section with target citations and visualization |\n| Refinement | RFx: apply `latex-rhythm-refiner` skill (after all Wx DONE) |\n| QA | Qx: citation verification, QA checklist, compilation, final review |\n\nStatus: `TODO` → `DOING` → `DONE`. Schema validated by `validate_paper_issues.py`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:08:16.040Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Academic Agents needing automated LaTeX and BibTeX workflow management for arXiv review papers.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化LaTeX和BibTeX工作流管理的学术代理，用于arXiv审稿论文。","ja":"arXivの査読論文のLaTeXとBibTeXのワークフローの自動化が必要な学術エージェントに最適です。","ko":"arXiv 심사 논문에 대한 자동화된 LaTeX 및 BibTeX 워크플로 관리가 필요한 학술 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes académicos que necesitan gestión automatizada de flujos de trabajo con LaTeX y BibTeX para artículos de revisión de arXiv.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents académiques ayant besoin d''une gestion automatisée des flux de travail LaTeX et BibTeX pour les articles de revue arXiv.","de":"Perfekt für akademische Agents, die eine automatisierte Verwaltung von LaTeX- und BibTeX-Workflows für arXiv-Übersichtsarbeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Acadêmicos que precisam de gestão automatizada de fluxo de trabalho LaTeX e BibTeX para artigos de revisão do arXiv.","ru":"Идеально подходит для академических агентов, которым необходима автоматизированная управление рабочим процессом LaTeX и BibTeX для статей обзора arXiv.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأكاديميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تلقائية للعملية LaTeX و BibTeX للأوراق المراجعة arXiv."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scaffold IEEEtran templates and verify BibTeX citations end-to-end, ensuring accurate and validated references for ML/AI review papers, leveraging LaTeX and BibTeX protocols.","zh":"赋予代理创建IEEEtran模板并端到端验证BibTeX引用，确保机器学习/人工智能审稿论文的准确性和有效性，利用LaTeX和BibTeX协议。","ja":"IEEEtranテンプレートの作成とBibTeX引用のエンドツーエンドの検証をエージェントに可能にし、LaTeXとBibTeXのプロトコルを利用して、機械学習/人工知能の査読論文の正確性と妥当性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 IEEEtran 템플릿을 생성하고 BibTeX 참조를 종단 간으로 검증하여 LaTeX 및 BibTeX 프로토콜을 사용하여 기계 학습/인공 지능 심사 논문의 정확성 및 유효성을 보장합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para crear andamiajes de plantillas IEEEtran y verificar citaciones BibTeX de extremo a extremo, asegurando referencias precisas y validadas para artículos de revisión de ML/IA, aprovechando los protocolos LaTeX y BibTeX.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des échafaudages pour les modèles IEEEtran et de vérifier les citations BibTeX de bout en bout, garantissant des références précises et validées pour les articles de revue ML/IA, en tirant parti des protocoles LaTeX et BibTeX.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, IEEEtran-Vorlagen zu scaffolden und BibTeX-Zitate end-to-end zu verifizieren, wodurch genaue und validierte Referenzen für ML/AI-Übersichtsarbeiten sichergestellt werden, unter Nutzung von LaTeX- und BibTeX-Protokollen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar estruturas de modelos IEEEtran e verificar citações BibTeX de ponta a ponta, garantindo referências precisas e validadas para artigos de revisão de ML/AI, utilizando protocolos LaTeX e BibTeX.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать шаблоны IEEEtran и проверять цитаты BibTeX от начала до конца, обеспечивая точные и проверенные ссылки для статей обзора ML/AI, используя протоколы LaTeX и BibTeX.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء هياكل قوالب IEEEtran والتحقق من استشهادات BibTeX من النهاية إلى النهاية، مما يضمن المراجع الدقيقة والمؤكدة للورقات المراجعة لمل/AI، مع استخدام بروتوكولات LaTeX و BibTeX."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating arXiv review paper drafts with verified citations","Generating and validating BibTeX citations for existing LaTeX projects","Scaffolding IEEEtran templates for ML/AI review papers with precise formatting"],"zh":["使用经过验证的引用自动化arXiv审稿论文草稿","为现有的LaTeX项目生成和验证BibTeX引用","为机器学习/人工智能审稿论文创建IEEEtran模板，具有精确的格式"],"ja":["検証された引用を使用してarXiv査読論文の草案を自動化する","既存のLaTeXプロジェクトのBibTeX引用を生成して検証する","機械学習/人工知能の査読論文用に精密なフォーマットを持つIEEEtranテンプレートを作成する"],"ko":["검증된 참조를 사용하여 arXiv 심사 논문의 초안을 자동화하는 것","기존 LaTeX 프로젝트의 BibTeX 참조를 생성하여 검증하는 것","기계 학습/인공 지능 심사 논문용으로 정확한 형식의 IEEEtran 템플릿을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de borradores de artículos de revisión para arXiv con citaciones verificadas","Generación y validación de citaciones BibTeX para proyectos existentes de LaTeX","Creación de andamiajes de plantillas IEEEtran para artículos de revisión de ML/IA con formato preciso"],"fr":["Automatisation des brouillons d''articles de revue arXiv avec des citations vérifiées","Génération et validation de citations BibTeX pour des projets LaTeX existants","Génération d''échafaudages pour modèles IEEEtran pour articles de revue ML/IA avec un formatage précis"],"de":["Automatisierung von arXiv-Übersichtsartikel-Entwürfen mit verifizierten Zitaten","Generierung und Validierung von BibTeX-Zitaten für bestehende LaTeX-Projekte","Scaffolding von IEEEtran-Vorlagen für ML/AI-Übersichtsarbeiten mit präziser Formatierung"],"pt":["Automatizar projtos de artigos de revisão do arXiv com citações verificadas","Gerar e validar citações BibTeX para projetos LaTeX existentes","Criar estruturas de modelos IEEEtran para artigos de revisão de ML/AI com formatação precisa"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проекты статей обзора arXiv с проверенными цитатами","Генерировать и проверять цитаты BibTeX для существующих проектов LaTeX","Создавать шаблоны IEEEtran для статей обзора ML/AI с точным форматированием"],"ar":["توفير مسودات أوراق المراجعة arXiv المحدّثة مع الاستشهادات المُحَققة","توليد وتحقق من الاستشهادات BibTeX للمشاريع LaTeX الحالية","إنشاء هياكل قوالب IEEEtran لأوراق المراجعة لمل/AI بالتنسيق الدقيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to review papers, excluding novel experimental research papers","Requires topic description and optional constraints as input","Exclusive to academic documents, not applicable to non-academic writing"],"zh":["仅限于审稿论文，不包括新颖的实验研究论文","需要主题描述和可选的约束作为输入","仅适用于学术文档，不适用于非学术写作"],"ja":["査読論文のみに限定されており、新しい実験研究論文は除外される","トピックの説明とオプションの制約が入力として必要","学術文書のみに適用され、非学術的な執筆には適用されない"],"ko":["심사 논문에만 제한되며 새로운 실험 연구 논문은 제외됨","주제 설명 및 선택적 제약 조건이 입력으로 필요함","학술 문서에만 적용되며 비학술적인 글쓰기에 적용되지 않음"],"es":["Limitado a artículos de revisión, excluyendo artículos de investigación experimental novedosa","Requiere una descripción del tema y restricciones opcionales como entrada","Exclusivo para documentos académicos, no aplicable a escritura no académica"],"fr":["Limité aux articles de revue, excluant les articles de recherche expérimentale novateurs","Nécessite une description du sujet et des contraintes optionnelles en entrée","Exclusif aux documents académiques, non applicable à l''écriture non académique"],"de":["Beschränkt auf Übersichtsarbeiten, schließt neuartige experimentelle Forschungsarbeiten aus","Erfordert eine Themenbeschreibung und optionale Einschränkungen als Eingabe","Ausschließlich für akademische Dokumente, nicht anwendbar auf nicht-akademische Texte"],"pt":["Limitado a artigos de revisão, excluindo artigos de pesquisa experimental novos","Requer descrição de tópico e restrições opcionais como entrada","Exclusivo para documentos acadêmicos, não se aplica à escrita não acadêmica"],"ru":["Ограничен статьями обзора, исключая новые экспериментальные исследовательские статьи","Требует описания темы и необязательных ограничений в качестве входных данных","Эксклюзивно для академических документов, не применимо к неакадемическим написанию"],"ar":["محدود بالأوراق المراجعة، باستثناء الأوراق البحثية التجريبية الجديدة","يتطلب وصف الموضوع والقيود الاختيارية كمدخلات","حصري للوثائق الأكاديمية، لا ينطبق على الكتابة غير الأكاديمية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d38960dce83becae3a92cb6569e41d6512a353777a89e79d3de6972a262558e1","qualityScore":57}');
