es":["Traducción de gobernanza en restricciones genéricas","Motor de restricciones para internet cooperativo","Integración con substrato","Aplicación de reglas de gobernanza","Soporte para aplicaciones cooperativas"],"fr":["Traduction de la gouvernance en contraintes génériques","Moteur de contraintes pour l''internet coopératif","Intégration avec le substrat","Application des règles de gouvernance","Support pour les applications coopératives"],"de":["Übersetzung von Governance in generische Einschränkungen","Einschränkungs-Motor für kooperatives Internet","Integration mit Substrat","Anwendung von Governance-Regeln","Unterstützung für kooperative Anwendungen"],"pt":["Daemon de substrate para internet cooperativa","Tradução de governança em restrições genéricas","Compatibilidade com aplicativos de internet cooperativa","Suporte a OpenAPI","Arquitetura de kernel para enforcement de restrições"],"ru":["Демон субстрата для кооперативного интернета","Перевод управления в общие ограничения","Совместимость с приложениями кооперативного интернета","Поддержка OpenAPI","Архитектура ядра для обеспечения ограничений"],"ar":["ديمون سبستريت للإنترنت التعاوني","ترجمة الحوكمة إلى قيود عامة","التوافق مع تطبيقات الإنترنت التعاونية","دعم OpenAPI","هندسة نواة للتنفيذ القيود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","icn-gateway-openapi-sync","基质守护进程","应用程序治理转换","通用约束","合作互联网","如何使用icn-gateway-openapi-sync","icn-gateway-openapi-sync安装","icn-gateway-openapi-sync设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","icn-gateway-openapi-sync","サブストレートデーモン","ガバナンスの翻訳","一般的な制約","協力的なインターネット","icn-gateway-openapi-syncの使い方","icn-gateway-openapi-syncのインストール","icn-gateway-openapi-syncの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","icn-gateway-openapi-sync","기질 데몬","애플리케이션 거버넌스 변환","일반적인 제약 조건","협력 인터넷","icn-gateway-openapi-sync 사용법","icn-gateway-openapi-sync 설치","icn-gateway-openapi-sync 설정 가이드"],"es":["icn-gateway-openapi-sync","Herramientas de AI para internet cooperativo","cómo usar icn-gateway-openapi-sync","qué es icn-gateway-openapi-sync","alternativas a icn-gateway-openapi-sync","icn-gateway-openapi-sync vs otros daemons","instalación de icn-gateway-openapi-sync","guía de configuración de icn-gateway-openapi-sync"],"fr":["icn-gateway-openapi-sync","Outils d''IA pour l''internet coopératif","comment utiliser icn-gateway-openapi-sync","quoi est icn-gateway-openapi-sync","alternatives à icn-gateway-openapi-sync","icn-gateway-openapi-sync vs autres daemons","installation de icn-gateway-openapi-sync","guide de configuration de icn-gateway-openapi-sync"],"de":["icn-gateway-openapi-sync","KI-Tools für kooperatives Internet","wie man icn-gateway-openapi-sync verwendet","was ist icn-gateway-openapi-sync","Alternativen zu icn-gateway-openapi-sync","icn-gateway-openapi-sync vs andere Daemons","Installation von icn-gateway-openapi-sync","Konfigurationsanleitung für icn-gateway-openapi-sync"],"pt":["como usar icn-gateway-openapi-sync","o que é icn-gateway-openapi-sync","icn-gateway-openapi-sync alternative","icn-gateway-openapi-sync vs outros","instalar icn-gateway-openapi-sync","guia de configuração do icn-gateway-openapi-sync","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com icn-gateway-openapi-sync"],"ru":["как использовать icn-gateway-openapi-sync","что такое icn-gateway-openapi-sync","альтернатива icn-gateway-openapi-sync","icn-gateway-openapi-sync vs другие","установка icn-gateway-openapi-sync","руководство по настройке icn-gateway-openapi-sync","разработка приложений с icn-gateway-openapi-sync"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام icn-gateway-openapi-sync","ما هو icn-gateway-openapi-sync","بديل icn-gateway-openapi-sync","icn-gateway-openapi-sync مقابل الآخرين","تثبيت icn-gateway-openapi-sync","دليل إعداد icn-gateway-openapi-sync","تطوير التطبيقات مع icn-gateway-openapi-sync"]}},"owner":"InterCooperative-Network","repo":"icn","repoPath":"InterCooperative-Network/icn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.747Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"icn-gateway-openapi-sync","description":"Keep ICN gateway API behavior, exported OpenAPI spec, and generated TypeScript SDK types in sync. Use when modifying icn-gateway routes, request/response models, auth behavior, or any API shape that can cause OpenAPI/SDK drift.","bodyPreview":"# ICN Gateway OpenAPI Sync\n\nTreat API drift as a blocking integration defect.\n\n## Trigger Conditions\n\nUse this skill when changes touch:\n- `icn/crates/icn-gateway/**`\n- shared API models consumed by gateway endpoints\n- auth/scopes/status codes that affect endpoint contracts\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Validate gateway behavior.\n```bash\ncd icn\ncargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage\n```\n\n2. Regenerate OpenAPI from source of truth.\n```bash\ncd icn\ncargo build -p icnctl\n./target/debug/icnctl api expo","body":"# ICN Gateway OpenAPI Sync\n\nTreat API drift as a blocking integration defect.\n\n## Trigger Conditions\n\nUse this skill when changes touch:\n- `icn/crates/icn-gateway/**`\n- shared API models consumed by gateway endpoints\n- auth/scopes/status codes that affect endpoint contracts\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Validate gateway behavior.\n```bash\ncd icn\ncargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage\n```\n\n2. Regenerate OpenAPI from source of truth.\n```bash\ncd icn\ncargo build -p icnctl\n./target/debug/icnctl api export-openapi -o ../docs/api/openapi.generated.yaml\n```\n\n3. Regenerate TypeScript types.\n```bash\ncd sdk/typescript\nnpm ci\nnpm run generate-types\nnpm run check-types\nnpm run build\nnpm test\nnpm run lint\n```\n\n4. Confirm drift status.\n```bash\ngit status --short docs/api/openapi.generated.yaml sdk/typescript\n```\n- If generated artifacts changed, include them in the same PR.\n- If artifacts did not change, state that explicitly.\n\n5. Validate docs alignment.\n- Update docs for changed semantics or response behavior.\n- Ensure auth gating semantics match implementation.\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Do not hand-edit generated OpenAPI/types.\n- Do not hide API changes by skipping regeneration.\n- Keep error/status semantics explicit and documented.\n\n## Output Contract\n\nReturn:\n1. whether gateway API surface changed,\n2. generated files changed or unchanged,\n3. commands run with pass/fail outcome,\n4. follow-up docs/spec tasks if any.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:10:03.425Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Rust-focused AI Agents requiring automated OpenAPI synchronization and constraint validation in cooperative internet applications.","zh":"适用于需要自动OpenAPI同步和约束验证的Rust焦点AI代理，特别是在合作互联网应用中。","ja":"Rust中心のAIエージェントに適しています。OpenAPIの自動同期と制約の検証が必要な協力的なインターネットアプリケーションです。","ko":"자동 OpenAPI 동기화 및 제약 검증이 필요한 Rust 중심의 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 협력 인터넷 응용 프로그램에서 특히 유용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA enfocados en Rust que requieren sincronización automatizada de OpenAPI y validación de restricciones en aplicaciones de internet cooperativas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Rust nécessitant une synchronisation automatique d''OpenAPI et une validation de contraintes dans les applications Internet coopératives.","de":"Ideal für Rust-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte OpenAPI-Synchronisation und Constraints-Validierung in kooperativen Internetanwendungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em Rust que requerem sincronização automática de OpenAPI e validação de restrições em aplicações de internet cooperativas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Rust, требующих автоматической синхронизации OpenAPI и проверки ограничений в кооперативных интернет-приложениях.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي المُركّزة على روست التي تتطلب تنسيقًا تلقائيًا لمواصفات OpenAPI وتحققًا من القيود في تطبيقات الإنترنت التعاونية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce generic constraints and validate API behavior using the `icn-gateway` substrate daemon, ensuring seamless integration and treating API drift as a blocking defect through features like `cargo test` and `icnctl api expo`.","zh":"赋予代理执行通用约束和使用`icn-gateway`底层守护进程验证API行为的能力，确保无缝集成，并通过诸如`cargo test`和`icnctl api expo`等功能将API漂移视为阻塞缺陷。","ja":"`icn-gateway`サブストレートデーモンを使用して、汎用の制約を適用し、APIの動作を検証する機能をエージェントに与え、シームレスな統合を保証し、`cargo test`や`icnctl api expo`などの機能によってAPIドリフトをブロッキング欠陥として扱います。","ko":"`icn-gateway` 하위strate 데몬을 사용하여 일반적인 제약 조건을 적용하고 API 동작을 검증할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에 부여하여, 무결점 통합을 보장하며 `cargo test` 및 `icnctl api expo`와 같은 기능을 통해 API 드리프트를 블로킹 결함으로 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar restricciones genéricas y validar el comportamiento de la API utilizando el daemon del substrato `icn-gateway`, garantizando una integración fluida y tratando el desplazamiento de la API como un defecto bloqueante a través de características como `cargo test` y `icnctl api expo`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des contraintes génériques et de valider le comportement de l''API en utilisant le daemon de substrat `icn-gateway`, assurant une intégration fluide et traitant le décalage de l''API comme un défaut bloquant grâce à des fonctionnalités telles que `cargo test` et `icnctl api expo`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, generische Einschränkungen durchzusetzen und das API-Verhalten unter Verwendung des `icn-gateway`-Substrat-Daemons zu validieren, um eine nahtlose Integration zu gewährleisten und API-Drift als blockierendes Defekt durch Funktionen wie `cargo test` und `icnctl api expo` zu behandeln.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor restrições genéricas e validar o comportamento da API usando o daemon do substrate `icn-gateway`, garantindo uma integração perfeita e tratando o desvio da API como um defeito de bloqueio por meio de recursos como `cargo test` e `icnctl api expo`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать общие ограничения и проверять поведение API с помощью демона субстрата `icn-gateway`, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию и рассматривая дрейф API как блокирующий дефект через функции, такие как `cargo test` и `icnctl api expo`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من فرض قيود عامة وتصديق سلوك واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام ديمون ثنائي `icn-gateway`، مما يضمن التكامل السلس والتعامل مع انحراف واجهة برمجة التطبيقات على أنه عيب حاسم من خلال ميزات مثل `cargo test` و `icnctl api expo`."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating gateway behavior through automated testing with `cargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage`","Regenerating OpenAPI definitions from source of truth using `icnctl api expo`","Enforcing endpoint contracts and auth/scopes/status codes through generic constraints"],"zh":["通过自动化测试使用`cargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage`验证网关行为","使用`icnctl api expo`从事实来源重新生成OpenAPI定义","通过通用约束强制执行端点合同和身份验证/范围/状态代码"],"ja":["`cargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage`を使用して自動テストによってゲートウェイの動作を検証する","`icnctl api expo`を使用して事実の出典からOpenAPI定義を再生成する","汎用の制約を通じてエンドポイント契約と認証/スコープ/ステータスコードを適用する"],"ko":["`cargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage`를 사용하여 자동 테스트를 통해 게이트웨이 동작을 검증합니다","`icnctl api expo`를 사용하여 사실의 출처에서 OpenAPI 정의를 재생성합니다","일반적인 제약 조건을 통해 엔드 포인트 계약 및 인증/범위/상태 코드를 적용합니다"],"es":["Validar el comportamiento de la puerta de enlace a través de pruebas automatizadas con `cargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage`","Regenerar las definiciones de OpenAPI desde la fuente de la verdad utilizando `icnctl api expo`","Aplicar contratos de puntos finales y autenticación/ámbitos/códigos de estado a través de restricciones genéricas"],"fr":["Valider le comportement de la passerelle via des tests automatisés avec `cargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage`","Régénérer les définitions d''OpenAPI à partir de la source de vérité en utilisant `icnctl api expo`","Appliquer des contrats de points de terminaison et d''authentification/étendues/codes d''état via des contraintes génériques"],"de":["Das Verhalten des Gateways durch automatisierte Tests mit `cargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage` validieren","OpenAPI-Definitionen aus der Wahrheitsquelle mit `icnctl api expo` regenerieren","Endpunkt-Verträge und Authentifizierung/Bereiche/Statuscodes durch generische Einschränkungen durchsetzen"],"pt":["Validação do comportamento do gateway por meio de testes automatizados com `cargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage`","Regeneração de definições de OpenAPI a partir da fonte de verdade usando `icnctl api expo`","Impor contratos de endpoint e autenticação/âmbitos/códigos de status por meio de restrições genéricas"],"ru":["Проверка поведения шлюза с помощью автоматизированных тестов с `cargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage`","Пересоздание определений OpenAPI из источника истины с помощью `icnctl api expo`","Обеспечение соблюдения контрактов конечных точек и аутентификации/областей/кодов состояния с помощью общих ограничений"],"ar":["التحقق من سلوك البوابة من خلال اختبارات آلية باستخدام `cargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage`","إعادة توليد تعريفات OpenAPI من مصدر الحقيقة باستخدام `icnctl api expo`","فرض عقود النقاط النهائية وتحقق مصادقة/نطاقات/أرقام الحالة من خلال قيود عامة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust and Cargo environment","Specific to `icn-gateway` and its dependencies","Needs access to `icn/crates/icn-gateway` and shared API models"],"zh":["需要Rust和Cargo环境","特定于`icn-gateway`及其依赖项","需要访问`icn/crates/icn-gateway`和共享API模型"],"ja":["RustとCargoの環境が必要","`icn-gateway`とその依存関係に特有","`icn/crates/icn-gateway`と共有APIモデルへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Rust 및 Cargo 환경이 필요합니다","`icn-gateway` 및 의존 항목에 특정","`icn/crates/icn-gateway` 및 공유 API 모델에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Rust y Cargo","Específico de `icn-gateway` y sus dependencias","Necesita acceso a `icn/crates/icn-gateway` y modelos de API compartidos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Rust et Cargo","Spécifique à `icn-gateway` et ses dépendances","Nécessite un accès à `icn/crates/icn-gateway` et des modèles d''API partagés"],"de":["Benötigt Rust- und Cargo-Umgebung","Spezifisch für `icn-gateway` und dessen Abhängigkeiten","Benötigt Zugriff auf `icn/crates/icn-gateway` und gemeinsame API-Modelle"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Rust e Cargo","Específico para `icn-gateway` e suas dependências","Necessita acesso a `icn/crates/icn-gateway` e modelos de API compartilhados"],"ru":["Требует среды Rust и Cargo","Спецефичен для `icn-gateway` и его зависимостей","Требует доступа к `icn/crates/icn-gateway` и общим моделям API"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة روست وكارغو","محدد ل `icn-gateway` وإهماله","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى `icn/crates/icn-gateway` ونماذج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المشتركة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"76136cfe64e19b332101f151593bcbd492e61634b1c27e76d9c98e2c03abc473","qualityScore":57}');
