ichere und teilebare QR-Codes","Verwaltung der Arbeitsgeschichte Ihres Fuhrparks","Integration mit Google Maps","Zugriff auf den Standort und die Arbeitsgeschichte","Benutzerdefinierte Benachrichtigungen und Warnungen"],"pt":["Gestão de histórico de trabalho de equipamentos","Códigos QR seguros e compartilháveis","Integração com o google-maps","Acesso a dados em tempo real","Relatórios personalizados"],"ru":["Управление историей работы оборудования","Безопасные и общедоступные QR-коды","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами google-maps","Доступ к данным в режиме реального времени","Настроенные отчеты"],"ar":["إدارة تاريخ العمل على معدات","رموز QR آمنة ويمكن مشاركتها","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي google-maps","الوصول إلى البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","التقارير المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Google Maps设备管理","设备历史管理","安全共享二维码","如何使用Google Maps AI智能代理","Google Maps AI智能代理安装","Google Maps设备管理工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Google Mapsを使用した機器管理","機器の履歴管理","セキュアな共有二维码","Google Maps AIエージェントの使用方法","Google Maps AIエージェントのインストール","Google Maps機器管理ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Google Maps 장비 관리","장비 기록 관리","보안 공유 QR 코드","Google Maps AI 에이전트 사용법","Google Maps AI 에이전트 설치","Google Maps 장비 관리 도구"],"es":["cómo usar google-maps","qué es google-maps","herramientas de AI para google maps","google-maps vs Waze","instalación de google-maps","guía de configuración de google-maps","alternativas a google-maps","google-maps para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser google-maps","qu''est-ce que google-maps","outils d''IA pour google maps","google-maps vs Waze","installation de google-maps","guide de configuration de google-maps","alternatives à google-maps","google-maps pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man google-maps verwendet","was ist google-maps","KI-Tools für google maps","google-maps vs Waze","installation von google-maps","einrichtungsanleitung für google-maps","alternativen zu google-maps","google-maps für entwickler"],"pt":["como usar google-maps","o que é google-maps","google-maps alternative","google-maps vs waze","instalar google-maps","guia de configuração do google-maps"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты google-maps","что такое ИИ Агенты google-maps","ИИ Агенты google-maps альтернатива","ИИ Агенты google-maps vs яндекс","установить ИИ Агенты google-maps","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов google-maps"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي google-maps","ما هي أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي google-maps","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي google-maps بديل","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي google-maps مقابل واز","تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي google-maps","دليل إعداد أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي google-maps"]}},"owner":"Columbia-Cloudworks-LLC","repo":"EquipQR","repoPath":"Columbia-Cloudworks-LLC/EquipQR","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.826Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"google-maps","description":"Expert guide for developing, debugging, and extending Google Maps integration in EquipQR. Use when working with maps, geocoding, places autocomplete, location features, fleet map, Google Maps API keys, or address components. Also use when the user mentions google maps, geocode, fleet map, places autocomplete, map marker, address picker, or location.","bodyPreview":"# Google Maps Integration — EquipQR\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\nEquipQR uses Google Maps for three main features: **Fleet Map** visualization, **Places Autocomplete** address picking, and **Geocoding**. The integration spans frontend hooks/components and server-side Supabase Edge Functions.\n\n```\nBrowser                                    Supabase Edge Functions\n───────                                    ──────────────────────\nuseGoogleMapsKey ──→ public-google-maps-key ──→ GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY","body":"# Google Maps Integration — EquipQR\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\nEquipQR uses Google Maps for three main features: **Fleet Map** visualization, **Places Autocomplete** address picking, and **Geocoding**. The integration spans frontend hooks/components and server-side Supabase Edge Functions.\n\n```\nBrowser                                    Supabase Edge Functions\n───────                                    ──────────────────────\nuseGoogleMapsKey ──→ public-google-maps-key ──→ GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY\nuseGoogleMapsLoader ──→ Google Maps JS API (loads <script> with browser key)\nGooglePlacesAutocomplete ──→ PlaceAutocompleteElement (web component)\n                         └─→ places-autocomplete edge fn (fallback) ──→ GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY\nMapView (GoogleMap) ──→ @react-google-maps/api\nClickableAddress ──→ maps.google.com deep link\ngeocode-location edge fn ──→ GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY + geocoded_locations cache\n```\n\n## API Keys\n\nTwo separate keys with different restrictions:\n\n| Key | Env Var | Where Set | Used By |\n|-----|---------|-----------|---------|\n| **Browser key** | `GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY` | Supabase Edge Function secrets | `public-google-maps-key` → served to browser |\n| **Server key** | `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY` | Supabase Edge Function secrets | `geocode-location`, `places-autocomplete` |\n\n**Local development**: Set both in `supabase/functions/.env` (NOT the root `.env`).\n\n**Production**: Set in Supabase Dashboard → Project → Settings → Edge Functions → Secrets.\n\n**Important**: These are NOT Vercel env vars. Redeploying on Vercel does not affect these secrets.\n\n### Legacy key names (still supported with fallback)\n\n| Legacy Name | New Canonical Name |\n|---|---|\n| `VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY` | `GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY` |\n| `GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY` | `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY` |\n| `VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY` | `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY` |\n\nAll edge functions prefer the new name and fall back to legacy names.\n\n## Frontend Components & Hooks\n\n### `useGoogleMapsKey` (`src/hooks/useGoogleMapsKey.ts`)\n\nFetches the browser API key from the `public-google-maps-key` edge function. Returns `{ googleMapsKey, isLoading, error, retry }`.\n\n### `useGoogleMapsLoader` (`src/hooks/useGoogleMapsLoader.ts`)\n\n**Singleton** Google Maps JS API loader. Ensures the `<script>` tag is loaded exactly once across all components. Returns `{ isLoaded, loadError, googleMapsKey, isKeyLoading, keyError, retry }`.\n\n**Always use this hook** — never load the Maps JS API manually.\n\n### `GooglePlacesAutocomplete` (`src/components/ui/GooglePlacesAutocomplete.tsx`)\n\nAddress picker with three-tier fallback strategy:\n1. **Web component** — `PlaceAutocompleteElement` (Google''s native widget)\n2. **Edge function** — `places-autocomplete` edge function proxy (if web component fails, e.g. Places API New not enabled)\n3. **Plain text** — simple text input fallback\n\nProps: `{ value, onPlaceSelect, onClear, placeholder, disabled, className, isLoaded }`.\n\nReturns `PlaceLocationData`: `{ formatted_address, street, city, state, country, lat, lng }`.\n\n### `MapView` (`src/features/fleet-map/components/MapView.tsx`)\n\nFleet map component using `@react-google-maps/api` (`GoogleMap`, `MarkerF`, `InfoWindowF`). Renders colored markers by location source (team, equipment, scan, geocoded) and star markers for team HQ locations.\n\n### `ClickableAddress` (`src/components/ui/ClickableAddress.tsx`)\n\nRenders an address as a link that opens Google Maps.\n\n## Edge Functions\n\n### `public-google-maps-key`\n\n- **Purpose**: Serve the browser API key to authenticated users\n- **Auth**: JWT required (`verify_jwt = true`)\n- **Key**: `GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY`\n- **Pattern**: User-scoped client with `requireUser`\n\n### `geocode-location`\n\n- **Purpose**: Geocode addresses with caching in `geocoded_locations` table\n- **Auth**: JWT + org membership verification\n- **Key**: `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY`\n- **Rate limit**: 30 cache misses per org per minute\n- **Cache**: `geocoded_locations` table (upsert on `organization_id, normalized_text`)\n- **Input normalization**: lowercase, trim, collapse whitespace\n\n### `places-autocomplete`\n\n- **Purpose**: Proxy Google Places Autocomplete and Details APIs\n- **Auth**: JWT required\n- **Key**: `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY`\n- **Actions**: `autocomplete` (predictions) and `details` (structured address)\n- **Validation**: Zod discriminated union schema\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Adding a new map feature\n\n1. Use `useGoogleMapsLoader` to get `isLoaded` state\n2. Only render Google Maps components when `isLoaded === true`\n3. Handle `loadError` and `keyError` gracefully with error boundaries\n\n```tsx\nimport { useGoogleMapsLoader } from ''@/hooks/useGoogleMapsLoader'';\n\nfunction MyMapFeature() {\n  const { isLoaded, loadError, retry } = useGoogleMapsLoader();\n  \n  if (loadError) return <ErrorState onRetry={retry} />;\n  if (!isLoaded) return <Skeleton />;\n  \n  return <GoogleMap /* ... */ />;\n}\n```\n\n### Using the address picker\n\n```tsx\nimport GooglePlacesAutocomplete, { PlaceLocationData } from ''@/components/ui/GooglePlacesAutocomplete'';\nimport { useGoogleMapsLoader } from ''@/hooks/useGoogleMapsLoader'';\n\nfunction AddressField() {\n  const { isLoaded } = useGoogleMapsLoader();\n  \n  const handlePlaceSelect = (data: PlaceLocationData) => {\n    // data.formatted_address, data.street, data.city, \n    // data.state, data.country, data.lat, data.lng\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <GooglePlacesAutocomplete\n      isLoaded={isLoaded}\n      onPlaceSelect={handlePlaceSelect}\n      placeholder=\"Enter address...\"\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Geocoding an address server-side\n\nCall the `geocode-location` edge function:\n\n```ts\nconst { data, error } = await supabase.functions.invoke(''geocode-location'', {\n  body: { organizationId: orgId, input: addressString }\n});\n// data: { lat, lng, formatted_address } or { lat: null, lng: null }\n```\n\n### Adding a new Edge Function that uses Google Maps\n\n1. Use the `edge-function-creator` skill to scaffold the function\n2. Read the server key: `Deno.env.get(\"GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY\")`\n3. Always fall back to legacy names: `|| Deno.env.get(\"GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY\")`\n4. Never expose the server key in responses — only return processed data\n\n## Debugging\n\n### \"Map Configuration Error\" toast\n\nThe browser key fetch failed. Check:\n1. `GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY` is set in Supabase Edge Function secrets\n2. The `public-google-maps-key` function is deployed\n3. The user is authenticated (JWT required)\n\n### Places autocomplete not showing results\n\n1. Check if web component mode failed (console: `AutocompletePlaces blocked`)\n2. The component auto-falls-back to edge function mode\n3. Verify `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY` is set in Supabase secrets\n4. Check the `places-autocomplete` edge function logs\n\n### Geocoding returns `{ lat: null, lng: null }`\n\n1. Address may be unresolvable — check raw address string\n2. Rate limit may be exceeded (30/min/org) — check for 429 responses\n3. Verify `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY` is valid and has Geocoding API enabled\n\n### Fleet map markers not appearing\n\n1. Confirm `isLoaded` is true before rendering `<GoogleMap>`\n2. Check that equipment has valid `lat`/`lng` coordinates\n3. Verify the location source in `EquipmentLocation.source` field\n\n## Google Cloud Console requirements\n\nThe project requires these APIs enabled:\n\n| API | Used By |\n|-----|---------|\n| Maps JavaScript API | Fleet map, web component autocomplete |\n| Places API | Web component autocomplete |\n| Places API (Legacy) | `places-autocomplete` edge function |\n| Geocoding API | `geocode-location` edge function |\n\nBrowser key restrictions should allow the app''s domain(s). Server key should have no referrer restrictions (IP restrictions recommended).\n\n## Key files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `src/hooks/useGoogleMapsKey.ts` | Fetch browser API key from edge function |\n| `src/hooks/useGoogleMapsLoader.ts` | Singleton Maps JS API loader |\n| `src/components/ui/GooglePlacesAutocomplete.tsx` | Address picker component |\n| `src/components/ui/ClickableAddress.tsx` | Address → Google Maps link |\n| `src/features/fleet-map/components/MapView.tsx` | Fleet map with markers |\n| `src/features/fleet-map/pages/FleetMap.tsx` | Fleet map page |\n| `src/features/fleet-map/components/FleetMapErrorBoundary.tsx` | Map error boundary |\n| `src/utils/effectiveLocation.ts` | Location resolution + Maps URL builder |\n| `src/services/placesAutocompleteService.ts` | Edge function client for places |\n| `supabase/functions/public-google-maps-key/index.ts` | Browser key edge function |\n| `supabase/functions/geocode-location/index.ts` | Geocoding edge function |\n| `supabase/functions/places-autocomplete/index.ts` | Places proxy edge function |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:41:20.883Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Location-Based Agents needing advanced geospatial data visualization and mapping capabilities through Google Maps integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级地理空间数据可视化和映射功能的基于位置的代理，通过Google Maps集成实现。","ja":"ロケーションベースのエージェントが高度な地理空間データの視覚化とマッピング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。Google Mapsの統合により、これらの機能を提供します。","ko":"고급 지리공간 데이터 시각화 및 매핑 기능이 필요한 위치 기반 에이전트에게 적합하며 Google Maps 통합을 통해 이러한 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en ubicación que necesitan visualización y capacidad de mapeo de datos geoespaciales avanzados a través de la integración de Google Maps.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents basés sur l''emplacement nécessitant une visualisation et des capacités de cartographie de données géospatiales avancées via l''intégration de Google Maps.","de":"Perfekt für standortbasierte Agenten, die erweiterte geospatialen Datenvisualisierungs- und Kartierungsfunktionen über die Google Maps-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Baseados em Localização que precisam de visualização de dados geoespaciais avançada e capacidades de mapeamento por meio da integração do Google Maps.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, основанных на местоположении, которым требуются продвинутые возможности визуализации геопространственных данных и картографии посредством интеграции с Google Maps.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الموقع الذين يحتاجون إلى بيانات رسوماتية متقدمة وميزات الخريطة من خلال دمج خرائط جوجل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Google Maps for Fleet Map visualization, Places Autocomplete address picking, and Geocoding, utilizing secure sharable QR codes and Supabase Edge Functions for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理使用Google Maps进行车队地图可视化、Places Autocomplete地址选择和Geocoding，利用安全的共享二维码和Supabase Edge Functions实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがGoogle Mapsを使用して車隊マップの視覚化、Places Autocompleteによる住所の自動入力、Geocodingを行い、安全な共有QRコードとSupabase Edge Functionsを使用してシームレスに統合できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 Google Maps를 사용하여 차량 지도 시각화, Places Autocomplete를 통한 주소 자동 입력, Geocoding을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 보안 공유 QR 코드와 Supabase Edge Functions를 사용하여 무결점 통합을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar Google Maps para la visualización de mapas de flotas, la selección de direcciones mediante Places Autocomplete y la geocodificación, utilizando códigos QR compartibles de forma segura y Supabase Edge Functions para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser Google Maps pour la visualisation de cartes de flotte, la sélection d''adresses à l''aide de Places Autocomplete et la géocodage, en utilisant des codes QR partageables sécurisés et Supabase Edge Functions pour une intégration transparente.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Google Maps für die Visualisierung von Flottenkarten, die Auswahl von Adressen mit Places Autocomplete und die Geocodierung zu nutzen, unter Verwendung sicherer teilerbarer QR-Codes und Supabase Edge Functions für eine nahtlose Integration.","pt":"Permite que os agentes usem o Google Maps para visualização de mapas de frota, seleção de endereços com Autocomplete de Places e Geocodificação, utilizando códigos QR compartilháveis seguros e Funções de Borda do Supabase para integração sem interrupções.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать Google Maps для визуализации карты флота, автозаполнения адресов с помощью Places Autocomplete и геокодирования, используя безопасные общие коды QR и функции Edge Supabase для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء استخدام خرائط جوجل لتصوير خريطة الأسطول واختيار العناوين تلقائيًا مع تكميل الأماكن وترميز الموقع الجغرافي، باستخدام رموز QR المشتركة الآمنة ووظائف حافة Supabase من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Visualizing fleet service equipment locations on a map","Automating address suggestions using Places Autocomplete","Geocoding addresses for precise location-based services"],"zh":["在地图上可视化车队服务设备位置","使用Places Autocomplete实现地址建议的自动化","对地址进行Geocoding以提供精确的位置 기반服务"],"ja":["マップ上で車隊サービス装置の位置を視覚化する","Places Autocompleteを使用して住所の提案を自動化する","住所をGeocodingして正確な位置ベースのサービスを提供する"],"ko":["지도상에서 차량 서비스 장비의 위치를 시각화하는 것","Places Autocomplete를 사용하여 주소 제안의 자동화를 thực hiện하는 것","주소의 Geocoding을 통해 精確한 위치 기반 서비스를 제공하는 것"],"es":["Visualizar las ubicaciones de los equipos de servicio de la flota en un mapa","Automatizar las sugerencias de direcciones mediante Places Autocomplete","Geocodificar direcciones para servicios basados en la ubicación precisos"],"fr":["Visualiser les emplacements de l''équipement de service de flotte sur une carte","Automatiser les suggestions d''adresses à l''aide de Places Autocomplete","Géocoder les adresses pour des services basés sur l''emplacement précis"],"de":["Visualisieren der Standorte der Flottenservicegeräte auf einer Karte","Automatisieren der Adressvorschläge mit Places Autocomplete","Geocodieren von Adressen für präzise standortbasierte Dienste"],"pt":["Visualizar locais de equipamentos de serviço de frota em um mapa","Automatizar sugestões de endereços usando Autocomplete de Places","Geocodificar endereços para serviços baseados em localização precisos"],"ru":["Визуализировать местоположения служебного оборудования флота на карте","Автоматизировать предложения адресов с помощью Places Autocomplete","Геокодировать адреса для точных услуг, основанных на местоположении"],"ar":["تصوير مواقع معدات خدمة الأسطول على الخريطة","توفير اقتراحات عناوين تلقائيًا باستخدام تكميل الأماكن","ترميز الموقع الجغرافي للعناوين من أجل خدمات موقع دقيقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Google Maps API key","Dependent on Supabase Edge Functions for server-side integration","Limited to Google Maps services and features"],"zh":["需要Google Maps API密钥","依赖Supabase Edge Functions进行服务器端集成","仅限Google Maps服务和功能"],"ja":["Google Maps APIキーが必要","サーバーサイドの統合にはSupabase Edge Functionsに依存","Google Mapsのサービスと機能のみに制限"],"ko":["Google Maps API 키가 필요","서버 측 통합에는 Supabase Edge Functions에 의존","Google Maps 서비스 및 기능만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere una clave de API de Google Maps","Depende de Supabase Edge Functions para la integración en el lado del servidor","Limitado a los servicios y características de Google Maps"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé API Google Maps","Dépend de Supabase Edge Functions pour l''intégration côté serveur","Limité aux services et fonctionnalités de Google Maps"],"de":["Benötigt einen Google Maps-API-Schlüssel","Hängt von Supabase Edge Functions für die Server-seitige Integration ab","Begrenzt auf Google Maps-Dienste und -Funktionen"],"pt":["Requer chave de API do Google Maps","Dependente de Funções de Borda do Supabase para integração no lado do servidor","Limitado aos serviços e recursos do Google Maps"],"ru":["Требуется ключ API Google Maps","Зависит от функций Edge Supabase для интеграции на стороне сервера","Ограничен услугами и функциями Google Maps"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لخرائط جوجل","يعتمد على وظائف حافة Supabase من أجل التكامل على جانب الخادم","محدود بخدمات وميزات خرائط جوجل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3372c251d462d8968482786480325ed73b12d987861fd40b624f5fff468dff64","qualityScore":57}');
