ktplanung","aufgaben-erstellung","integration mit cursor ide","installationsanleitungen für sdd-evolve"],"pt":["como usar SDD Evolve","o que é SDD Evolve","SDD Evolve alternativa","SDD Evolve vs outras ferramentas","instalar SDD Evolve","guia de configuração do SDD Evolve","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","desenvolvimento de software com SDD Evolve"],"ru":["как использовать SDD Evolve","что такое SDD Evolve","SDD Evolve альтернатива","SDD Evolve vs другие инструменты","установить SDD Evolve","руководство по настройке SDD Evolve","ИИ инструменты для разработчиков","разработка программного обеспечения с SDD Evolve"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام SDD Evolve","ما هو SDD Evolve","بديل SDD Evolve","SDD Evolve مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت SDD Evolve","دليل إعداد SDD Evolve","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","تطوير البرمجيات مع SDD Evolve"]}},"owner":"madebyaris","repo":"spec-kit-command-cursor","repoPath":"madebyaris/spec-kit-command-cursor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.832Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sdd-evolve","description":"Update specifications with discoveries made during development. Use when implementation reveals new requirements, constraints, or design changes.","bodyPreview":"# SDD Evolve Skill\n\nKeep specifications in sync with implementation discoveries.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Implementation reveals new requirements\n- Technical constraints discovered during development\n- Design changes needed based on learnings\n- Edge cases found not in original spec\n\n## Protocol\n\n### Step 1: Categorize the Discovery\n- **Discovery**: New information that was unknown\n- **Refinement**: Clarification of existing requirement\n- **Addition**: New requirement not in original scope\n- **Modifica","body":"# SDD Evolve Skill\n\nKeep specifications in sync with implementation discoveries.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Implementation reveals new requirements\n- Technical constraints discovered during development\n- Design changes needed based on learnings\n- Edge cases found not in original spec\n\n## Protocol\n\n### Step 1: Categorize the Discovery\n- **Discovery**: New information that was unknown\n- **Refinement**: Clarification of existing requirement\n- **Addition**: New requirement not in original scope\n- **Modification**: Change to existing requirement\n- **Removal**: Requirement no longer needed\n\n### Step 2: Assess Impact\n1. Which spec files are affected?\n2. Does this change the plan?\n3. Are there downstream impacts?\n4. Should implementation pause for review?\n\n### Step 3: Document the Change\n\n```markdown\n## Changelog\n\n### [Date] - [Category]: [Brief Description]\n**Context**: [Why this change is needed]\n**Change**: [What specifically changed]\n**Impact**: [How this affects existing work]\n**Decision**: [What was decided]\n```\n\n### Step 4: Update Specs\nModify the appropriate files: `spec.md`, `plan.md`, `tasks.md`, `todo-list.md`.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Document immediately** — don''t wait until end of implementation\n2. **Be specific** — include enough detail to understand later\n3. **Link to context** — reference related tasks\n4. **Assess impact** — flag if review is needed\n5. **Preserve history** — never delete, always add changelog\n\n## Integration\n\n- Called during `sdd-implementer` subagent work\n- Triggered by `/evolve` command\n- Feeds into future `/audit` runs\n- Use the ask question tool if change requires stakeholder input\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:44:19.166Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing to synchronize specifications with implementation discoveries in Cursor IDE","zh":"非常适合需要在Cursor IDE中将规范与实现发现同步的开发代理","ja":"Cursor IDEで仕様と実装の発見を同期する必要がある開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Cursor IDE에서 사양과 구현 발견을 동기화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan sincronizar especificaciones con descubrimientos de implementación en Cursor IDE","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de synchroniser les spécifications avec les découvertes d''implémentation dans Cursor IDE","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die Spezifikationen mit Implementierungsentdeckungen in Cursor IDE synchronisieren müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam sincronizar especificações com descobertas de implementação no Cursor IDE","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходимо синхронизировать спецификации с открытиями реализации в Cursor IDE","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطويرية الذين يحتاجون إلى مزامنة المواصفات مع اكتشافات التنفيذ في Cursor IDE"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to keep specifications in sync with implementation discoveries using the SDD toolkit, incorporating /specify, /plan, and /tasks protocols to handle new requirements, technical constraints, and design changes","zh":"赋予代理人使用SDD工具包的能力，包括/specify、/plan和/tasks协议，以处理新需求、技术约束和设计更改，从而使代理人能够保持规范与实现发现的同步","ja":"SDDツールキットを使用し、/specify、/plan、/tasksプロトコルを含むことで、新しい要件、技術的な制約、設計変更に対処することができ、エージェントが仕様と実装の発見を同期させられるようになる","ko":"SDD 툴킷을 사용하여 /specify, /plan, /tasks 프로토콜을 포함하여 새로운 요구 사항, 기술적 제약 및 디자인 변경을 처리하여 에이전트가 사양과 구현 발견을 동기화할 수 있도록 하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener las especificaciones sincronizadas con los descubrimientos de implementación utilizando el kit de herramientas SDD, que incorpora los protocolos /specify, /plan y /tasks para manejar nuevos requisitos, restricciones técnicas y cambios de diseño","fr":"Permet aux agents de garder les spécifications synchronisées avec les découvertes d''implémentation en utilisant le kit d''outils SDD, qui intègre les protocoles /specify, /plan et /tasks pour gérer les nouveaux besoins, les contraintes techniques et les changements de conception","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, Spezifikationen mit Implementierungsentdeckungen mithilfe des SDD-Toolkits zu synchronisieren, das die Protokolle /specify, /plan und /tasks zur Handhabung neuer Anforderungen, technischer Einschränkungen und Designänderungen integriert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter as especificações em sincronia com as descobertas de implementação usando a toolkit SDD, incorporando protocolos /specify, /plan e /tasks para lidar com novos requisitos, restrições técnicas e alterações de design","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать спецификации в синхронизации с открытиями реализации с помощью toolkit SDD, включающей протоколы /specify, /plan и /tasks для обработки новых требований, технических ограничений и изменений дизайна","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إبقاء المواصفات متزامنة مع اكتشافات التنفيذ باستخدام أداة SDD، وتضم بروتوكولات /specify و /plan و /tasks لمعالجة المتطلبات الجديدة والقيود الفنية والتغييرات في التصميم"},"useCases":{"en":["Updating specifications based on implementation revelations","Refining existing requirements through clarification","Adding new requirements not in the original scope","Addressing edge cases not initially considered"],"zh":["基于实现的启示更新规范","通过澄清现有要求","添加原始范围内不包含的新要求","解决最初未考虑的边缘情况"],"ja":["実装の発見に基づいて仕様を更新する","既存の要件を明確化する","元の範囲に含まれない新しい要件を追加する","最初に考慮されなかったエッジケースに対処する"],"ko":["구현의 발견에 따라 사양을 업데이트하는 것","기존 요구 사항을 명확히 하는 것","원래 범위에 포함되지 않은 새로운 요구 사항을 추가하는 것","처음에 고려되지 않은 에지 케이스를 해결하는 것"],"es":["Actualización de especificaciones en función de revelaciones de implementación","Perfeccionamiento de los requisitos existentes a través de la aclaración","Adición de nuevos requisitos que no estaban en el alcance original","Atención a casos límite que no se consideraron inicialmente"],"fr":["Mise à jour des spécifications en fonction des révélations d''implémentation","Affinement des exigences existantes par clarification","Ajout de nouveaux besoins non inclus dans la portée d''origine","Traitement de cas limite non considérés initialement"],"de":["Aktualisierung von Spezifikationen basierend auf Implementierungsoffenbarungen","Verfeinerung bestehender Anforderungen durch Klarstellung","Hinzufügen neuer Anforderungen, die nicht im ursprünglichen Umfang enthalten waren","Behandlung vo